name: ['Aeronaut Cavalry', "Aeronaut's Wings", 'Air Marshal', 'Airlift Chaplain', 'Alloy Animist', 'Ambush Paratrooper', 'Arbalest Engineers', 'Arcane Proxy', 'Argivian Avenger', 'Argoth, Sanctum of Nature // Titania, Gaea Incarnate', 'Argothian Opportunist', 'Argothian Sprite', 'Arms Race', "Artificer's Dragon", "Ashnod's Harvester", "Ashnod's Intervention", 'Ashnod, Flesh Mechanist', 'Audacity', 'Autonomous Assembler', 'Awaken the Woods', 'Battery Bearer', 'Battlefield Butcher', 'Battlefield Forge', 'Bitter Reunion', 'Bladecoil Serpent', 'Blanchwood Armor', 'Blanchwood Prowler', 'Blast Zone', 'Blitz Automaton', 'Boulderbranch Golem', "Brotherhood's End", 'Brushland', 'Burrowing Razormaw', 'Bushwhack', "Calamity's Wake", 'Carrion Locust', 'Citanul Stalwart', 'Cityscape Leveler', 'Clay Champion', 'Clay Revenant', 'Coastal Bulwark', 'Combat Courier', 'Combat Thresher', 'Conscripted Infantry', 'Corrupt', 'Cradle Clearcutter', 'Curate', 'Deadly Riposte', 'Deathbloom Ritualist', 'Defabricate', 'Demolition Field', 'Depth Charge Colossus', 'Desynchronize', 'Diabolic Intent', 'Disciples of Gix', 'Disenchant', 'Disfigure', 'Draconic Destiny', 'Drafna, Founder of Lat-Nam', 'Dreams of Steel and Oil', 'Dredging Claw', 'Dwarven Forge-Chanter', 'Emergency Weld', 'Energy Refractor', 'Epic Confrontation', 'Evangel of Synthesis', 'Evolving Wilds', 'Excavation Explosion', 'Fade from History', 'Fallaji Archaeologist', 'Fallaji Chaindancer', 'Fallaji Dragon Engine', 'Fallaji Excavation', 'Fallaji Vanguard', 'Fateful Handoff', 'Fauna Shaman', 'Feldon, Ronom Excavator', 'Flow of Knowledge', 'Fog of War', 'Forest', 'Forging the Anchor', 'Fortified Beachhead', "Gaea's Courser", "Gaea's Gift", 'Geology Enthusiast', 'Giant Cindermaw', 'Giant Growth', "Gix's Caress", "Gix's Command", 'Gix, Yawgmoth Praetor', 'Gixian Infiltrator', 'Gixian Puppeteer', 'Gixian Skullflayer', 'Gnarlroot Pallbearer', 'Gnawing Vermin', 'Go for the Throat', 'Goblin Blast-Runner', 'Goblin Firebomb', 'Goring Warplow',