rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The swamps are counted on resolution.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "The amount of damage dealt to a creature is not bounded by its toughness, and the amount of damage dealt to a player is not bounded by that player\'s life total. For example, if Corrupt deals 6 damage to a 2/2 creature, you\'ll gain 6 life."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The life you gain is equal to the damage dealt by Corrupt, not necessarily to the number of Swamps you control (if some or all of the damage is prevented, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'Corrupt counts any land you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is not modal. If the target changes from an artifact to an enchantment or vice versa, this still destroys it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You must choose a card if there are any in your library.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Whenever an opponent casts a spell, Painful Quandary\'s ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it. It will resolve before the spell does."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is also an artifact when Go for the Throat tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is also an artifact when Go for the Throat tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any spell you cast that doesn\'t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won\'t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won\'t cause prowess to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Once it triggers, prowess isn\'t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Like most lands, each land in this cycle is colorless. The damage dealt to you is dealt by a colorless source.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The damage dealt to you is part of the second mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Obstinate Baloth, and both Obstinate Baloth\'s ability and another ability (such as that of an opponent\'s Leyline of the Void) instruct you to put Obstinate Baloth somewhere else instead of putting it into your graveyard, you choose which one to apply."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If you discard Obstinate Baloth and put it onto the battlefield, you\'ve still discarded it. Abilities that trigger when you discard a card (such as that of Raiders\' Wake) will still trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you discard Obstinate Baloth and put it onto the battlefield, you\'ve still discarded it. Abilities that trigger when you discard a card will still trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the creature you control is an illegal target as Epic Confrontation tries to resolve, the creature you control won\'t get +1/+2. If that creature is a legal target but the creature you don\'t control isn\'t, your creature will still get +1/+2. In both cases, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Epic Confrontation unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the creature you control is an illegal target as Epic Confrontation tries to resolve, the creature you control won\'t get +1/+2. If that creature is a legal target but the creature you don\'t control isn\'t, your creature will still get +1/+2. In both cases, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Epic Confrontation unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "An activation cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {6} to activate Blast Zone\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Tokens that aren\'t a copy of something else don\'t have a mana cost. Anything without a mana cost normally has a mana value of 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A player prompted to name a card may name the combined back face, and each player has the right to know that combined back face\'s characteristics at all times."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Although all the cards in The Brothers\' War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn\'t part of the token\'s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won\'t enter the battlefield tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If an effect moves a melded permanent to a new zone and then affects "that card," it affects both cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "In the Commander variant, a meld card\'s color identity is determined only by the mana costs and mana symbols in the rules text of its front face. No symbols or rules text of the permanent it melds into are considered."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Note that the permanent represented by the combined back faces has a color indicator.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'One card in each pair of meld cards has an ability that instructs you to exile the two cards and meld them. If you control more than one object with one of those names, you select one object with that name to exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Only two cards belonging to the same meld pair can be melded. Tokens, cards that aren\'t meld cards, or meld cards that don\'t form a meld pair can\'t be melded. If an effect instructs a player to meld cards that can\'t be melded, those cards remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype "Powerstone" and the ability "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can\\\'t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a melded permanent is the sum of the mana values of its front faces. A creature that becomes a copy of a melded permanent has only the characteristics of that combined back face, and its mana value is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When a pair of cards are melded, the result is a single creature that\'s represented by two cards. If the melded creature dies, both cards are put into your graveyard. As it leaves the battlefield, both of those cards are turned face up again. If the cards are put on the top or bottom of your library, you choose their relative order."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When two cards are exiled and melded, they each leave the battlefield, then return together as one new object with no relation to either of the objects that left the battlefield. Counters, Auras, Equipment, and other effects that affected those two cards don\'t affect the melded permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "While a meld card is in any zone other than the battlefield, it has only the characteristics of its front face. The same is true while it\'s on the battlefield with its front face up."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'While a melded permanent is on the battlefield, it has only the characteristics of its combined back face. Any effects that modify how the new object enters the battlefield will consider only the combined back face.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn\'t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A player prompted to name a card may name the combined back face, and each player has the right to know that combined back face\'s characteristics at all times."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Although all the cards in The Brothers\' War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn\'t part of the token\'s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won\'t enter the battlefield tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If an effect moves a melded permanent to a new zone and then affects "that card," it affects both cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "In the Commander variant, a meld card\'s color identity is determined only by the mana costs and mana symbols in the rules text of its front face. No symbols or rules text of the permanent it melds into are considered."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Mishra, Lost to Phyrexia enters the battlefield tapped and attacking, but since it wasn\'t declared as an attacker, no abilities that trigger when a creature attacks will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Note that the permanent represented by the combined back faces has a color indicator.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'One card in each pair of meld cards has an ability that instructs you to exile the two cards and meld them. If you control more than one object with one of those names, you select one object with that name to exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Only two cards belonging to the same meld pair can be melded. Tokens, cards that aren\'t meld cards, or meld cards that don\'t form a meld pair can\'t be melded. If an effect instructs a player to meld cards that can\'t be melded, those cards remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype "Powerstone" and the ability "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can\\\'t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a melded permanent is the sum of the mana values of its front faces. A creature that becomes a copy of a melded permanent has only the characteristics of that combined back face, and its mana value is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When a pair of cards are melded, the result is a single creature that\'s represented by two cards. If the melded creature dies, both cards are put into your graveyard. As it leaves the battlefield, both of those cards are turned face up again. If the cards are put on the top or bottom of your library, you choose their relative order."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When two cards are exiled and melded, they each leave the battlefield, then return together as one new object with no relation to either of the objects that left the battlefield. Counters, Auras, Equipment, and other effects that affected those two cards don\'t affect the melded permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "While a meld card is in any zone other than the battlefield, it has only the characteristics of its front face. The same is true while it\'s on the battlefield with its front face up."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'While a melded permanent is on the battlefield, it has only the characteristics of its combined back face. Any effects that modify how the new object enters the battlefield will consider only the combined back face.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn\'t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'You choose which player or planeswalker Mishra, Lost to Phyrexia is attacking as it enters the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A player prompted to name a card may name the combined back face, and each player has the right to know that combined back face\'s characteristics at all times."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "During each of your turns, you may activate Urza, Planeswalker\'s loyalty abilities twice, whether that\'s activating the same ability two times, or activating two different abilities once each."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If an effect moves a melded permanent to a new zone and then affects "that card," it affects both cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "In the Commander variant, a meld card\'s color identity is determined only by the mana costs and mana symbols in the rules text of its front face. No symbols or rules text of the permanent it melds into are considered."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Note that the permanent represented by the combined back faces has a color indicator.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'One card in each pair of meld cards has an ability that instructs you to exile the two cards and meld them. If you control more than one object with one of those names, you select one object with that name to exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Only two cards belonging to the same meld pair can be melded. Tokens, cards that aren\'t meld cards, or meld cards that don\'t form a meld pair can\'t be melded. If an effect instructs a player to meld cards that can\'t be melded, those cards remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a melded permanent is the sum of the mana values of its front faces. A creature that becomes a copy of a melded permanent has only the characteristics of that combined back face, and its mana value is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Urza, Lord Protector\'s first ability can\'t reduce the colored mana costs of spells you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When a pair of cards are melded, the result is a single creature that\'s represented by two cards. If the melded creature dies, both cards are put into your graveyard. As it leaves the battlefield, both of those cards are turned face up again. If the cards are put on the top or bottom of your library, you choose their relative order."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When two cards are exiled and melded, they each leave the battlefield, then return together as one new object with no relation to either of the objects that left the battlefield. Counters, Auras, Equipment, and other effects that affected those two cards don\'t affect the melded permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "While a meld card is in any zone other than the battlefield, it has only the characteristics of its front face. The same is true while it\'s on the battlefield with its front face up."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'While a melded permanent is on the battlefield, it has only the characteristics of its combined back face. Any effects that modify how the new object enters the battlefield will consider only the combined back face.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A player prompted to name a card may name the combined back face, and each player has the right to know that combined back face\'s characteristics at all times."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If an effect moves a melded permanent to a new zone and then affects "that card," it affects both cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "In the Commander variant, a meld card\'s color identity is determined only by the mana costs and mana symbols in the rules text of its front face. No symbols or rules text of the permanent it melds into are considered."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Note that the permanent represented by the combined back faces has a color indicator.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'One card in each pair of meld cards has an ability that instructs you to exile the two cards and meld them. If you control more than one object with one of those names, you select one object with that name to exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Only two cards belonging to the same meld pair can be melded. Tokens, cards that aren\'t meld cards, or meld cards that don\'t form a meld pair can\'t be melded. If an effect instructs a player to meld cards that can\'t be melded, those cards remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a melded permanent is the sum of the mana values of its front faces. A creature that becomes a copy of a melded permanent has only the characteristics of that combined back face, and its mana value is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Titania, Gaea Incarnate\'s last ability doesn\'t have a duration, which means that the land remains a creature indefinitely."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When a pair of cards are melded, the result is a single creature that\'s represented by two cards. If the melded creature dies, both cards are put into your graveyard. As it leaves the battlefield, both of those cards are turned face up again. If the cards are put on the top or bottom of your library, you choose their relative order."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When two cards are exiled and melded, they each leave the battlefield, then return together as one new object with no relation to either of the objects that left the battlefield. Counters, Auras, Equipment, and other effects that affected those two cards don\'t affect the melded permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "While a meld card is in any zone other than the battlefield, it has only the characteristics of its front face. The same is true while it\'s on the battlefield with its front face up."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'While a melded permanent is on the battlefield, it has only the characteristics of its combined back face. Any effects that modify how the new object enters the battlefield will consider only the combined back face.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'You can activate the ability multiple times targeting the same land to add more counters.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A player prompted to name a card may name the combined back face, and each player has the right to know that combined back face\'s characteristics at all times."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If an effect moves a melded permanent to a new zone and then affects "that card," it affects both cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "In the Commander variant, a meld card\'s color identity is determined only by the mana costs and mana symbols in the rules text of its front face. No symbols or rules text of the permanent it melds into are considered."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Note that the permanent represented by the combined back faces has a color indicator.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'One card in each pair of meld cards has an ability that instructs you to exile the two cards and meld them. If you control more than one object with one of those names, you select one object with that name to exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Only two cards belonging to the same meld pair can be melded. Tokens, cards that aren\'t meld cards, or meld cards that don\'t form a meld pair can\'t be melded. If an effect instructs a player to meld cards that can\'t be melded, those cards remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a melded permanent is the sum of the mana values of its front faces. A creature that becomes a copy of a melded permanent has only the characteristics of that combined back face, and its mana value is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When a pair of cards are melded, the result is a single creature that\'s represented by two cards. If the melded creature dies, both cards are put into your graveyard. As it leaves the battlefield, both of those cards are turned face up again. If the cards are put on the top or bottom of your library, you choose their relative order."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When two cards are exiled and melded, they each leave the battlefield, then return together as one new object with no relation to either of the objects that left the battlefield. Counters, Auras, Equipment, and other effects that affected those two cards don\'t affect the melded permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "While a meld card is in any zone other than the battlefield, it has only the characteristics of its front face. The same is true while it\'s on the battlefield with its front face up."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'While a melded permanent is on the battlefield, it has only the characteristics of its combined back face. Any effects that modify how the new object enters the battlefield will consider only the combined back face.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A prototype card is a colorless card in every zone except the stack or the battlefield, as well as while on the stack or the battlefield if not cast as a prototyped spell. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Blitz Automaton is a colorless creature card with mana value 7. It can\'t be the target of Recommission, a spell that targets an artifact or creature card with mana value 3 or less in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Casting a prototyped spell isn\'t the same as casting it for an alternative cost, and an alternative cost may be applied to a spell cast this way. For example, if an effect allows you to cast an artifact card without paying its mana cost, you could either cast Blitz Automaton normally, or as a prototyped spell."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell. Similarly, if an effect creates a token that\'s a copy of a prototyped permanent or causes another permanent to become a copy of it, the copy would have the same characteristics as the prototyped permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If another effect causes Arcane Proxy\'s power to be less than the mana value of the target card as the ability tries to resolve, the target is illegal. The card won\'t be exiled, and you won\'t get to cast a copy."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If the spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you don\'t want to cast the copy, you can choose not to; the copy ceases to exist the next time state-based actions are checked."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Regardless of how it was cast, a prototype card always has the same name, abilities, types, and so on. Only the mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness change depending on whether the card was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The prototype ability functions in any zone that the spell could be cast from. For example, if an effect allows you to cast artifact spells from your graveyard, you could cast a prototyped Blitz Automaton from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'When cast as a prototyped spell, that spell has the mana cost, power, and toughness characteristics shown in its colored, secondary text box rather than the normal values of those characteristics. Its color and mana value are determined by that mana cost. The permanent that spell becomes as it resolves has the same characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack in any other way, or the permanent it becomes leaves the battlefield, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When casting a prototyped spell, use only its prototype characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast it. For example, if Blitz Automaton is exiled with the last ability of Chandra, Dressed to Kill, you would be able to cast it for {2}{R} (because it\'s a red spell), even though you wouldn\'t be able to cast it as a colorless spell for its normal cost."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You cast the copy while the ability is resolving and still on the stack. You can\'t wait to cast it later in the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A prototype card is a colorless card in every zone except the stack or the battlefield, as well as while on the stack or the battlefield if not cast as a prototyped spell. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Blitz Automaton is a colorless creature card with mana value 7. It can\'t be the target of Recommission, a spell that targets an artifact or creature card with mana value 3 or less in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Casting a prototyped spell isn\'t the same as casting it for an alternative cost, and an alternative cost may be applied to a spell cast this way. For example, if an effect allows you to cast an artifact card without paying its mana cost, you could either cast Blitz Automaton normally, or as a prototyped spell."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell. Similarly, if an effect creates a token that\'s a copy of a prototyped permanent or causes another permanent to become a copy of it, the copy would have the same characteristics as the prototyped permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Regardless of how it was cast, a prototype card always has the same name, abilities, types, and so on. Only the mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness change depending on whether the card was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The amount of life an opponent needs to pay for that spell or ability to resolve is equal to Phyrexian Fleshgorger\'s power at the time the ward ability resolves, which may be different from its power when the ward ability triggered. If Phyrexian Fleshgorger is no longer on the battlefield at the time the ward ability resolves, use the power it had the last time it was on the battlefield to determine how much life that player must pay (though if Phyrexian Fleshgorger was the only target, the spell has no legal targets anymore and hence it would not resolve even if they pay the life)."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The prototype ability functions in any zone that the spell could be cast from. For example, if an effect allows you to cast artifact spells from your graveyard, you could cast a prototyped Blitz Automaton from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'When cast as a prototyped spell, that spell has the mana cost, power, and toughness characteristics shown in its colored, secondary text box rather than the normal values of those characteristics. Its color and mana value are determined by that mana cost. The permanent that spell becomes as it resolves has the same characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack in any other way, or the permanent it becomes leaves the battlefield, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When casting a prototyped spell, use only its prototype characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast it. For example, if Blitz Automaton is exiled with the last ability of Chandra, Dressed to Kill, you would be able to cast it for {2}{R} (because it\'s a red spell), even though you wouldn\'t be able to cast it as a colorless spell for its normal cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A prototype card is a colorless card in every zone except the stack or the battlefield, as well as while on the stack or the battlefield if not cast as a prototyped spell. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Blitz Automaton is a colorless creature card with mana value 7. It can\'t be the target of Recommission, a spell that targets an artifact or creature card with mana value 3 or less in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Casting a prototyped spell isn\'t the same as casting it for an alternative cost, and an alternative cost may be applied to a spell cast this way. For example, if an effect allows you to cast an artifact card without paying its mana cost, you could either cast Blitz Automaton normally, or as a prototyped spell."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell. Similarly, if an effect creates a token that\'s a copy of a prototyped permanent or causes another permanent to become a copy of it, the copy would have the same characteristics as the prototyped permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Regardless of how it was cast, a prototype card always has the same name, abilities, types, and so on. Only the mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness change depending on whether the card was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The copies will have the same mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness as Skitterbeam Battalion, which vary depending on whether it was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The prototype ability functions in any zone that the spell could be cast from. For example, if an effect allows you to cast artifact spells from your graveyard, you could cast a prototyped Blitz Automaton from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'When cast as a prototyped spell, that spell has the mana cost, power, and toughness characteristics shown in its colored, secondary text box rather than the normal values of those characteristics. Its color and mana value are determined by that mana cost. The permanent that spell becomes as it resolves has the same characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack in any other way, or the permanent it becomes leaves the battlefield, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When casting a prototyped spell, use only its prototype characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast it. For example, if Blitz Automaton is exiled with the last ability of Chandra, Dressed to Kill, you would be able to cast it for {2}{R} (because it\'s a red spell), even though you wouldn\'t be able to cast it as a colorless spell for its normal cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A prototype card is a colorless card in every zone except the stack or the battlefield, as well as while on the stack or the battlefield if not cast as a prototyped spell. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Blitz Automaton is a colorless creature card with mana value 7. It can\'t be the target of Recommission, a spell that targets an artifact or creature card with mana value 3 or less in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Casting a prototyped spell isn\'t the same as casting it for an alternative cost, and an alternative cost may be applied to a spell cast this way. For example, if an effect allows you to cast an artifact card without paying its mana cost, you could either cast Blitz Automaton normally, or as a prototyped spell."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell. Similarly, if an effect creates a token that\'s a copy of a prototyped permanent or causes another permanent to become a copy of it, the copy would have the same characteristics as the prototyped permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Regardless of how it was cast, a prototype card always has the same name, abilities, types, and so on. Only the mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness change depending on whether the card was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The prototype ability functions in any zone that the spell could be cast from. For example, if an effect allows you to cast artifact spells from your graveyard, you could cast a prototyped Blitz Automaton from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Use Rootwire Amalgam\'s power as it existed the last time it was on the battlefield (not the power of the creature card in the graveyard) to determine the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'When cast as a prototyped spell, that spell has the mana cost, power, and toughness characteristics shown in its colored, secondary text box rather than the normal values of those characteristics. Its color and mana value are determined by that mana cost. The permanent that spell becomes as it resolves has the same characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack in any other way, or the permanent it becomes leaves the battlefield, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When casting a prototyped spell, use only its prototype characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast it. For example, if Blitz Automaton is exiled with the last ability of Chandra, Dressed to Kill, you would be able to cast it for {2}{R} (because it\'s a red spell), even though you wouldn\'t be able to cast it as a colorless spell for its normal cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A prototype card is a colorless card in every zone except the stack or the battlefield, as well as while on the stack or the battlefield if not cast as a prototyped spell. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Blitz Automaton is a colorless creature card with mana value 7. It can\'t be the target of Recommission, a spell that targets an artifact or creature card with mana value 3 or less in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Casting a prototyped spell isn\'t the same as casting it for an alternative cost, and an alternative cost may be applied to a spell cast this way. For example, if an effect allows you to cast an artifact card without paying its mana cost, you could either cast Blitz Automaton normally, or as a prototyped spell."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell. Similarly, if an effect creates a token that\'s a copy of a prototyped permanent or causes another permanent to become a copy of it, the copy would have the same characteristics as the prototyped permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Regardless of how it was cast, a prototype card always has the same name, abilities, types, and so on. Only the mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness change depending on whether the card was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The prototype ability functions in any zone that the spell could be cast from. For example, if an effect allows you to cast artifact spells from your graveyard, you could cast a prototyped Blitz Automaton from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Use Spotter Thopter\'s power at the time its triggered ability resolves (not the time it triggered) to determine the value of X. If Spotter Thopter is no longer on the battlefield at the time the ability resolves, use its power as it existed the last time it was on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'When cast as a prototyped spell, that spell has the mana cost, power, and toughness characteristics shown in its colored, secondary text box rather than the normal values of those characteristics. Its color and mana value are determined by that mana cost. The permanent that spell becomes as it resolves has the same characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack in any other way, or the permanent it becomes leaves the battlefield, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When casting a prototyped spell, use only its prototype characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast it. For example, if Blitz Automaton is exiled with the last ability of Chandra, Dressed to Kill, you would be able to cast it for {2}{R} (because it\'s a red spell), even though you wouldn\'t be able to cast it as a colorless spell for its normal cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A prototype card is a colorless card in every zone except the stack or the battlefield, as well as while on the stack or the battlefield if not cast as a prototyped spell. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Blitz Automaton is a colorless creature card with mana value 7. It can\'t be the target of Recommission, a spell that targets an artifact or creature card with mana value 3 or less in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Casting a prototyped spell isn\'t the same as casting it for an alternative cost, and an alternative cost may be applied to a spell cast this way. For example, if an effect allows you to cast an artifact card without paying its mana cost, you could either cast Blitz Automaton normally, or as a prototyped spell."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell. Similarly, if an effect creates a token that\'s a copy of a prototyped permanent or causes another permanent to become a copy of it, the copy would have the same characteristics as the prototyped permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Regardless of how it was cast, a prototype card always has the same name, abilities, types, and so on. Only the mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness change depending on whether the card was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The prototype ability functions in any zone that the spell could be cast from. For example, if an effect allows you to cast artifact spells from your graveyard, you could cast a prototyped Blitz Automaton from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Use Woodcaller Automaton\'s power and toughness at the time its triggered ability resolves to determine the base power and toughness of the Treefolk creature land. If Woodcaller Automaton is no longer on the battlefield, use the power and toughness it had the last time it was on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'When cast as a prototyped spell, that spell has the mana cost, power, and toughness characteristics shown in its colored, secondary text box rather than the normal values of those characteristics. Its color and mana value are determined by that mana cost. The permanent that spell becomes as it resolves has the same characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack in any other way, or the permanent it becomes leaves the battlefield, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When casting a prototyped spell, use only its prototype characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast it. For example, if Blitz Automaton is exiled with the last ability of Chandra, Dressed to Kill, you would be able to cast it for {2}{R} (because it\'s a red spell), even though you wouldn\'t be able to cast it as a colorless spell for its normal cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A prototype card is a colorless card in every zone except the stack or the battlefield, as well as while on the stack or the battlefield if not cast as a prototyped spell. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Blitz Automaton is a colorless creature card with mana value 7. It can\'t be the target of Recommission, a spell that targets an artifact or creature card with mana value 3 or less in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Casting a prototyped spell isn\'t the same as casting it for an alternative cost, and an alternative cost may be applied to a spell cast this way. For example, if an effect allows you to cast an artifact card without paying its mana cost, you could either cast Blitz Automaton normally, or as a prototyped spell."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell. Similarly, if an effect creates a token that\'s a copy of a prototyped permanent or causes another permanent to become a copy of it, the copy would have the same characteristics as the prototyped permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Regardless of how it was cast, a prototype card always has the same name, abilities, types, and so on. Only the mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness change depending on whether the card was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The prototype ability functions in any zone that the spell could be cast from. For example, if an effect allows you to cast artifact spells from your graveyard, you could cast a prototyped Blitz Automaton from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'When cast as a prototyped spell, that spell has the mana cost, power, and toughness characteristics shown in its colored, secondary text box rather than the normal values of those characteristics. Its color and mana value are determined by that mana cost. The permanent that spell becomes as it resolves has the same characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack in any other way, or the permanent it becomes leaves the battlefield, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When casting a prototyped spell, use only its prototype characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast it. For example, if Blitz Automaton is exiled with the last ability of Chandra, Dressed to Kill, you would be able to cast it for {2}{R} (because it\'s a red spell), even though you wouldn\'t be able to cast it as a colorless spell for its normal cost."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You choose the target creature as you put Steel Seraph\'s triggered ability on the stack. You choose which ability that creature gains as the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A prototype card is a colorless card in every zone except the stack or the battlefield, as well as while on the stack or the battlefield if not cast as a prototyped spell. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Blitz Automaton is a colorless creature card with mana value 7. It can\'t be the target of Recommission, a spell that targets an artifact or creature card with mana value 3 or less in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Casting a prototyped spell isn\'t the same as casting it for an alternative cost, and an alternative cost may be applied to a spell cast this way. For example, if an effect allows you to cast an artifact card without paying its mana cost, you could either cast Blitz Automaton normally, or as a prototyped spell."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell. Similarly, if an effect creates a token that\'s a copy of a prototyped permanent or causes another permanent to become a copy of it, the copy would have the same characteristics as the prototyped permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Regardless of how it was cast, a prototype card always has the same name, abilities, types, and so on. Only the mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness change depending on whether the card was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The prototype ability functions in any zone that the spell could be cast from. For example, if an effect allows you to cast artifact spells from your graveyard, you could cast a prototyped Blitz Automaton from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'When cast as a prototyped spell, that spell has the mana cost, power, and toughness characteristics shown in its colored, secondary text box rather than the normal values of those characteristics. Its color and mana value are determined by that mana cost. The permanent that spell becomes as it resolves has the same characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack in any other way, or the permanent it becomes leaves the battlefield, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When casting a prototyped spell, use only its prototype characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast it. For example, if Blitz Automaton is exiled with the last ability of Chandra, Dressed to Kill, you would be able to cast it for {2}{R} (because it\'s a red spell), even though you wouldn\'t be able to cast it as a colorless spell for its normal cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A prototype card is a colorless card in every zone except the stack or the battlefield, as well as while on the stack or the battlefield if not cast as a prototyped spell. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Blitz Automaton is a colorless creature card with mana value 7. It can\'t be the target of Recommission, a spell that targets an artifact or creature card with mana value 3 or less in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Casting a prototyped spell isn\'t the same as casting it for an alternative cost, and an alternative cost may be applied to a spell cast this way. For example, if an effect allows you to cast an artifact card without paying its mana cost, you could either cast Blitz Automaton normally, or as a prototyped spell."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If Boulderbranch Golem leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability resolves, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained, not its power in the zone it moved to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell. Similarly, if an effect creates a token that\'s a copy of a prototyped permanent or causes another permanent to become a copy of it, the copy would have the same characteristics as the prototyped permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Regardless of how it was cast, a prototype card always has the same name, abilities, types, and so on. Only the mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness change depending on whether the card was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The prototype ability functions in any zone that the spell could be cast from. For example, if an effect allows you to cast artifact spells from your graveyard, you could cast a prototyped Blitz Automaton from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'When cast as a prototyped spell, that spell has the mana cost, power, and toughness characteristics shown in its colored, secondary text box rather than the normal values of those characteristics. Its color and mana value are determined by that mana cost. The permanent that spell becomes as it resolves has the same characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack in any other way, or the permanent it becomes leaves the battlefield, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When casting a prototyped spell, use only its prototype characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast it. For example, if Blitz Automaton is exiled with the last ability of Chandra, Dressed to Kill, you would be able to cast it for {2}{R} (because it\'s a red spell), even though you wouldn\'t be able to cast it as a colorless spell for its normal cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "A prototype card is a colorless card in every zone except the stack or the battlefield, as well as while on the stack or the battlefield if not cast as a prototyped spell. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Blitz Automaton is a colorless creature card with mana value 7. It can\'t be the target of Recommission, a spell that targets an artifact or creature card with mana value 3 or less in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when Hulking Metamorph enters the battlefield. Any "as [this] enters the battlefield" or "[this] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Casting a prototyped spell isn\'t the same as casting it for an alternative cost, and an alternative cost may be applied to a spell cast this way. For example, if an effect allows you to cast an artifact card without paying its mana cost, you could either cast Blitz Automaton normally, or as a prototyped spell."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Except for also being an artifact creature and having a different power and toughness, Hulking Metamorph copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent and nothing more (unless that permanent is itself copying something or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If Hulking Metamorph somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another permanent, Hulking Metamorph can\'t become a copy of that permanent. You may choose only a permanent that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell. Similarly, if an effect creates a token that\'s a copy of a prototyped permanent or causes another permanent to become a copy of it, the copy would have the same characteristics as the prototyped permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If the chosen permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If the chosen permanent is a token, Hulking Metamorph copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield, with the listed exceptions. Hulking Metamorph does not become a token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If the chosen permanent is copying something else (for example, if the chosen permanent is a Clone), then your Hulking Metamorph enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen permanent copied, with the stated exceptions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Regardless of how it was cast, a prototype card always has the same name, abilities, types, and so on. Only the mana cost, mana value, color, power, and toughness change depending on whether the card was cast as a prototyped spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The prototype ability functions in any zone that the spell could be cast from. For example, if an effect allows you to cast artifact spells from your graveyard, you could cast a prototyped Blitz Automaton from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Use the appropriate printed power and toughness (either 7/7 or 3/3) to determine the result of Hulking Metamorph\'s copy effect."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'When cast as a prototyped spell, that spell has the mana cost, power, and toughness characteristics shown in its colored, secondary text box rather than the normal values of those characteristics. Its color and mana value are determined by that mana cost. The permanent that spell becomes as it resolves has the same characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack in any other way, or the permanent it becomes leaves the battlefield, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "When casting a prototyped spell, use only its prototype characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast it. For example, if Blitz Automaton is exiled with the last ability of Chandra, Dressed to Kill, you would be able to cast it for {2}{R} (because it\'s a red spell), even though you wouldn\'t be able to cast it as a colorless spell for its normal cost."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Hulking Metamorph simply enters the battlefield as a 7/7 (or 3/3) artifact creature.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Although all the cards in The Brothers\' War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn\'t part of the token\'s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won\'t enter the battlefield tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Cityscape Leveler\'s triggered ability won\'t trigger when you activate its unearth ability from your graveyard. It will, however, trigger when you attack with Cityscape Leveler that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype "Powerstone" and the ability "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can\\\'t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn\'t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Despite the appearance of the reminder text, the unearth abilities that Mishra, Tamer of Mak Fawa grants are activated abilities of each individual artifact card in your graveyard. They\'re not activated abilities of Mishra."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If Mishra\'s Juggernaut can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the target permanent has unearth and was put onto the battlefield using its unearth ability, this effect can still exile it and return it to its owner\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you attack the same player with two Terisian Mindbreakers, that player will mill half their library as the first Mindbreaker\'s ability resolves. Then they will mill half of what remains in their library as the second Mindbreaker\'s ability resolves. They do not mill their entire library unless their library only had three or fewer cards to begin with."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Perennial Behemoth doesn\'t allow you to activate abilities (such as cycling) of land cards in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Perennial Behemoth doesn\'t change the times when you can play those land cards. You can still play only one land per turn, and only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The first activated ability affects only artifact creatures you control at the time it resolves. Any artifact creatures that come under your control later in the turn won\'t be affected."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose a target for Terror Ballista\'s triggered ability when it attacks. If you choose to sacrifice a creature, a second triggered ability triggers and you choose a target for that second ability. Players may respond as normal to this second ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You must control two or more other creatures both when the first ability triggers and when it resolves. If you control fewer than two other creatures at either time, you won\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You must pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for spells cast using the first ability of Mishra\'s Research Desk."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Although all the cards in The Brothers\' War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn\'t part of the token\'s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won\'t enter the battlefield tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to an exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If Static Net leaves the battlefield before its first ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Static Net\'s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype "Powerstone" and the ability "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can\\\'t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Static Net\'s first ability creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the permanent when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to the battlefield immediately after Static Net leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn\'t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Although all the cards in The Brothers\' War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn\'t part of the token\'s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won\'t enter the battlefield tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the card you exiled with the first ability is an instant, you may play it during your end step after Visions of Phyrexia\'s last ability has already resolved and created a Powerstone token. We call this having your cake and compleating it too."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you played a card from exile for any reason, the ability won\'t trigger, even if it wasn\'t the card you exiled with the first ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype "Powerstone" and the ability "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can\\\'t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn\'t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You must follow all normal timing rules for a card you play using Visions of Phyrexia\'s first ability and, if it\'s a spell, you must pay its costs to cast it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Although all the cards in The Brothers\' War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn\'t part of the token\'s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won\'t enter the battlefield tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If Slagstone Refinery is put into a graveyard from the battlefield or exiled from the battlefield at the same time that one or more other nontoken artifacts controlled by the same player are put into a graveyard from the battlefield and/or exiled from the battlefield, its triggered ability will trigger once for each of them plus once for itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype "Powerstone" and the ability "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can\\\'t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn\'t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Although all the cards in The Brothers\' War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn\'t part of the token\'s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won\'t enter the battlefield tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype "Powerstone" and the ability "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can\\\'t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Sarinth Greatwurm\'s second ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under any player\'s control, not just under your control."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn\'t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Although all the cards in The Brothers\' War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn\'t part of the token\'s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won\'t enter the battlefield tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype "Powerstone" and the ability "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can\\\'t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The ability of that Construct token does count the Construct itself, so it\'ll be at least 1/1."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn\'t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Although all the cards in The Brothers\' War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn\'t part of the token\'s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won\'t enter the battlefield tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype "Powerstone" and the ability "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can\\\'t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn\'t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Any spell you cast that doesn\'t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won\'t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won\'t cause prowess to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Once it triggers, prowess isn\'t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "As Alloy Animist\'s ability resolves, the target permanent keeps any other types and subtypes it had before it became an artifact creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to an exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If In the Trenches leaves the battlefield and later returns to the battlefield, it is a new object on the battlefield with no memory of the last time it was there. Its ability may be activated, even if it was activated a previous time it was on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If In the Trenches leaves the battlefield before its activated ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if the owner of In the Trenches leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The activated ability can only be activated once per game. If the ability is countered or otherwise fails to resolve after being activated, it can\'t be activated again."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The activated ability is a single ability that creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the permanent when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to the battlefield immediately after In the Trenches leaves the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Being a Dragon isn\'t part of the activated ability the enchanted creature has. It\'s a Dragon in addition to its other types whether or not that ability has been activated."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Each of the cards needs to have mana value 3 or less. It\'s not the total mana value of the cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the ones created by Giant Growth, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the artifact was already a creature, its base power and toughness will each become 4. This overwrites any previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Mightstone\'s Animation becomes attached to the artifact will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The artifact retains any types, subtypes, or supertypes it has. Notably, an Equipment that becomes an artifact creature usually can\'t be attached to another creature. If it was attached to a creature, it becomes unattached."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The resulting artifact creature will be able to attack on your turn if it\'s been under your control continuously since the turn began. That is, it doesn\'t matter how long it\'s been a creature, just how long it\'s been on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "For Urza, Prince of Kroog\'s activated ability, the token copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent, with the listed exceptions, and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent is a token, the token created with Urza copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token, with the listed exceptions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that permanent copied, with the listed exceptions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The token is a Soldier creature in addition to its other types. Its base power and toughness is 1/1. These are the copiable values of the token\'s characteristics that other effects may copy."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "For the first ability, you don\'t choose which artifact to tap until the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you manage to activate Saheeli\'s last ability multiple times, each emblem you get is applied independently. For example, if you have two of those emblems, artifact creatures you control get +2/+2 and artifact spells you cast cost {2} less."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The cost reduction provided by Saheeli\'s emblem can never reduce the colored mana costs of an artifact spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Gaining protection from everything causes a spell or ability on the stack to have an illegal target if it targets you. As a spell or ability tries to resolve, if all its targets are illegal, that spell or ability doesn\'t resolve and none of its effects happen, including effects unrelated to the target. If at least one target is still legal, the spell or ability does as much as it can to the remaining legal targets, and its other effects still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a player has protection from everything, it means three things: (1) All damage that would be dealt to that player is prevented. (2) Auras can\'t be attached to that player. (3) That player can\'t be the target of spells or abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect says that damage can\'t be prevented, you can still take damage from untargeted sources, such as attacking creatures or spells that deal damage to each player."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Nothing other than the specified events are prevented or illegal. An effect that doesn\'t target you could still cause you to discard cards, for example. Creatures can still attack you while you have protection from everything, although combat damage that they would deal to you will be prevented."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Gixian Skullflayer\'s triggered ability checks the number of cards in your graveyard both when it triggers and when it resolves. If there aren\'t three or more creature cards in your graveyard each time, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Goblin Blast-Runner doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield at the time the permanent was sacrificed in order to get the bonus."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If Mishra\'s Foundry becomes a creature and you haven\'t controlled it continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, you won\'t be able to activate its first or last abilities, and it won\'t be able to attack (unless it somehow gains haste)."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If Mishra\'s Foundry is already a creature, activating the second ability will override any previous effects that set its power and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that are affecting its power and/or toughness, including +1/+1 counters and the effects of spells like Giant Growth, will continue to apply."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If One with the Multiverse leaves the battlefield and later returns to the battlefield (or you play a second one), it\'s considered a new object and you may cast a spell using its last ability regardless of whether or not you did so earlier this turn using the enchantment that was on the battlefield before."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Similarly, if you control more than one One with the Multiverse (Two with the Multiverse, if you will), each one\'s last ability applies independently, and you may cast a spell without paying its mana cost once for each of them during each of your turns. In this case, you will need to track which enchantment\'s permission you are using to cast a spell this way (due to the possibility that one of them might leave the battlefield before you use its permission that turn)."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "While casting a card with the prototype ability using the last ability of One with the Multiverse, you can either choose to cast it normally or choose to cast it as a prototyped spell. In either case, you won\'t pay its mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "While casting a spell without paying its mana cost using the last ability, you can\'t pay alternative costs, but you may choose to pay any optional additional costs the spell may have (such as a kicker cost). You still must pay any mandatory additional costs."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'You must follow all normal timing rules for spells cast and lands played using the middle ability and must pay all costs for spells cast this way. To cast a spell this way, you may choose to pay any alternative costs or optional additional costs the spell may have (such as a kicker cost). You must pay any mandatory additional costs.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an artifact or land that becomes a creature this way has been on the battlefield since the beginning of your upkeep (even if it wasn\'t a creature at the time), it can attack during your turn and its abilities may be activated."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Tawnos\'s Tinkering doesn\'t grant haste, so if a noncreature permanent that entered the battlefield since the beginning of your upkeep becomes a creature this way, it can\'t attack until your next turn. Any activated abilities that it has with a {T} symbol in their cost also can\'t be activated until your next upkeep step. Notably, this means a land that entered the battlefield after your last upkeep can\'t be tapped for mana if it becomes a creature this way."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If an effect says to set a player\'s life total to a number that\'s higher than the player\'s current life total while Giant Cindermaw is on the battlefield, the player\'s life total doesn\'t change."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Spells and abilities that cause players to gain life still resolve while Giant Cindermaw is on the battlefield. No player will gain life, but any other effects of that spell or ability will happen.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If another effect modifies how much damage a source would deal to an opponent or a permanent they control, including preventing some of it, the player being dealt damage or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage chooses an order in which to apply those effects. If all of the damage is prevented, Mechanized Warfare\'s effect no longer applies."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If damage dealt by a red or artifact source you control is being divided or assigned among multiple opponents and/or permanents opponents\' control, divide the original amount before adding 1. For example, if you cast a red spell that deals 4 damage divided among any number of targets and you choose to have it deal 2 damage to a creature and 2 damage to that creature\'s controller, that spell will deal 3 damage to each of them instead."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The additional 1 damage is dealt by the original source of damage. The additional damage isn\'t dealt by Mechanized Warfare."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If one or more static abilities that apply to a creature entering the battlefield change its power or toughness, those abilities are considered when determining whether or not Symmetry Matrix\'s ability triggers. The same is true for replacement effects that apply to it, such as entering the battlefield with one or more +1/+1 counters or entering the battlefield as a copy of another creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the card in your graveyard is an illegal target as Emergency Weld tries to resolve, Emergency Weld is removed from the stack and you won\'t create a token."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Emergency Weld without an artifact or creature card in your graveyard to target."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the creature Audacity would enchant is an illegal target by the time the Aura spell resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. It\'s put into your graveyard from the stack, not the battlefield, so its last ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the targeted land is an illegal target by the time Demolition Field\'s ability resolves, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. Neither player will get to search for a basic land card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The target land\'s controller gets to search for a basic land card even if that land wasn\'t destroyed by Demolition Field\'s ability. This may happen because the land has indestructible."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you choose the first mode and that player is an illegal target by the time Titania\'s Command would resolve, the spell is removed from the stack and none of its effects happen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you have fewer than six cards in your library, the second pile will be smaller than the first. If you have fewer than four cards in your library, only the first pile will have cards in it at all, and the second pile will be empty. You may choose to turn the empty pile face up, but your opponent will probably choose to give you the empty pile regardless, unless they\'re feeling especially generous."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "None of the modes have any targets. Notably, this means that you don\'t have to choose a creature for the second mode until the spell resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Notably, this means that players won\'t get to know what nonland permanent you plan to target before you choose whether to sacrifice a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Skyfisher Spider\\\'s first triggered ability doesn\\\'t have any targets. If you choose to sacrifice another creature, a second triggered ability (called a "reflexive" triggered ability) goes on the stack and you choose a target nonland permanent at that time. Players may respond to that second ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Overwhelming Remorse\'s first ability can\'t reduce its cost to less than {B}."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Overwhelming Remorse\'s first ability doesn\'t change its mana cost or mana value. It just reduces the cost to cast the spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Since Skystrike Officer\'s activated ability doesn\'t have a tap symbol in its cost, you can tap creatures that haven\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began (including Skystrike Officer itself if you\'d like) to pay the cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Since none of the modes have targets, you don\'t have to choose which creature is getting the counters or which cards you\'re returning until Gix\'s Command resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "That creature doesn\'t necessarily have to be dealt damage by Obliterating Bolt to be exiled. If it would die for any reason that turn, it will be exiled instead."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The enchanted permanent doesn\'t untap during its controller\'s untap step even if you didn\'t pay {3}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The permanent\'s owner chooses whether to put it on the top or bottom of their library. If multiple cards are put into the library this way (such as when the spell targets a melded permanent), that permanent\'s owner puts all the cards on top or all the cards on the bottom. They put them in whatever order they wish, and do not need to reveal the order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The triggered ability of Urza\'s Sylex will resolve before the activated ability. This means that you choose whether to pay {2} and search your library before any player chooses lands. Notably, this means that the other players will get to know which planeswalker card you searched for before choosing any lands."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Trench Stalker doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield when you drew the cards. If you draw two cards, then play Trench Stalker, it has deathtouch and lifelink this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped artifact or creature you control, including a creature you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Citanul Stalwart\'s activated ability. However, you must have controlled Citanul Stalwart continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to reveal the card if it\'s a land card. You may choose not to reveal it and instead put it into your graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You must follow all normal timing rules for a card you play using The Temporal Anchor\'s last ability and, if it\'s a spell, you must pay its costs to cast it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You sacrifice the artifact only if you still control it at the beginning of the next end step. If that artifact has left the battlefield, even if it later came back, you don\'t sacrifice it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'"This spell can\\\'t be countered" means it can\\\'t be countered even by the ward keyword ability. The spell\\\'s controller may still pay the ward cost if it targets an artifact with ward, but Raze to the Ground won\\\'t be countered if they don\\\'t.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'A resolving copy of a permanent spell becomes a token, so the token isn\\\'t "created." Effects that care about a token being created won\\\'t interact with a token that enters the battlefield because the triggered ability copied a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies a prototyped spell, that copy (as well as the token it becomes on the battlefield) will have the same characteristics as the prototyped spell.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'A resolving copy of a permanent spell becomes a token, so the token isn\\\'t "created." Effects that care about a token being created won\\\'t interact with a token that enters the battlefield from Tawnos, the Toymaker\\\'s ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The copy remembers any decisions that were made for the original spell as it was cast, including values chosen for X in its mana cost and whether any alternative or additional costs were chosen. For example, if the original creature spell had kicker and its kicker cost was paid, the copy will also be kicked.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger when a permanent "becomes untapped" won\\\'t trigger if a stun counter is removed instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has more than one stun counter on it, only one will be removed each time it would become untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If a tapped permanent with a stun counter on it would become untapped, a stun counter will be removed from it instead. This is a replacement effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If untapping a permanent is part of a cost (such as that of Halo Fountain\\\'s first ability), you may pay that cost by "untapping" a tapped permanent with a stun counter on it. The stun counter will be removed and the creature will remain tapped. However, the cost will still be paid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'On the other hand, if untapping multiple permanents is part of a cost (such as that of Halo Fountain\\\'s last two abilities), you can\\\'t "untap" the same permanent more than once to pay that cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Stun counters are not keyword counters, and they don\'t cause the permanents they\'re on to gain any abilities. They won\'t be affected by effects that cause permanents to lose all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Stun counters exist independently of the effects that created them. If a permanent has no stun counters on it, it will untap as normal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Stun counters replace untapping for any reason, including players untapping tapped permanents during their untap steps.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities (such as equip and unearth) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Myrel, Shield of Argive\'s first ability prevents opponents from activating abilities of permanents on the battlefield that are artifacts, creatures, and/or enchantments. It doesn\'t prevent activated abilities from cards in any zone other than the battlefield. Notably, this means that your opponents may still activate abilities of cards in their graveyard (such as unearth)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities (such as equip and unearth) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The last mode can target delayed triggered abilities. Notably, it can target the delayed triggered ability that exiles an unearthed permanent at the beginning of the next end step. If that delayed triggered ability is countered, the unearthed permanent remains on the battlefield indefinitely. It will still be exiled, however, if it would die or otherwise leave the battlefield for any other reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Triggered abilities use the word "when," "whenever," or "at." They\\\'re often written as "[Trigger condition], [effect]."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Turn-based actions and special actions like the normal card draw, combat damage, or turning a face-down creature face up can\'t be targeted. Mana abilities also can\'t be targeted."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities (such as equip and unearth) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Because creatures controlled by opponents aren\\\'t being put into a graveyard, any "when [this creature] dies" triggered abilities those creatures have won\\\'t trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'From among the discarded cards, you may choose an artifact or creature card with mana value 1, you may choose an artifact or creature card with mana value 2, and you may choose an artifact or creature card with mana value 3. Then put all the chosen cards onto the battlefield simultaneously.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a replacement effect causes cards you discard this way to be exiled rather than go to the graveyard, Queen Kayla bin-Kroog\'s ability can still find those cards in exile. You can still put cards discarded this way onto the battlefield with Queen Kayla\'s ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Hurkyl need not have been on the battlefield at the time the noncreature spells were cast for the ability to trigger or for the spells to be counted.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The card types that a noncreature spell can have are artifact, enchantment, instant, planeswalker, sorcery, and tribal. Subtypes, like Human and Equipment, and supertypes, like snow and legendary, aren\'t card types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If Rescue Retriever leaves the battlefield before combat damage is dealt to your other attacking Soldiers, they will take damage as normal. Notably, this means it is usually a bad idea to attack with Rescue Retriever if your opponent could block it with a creature that has first strike and enough power to kill it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Rescue Retriever prevents damage to other attacking Soldiers even if it isn\'t also attacking."}]', "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If Siege Veteran dies at the same time as one or more other nontoken Soldier creatures, its second ability will trigger for each of them.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If Surge Engine loses defender in some way other than its first ability, its second ability may still be activated. Likewise, if it becomes blue in some way other than its second ability, its last ability may still be activated. Note that an effect that allows a creature to "attack as though it didn\\\'t have defender" doesn\\\'t actually cause it to lose defender.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a Surge Engine whose last ability has been activated leaves the battlefield and comes back, it\'s a new object on the battlefield and its last ability can be activated again (once it\'s blue, of course)."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Surge Engine\'s last ability can be activated only once per game, not once per turn."}]', "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If a noncreature artifact is returned to the battlefield this way and another effect would cause that artifact to be a creature while it is on the battlefield (such as the ability of March of the Machines), that artifact will enter the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If a replacement effect causes the milled cards to be exiled instead of going to the graveyard, this effect can still apply to the cards "milled this way" in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You put a +1/+1 counter on Tomakul Scrapsmith if you don\'t put an artifact card into your hand with its ability, even if there wasn\'t an artifact card among the milled cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If a replacement effect causes the milled cards to be exiled instead of going to the graveyard, this effect can still apply to the cards "milled this way" in exile.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If a replacement effect causes the milled cards to be exiled rather than go to the graveyard, this effect can still apply to the cards "milled this way" in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You put a +1/+1 counter on Ravenous Gigamole if you don\'t put a creature card into your hand with its ability, even if there wasn\'t a creature card among the milled cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If a spell you cast this way has an {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 for X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'You may play a land this way only during your own turn and only if you have not yet played a land this turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You must play the cards as you resolve the last ability. You can\'t wait and play them later."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'If an artifact or creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The mana value of an artifact creature that was cast as a prototype is based on the prototype mana cost rather than the card\'s usual mana cost."}]', "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the opponent has no artifact or creature cards in their hand, you must still choose an artifact or creature card from their graveyard to exile.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'You must choose an artifact or creature card from their hand if they reveal one. Similarly, you must choose an artifact or creature card from their graveyard if one exists there.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the target is illegal as Legions to Ashes tries to resolve, it will be removed from the stack and do nothing, even if there are tokens with that name still on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'The target permanent need not be a token. In that case, it will still be exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the targeted creature card has an {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to interfere with the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The sacrificed creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Playing the exiled card follows all normal timing rules for a card of that type, and its owner must pay all costs (including the additional {2} if applicable) to cast it this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Power Plant Worker will get two +1/+1 counters instead of getting +2/+2 if, at the time the ability resolves, you control at least one creature named Mine Worker and at least one creature named Tower Worker.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The ability has no effect on permanents with the chosen name that are on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Unlike most effects of this kind, The Stone Brain\'s ability allows its controller to choose the name of a basic land. Note that you may only search for up to four copies of that card, even if you find more of them."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to choose the name of a card that you\'ve already seen this game; you may guess at a card you think your opponent might have in their deck, if you\'d like."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to exile each card you find with that name. If you want to leave one in their graveyard, for example, you may."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "You target a player as The Stone Brain\'s activated ability is put on the stack, but you don\'t name a card until it resolves. Notably, this means that players don\'t get to respond to the ability knowing what card you will name."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The last ability cares only about the amount of mana that was actually spent to cast the spell, regardless of its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'The third ability applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can be activated "only as a sorcery."\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'The last ability will trigger if you discard artifact cards for any reason, not just due to its activated ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'You must pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules when casting a spell this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'You will add {C}{C}{C} instead of {C} if you control at least one creature named Mine Worker and at least one creature named Power Plant Worker.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'You will gain 3 life instead of 1 if, at the time the ability resolves, you control at least one creature named Power Plant Worker and at least one creature named Tower Worker.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Gix\' Befehl", \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf bis zu eine Kreatur. Sie erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Zerstöre jede Kreatur mit Stärke 2 oder weniger.\\n• Bringe bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n• Jeder Gegner opfert eine Kreatur mit der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26892fc5-bd29-48f7-af3b-3bea6a63379c\', \'multiverseId\': 583943}, \'multiverseid\': 583943}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de Gix\', \'text\': \'Elige dos:\\n• Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura. Gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\\n• Destruye cada criatura con fuerza de 2 o menos.\\n• Regresa hasta dos cartas de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n• Cada oponente sacrifica una criatura con la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09799e04-80b2-469a-9859-841b8ed17142\', \'multiverseId\': 584204}, \'multiverseid\': 584204}, {\'name\': \'Commandement de Gix\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur jusqu\'à une créature. Elle acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Détruisez chaque créature de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\n• Renvoyez dans votre main jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature depuis votre cimetière.\\n• Chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature avec la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffe7cba8-85aa-4176-bdd0-07c611c56667\', \'multiverseId\': 584465}, \'multiverseid\': 584465}, {\'name\': \'Comando di Gix\', \'text\': \'Scegli due —\\n• Scegli fino a una creatura. Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa. Ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Distruggi ogni creatura con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\\n• Riprendi in mano fino a due carte creatura dal tuo cimitero.\\n• Ogni avversario sacrifica una creatura con la forza maggiore tra le creature che controlla.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fce4e9b5-28e5-4c3a-8bba-4d28387f5afd\', \'multiverseId\': 584726}, \'multiverseid\': 584726}, {\'name\': \'ギックスの命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャー最大１体の上に、＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。\\n・パワーが２以下であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\\n・あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大２枚をあなたの手札に戻す。\\n・各対戦相手はそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャーの中で最も大きいパワーを持つクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4636bd35-c194-4f2d-8a3b-5a59d5c217f5\', \'multiverseId\': 584987}, \'multiverseid\': 584987}, {\'name\': \'Comando de Gix\', \'text\': \'Escolha dois —\\n• Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em até uma criatura. Ela ganha vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.\\n• Destrua cada criatura com poder igual ou inferior a 2.\\n• Devolva até dois cards de criatura de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\n• Cada oponente sacrifica uma criatura com o maior poder dentre as que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18177cfe-64a5-4730-9b6f-a0a064aac870\', \'multiverseId\': 585248}, \'multiverseid\': 585248}, {\'name\': \'基克斯的指命\', \'text\': \'选择两项～\\n•在至多一个生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。它获得系命异能直到回合结束。\\n•消灭所有力量等于或小于2的生物。\\n•将至多两张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n•每位对手各牺牲一个生物，且须是由其操控的生物中力量最大者。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'100d2b12-0bbc-4c58-9d2a-2d9d6ed891ee\', \'multiverseId\': 585509}, \'multiverseid\': 585509}]', '[{\'name\': "Gix\' Befehl", \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf bis zu eine Kreatur. Sie erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Zerstöre jede Kreatur mit Stärke 2 oder weniger.\\n• Bringe bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n• Jeder Gegner opfert eine Kreatur mit der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585802&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'474e1629-5e51-4651-ac57-da6a4c2b2e92\', \'multiverseId\': 585802}, \'multiverseid\': 585802}, {\'name\': \'Commandement de Gix\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur jusqu\'à une créature. Elle acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Détruisez chaque créature de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\n• Renvoyez dans votre main jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature depuis votre cimetière.\\n• Chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature avec la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585874&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54b8f66a-fb47-46c0-b4fa-9e07fd86edcb\', \'multiverseId\': 585874}, \'multiverseid\': 585874}, {\'name\': \'ギックスの命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャー最大１体の上に、＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。\\n・パワーが２以下であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\\n・あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大２枚をあなたの手札に戻す。\\n・各対戦相手はそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャーの中で最も大きいパワーを持つクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92decaa7-6c4d-4f08-9dbe-7a72d2131b6f\', \'multiverseId\': 585946}, \'multiverseid\': 585946}, {\'name\': \'基克斯的指命\', \'text\': \'选择两项～\\n•在至多一个生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。它获得系命异能直到回合结束。\\n•消灭所有力量等于或小于2的生物。\\n•将至多两张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n•每位对手各牺牲一个生物，且须是由其操控的生物中力量最大者。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04be367a-101c-4a1c-a2ba-089d53f2d2c6\', \'multiverseId\': 586018}, \'multiverseid\': 586018}]', '[{\'name\': "Gix\' Umarmung", \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl zeigt seine Hand offen vor. Du bestimmst davon eine Nichtland-Karte. Der Spieler wirft die bestimmte Karte ab.\\nErzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Zeige mir all das köstliche Elend, das du gesät hast."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583942&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'741c70ba-28cd-401a-962a-edda8c4d39e8\', \'multiverseId\': 583942}, \'multiverseid\': 583942}, {\'name\': \'Caricia de Gix\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo muestra su mano. Tú eliges de ahí una carta que no sea tierra. Ese jugador descarta esa carta.\\nCrea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Muéstrame toda la deliciosa miseria que sembraste".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6d256a8-18bc-46a1-bb52-56fa41ec94ac\', \'multiverseId\': 584203}, \'multiverseid\': 584203}, {\'name\': \'Caresse de Gix\', \'text\': "Un adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Vous y choisissez une carte non-terrain. Ce joueur se défausse de cette carte.\\nCréez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Montre-moi toute la délectable misère que tu as semée. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5de97b6e-9d70-451f-9bd1-b28a80459f96\', \'multiverseId\': 584464}, \'multiverseid\': 584464}, {\'name\': \'Carezza di Gix\', \'text\': \'Un avversario bersaglio rivela la sua mano. Scegli una carta non terra da quella mano. Quel giocatore scarta quella carta.\\nCrea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Mostrami tutta la deliziosa miseria che hai seminato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df45d33-b7bf-4fad-8521-3360b548194a\', \'multiverseId\': 584725}, \'multiverseid\': 584725}, {\'name\': \'ギックスの愛撫\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中から土地でないカード１枚を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーはそのカードを捨てる。\\nあなたはパワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「おまえの蒔いた愉快な不幸を、すべて見せてもらおう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52671cb8-60ed-4d88-b139-dfe29dd10812\', \'multiverseId\': 584986}, \'multiverseid\': 584986}, {\'name\': \'Carícia de Gix\', \'text\': \'O oponente alvo revela a própria mão. Você escolhe um card não de terreno da mão dele. Aquele jogador descarta aquele card.\\nCrie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Mostre-me todo o delicioso sofrimento que você semeou."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'259b4360-f603-43b1-8d0b-ddda5d1958bf\', \'multiverseId\': 585247}, \'multiverseid\': 585247}, {\'name\': \'基克斯的抚慰\', \'text\': \'目标对手展示其手牌。你选择其中一张非地牌。该牌手弃掉该牌。\\n派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「让我看看你经历的美味伤悲。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c42d481-cc88-4325-b59d-768741fdd082\', \'multiverseId\': 585508}, \'multiverseid\': 585508}]', '[{\'name\': "Tawnos\' Bastelei", \'text\': \'Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur oder ein Land deiner Wahl, das bzw. die du kontrollierst. Enttappe die bleibende Karte. Falls sie keine Kreatur ist, wird sie zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen zu einer 0/0 Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Während sein Meister versuchte, die Natur zu übertreffen, zielte Tawnos darauf ab, ihre Schönheit einzufangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584036&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7cdd7b2-bedb-43bf-8b22-0693f0ec368d\', \'multiverseId\': 584036}, \'multiverseid\': 584036}, {\'name\': \'Creación de Tawnos\', \'text\': \'Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el artefacto, criatura o tierra objetivo que controlas. Endereza ese permanente. Si no es una criatura, se convierte en una criatura 0/0 además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras que su maestro trataba de superar a la naturaleza, Tawnos intentaba capturar su belleza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a430772e-4e3e-483f-91c6-1a6b877277ff\', \'multiverseId\': 584297}, \'multiverseid\': 584297}, {\'name\': \'Bricolage de Tavnos\', \'text\': "Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une cible que vous contrôlez, artefact, créature ou terrain. Dégagez ce permanent. Si ce n\'est pas une créature, il devient une créature 0/0 en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Alors que son maître s\'évertuait à surpasser la nature, Tavnos aspirait à capturer sa beauté.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584558&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df53fc8-0d76-43ca-803b-7712aa6ef67e\', \'multiverseId\': 584558}, \'multiverseid\': 584558}, {\'name\': \'Fabbricazione di Tawnos\', \'text\': \'Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su un artefatto, una creatura o una terra bersaglio che controlli. STAPpa quel permanente. Se non è una creatura, diventa una creatura 0/0 in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre il suo maestro cercava di trascendere la natura, Tawnos ambiva a catturarne la bellezza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56fad5f3-47a2-4615-a6db-4af4198a300a\', \'multiverseId\': 584819}, \'multiverseid\': 584819}, {\'name\': \'タウノスの修繕\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトやクリーチャーや土地のうち１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。そのパーマネントをアンタップする。それがクリーチャーでないなら、それは他のタイプに加えて０/０のクリーチャーになる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'師が自然を超越しようとしたのに対し、タウノスは自然の美しさをとらえることを目指した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edb4331c-90e5-4034-af06-eca74fa3407f\', \'multiverseId\': 585080}, \'multiverseid\': 585080}, {\'name\': \'Engenhocagem de Tawnos\', \'text\': \'Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 no artefato, na criatura ou no terreno alvo que você controla. Desvire aquela permanente. Se ela não for uma criatura, ela se tornará uma criatura 0/0 além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto seu mestre tentava superar a natureza, Tawnos tentava capturar sua beleza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8d0a0a0-318f-4ac7-9ca8-15720b4d563f\', \'multiverseId\': 585341}, \'multiverseid\': 585341}, {\'name\': \'达硌士的打造\', \'text\': \'在目标由你操控的神器，生物或地上放置两个+1/+1指示物。重置该永久物。如果它不是生物，则它成为0/0生物，且仍具有原本类别。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'他的师傅试图超越自然，达硌士则致力于捕捉自然之美。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2615c55-62a1-4fc3-870d-a0b49c67464a\', \'multiverseId\': 585602}, \'multiverseid\': 585602}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aas-Heuschrecke\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Aas-Heuschrecke ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners ins Exil. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte war, verliert jener Spieler 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'Keine Ehre. Kein Ruhm. Keine Überreste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebaf9b16-da43-4b88-8c20-3edb24288b26\', \'multiverseId\': 583933}, \'multiverseid\': 583933}, {\'name\': \'Langosta carroñera\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Langosta carroñera entre al campo de batalla, exilia la carta objetivo del cementerio de un oponente. Si era una carta de criatura, ese jugador pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Sin honor. Sin gloria. Sin restos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5052fb80-3ee2-41fb-8a03-122dc2a8b326\', \'multiverseId\': 584194}, \'multiverseid\': 584194}, {\'name\': \'Sauterelle charognarde\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Sauterelle charognarde arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire. Si c\'était une carte de créature, ce joueur perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte et horreur\', \'flavor\': \'Sans honneur. Sans gloire. Sans restes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e584c59-b24a-4399-b307-6e9a6a045708\', \'multiverseId\': 584455}, \'multiverseid\': 584455}, {\'name\': \'Locusta delle Carogne\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Locusta delle Carogne entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una carta bersaglio dal cimitero di un avversario. Se era una carta creatura, quel giocatore perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Niente onore. Niente gloria. Niente avanzi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdc57405-885b-4c18-ada6-f4833785c690\', \'multiverseId\': 584716}, \'multiverseid\': 584716}, {\'name\': \'屍肉蝗\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n屍肉蝗が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手の墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。それがクリーチャー・カードであったなら、そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'誉れはない。栄光はない。何一つ、残りはしない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43d843c8-f779-46ea-afc9-e4916d3c677a\', \'multiverseId\': 584977}, \'multiverseid\': 584977}, {\'name\': \'Gafanhoto Necrófago\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Gafanhoto Necrófago entrar no campo de batalha, exile o card alvo do cemitério de um oponente. Se era um card de criatura, aquele jogador perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto Horror\', \'flavor\': \'Sem honra. Sem glória. Sem sobras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c365d20e-31e8-4340-abec-7ea9afcb1cad\', \'multiverseId\': 585238}, \'multiverseid\': 585238}, {\'name\': \'腐肉蝗虫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当腐肉蝗虫进战场时，将目标牌从对手的坟墓场放逐。若它是生物牌，则该牌手失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': \'绝不光彩。绝不光荣。绝不剩余。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1670c854-e57b-4787-b2d2-b4ca6b4f2028\', \'multiverseId\': 585499}, \'multiverseid\': 585499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abheben\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+0 und hat Flugfähigkeit und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, ziehe eine Karte."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Der letzte gemeinsame glückliche Moment der Brüder war, als sie den uralten Thopter flogen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583911&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b073eb6-b9db-462f-a336-c4ffee125103\', \'multiverseId\': 583911}, \'multiverseid\': 583911}, {\'name\': \'Alzar el vuelo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+0 y tiene la habilidad de volar y "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, roba una carta".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque ninguno de los hermanos estaba dispuesto a admitirlo, hacer volar el viejo tóptero fue el último momento de felicidad que compartieron.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a1f4b47-8c4c-4a98-bbd4-a753f726574a\', \'multiverseId\': 584172}, \'multiverseid\': 584172}, {\'name\': \'Décollage\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+0 et a le vol et « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, piochez une carte. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Bien qu\'aucun des deux frères n\'oserait l\'avouer, piloter l\'ancien mécanoptère avait été leur dernier moment heureux ensemble.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb885e28-38ff-467b-8e75-59df7e81a3e4\', \'multiverseId\': 584433}, \'multiverseid\': 584433}, {\'name\': \'Prendere il Volo\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+0 e ha volare e "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, pesca una carta".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "Anche se nessuno dei due fratelli lo avrebbe mai ammesso, il volo dell\'antico tottero fu l\'ultimo momento felice vissuto insieme.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b57d5014-176a-467d-b01a-8cf286e14be4\', \'multiverseId\': 584694}, \'multiverseid\': 584694}, {\'name\': \'飛び立ち\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け、飛行と「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、カード１枚を引く。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'兄も弟も認めようとはしなかったが、太古の飛行機械を飛ばしたのが、共に幸せに過ごした最後のひとときだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98f442d2-1598-4691-b2d5-c85fe4353560\', \'multiverseId\': 584955}, \'multiverseid\': 584955}, {\'name\': \'Alçar Voo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+0 e tem voar e "Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, compre um card".\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Embora nenhum dos dois irmãos admitisse, o voo no antigo tóptero fora seu último momento de felicidade juntos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8a21219-e955-42db-bbca-e951d5834909\', \'multiverseId\': 585216}, \'multiverseid\': 585216}, {\'name\': \'腾跃飞空\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+0且具有飞行与「每当此生物攻击时，抓一张牌。」\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'虽然两兄弟都不愿承认，但合力让远古振翼机重新腾空，是他们共享的最后一段快乐时光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d242cd27-9db0-4cf5-9ebe-5d566b20062e\', \'multiverseId\': 585477}, \'multiverseid\': 585477}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abrisszone\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Abrisszone: Zerstöre ein Nichtstandardland deiner Wahl, das ein Gegner kontrolliert. Der Beherrscher des Landes kann seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen. Du kannst deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584100&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c1f038-091b-4256-b3b5-45ab87657792\', \'multiverseId\': 584100}, \'multiverseid\': 584100}, {\'name\': \'Campo de demolición\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Campo de demolición: Destruye la tierra no básica objetivo que controla un oponente. El controlador de esa tierra puede buscar en su biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla y luego barajar. Tú puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75a38472-b720-4e9a-b1ed-f33b75d232f3\', \'multiverseId\': 584361}, \'multiverseid\': 584361}, {\'name\': \'Champ de démolition\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Champ de démolition : Détruisez un terrain non-base ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Le contrôleur de ce terrain peut chercher dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille, puis mélanger. Vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584622&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29054430-be97-4372-adec-91034691f693\', \'multiverseId\': 584622}, \'multiverseid\': 584622}, {\'name\': \'Campo di Demolizione\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Campo di Demolizione: Distruggi una terra non base bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Il controllore di quella terra può passare in rassegna il suo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescolare. Puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4ae1439-eb2e-4060-afd7-c41c77ccafcd\', \'multiverseId\': 584883}, \'multiverseid\': 584883}, {\'name\': \'解体爆破場\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 解体爆破場を生け贄に捧げる：対戦相手がコントロールしていて基本でない土地１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。その土地のコントローラーは「自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b2c7fbb-22d7-4155-8dd1-926f19bd2418\', \'multiverseId\': 585144}, \'multiverseid\': 585144}, {\'name\': \'Campo de Demolição\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Campo de Demolição: Destrua o terreno alvo não básico que um oponente controla. O controlador daquele terreno pode procurar no próprio grimório um card de terreno básico, colocá-lo no campo de batalha e depois embaralhar. Você pode procurar em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, colocá-lo no campo de batalha e depois embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e21ca2c4-a680-4e1f-ae95-a9c417e83116\', \'multiverseId\': 585405}, \'multiverseid\': 585405}, {\'name\': \'颓垣废址\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲颓垣废址：消灭目标由对手操控的非基本地。该地的操控者可以从其牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a7faf62-6575-41a0-8b1a-a18f23a1a190\', \'multiverseId\': 585666}, \'multiverseid\': 585666}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adept von Lat-Nam\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Adepten von Lat-Nam.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Jedes Buch ist ein Tor zur Erleuchtung. Neugier ist dein Schlüssel."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c5ad8e2-47f9-44cf-a6b4-3292b19ab1d5\', \'multiverseId\': 583902}, \'multiverseid\': 583902}, {\'name\': \'Adepto de Lat-Nam\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Adepto de Lat-Nam.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada libro es una puerta hacia la iluminación. La curiosidad es la llave".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e2c5565-a00f-49ce-809d-25009aa5e5e2\', \'multiverseId\': 584163}, \'multiverseid\': 584163}, {\'name\': \'Expert de Lat-Nam\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Expert de Lat-Nam.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Chaque livre est une porte s\'ouvrant sur l\'illumination. La curiosité est votre clé. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584424&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2349a4ba-be3c-4397-b249-fe36f1f37be7\', \'multiverseId\': 584424}, \'multiverseid\': 584424}, {\'name\': \'Adepto di Lat-Nam\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Adepto di Lat-Nam.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni libro è una porta che conduce all\\\'illuminazione. La curiosità è la chiave che la apre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bac3a5eb-29c1-46d4-b65a-f896e9773510\', \'multiverseId\': 584685}, \'multiverseid\': 584685}, {\'name\': \'ラト＝ナムの達人\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、ラト＝ナムの達人の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「すべての書物は啓発への戸口である。好奇心があなたの鍵だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9df527b7-a7ec-4c30-9759-f3bbab86ab76\', \'multiverseId\': 584946}, \'multiverseid\': 584946}, {\'name\': \'Adepto de Lat-Nam\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você comprar seu segundo card a cada turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Adepto de Lat-Nam.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Todo livro é uma porta para a iluminação. A curiosidade é a chave."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0144544-bd6b-40be-9b0f-72d7c017ef61\', \'multiverseId\': 585207}, \'multiverseid\': 585207}, {\'name\': \'拉特南专家\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，在拉特南专家上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「每本著作都是通向启迪之门。求知欲则是你打开大门的钥匙。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'039e772e-5974-4057-9bd2-5cd847c4f56b\', \'multiverseId\': 585468}, \'multiverseid\': 585468}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aeronautenkavallerie\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Aeronautenkavallerie ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf einen anderen Soldaten deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Auf dem Boden werden Kriege geführt, aber in der Luft werden sie gewonnen."\\n—Harbin, Pilot der Vorhut\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583847&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c904731-d341-40a3-a9e6-b3ef5945ba01\', \'multiverseId\': 583847}, \'multiverseid\': 583847}, {\'name\': \'Caballería aeronauta\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Caballería aeronauta entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre otro Soldado objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Las guerras se luchan en tierra, pero se ganan en el aire".\\n—Harbin, aviador de vanguardia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb66fb1e-775d-4858-9d14-ca3592c633b3\', \'multiverseId\': 584108}, \'multiverseid\': 584108}, {\'name\': "Cavalerie d\'aéronautes", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Cavalerie d\'aéronautes arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur un autre soldat ciblé que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Les guerres ont lieu au sol, mais c\'est dans les airs qu\'elles sont gagnées. »\\n—Harbin, aviateur d\'avant-garde", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584369&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce52b4c6-28f2-4d24-928c-7ba980a81c1f\', \'multiverseId\': 584369}, \'multiverseid\': 584369}, {\'name\': \'Cavalleria Aeronautica\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Cavalleria Aeronautica entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su un altro Soldato bersaglio che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Le guerre vengono combattute a terra, ma è nei cieli che si decidono."\\n—Harbin, aviatore dell\\\'avanguardia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'535379ee-5c20-4611-a1c9-dcba466249d6\', \'multiverseId\': 584630}, \'multiverseid\': 584630}, {\'name\': \'飛空士の騎兵部隊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n飛空士の騎兵部隊が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない兵士１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「戦争は地上で行なわれるが、決するのは空だ。」\\n――先兵の飛行士、ハービン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be2f3f0b-21b5-4901-ad06-cd9302f46b92\', \'multiverseId\': 584891}, \'multiverseid\': 584891}, {\'name\': \'Cavalaria de Aeronautas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Cavalaria de Aeronautas entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em outro Soldado alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"As batalhas podem ser travadas na terra, mas é no ar que elas são ganhas."\\n— Harbin, aviador da vanguarda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e17ae86f-ce87-4142-b2bc-5523f264d476\', \'multiverseId\': 585152}, \'multiverseid\': 585152}, {\'name\': \'空行骑兵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当空行骑兵进战场时，在另一个目标由你操控的士兵上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「兴战于陆地，决胜于天空。」\\n～飞行先锋哈宾\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ff89d3d-78db-48ac-8c8a-9e323de1e4d4\', \'multiverseId\': 585413}, \'multiverseid\': 585413}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akribische Ausgrabung\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}: Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Falls sie Exhumieren hat, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil und bringe sie dann auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Denkt immer daran, meine Schüler, falls es summt oder surrt: Nicht berühren!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583862&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94ce441d-e8e0-4954-bd92-e3aa5aead2ee\', \'multiverseId\': 583862}, \'multiverseid\': 583862}, {\'name\': \'Excavación meticulosa\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}: Regresa el permanente objetivo que controlas a la mano de su propietario. Si tiene la habilidad de desenterrar, en vez de eso, exílialo. Luego, regresa esa carta a la mano de su propietario. Activa esto solo durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Recuerden, alumnos: si brilla, zumba o chirría, ¡no lo toquen!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5567b580-db66-44c1-8d57-1ccbb99e2f37\', \'multiverseId\': 584123}, \'multiverseid\': 584123}, {\'name\': \'Excavation méticuleuse\', \'text\': "{2}{W} : Renvoyez un permanent ciblé que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire. S\'il a l\'exhumation, à la place exilez-le, puis renvoyez cette carte dans la main de son propriétaire. N\'activez que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« N\'oubliez pas, chers étudiants. Si ça luit, si ça bourdonne ou si ça tourne, n\'y touchez pas ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584384&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92b9d663-8ade-476f-b7b2-bd6ea49dab3a\', \'multiverseId\': 584384}, \'multiverseid\': 584384}, {\'name\': \'Scavo Meticoloso\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}: Fai tornare un permanente bersaglio che controlli in mano al suo proprietario. Se ha dissotterrare, invece esilialo, poi fai tornare quella carta in mano al suo proprietario. Attiva solo durante il tuo turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ricordate, studenti: se s\\\'illumina o emette un ronzio, non toccatelo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e940f37-fdbc-4d0f-9d58-cbcd4e3f424e\', \'multiverseId\': 584645}, \'multiverseid\': 584645}, {\'name\': \'行き届いた採掘\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}：あなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。それが蘇生を持っているなら、代わりにそれを追放する。その後、そのカードをオーナーの手札に戻す。あなたのターン中にしか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「生徒諸君、光ったり、唸り音を立てていたりしたなら、触ってはならないぞ。忘れるな！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dcba9e7-1804-47c5-85fb-84d8a163c1da\', \'multiverseId\': 584906}, \'multiverseid\': 584906}, {\'name\': \'Escavação Meticulosa\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}: Devolva a permanente alvo que você controla para a mão de seu dono. Se ela tiver desenterrar, em vez disso, exile-a e depois devolva aquele card para a mão de seu dono. Ative apenas durante seu turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Lembrem-se, alunos, se brilhar, zumbir ou ranger, não toquem!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8081d6b-f8df-45b8-879e-98b7c74fbf1e\', \'multiverseId\': 585167}, \'multiverseid\': 585167}, {\'name\': \'细工掘古\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}：将目标由你操控的永久物移回其拥有者手上。如果它具有破坟异能，则改为将它放逐，然后将该牌移回其拥有者手上。只能于你的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「同学们切记，如果是发光、嗡响或啸叫的，千万别碰！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29fe5f3f-1de1-4dec-be39-bd79ffb87b0d\', \'multiverseId\': 585428}, \'multiverseid\': 585428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Altar des Transmogranten\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}{C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Erzeuge einen 3/3 farblosen Zombie-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Der menschliche Körper kann wie jede andere Maschine auch in seine Einzelteile zerlegt werden."\\n—Ashnod\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6b2bb73-3018-4022-9c12-d232103843c8\', \'multiverseId\': 583970}, \'multiverseid\': 583970}, {\'name\': \'Altar de transmutación\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura: Agrega {C}{C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Zombie incolora 3/3. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Al igual que cualquier otra máquina, el cuerpo humano se puede desmontar para aprovechar sus piezas".\\n—Ashnod\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b05b312-eb7b-4c26-ac8b-73c490ef8a35\', \'multiverseId\': 584231}, \'multiverseid\': 584231}, {\'name\': \'Autel des transfigurants\', \'text\': "{B}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Ajoutez {C}{C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Zombie. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Le corps humain, comme toute autre machine, peut être démonté pour récupérer des pièces détachées. »\\n—Ashnod\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584492&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c425bc1-d9f6-4331-8722-8b5c105161f7\', \'multiverseId\': 584492}, \'multiverseid\': 584492}, {\'name\': \'Altare del Trasmutatore\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Aggiungi {C}{C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Zombie 3/3 incolore. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Il corpo umano, come ogni altra macchina, può essere smantellato per ricavarne pezzi di ricambio."\\n—Ashnod\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1142a14a-e32f-43b9-ab79-e168e37492dd\', \'multiverseId\': 584753}, \'multiverseid\': 584753}, {\'name\': \'人体改造機の供犠台\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：{C}{C}{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：無色の３/３のゾンビ・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「他の機械と同じように、人間の肉体からも部品を取ることができるのよ。」\\n――アシュノッド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92b5f32d-0e25-4908-904a-078fd79c3aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 585014}, \'multiverseid\': 585014}, {\'name\': \'Altar Transmutador\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, sacrifique uma criatura: Adicione {C}{C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique uma criatura: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Zumbi incolor 3/3. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O corpo humano, como qualquer outra máquina, pode ser desmontado para a obtenção de peças."\\n— Ashnod\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a901d7d-7507-4ea2-8275-28d7a9832a6d\', \'multiverseId\': 585275}, \'multiverseid\': 585275}, {\'name\': \'变械祭坛\', \'text\': \'{B}，{T}，牺牲一个生物：加{C}{C}{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲一个生物：派出一个3/3无色灵俑衍生神器生物。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「人身躯体就跟其他机械一样，能够拆解备用。」\\n～阿士诺\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1337062-8a88-4796-9906-55cf63b55559\', \'multiverseId\': 585536}, \'multiverseid\': 585536}]', '[{\'name\': \'An die Kehle gehen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Nichtartefaktkreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als Titania Frieden anbot, erteilte Urza ihr lediglich eine Absage. Mishra hingegen ließ ihr Volk für die Beleidigung zahlen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583948&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eaab8b3-8dee-4aaa-a0a0-9deb33249cef\', \'multiverseId\': 583948}, \'multiverseid\': 583948}, {\'name\': \'Golpe a la garganta\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando Titania ofreció la paz, Urza se limitó a rechazarla. Sin embargo, Mishra hizo que su gente pagara por el insulto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54359cd4-a3e8-4dca-a9c3-873605f9bb47\', \'multiverseId\': 584209}, \'multiverseid\': 584209}, {\'name\': \'Droit à la gorge\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature non-artefact ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Lorsque Titania lui proposa la paix, Urza refusa, tout simplement. Mishra fit payer à son peuple son insulte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584470&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa5525ec-5f13-4061-8f86-68356a8cf9cf\', \'multiverseId\': 584470}, \'multiverseid\': 584470}, {\'name\': \'Mirare alla Gola\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura non artefatto bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Quando Titania offrì la pace, Urza semplicemente rifiutò. Mishra colpì la sua gente per farle pagare l\'affronto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d494250-ca10-4526-8162-2929e3666c17\', \'multiverseId\': 584731}, \'multiverseid\': 584731}, {\'name\': \'喉首狙い\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ティタニアが和平を申し出ても、ウルザはそれをはねつけるだけだった。ミシュラは彼女の民に、その侮辱の報復をした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'454c4b8a-8c71-403d-b282-3f6993e5c1ff\', \'multiverseId\': 584992}, \'multiverseid\': 584992}, {\'name\': \'Atacar na Jugular\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura não artefato alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quando Titânia ofereceu a paz, Urza se limitou a recusar. Mishra fez o povo dela pagar pelo insulto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e86ed138-430f-4bfe-868c-4d7d5852cf01\', \'multiverseId\': 585253}, \'multiverseid\': 585253}, {\'name\': \'直刺咽喉\', \'text\': \'消灭目标非神器的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'当泰坦尼亚提议收兵时，克撒只不过言辞上加以拒绝。而米斯拉则以行动令她的子民为此等羞辱付出代价。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb874ad8-ee45-460f-857d-950887630239\', \'multiverseId\': 585514}, \'multiverseid\': 585514}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arbalesteningenieure\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Arbalesteningenieure ins Spiel kommen, bestimme eines —\\n• Die Arbalesteningenieure fügen einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n• Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält sie Eile und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\n• Erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584050&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11737cd4-50b3-49ce-a7d2-fd6a0f905a44\', \'multiverseId\': 584050}, \'multiverseid\': 584050}, {\'name\': \'Ingenieras de arbalestas\', \'text\': \'Cuando las Ingenieras de arbalestas entren al campo de batalla, elige uno:\\n• Las Ingenieras de arbalestas hacen 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n• Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Gana las habilidades de arrollar y prisa hasta el final del turno.\\n• Crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1736c2f-f3fc-45af-b01e-dfd63a15d901\', \'multiverseId\': 584311}, \'multiverseid\': 584311}, {\'name\': \'Ingénieurs arbalestriers\', \'text\': "Quand les Ingénieurs arbalestriers arrivent sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Les Ingénieurs arbalestriers infligent 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée. Elle acquiert le piétinement et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584572&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e075bf9-c376-4e8b-9a36-c148c2ea1920\', \'multiverseId\': 584572}, \'multiverseid\': 584572}, {\'name\': \'Ingegneri della Balestra\', \'text\': \'Quando gli Ingegneri della Balestra entrano nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno —\\n• Gli Ingegneri della Balestra infliggono 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n• Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. Ha travolgere e rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'284cd9fd-48e7-48cf-a492-0b8e1b8c60e1\', \'multiverseId\': 584833}, \'multiverseid\': 584833}, {\'name\': \'大石弓の技師\', \'text\': \'大石弓の技師が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それはトランプルと速攻を得る。\\n・パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53436eb2-cdf2-40fd-95b9-6a68f8f5f877\', \'multiverseId\': 585094}, \'multiverseid\': 585094}, {\'name\': \'Engenheiras de Balestra\', \'text\': \'Quando Engenheiras de Balestra entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um —\\n• Engenheiras de Balestra causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\\n• Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo. Ela ganha atropelar e ímpeto até o final do turno.\\n• Crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ab2b152-fe98-4c98-ad34-de7244481b7f\', \'multiverseId\': 585355}, \'multiverseid\': 585355}, {\'name\': \'弩械工程师\', \'text\': \'当弩械工程师进战场时，选择一项～\\n•弩械工程师对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\\n•在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得践踏与敏捷异能直到回合结束。\\n•派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eec76f98-da02-4f5b-aec3-ad5a4a2bfb06\', \'multiverseId\': 585616}, \'multiverseid\': 585616}]', '[{\'name\': \'Argivischer Rächer\', \'text\': \'{1}: Der Argivische Rächer erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges -1/-1 sowie Flugfähigkeit, Wachsamkeit, Todesberührung oder Eile (du entscheidest).\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'Urza konnte sich mit einem einzigen vielseitigen Wesen nicht zufriedengeben, daher erschuf er eine ganze Heerschar anpassbarer Maschinen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584074&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ec747f4-2685-4a8a-9a8b-a0c2782cd1a9\', \'multiverseId\': 584074}, \'multiverseid\': 584074}, {\'name\': \'Vengador argiviano\', \'text\': \'{1}: Hasta el final del turno, el Vengador argiviano obtiene -1/-1 y gana a tu elección la habilidad de volar, vigilancia, toque mortal o prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Incapaz de decidirse por un solo ser versátil, Urza optó por crear miles de máquinas capaces de adaptarse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf950916-ae43-409d-8602-644dbc335523\', \'multiverseId\': 584335}, \'multiverseid\': 584335}, {\'name\': \'Vengeur argivian\', \'text\': "{1} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, le Vengeur argivian gagne -1/-1 et acquiert, selon votre choix, le vol, la vigilance, le contact mortel ou la célérité.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : changeforme\', \'flavor\': \'Sans pouvoir se décider sur un être polyvalent, Urza préféra créer des tonnes de machines adaptables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584596&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31a285da-2fef-4788-a709-102685982710\', \'multiverseId\': 584596}, \'multiverseid\': 584596}, {\'name\': \'Vendicatore di Argivia\', \'text\': \'{1}: Fino alla fine del turno, il Vendicatore di Argivia prende -1/-1 e ha a tua scelta volare, cautela, tocco letale o rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Non riuscendo a decidersi su un solo essere versatile, Urza scelse di creare una miriade di macchine adattabili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b764c0d0-ba1d-4a1f-9eba-25c167e376ee\', \'multiverseId\': 584857}, \'multiverseid\': 584857}, {\'name\': \'アルガイヴの報復者\', \'text\': \'{1}：ターン終了時まで、アルガイヴの報復者は－１/－１の修整を受け、飛行や警戒や接死や速攻のうちあなたが選んだ１つを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'多目的機をただひとつ造るだけでは飽き足らず、ウルザは無数の適応型機械を造ることにした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'012ba637-426e-4d6b-bf9b-913ed8526a6d\', \'multiverseId\': 585118}, \'multiverseid\': 585118}, {\'name\': \'Vingador Argiviano\', \'text\': \'{1}: Até o final do turno, Vingador Argiviano recebe -1/-1 e ganha voar, vigilância, toque mortífero ou ímpeto, à sua escolha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Incapaz de se contentar com um único ente versátil, Urza resolveu criar uma miríade de máquinas adaptáveis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de01cf53-63e1-4f76-90fa-f2d1564e575e\', \'multiverseId\': 585379}, \'multiverseid\': 585379}, {\'name\': \'阿基夫复仇者\', \'text\': \'{1}：选择飞行，警戒，死触或敏捷。直到回合结束，阿基夫的复仇者得-1/-1且获得该异能。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': \'克撒不满足于只有一台多用途机械，决定要造出一支自适应大军。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04db3ae-ef2a-4554-8abe-8f03be8ae4da\', \'multiverseId\': 585640}, \'multiverseid\': 585640}]', '[{\'name\': \'Argothische Opportunistin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Argothische Opportunistin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Natur passt sich an. Wir sollten es ihr gleichtun."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb5bbdfd-9813-466b-9ee3-81c383653d32\', \'multiverseId\': 584012}, \'multiverseid\': 584012}, {\'name\': \'Oportunista argotiana\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Oportunista argotiana entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La naturaleza se adapta y nosotros también debemos hacerlo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'245c0a0c-6671-4b8e-89b6-8bcd1d1d08c1\', \'multiverseId\': 584273}, \'multiverseid\': 584273}, {\'name\': \'Opportuniste argothienne\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Opportuniste argothienne arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "« La nature s\'adapte. Nous devrions en faire autant. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584534&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'716a885a-838e-45cb-9ce9-b4388942ed36\', \'multiverseId\': 584534}, \'multiverseid\': 584534}, {\'name\': \'Opportunista Argothiana\', \'text\': \'Quando l\\\'Opportunista Argothiana entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La natura si adatta. Dovremmo fare lo stesso anche noi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c3e69ed-555d-4b21-a4d8-e17c8b1fd2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 584795}, \'multiverseid\': 584795}, {\'name\': \'アルゴスの日和見主義者\', \'text\': \'アルゴスの日和見主義者が戦場に出たとき、パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「自然は適応するものだ。然ればこそ、我らも斯くあらん。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d491a721-3568-4744-bc12-772ccbe5ab83\', \'multiverseId\': 585056}, \'multiverseid\': 585056}, {\'name\': \'Oportunista Argothiana\', \'text\': \'Quando Oportunista Argothiana entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"A natureza sempre se adapta. Devíamos fazer o mesmo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed0f8673-8e22-4e90-9d5a-a7858c7ca8cb\', \'multiverseId\': 585317}, \'multiverseid\': 585317}, {\'name\': \'亚格斯投机者\', \'text\': \'当亚格斯投机者进战场时，派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「自然会自我适应。我们也应当如此。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'259479f7-52cd-40e6-aafb-822359e30829\', \'multiverseId\': 585578}, \'multiverseid\': 585578}]', '[{\'name\': \'Argothische Sylphide\', \'text\': \'Die Argothische Sylphide kann von Artefaktkreaturen nicht geblockt werden.\\n{7}: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf die Argothische Sylphide.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Macht die Luftschächte nächstes Mal enger!"\\n—Urza, Anweisungen an seine Ingenieure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efb5c990-4444-4391-adb9-283d2026a6df\', \'multiverseId\': 584013}, \'multiverseid\': 584013}, {\'name\': \'Duende argotiana\', \'text\': \'La Duende argotiana no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas artefacto.\\n{7}: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la Duende argotiana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hada\', \'flavor\': \'"¡La próxima vez, hagan las aberturas de ventilación más pequeñas!".\\n—Urza, notas a sus ingenieros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a2ce56f-6ef9-44a6-9a7c-da200dbe56bb\', \'multiverseId\': 584274}, \'multiverseid\': 584274}, {\'name\': \'Farfadette argothienne\', \'text\': \'La Farfadette argothienne ne peut pas être bloquée par les créatures-artefacts.\\n{7} : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur la Farfadette argothienne.\', \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée\', \'flavor\': "« La prochaine fois, concevez des conduits d\'échappement plus petits ! »\\n—Urza, notes à ses ingénieurs", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584535&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc8f2a37-fe5c-4832-b43e-8a5a3b999c03\', \'multiverseId\': 584535}, \'multiverseid\': 584535}, {\'name\': \'Folletta Argothiana\', \'text\': \'La Folletta Argothiana non può essere bloccata da creature artefatto.\\n{7}: Metti due segnalini +1/+1 sulla Folletta Argothiana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'"Progettate sfiati di scarico di dimensioni più ridotte, la prossima volta!"\\n—Urza, appunti ai suoi ingegneri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50ac2b1e-f42b-4a24-9aba-5c4fb22810ca\', \'multiverseId\': 584796}, \'multiverseid\': 584796}, {\'name\': \'アルゴスのスプライト\', \'text\': \'アルゴスのスプライトは、アーティファクト・クリーチャーにはブロックされない。\\n{7}：アルゴスのスプライトの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー\', \'flavor\': \'「次は排気口をもっと小さくしておけ！」\\n――ウルザ、配下の技師へのメモ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02dc0899-da23-4efc-957f-90fa8105dca1\', \'multiverseId\': 585057}, \'multiverseid\': 585057}, {\'name\': \'Sílfide Argothiana\', \'text\': \'Sílfide Argothiana não pode ser bloqueada por criaturas artefato.\\n{7}: Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em Sílfide Argothiana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada\', \'flavor\': \'"Faça exaustores menores da próxima vez!"\\n— Urza, observações para seus engenheiros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bd5e456-6d88-40cf-8c95-0b1c2a8d731a\', \'multiverseId\': 585318}, \'multiverseid\': 585318}, {\'name\': \'亚格斯仙子\', \'text\': \'亚格斯仙子不能被神器生物阻挡。\\n{7}：在亚格斯仙子上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵\', \'flavor\': \'「下次把排气口造小一点！」\\n～克撒，给工程师的批注\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82e949d4-b873-4773-b234-25aa211d7d64\', \'multiverseId\': 585579}, \'multiverseid\': 585579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Stellvertreter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Arkane Stellvertreter ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, schicke eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich der Stärke des Arkanen Stellvertreters aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere die Karte. Du kannst die Kopie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n2/1\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583921&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'545d4370-db64-4850-97ae-9b6b7bf4f2d5\', \'multiverseId\': 583921}, \'multiverseid\': 583921}, {\'name\': \'Agente arcano\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Agente arcano entre al campo de batalla, si lo lanzaste, exilia de tu cementerio la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo con valor de maná menor o igual que la fuerza del Agente arcano. Copia esa carta. Puedes lanzar la copia sin pagar su coste de maná.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n2/1\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Hechicero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f07deb3e-45bd-435d-8f6d-5ab65d8d79be\', \'multiverseId\': 584182}, \'multiverseid\': 584182}, {\'name\': \'Intermédiaire ésotérique\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Intermédiaire ésotérique arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à la force de l\'Intermédiaire ésotérique depuis votre cimetière. Copiez cette carte. Vous pouvez lancer la copie sans payer son coût de mana.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n2/1", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e746d1b2-5b97-4d2a-84e3-d4159d2724f9\', \'multiverseId\': 584443}, \'multiverseid\': 584443}, {\'name\': \'Sostituto Arcano\', \'text\': \'Quando il Sostituto Arcano entra nel campo di battaglia, se lo hai lanciato, esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore alla forza del Sostituto Arcano dal tuo cimitero. Copia quella carta. Puoi lanciare la copia senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n2/1\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5bb192b-ed59-41e1-aeda-efae5fc8e8a2\', \'multiverseId\': 584704}, \'multiverseid\': 584704}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の代理者\', \'text\': \'秘儀の代理者が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が秘術の代理者のパワー以下でありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。そのカードをコピーする。あなたは「そのコピーをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。」を選んでもよい。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n２/１\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e75b98f-2b29-4ddd-910f-f3472247e32c\', \'multiverseId\': 584965}, \'multiverseid\': 584965}, {\'name\': \'Substituto Arcano\', \'text\': \'Quando Substituto Arcano entrar no campo de batalha, se você o tiver conjurado, exile de seu cemitério o card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço alvo com valor de mana inferior ou igual ao poder de Substituto Arcano. Copie aquele card. Você pode conjurar a cópia sem pagar seu custo de mana.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n2/1\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'736aa7f7-94ff-4a74-bd65-6d019c363297\', \'multiverseId\': 585226}, \'multiverseid\': 585226}, {\'name\': \'秘法代行械\', \'text\': \'当秘法代行械进战场时，若它经你施放，则将目标法术力值等于或小于秘法代行械力量的瞬间或法术牌从你坟墓场放逐。复制该牌。你可以施放该复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n2/1\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4767180a-7df3-498e-aef9-758483896a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 585487}, \'multiverseid\': 585487}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Stellvertreter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Arkane Stellvertreter ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, schicke eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich der Stärke des Arkanen Stellvertreters aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere die Karte. Du kannst die Kopie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n2/1\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585794&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'042e316d-8126-4957-95df-11457d8b7a08\', \'multiverseId\': 585794}, \'multiverseid\': 585794}, {\'name\': \'Intermédiaire ésotérique\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Intermédiaire ésotérique arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à la force de l\'Intermédiaire ésotérique depuis votre cimetière. Copiez cette carte. Vous pouvez lancer la copie sans payer son coût de mana.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n2/1", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1379e5f-31d6-4630-ab0a-a667fad18253\', \'multiverseId\': 585866}, \'multiverseid\': 585866}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の代理者\', \'text\': \'秘儀の代理者が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が秘術の代理者のパワー以下でありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。そのカードをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n２/１\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72877853-1957-430f-94e1-c54f3f7af4d3\', \'multiverseId\': 585938}, \'multiverseid\': 585938}, {\'name\': \'秘法代行械\', \'text\': \'当秘法代行械进战场时，若它经你施放，则将目标法术力值等于或小于秘法代行械力量的瞬间或法术牌从你坟墓场放逐。复制该牌。你可以施放该复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{U}{U}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n2/1\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f961fbf7-0de3-433c-b239-e7f77c191ccd\', \'multiverseId\': 586010}, \'multiverseid\': 586010}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashnod die Fleischmechanikerin\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn Ashnod die Fleischmechanikerin angreift, kannst du eine andere Kreatur opfern. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein.\\n{5}, schicke eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen getappten 3/3 farblosen Zombie-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'362d4d0e-ce22-4b40-b254-eb42f97b3fa8\', \'multiverseId\': 583930}, \'multiverseid\': 583930}, {\'name\': \'Ashnod, mecánica de la carne\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nSiempre que Ashnod, mecánica de la carne ataque, puedes sacrificar otra criatura. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada.\\n{5}, exiliar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Zombie incolora 3/3 girada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b46f13-67a4-4524-9cb6-76a9faec4f15\', \'multiverseId\': 584191}, \'multiverseid\': 584191}, {\'name\': \'Ashnod, mécaniste de chair\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Ashnod, mécaniste de chair attaque, vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé.\\n{5}, exilez une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière : Créez, engagé, un jeton de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Zombie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba0a63b1-8c39-41f6-af90-3423dafaa592\', \'multiverseId\': 584452}, \'multiverseid\': 584452}, {\'name\': \'Ashnod, Meccanista della Carne\', \'text\': "Tocco letale\\nOgniqualvolta Ashnod, Meccanista della Carne attacca, puoi sacrificare un\'altra creatura. Se lo fai, crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata.\\n{5}, Esilia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Zombie 3/3 incolore TAPpata.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3463c8ed-c72f-48fc-93ae-5cc85617196d\', \'multiverseId\': 584713}, \'multiverseid\': 584713}, {\'name\': \'肉体装置技師、アシュノッド\', \'text\': \'接死\\n肉体装置技師、アシュノッドが攻撃するたび、あなたはこれでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。\\n{5}, あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放する：無色の３/３のゾンビ・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体をタップ状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85c4dbaa-0d61-4198-a913-9907498d926b\', \'multiverseId\': 584974}, \'multiverseid\': 584974}, {\'name\': \'Ashnod, Mecanista da Carne\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nToda vez que Ashnod, Mecanista da Carne, ataca, você pode sacrificar outra criatura. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada.\\n{5}, exile um card de criatura de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Zumbi incolor 3/3 virada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf011551-c0cb-434d-887b-b10ff379d635\', \'multiverseId\': 585235}, \'multiverseid\': 585235}, {\'name\': \'肉身械师阿士诺\', \'text\': \'死触\\n每当肉身械师阿士诺攻击时，你可以牺牲另一个生物。若你如此作，则派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。\\n{5}，从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌：派出一个已横置的3/3无色灵俑衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5560701a-c6ea-4b91-aabf-8d21f8810fd0\', \'multiverseId\': 585496}, \'multiverseid\': 585496}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashnod die Fleischmechanikerin\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn Ashnod die Fleischmechanikerin angreift, kannst du eine andere Kreatur opfern. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein.\\n{5}, schicke eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen getappten 3/3 farblosen Zombie-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585798&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98547493-cee1-4b88-8328-5f6c5eecc410\', \'multiverseId\': 585798}, \'multiverseid\': 585798}, {\'name\': \'Ashnod, mécaniste de chair\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Ashnod, mécaniste de chair attaque, vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé.\\n{5}, exilez une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière : Créez, engagé, un jeton de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Zombie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585870&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efd6f559-5fcb-4158-9106-4f6779d17fa4\', \'multiverseId\': 585870}, \'multiverseid\': 585870}, {\'name\': \'肉体装置技師、アシュノッド\', \'text\': \'接死\\n肉体装置技師、アシュノッドが攻撃するたび、あなたはこれでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。\\n{5}, あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放する：無色の３/３のゾンビ・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体をタップ状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0317c9b-4cd2-494c-a5b7-02e64f619de8\', \'multiverseId\': 585942}, \'multiverseid\': 585942}, {\'name\': \'肉身械师阿士诺\', \'text\': \'死触\\n每当肉身械师阿士诺攻击时，你可以牺牲另一个生物。若你如此作，则派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。\\n{5}，从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌：派出一个已横置的3/3无色灵俑衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'396da088-222e-4a0d-9dcd-b361ffde2d95\', \'multiverseId\': 586014}, \'multiverseid\': 586014}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashnods Eingreifen\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +2/+0 und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt oder aus dem Spiel ins Exil geschickt wird, bringe sie auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück."\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Hör zu, Duck. Gix mischt auf beiden Seiten mit. Mishra wird uns kein Gehör schenken … aber Urza vielleicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89f075ef-f4c7-4181-a109-59f153a78308\', \'multiverseId\': 583931}, \'multiverseid\': 583931}, {\'name\': \'Intervención de Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana "Cuando esta criatura muera o vaya al exilio desde el campo de batalla, regrésala a la mano de su propietario".\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Escucha, Duck. Gix está en todas partes y juega con todos los bandos. Mishra no nos va a escuchar... Pero puede que Urza sí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'430470a2-3a1e-4715-a4bd-14de04940799\', \'multiverseId\': 584192}, \'multiverseid\': 584192}, {\'name\': "Intervention d\'Ashnod", \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert « Quand cette créature meurt ou est mise en exil depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez-la dans la main de son propriétaire. »", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Écoute-moi bien. Gix est partout ; il manipule tous les camps. Mishra refuse d\'écouter… mais Urza le fera peut-être. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c2e811d-b9aa-4a2a-8fa0-833d814ee416\', \'multiverseId\': 584453}, \'multiverseid\': 584453}, {\'name\': \'Intervento di Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha "Quando questa creatura muore o viene messa in esilio dal campo di battaglia, falla tornare in mano al suo proprietario".\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Stammi a sentire, Duck. Gix è ovunque e tesse le fila in entrambe le fazioni. Mishra non ha intenzione di ascoltare... ma forse lo farà Urza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0afaf5d-9bbe-4c47-8a9e-b3fca337ffef\', \'multiverseId\': 584714}, \'multiverseid\': 584714}, {\'name\': \'アシュノッドの介入\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け「このクリーチャーが死亡したか戦場から追放領域に置かれたとき、これをオーナーの手札に戻す。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「良く聞いて、ダック。ギックスはどこにでもいて、あらゆる陣営で活動しているの。ミシュラは聞いてくださらなくても、ウルザは聞いてくれるかもしれない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44699db7-e570-4ddc-929f-6644a8635eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 584975}, \'multiverseid\': 584975}, {\'name\': \'Intervenção de Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, a criatura alvo recebe +2/+0 e ganha "Quando esta criatura morrer ou for colocada no exílio vinda do campo de batalha, devolva-a para a mão de seu dono".\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Escuta, Duck. Gix está por toda parte e fazendo seu jogo duplo. Mishra não quer ouvir... mas talvez Urza ouça."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89713b33-f8f0-4fcd-9213-d5247e6f8e72\', \'multiverseId\': 585236}, \'multiverseid\': 585236}, {\'name\': \'阿士诺的干预\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+0且获得「当此生物死去或从战场进入放逐区时，将它移回其拥有者手上。」\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「听着，鸭鸭。基克斯势力无处不在，遍布各界。米斯拉听不进去…或许克撒愿听。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e329ce2-5ef7-454d-b89b-ac870bc4513f\', \'multiverseId\': 585497}, \'multiverseid\': 585497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashnods Ernter\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Ashnods Ernter angreift, schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil.\\nExhumieren {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51318cf8-dfc8-4538-9634-546e029a38de\', \'multiverseId\': 583963}, \'multiverseid\': 583963}, {\'name\': \'Segador de Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Segador de Ashnod ataque, exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio.\\nDesenterrar {1}{B}. ({1}{B}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdf89ba7-07ad-4b38-91a3-107a6abce049\', \'multiverseId\': 584224}, \'multiverseid\': 584224}, {\'name\': "Moissonneur d\'Ashnod", \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Moissonneur d\'Ashnod attaque, exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière.\\nExhumation {1}{B} ({1}{B} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584485&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f7f3492-2cc2-483b-86f0-a0a2b65a4b00\', \'multiverseId\': 584485}, \'multiverseid\': 584485}, {\'name\': \'Mietitore di Ashnod\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Mietitore di Ashnod attacca, esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero.\\nDissotterrare {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f35f16d-e70c-4319-b5d8-7875df91a760\', \'multiverseId\': 584746}, \'multiverseid\': 584746}, {\'name\': \'アシュノッドの収穫者\', \'text\': \'アシュノッドの収獲者が攻撃するたび、墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。\\n蘇生{1}{B}（{1}{B}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、あるいは、これが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7931992-ac5a-4b95-8706-fb162481273a\', \'multiverseId\': 585007}, \'multiverseid\': 585007}, {\'name\': \'Colheitadeira de Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Colheitadeira de Ashnod atacar, exile o card alvo de um cemitério.\\nDesenterrar {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94312316-6404-425f-8699-66d2ff0efe58\', \'multiverseId\': 585268}, \'multiverseid\': 585268}, {\'name\': \'阿士诺的索命械\', \'text\': \'每当阿士诺的索命械攻击时，将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。\\n破坟{1}{B}（{1}{B}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73b0f961-a5ca-4aeb-9e7c-df8054a34452\', \'multiverseId\': 585529}, \'multiverseid\': 585529}]', "[{'name': 'Aufklärer-Thopter', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Aufklärer-Thopter ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich seiner Stärke ist.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{U}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n2/3', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Thopter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583926&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9e72439-d647-48da-a503-911790d4a51b', 'multiverseId': 583926}, 'multiverseid': 583926}, {'name': 'Tóptero avistador', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Tóptero avistador entre al campo de batalla, adivina X, donde X es su fuerza.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{U}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n2/3', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Tóptero', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584187&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ece4f9a-2c81-4afd-a16b-8475ea431d84', 'multiverseId': 584187}, 'multiverseid': 584187}, {'name': 'Mécanoptère observateur', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Mécanoptère observateur arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard X, X étant sa force.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{U}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n2/3', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : mécanoptère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584448&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30f8c256-e3f2-4b2d-8803-e9694144b629', 'multiverseId': 584448}, 'multiverseid': 584448}, {'name': 'Tottero da Ricognizione', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando il Tottero da Ricognizione entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza X, dove X è la sua forza.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{U}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n2/3', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Tottero', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584709&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d0d2d94-3f41-44ee-bae4-dc4c88ba63dd', 'multiverseId': 584709}, 'multiverseid': 584709}, {'name': '観測用飛行機械', 'text': '飛行\\n観測用飛行機械が戦場に出たとき、占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはこれのパワーに等しい。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{U}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n２/３', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584970&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edeca75a-259c-4b13-a886-297eeda0b282', 'multiverseId': 584970}, 'multiverseid': 584970}, {'name': 'Tóptero Observador', 'text': 'Voar\\nQuando Tóptero Observador entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência X, sendo X seu poder.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{U}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n2/3', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Tóptero', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585231&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57d114a9-b2f2-4c78-aaf6-8c77ddd11315', 'multiverseId': 585231}, 'multiverseid': 585231}, {'name': '监视振翼机', 'text': '飞行\\n当监视振翼机进战场时，占卜X，X为其力量。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{U}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n2/3', 'type': '神器生物 ～振翼机', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585492&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '283b5df4-b0a8-4f7d-90f0-70eb2772d445', 'multiverseId': 585492}, 'multiverseid': 585492}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ausbessern und aufladen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Artefakt-, Verzauberungs- oder Planeswalkerkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Entfernt die Gefallenen, sie sind unnötiger Ballast."\\n—Rolf, Argivischer Mechaniker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b632ee5d-8f46-4396-a959-a3eb87679893\', \'multiverseId\': 583870}, \'multiverseid\': 583870}, {\'name\': \'Reparar y recargar\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de artefacto, encantamiento o planeswalker objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Echen fuera los cadáveres o hundirán la estructura".\\n—Rolf, mecánico argiviano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'935b7180-92d9-44d8-bbfd-bb49c0ec7b5a\', \'multiverseId\': 584131}, \'multiverseid\': 584131}, {\'name\': \'Réparation et recharge\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte d\'artefact, d\'enchantement ou de planeswalker ciblée. Créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Balancez les cadavres. Ils ne font qu\'alourdir l\'appareil. »\\n—Rolf, mécanicien argivian", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584392&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc526a08-f89a-4184-8fd4-99e3d66a4286\', \'multiverseId\': 584392}, \'multiverseid\': 584392}, {\'name\': \'Riparare e Ricaricare\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta artefatto, incantesimo o planeswalker bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Dobbiamo disfarci dei cadaveri. Saranno soltanto un peso."\\n—Rolf, meccanico di Argivia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f68183c7-9fc9-4562-b19a-aba0a284cccc\', \'multiverseId\': 584653}, \'multiverseid\': 584653}, {\'name\': \'修復と充電\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にありアーティファクトやエンチャントやプレインズウォーカーであるカードのうち１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「死体を捨てろ。躯体の重荷になるだけだ。」\\n――アルガイヴの整備士、ロルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c2ef9b4-5451-4a33-be54-17b007290dd6\', \'multiverseId\': 584914}, \'multiverseid\': 584914}, {\'name\': \'Reparar e Recarregar\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card alvo de artefato, encantamento ou planeswalker de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Jogue os corpos fora. Eles vão ser só peso morto."\\n— Rolf, mecânico argiviano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b188dd4-8353-47b7-8455-f1bcba689662\', \'multiverseId\': 585175}, \'multiverseid\': 585175}, {\'name\': \'整修充能\', \'text\': \'将目标神器，结界或鹏洛客牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「把遗体都抛出去。他们只会徒增重量。」\\n～阿基夫技师罗尔夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'287fbcdb-b482-442c-8751-152834c6a5c7\', \'multiverseId\': 585436}, \'multiverseid\': 585436}]', "[{'name': 'Autonomer Assemblierer', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit\\n{1}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf einen Montagearbeiter deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n2/2', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583880&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48bc06b7-ae36-4e6e-9f7e-7085e787e1eb', 'multiverseId': 583880}, 'multiverseid': 583880}, {'name': 'Ensamblador autónomo', 'text': 'Vigilancia.\\n{1}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Operario objetivo que controlas.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n2/2', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Operario', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584141&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0fb893b-ce77-4cc1-9079-822f0f3be635', 'multiverseId': 584141}, 'multiverseid': 584141}, {'name': 'Assembleur autonome', 'text': 'Vigilance\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur un ouvrier spécialisé ciblé que vous contrôlez.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n2/2', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : ouvrier spécialisé', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584402&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca7f9e78-e227-4c87-8e46-a12fa87356d7', 'multiverseId': 584402}, 'multiverseid': 584402}, {'name': 'Assemblatore Autonomo', 'text': 'Cautela\\n{1}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su un Addetto-al-Montaggio bersaglio che controlli.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n2/2', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Addetto-al-Montaggio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584663&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '002e31f1-6b71-4e77-9b7a-312a56c7c828', 'multiverseId': 584663}, 'multiverseid': 584663}, {'name': '自律型組立工', 'text': '警戒\\n{1}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしている組立作業員１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n//PRT-Prype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n２/２', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584924&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd86b01d9-1923-4bc0-a9dc-f7392d1775e5', 'multiverseId': 584924}, 'multiverseid': 584924}, {'name': 'Montador Autônomo', 'text': 'Vigilância\\n{1}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 no Operário de Linha de Montagem alvo que você controla.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n2/2', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Operário de Linha de Montagem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585185&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bb09756-1c50-4e5d-b3c6-12f6f4bb88c4', 'multiverseId': 585185}, 'multiverseid': 585185}, {'name': '自动组装械', 'text': '警戒\\n{1}，{T}：在目标由你操控的组装工人上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n//PRT-Prype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n2/2', 'type': '神器生物 ～组装工人', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585446&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5bb25c8-601f-480b-a69b-66565b81e5a9', 'multiverseId': 585446}, 'multiverseid': 585446}]", "[{'name': 'Autonomer Assemblierer', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit\\n{1}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf einen Montagearbeiter deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n2/2', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585784&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b56a4c3d-5b18-4190-b2d5-6584b7496e3b', 'multiverseId': 585784}, 'multiverseid': 585784}, {'name': 'Assembleur autonome', 'text': 'Vigilance\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur un ouvrier spécialisé ciblé que vous contrôlez.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n2/2', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : ouvrier spécialisé', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585856&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd06f777c-ec35-429b-b229-11c5deb27f49', 'multiverseId': 585856}, 'multiverseid': 585856}, {'name': '自律型組立工', 'text': '警戒\\n{1}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしている組立作業員１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n//PRT-Prype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n２/２', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585928&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '088881ab-e69b-4395-a07f-4b5358d04107', 'multiverseId': 585928}, 'multiverseid': 585928}, {'name': '自动组装械', 'text': '警戒\\n{1}，{T}：在目标由你操控的组装工人上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n//PRT-Prype_Mech//\\n{1}{W}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n2/2', 'type': '神器生物 ～组装工人', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586000&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8146082b-7f54-409e-ace7-fad7be4bad97', 'multiverseId': 586000}, 'multiverseid': 586000}]", '[{\'name\': \'Baggerklaue\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+0 und hat Bedrohlichkeit. (Sie kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel kommt, kannst du die Baggerklaue an sie anlegen.\\nAusrüsten {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc3638dc-cdb9-45c0-8348-2cef9a84e208\', \'multiverseId\': 583965}, \'multiverseid\': 583965}, {\'name\': \'Garra excavadora\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+0 y tiene la habilidad de amenaza. (No puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\\nSiempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla desde tu cementerio, puedes anexarle la Garra excavadora.\\nEquipar {1}{B}. ({1}{B}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acf1bf67-0367-4dd5-bd54-2253289e7140\', \'multiverseId\': 584226}, \'multiverseid\': 584226}, {\'name\': \'Griffe de dragage\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+0 et a la menace. (Elle ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière, vous pouvez lui attacher la Griffe de dragage.\\nÉquipement {1}{B} ({1}{B} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584487&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d63e7d2b-1c67-4706-9f33-f0538e701d78\', \'multiverseId\': 584487}, \'multiverseid\': 584487}, {\'name\': \'Draga Artiglio\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+0 e ha minacciare. (Non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia dal tuo cimitero, puoi assegnarle la Draga Artiglio.\\nEquipaggiare {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b93e6e-6d81-470e-97c6-8a148c6954ef\', \'multiverseId\': 584748}, \'multiverseid\': 584748}, {\'name\': \'底ざらいの鉤爪\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け威迫を持つ。（これは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\nクリーチャー１体があなたの墓地から戦場に出るたび、あなたは底ざらいの鉤爪をそれにつけてもよい。\\n装備{1}{B} （{1}{B}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eff8b444-4e39-4da1-9003-b06ce92e50d3\', \'multiverseId\': 585009}, \'multiverseid\': 585009}, {\'name\': \'Garra Dragadora\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+0 e tem ameaçar. (Ela só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)\\nToda vez que uma criatura entra no campo de batalha vinda do seu cemitério, você pode anexar Garra Dragadora a ela.\\nEquipar {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6840c942-6358-4a9f-a149-6b88974835f5\', \'multiverseId\': 585270}, \'multiverseid\': 585270}, {\'name\': \'发掘爪\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+0且具有威慑异能。（它只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\\n每当一个生物从你的坟墓场进战场时，你可以将发掘爪贴附于其上。\\n佩带{1}{B}（{1}{B}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03eaf839-fbe1-417c-8e4e-e1195006ef2c\', \'multiverseId\': 585531}, \'multiverseid\': 585531}]', '[{\'name\': \'Batterieträgerin\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken."\\nImmer wenn du einen Artefaktzauber mit Manabetrag 6 oder mehr wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Sie hat immer eine geballte Ladung im Gepäck.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584051&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aebd500-96d2-404b-b7f8-ed84b38ca73d\', \'multiverseId\': 584051}, \'multiverseid\': 584051}, {\'name\': \'Fabricabaterías\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de artefacto con valor de maná de 6 o más, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Siempre liderando la carga.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3c4bd7d-4a27-4415-8763-ffea0346f83a\', \'multiverseId\': 584312}, \'multiverseid\': 584312}, {\'name\': \'Porteuse de batteries\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'artefact avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 6, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'Elle mène toujours la charge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584573&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96efa316-5a4e-4fe6-a5ef-2d46a190afe0\', \'multiverseId\': 584573}, \'multiverseid\': 584573}, {\'name\': \'Portabatteria\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia artefatto con valore di mana pari o superiore a 6, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'È sempre lei a guidare la carica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98510333-ca77-4f83-8644-fc4e2fe541b6\', \'multiverseId\': 584834}, \'multiverseid\': 584834}, {\'name\': \'電池持ち\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つ。\\nあなたが、マナ総量が６以上であるアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'彼女はいつも充電池から流れる電流のごとく、先頭を切って行動する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44a6196b-d5a4-4106-9849-e61ad2396574\', \'multiverseId\': 585095}, \'multiverseid\': 585095}, {\'name\': \'Portadora de Baterias\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla têm "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato."\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de artefato com valor de mana igual ou superior a 6, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Ela sempre conduz a carga.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbd04360-342a-4230-b5e8-e84627217191\', \'multiverseId\': 585356}, \'multiverseid\': 585356}, {\'name\': \'蓄电技师\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语。」\\n每当你施放法术力值等于或大于6的神器咒语时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'她一向充在最前。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91af7014-6a95-4da8-8de8-4f7257c373ee\', \'multiverseId\': 585617}, \'multiverseid\': 585617}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befestigter Brückenkopf\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Befestigte Brückenkopf ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Soldat-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Der Befestigte Brückenkopf kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du hast auf diese Weise eine Soldat-Karte offen vorgezeigt oder du kontrollierst einen Soldaten.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\\n{5}, {T}: Soldaten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584102&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f06abbb3-a75a-4927-a1db-03f7f4a7f7a5\', \'multiverseId\': 584102}, \'multiverseid\': 584102}, {\'name\': \'Cabeza de playa fortificada\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Cabeza de playa fortificada entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Soldado de tu mano. La Cabeza de playa fortificada entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que muestres una carta de Soldado de esta manera o controles un Soldado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\\n{5}, {T}: Los Soldados que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46e5013a-44ed-4824-b021-155965f226c1\', \'multiverseId\': 584363}, \'multiverseid\': 584363}, {\'name\': \'Tête de pont fortifiée\', \'text\': "Au moment où la Tête de pont fortifiée arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de soldat de votre main. La Tête de pont fortifiée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous n\'ayez révélé une carte de soldat de cette manière ou que vous ne contrôliez un soldat.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.\\n{5}, {T} : Les soldats que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584624&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f27acb37-a954-433b-b5e8-784ea3cd6c39\', \'multiverseId\': 584624}, \'multiverseid\': 584624}, {\'name\': \'Spiaggia Fortificata\', \'text\': \'Mentre la Spiaggia Fortificata entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Soldato dalla tua mano. La Spiaggia Fortificata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non abbia rivelato una carta Soldato in questo modo o che tu non controlli un Soldato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.\\n{5}, {T}: I Soldati che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ebcdb0c-9f8d-4394-b446-ce6aadd1167c\', \'multiverseId\': 584885}, \'multiverseid\': 584885}, {\'name\': \'要塞化した海岸堡\', \'text\': \'要塞化した海岸堡が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にある兵士・カード１枚を公開してもよい。あなたがこれにより兵士・カードを公開しておらず兵士をコントロールもしていないなら、要塞化した海岸堡はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\\n{5}, {T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべての兵士は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9827abd-dcc8-427a-8593-3635ab3532a3\', \'multiverseId\': 585146}, \'multiverseid\': 585146}, {\'name\': \'Cabeça de Ponte Fortificada\', \'text\': \'Conforme Cabeça de Ponte Fortificada entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Soldado de sua mão. Cabeça de Ponte Fortificada entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você tenha revelado um card de Soldado dessa forma ou controle um Soldado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.\\n{5}, {T}: Os Soldados que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abd81af9-0a88-4f8c-a0a2-b43d31a8c33a\', \'multiverseId\': 585407}, \'multiverseid\': 585407}, {\'name\': \'筑防滩头\', \'text\': \'于筑防滩头进战场时，你可以从手上展示一张士兵牌。除非你以此法展示士兵牌或你操控士兵，否则筑防滩头须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{U}。\\n{5}，{T}：由你操控的士兵得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e5ac9ea-7117-424e-b8af-048471efeff7\', \'multiverseId\': 585668}, \'multiverseid\': 585668}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befestigter Brückenkopf\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Befestigte Brückenkopf ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Soldat-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Der Befestigte Brückenkopf kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du hast auf diese Weise eine Soldat-Karte offen vorgezeigt oder du kontrollierst einen Soldaten.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\\n{5}, {T}: Soldaten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585845&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d52bd35-1408-4d90-af3c-af66f36273ca\', \'multiverseId\': 585845}, \'multiverseid\': 585845}, {\'name\': \'Tête de pont fortifiée\', \'text\': "Au moment où la Tête de pont fortifiée arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de soldat de votre main. La Tête de pont fortifiée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous n\'ayez révélé une carte de soldat de cette manière ou que vous ne contrôliez un soldat.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.\\n{5}, {T} : Les soldats que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585917&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2ebfe4-53a8-491b-bac0-aff967d1a22f\', \'multiverseId\': 585917}, \'multiverseid\': 585917}, {\'name\': \'要塞化した海岸堡\', \'text\': \'要塞化した海岸堡が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にある兵士・カード１枚を公開してもよい。あなたがこれにより兵士・カードを公開しておらず兵士をコントロールもしていないなら、要塞化した海岸堡はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\\n{5}, {T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべての兵士は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b8dd7ad-2976-4e28-8f30-e8bfd8bfaa3b\', \'multiverseId\': 585989}, \'multiverseid\': 585989}, {\'name\': \'筑防滩头\', \'text\': \'于筑防滩头进战场时，你可以从手上展示一张士兵牌。除非你以此法展示士兵牌或你操控士兵，否则筑防滩头须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{U}。\\n{5}，{T}：由你操控的士兵得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9993cfec-4eeb-4b33-9ede-3ffab6f44fda\', \'multiverseId\': 586061}, \'multiverseid\': 586061}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungsveteranin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug legst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn ein anderer Nichtspielstein-Soldat, den du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Sachte, Rekrut. Wir kämpfen mit dem Licht der Gerechtigkeit im Rücken. Wir werfen keine Schatten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583871&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c81dad4-79a7-42a5-b39a-f3cb9ed45902\', \'multiverseId\': 583871}, \'multiverseid\': 583871}, {\'name\': \'Veterana del asedio\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nSiempre que otro Soldado que no sea ficha que controlas muera, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Soldado incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Firme, recluta. Luchamos a la luz de la justicia; no arrojamos sombras".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e07a0218-39ec-4abf-8ae2-9b54dd7dd779\', \'multiverseId\': 584132}, \'multiverseid\': 584132}, {\'name\': \'Vétérane de siège\', \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre soldat non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Du calme, recrue. Nous combattons à la lumière de la justice. Nous ne projetons pas d\'ombre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584393&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e6e102f-b146-4c63-a165-baf15a702426\', \'multiverseId\': 584393}, \'multiverseid\': 584393}, {\'name\': "Veterana dell\'Assedio", \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta un altro Soldato non pedina che controlli muore, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Soldato 1/1 incolore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nervi saldi, recluta. Combattiamo avvolti dalla luce della giustizia. Noi non proiettiamo ombra alcuna."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60ed71a9-8241-4ac7-8fb9-a8ba50312408\', \'multiverseId\': 584654}, \'multiverseid\': 584654}, {\'name\': \'包囲の古参兵\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでもこれでもない兵士１体が死亡するたび、無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「新兵、動揺するな。我らは正義の光の下で戦う。影を落とすことはない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16d75e05-98a7-41c4-97b4-8c034c318eb6\', \'multiverseId\': 584915}, \'multiverseid\': 584915}, {\'name\': \'Veterana de Cercos\', \'text\': \'No início do combate no seu turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\\nToda vez que outro Soldado não ficha que você controla morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Soldado incolor 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Firme, recruta. Nós lutamos na luz da justiça. E não temos sombra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f568d811-4d79-4992-b6dc-9fc912846927\', \'multiverseId\': 585176}, \'multiverseid\': 585176}, {\'name\': \'围城老兵\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当另一个由你操控且非衍生物的士兵死去时，派出一个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「稳着点，新来的。我们置身正义之光作战，不留下一丝阴影。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef270717-1c83-46f7-ab42-e42442188a23\', \'multiverseId\': 585437}, \'multiverseid\': 585437}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungsveteranin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug legst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn ein anderer Nichtspielstein-Soldat, den du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585781&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b04158e-89ef-4d4e-981e-769e71814578\', \'multiverseId\': 585781}, \'multiverseid\': 585781}, {\'name\': \'Vétérane de siège\', \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre soldat non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585853&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7199375-46cb-4893-8b3f-ed4d253c6f62\', \'multiverseId\': 585853}, \'multiverseid\': 585853}, {\'name\': \'包囲の古参兵\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでもこれでもない兵士１体が死亡するたび、無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a68d5db-9661-4969-af6e-8955ac30e16c\', \'multiverseId\': 585925}, \'multiverseid\': 585925}, {\'name\': \'围城老兵\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当另一个由你操控且非衍生物的士兵死去时，派出一个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b2fba87-aa73-4d43-a562-777bfd475273\', \'multiverseId\': 585997}, \'multiverseid\': 585997}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergwerksarbeiter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu. Falls du Kreaturen namens Kraftwerksarbeiter und Turmarbeiter kontrollierst, erhältst du stattdessen 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter\', \'flavor\': \'Indem Urza seinen Hunger nach dem Wissen und der Macht der Vergangenheit stillte, raubte er Dominarias Zukunft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584080&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'728b2483-0bd1-49e1-afcc-f68bc54db76f\', \'multiverseId\': 584080}, \'multiverseid\': 584080}, {\'name\': \'Operario de la mina\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ganas 1 vida. Si controlas criaturas llamadas Operario de la central de energía y Operario de la torre, en vez de eso, ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Operario\', \'flavor\': \'En su ansia por el conocimiento y el poder del pasado, Urza consumió el futuro de Dominaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4b78d3-8711-4aca-aac5-4afc29133da0\', \'multiverseId\': 584341}, \'multiverseid\': 584341}, {\'name\': \'Ouvrier de la mine\', \'text\': \'{T} : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie. Si vous contrôlez des créatures appelées Ouvrier de la centrale énergétique et Ouvrier de la tour, vous gagnez 3 points de vie à la place.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ouvrier spécialisé\', \'flavor\': "Poursuivant sa soif de connaissance et de puissance du passé, Urza condamna l\'avenir de Dominaria à la famine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584602&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c399cafa-83cf-4e9a-b6de-57bc042dc0e1\', \'multiverseId\': 584602}, \'multiverseid\': 584602}, {\'name\': \'Addetto alla Miniera\', \'text\': \'{T}: Guadagni 1 punto vita. Se controlli creature chiamate Addetto alla Centrale Energetica e Addetto alla Torre, guadagni invece 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Addetto-al-Montaggio\', \'flavor\': "Assecondando la sua fame di conoscenza e potere dal passato, Urza ridusse all\'osso il futuro di Dominaria.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9840c7d-be11-4f18-b948-a820da18016a\', \'multiverseId\': 584863}, \'multiverseid\': 584863}, {\'name\': \'鉱山の作業員\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたは１点のライフを得る。あなたが「魔力炉の作業員」という名前を持つクリーチャーと「塔の作業員」という名前を持つクリーチャーを両方ともコントロールしているなら、代わりに３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員\', \'flavor\': \'過去の力と学識への渇望に従うまま、ウルザはドミナリアの未来を枯渇させた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa69d620-119e-417c-a3ea-d5024a312e8b\', \'multiverseId\': 585124}, \'multiverseid\': 585124}, {\'name\': \'Operário da Mina\', \'text\': \'{T}: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida. Se você controlar criaturas com o nome Operário da Usina e Operário da Torre, em vez disso, você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Operário de Linha de Montagem\', \'flavor\': \'Seguindo sua fome de conhecimento e de poder do passado, Urza consumiu o futuro de Dominária.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2930fb8-260f-4a55-9a0c-a46eb6fc7010\', \'multiverseId\': 585385}, \'multiverseid\': 585385}, {\'name\': \'矿脉工人\', \'text\': \'{T}：你获得1点生命。如果你操控名称为动力炉工人和高塔工人的生物，则改为你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组装工人\', \'flavor\': \'在从过往汲取足够力量与知识之后，克撒继而耗尽了多明纳里亚的未来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50959863-9c38-4199-ac2c-55a40cae5f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 585646}, \'multiverseid\': 585646}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beständiger Behemoth\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Länder aus deinem Friedhof spielen.\\nExhumieren {G}{G} ({G}{G}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584046&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a91ff3a-381a-4c2c-9b67-5d1e5d76fb0d\', \'multiverseId\': 584046}, \'multiverseid\': 584046}, {\'name\': \'Behemot perenne\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar tierras desde tu cementerio.\\nDesenterrar {G}{G}. ({G}{G}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4658b815-11dc-4795-ab84-cdb6bb2e6555\', \'multiverseId\': 584307}, \'multiverseid\': 584307}, {\'name\': \'Béhémoth vivace\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez jouer des terrains depuis votre cimetière.\\nExhumation {G}{G} ({G}{G} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584568&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c27c6c10-558a-4f05-9bb6-da3a87e2d046\', \'multiverseId\': 584568}, \'multiverseid\': 584568}, {\'name\': \'Behemoth Sempreverde\', \'text\': "Puoi giocare terre dal tuo cimitero.\\nDissotterrare {G}{G} ({G}{G}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12bf5e84-990a-428f-a6de-6ad66e7b68d4\', \'multiverseId\': 584829}, \'multiverseid\': 584829}, {\'name\': \'常緑のビヒモス\', \'text\': \'あなたはあなたの墓地から土地をプレイしてもよい。\\n蘇生{G}{G}（{G}{G}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、あるいは、これが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc86ea68-5cc6-45c7-8269-8662c5fe14cd\', \'multiverseId\': 585090}, \'multiverseid\': 585090}, {\'name\': \'Behemoth Perene\', \'text\': \'Você pode jogar terrenos do seu cemitério.\\nDesenterrar {G}{G} ({G}{G}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30288079-ee25-4b40-898b-0485e15e75f8\', \'multiverseId\': 585351}, \'multiverseid\': 585351}, {\'name\': \'经年贝西摩斯\', \'text\': \'你可以从你的坟墓场中使用地。\\n破坟{G}{G}（{G}{G}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f57ce7f-cf1e-433c-b082-bd2b27ecd954\', \'multiverseId\': 585612}, \'multiverseid\': 585612}]', "[{'name': 'Beständiger Behemoth', 'text': 'Du kannst Länder aus deinem Friedhof spielen.\\nExhumieren {G}{G}', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Bestie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585825&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0cdaeb29-3aeb-4e4e-93e0-210521438cc3', 'multiverseId': 585825}, 'multiverseid': 585825}, {'name': 'Béhémoth vivace', 'text': 'Vous pouvez jouer des terrains depuis votre cimetière.\\nExhumation {G}{G}', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : bête', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585897&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78134ff9-010f-4b5f-b032-89058e952f16', 'multiverseId': 585897}, 'multiverseid': 585897}, {'name': '常緑のビヒモス', 'text': 'あなたはあなたの墓地から土地をプレイしてもよい。\\n蘇生{G}{G}', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585969&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56cb5564-82fe-4b03-bd01-b47a51e4c16c', 'multiverseId': 585969}, 'multiverseid': 585969}, {'name': '经年贝西摩斯', 'text': '你可以从你的坟墓场中使用地。\\n破坟{G}{G}', 'type': '神器生物 ～野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586041&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eded7ac5-9a98-4410-bfbb-307ac1d04d7d', 'multiverseId': 586041}, 'multiverseid': 586041}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bitteres Wiedersehen\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Bittere Wiedersehen ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe zwei Karten.\\n{1}, opfere das Bittere Wiedersehen: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Der Friedensgipfel offenbarte, dass die Fehde zwischen Urza und Mishra nur blutig enden konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b197df29-e2e1-4cc9-b859-e92a90ef1d71\', \'multiverseId\': 583973}, \'multiverseid\': 583973}, {\'name\': \'Reencuentro amargo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Reencuentro amargo entre al campo de batalla, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba dos cartas.\\n{1}, sacrificar el Reencuentro amargo: Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La cumbre de paz demostró que el enfrentamiento entre Urza y Mishra solo podía acabar con un derramamiento de sangre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fbde87b-29e3-4720-bfb8-66b364e46159\', \'multiverseId\': 584234}, \'multiverseid\': 584234}, {\'name\': \'Retrouvailles amères\', \'text\': "Quand les Retrouvailles amères arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez deux cartes.\\n{1}, sacrifiez les Retrouvailles amères : Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'La conférence de paix prouva que la rancœur entre Urza et Mishra ne pourrait finir que dans le sang.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584495&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba5c6658-582b-4de4-a781-bd65a0c27d69\', \'multiverseId\': 584495}, \'multiverseid\': 584495}, {\'name\': \'Ricongiungimento Rancoroso\', \'text\': \'Quando il Ricongiungimento Rancoroso entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, peschi due carte.\\n{1}, Sacrifica il Ricongiungimento Rancoroso: Le creature che controlli hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Il vertice di pace confermò che le ruggini tra Urza e Mishra sarebbero terminate soltanto nel sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cc64ecf-b141-45eb-9a1f-8e00c8f892db\', \'multiverseId\': 584756}, \'multiverseid\': 584756}, {\'name\': \'苦々しい再会\', \'text\': \'苦々しい再会が戦場に出たとき、あなたはカード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カード２枚を引く。\\n{1}, 苦々しい再会を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'和平交渉で判明したのは、ウルザとミシュラの怨恨は流血沙汰にしかならないということだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33473421-701d-4033-9dfa-c63d94160155\', \'multiverseId\': 585017}, \'multiverseid\': 585017}, {\'name\': \'Reencontro Amargo\', \'text\': \'Quando Reencontro Amargo entra no campo de batalha, você pode descartar um card. Se fizer isso, compre dois cards.\\n{1}, sacrifique Reencontro Amargo: As criaturas que você controla ganham ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A Cúpula da Paz provou que a rixa entre Urza e Mishra só se encerraria com sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eee49399-104e-47a0-bf57-b92f5a753077\', \'multiverseId\': 585278}, \'multiverseid\': 585278}, {\'name\': \'苦涩重逢\', \'text\': \'当苦涩重逢进战场时，你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓两张牌。\\n{1}，牺牲苦涩重逢：由你操控的生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'和平峰会证明，克撒与米斯拉之间的嫌隙只能以流血收场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c092eed-24cc-4864-9e67-2ddb8d462a79\', \'multiverseId\': 585539}, \'multiverseid\': 585539}]', "[{'name': 'Bleichholz-Schleicher', 'text': 'Wenn der Bleichholz-Schleicher ins Spiel kommt, millst du drei Karten. Du kannst von den auf diese Weise gemillten Karten eine Länderkarte auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du dies nicht tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Bleichholz-Schleicher. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584017&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '721dc5a7-47f7-48f3-994c-0018534a75c1', 'multiverseId': 584017}, 'multiverseid': 584017}, {'name': 'Rondador de maderapálida', 'text': 'Cuando el Rondador de maderapálida entre al campo de batalla, muele tres cartas. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta de tierra de entre las cartas molidas de esta manera. Si no lo haces, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Rondador de maderapálida. (Para moler una carta, pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584278&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a73c3fa4-e0ca-40a3-8bd1-6ab37b8bdf10', 'multiverseId': 584278}, 'multiverseid': 584278}, {'name': 'Rôdeur de boisblanc', 'text': 'Quand le Rôdeur de boisblanc arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez trois cartes. Vous pouvez mettre dans votre main une carte de terrain parmi les cartes meulées de cette manière. Si vous ne faites pas ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Rôdeur de boisblanc. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)', 'type': 'Créature : élémental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584539&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed02795f-af54-4372-8f83-d8aed069db88', 'multiverseId': 584539}, 'multiverseid': 584539}, {'name': 'Predatore di Boscopallido', 'text': 'Quando il Predatore di Boscopallido entra nel campo di battaglia, macina tre carte. Puoi aggiungere alla tua mano una carta terra scelta tra le carte macinate in questo modo. Se non lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Predatore di Boscopallido. (Per macinare una carta, metti nel tuo cimitero la prima carta del tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Elementale', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584800&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4c8a948-9702-43c2-8fc8-9424b46478ea', 'multiverseId': 584800}, 'multiverseid': 584800}, {'name': 'ブランチウッドのうろつくもの', 'text': 'ブランチウッドのうろつくものが戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を切削する。あなたは、これにより切削されたカードの中から土地・カード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。そうしないなら、ブランチウッドのうろつくものの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585061&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cc3395d-6dbc-4b7b-be1a-049b1683d4ff', 'multiverseId': 585061}, 'multiverseid': 585061}, {'name': 'Espreitador de Blanchwood', 'text': 'Quando Espreitador de Blanchwood entrar no campo de batalha, triture três cards. Você pode colocar em sua mão um card de terreno dentre os cards triturados dessa forma. Se não fizer isso, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Espreitador de Blanchwood. (Para triturar um card, coloque o card do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585322&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b28d368-f9a1-4f8c-be2d-b8a8cd4dfcc6', 'multiverseId': 585322}, 'multiverseid': 585322}, {'name': '白木游掠灵', 'text': '当白木游掠灵进战场时，磨三张牌。你可以将以此法磨掉的一张地牌置于你手上。若你未如此作，则在白木游掠灵上放置一个+1/+1指示物。（磨一张牌的流程是将你牌库顶的牌置入你坟墓场。）', 'type': '生物 ～元素', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585583&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0243297f-e9ca-4091-b6eb-7b1c66e87bd8', 'multiverseId': 585583}, 'multiverseid': 585583}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bleichholzrüstung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jeden Wald, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Rüstungen werden geformt, manche werden geforstet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8589630d-9071-4f7e-8880-e7d854440c95\', \'multiverseId\': 584016}, \'multiverseid\': 584016}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de maderapálida\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada Bosque que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Algunas armaduras se forjan y otras se cultivan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cadced9-42c8-4d7a-bcba-4d602e0b2b43\', \'multiverseId\': 584277}, \'multiverseid\': 584277}, {\'name\': \'Armure de boisblanc\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque forêt que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Certaines armures sont forgées, d\'autres poussent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584538&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fc297d5-225e-4407-bebe-972bdc376d68\', \'multiverseId\': 584538}, \'multiverseid\': 584538}, {\'name\': \'Armatura di Boscopallido\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni Foresta che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Ci sono armature che vengono forgiate nella fucina e armature che vengono forgiate nella foresta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e47298c2-7804-4e27-bac4-47abf9ebdfec\', \'multiverseId\': 584799}, \'multiverseid\': 584799}, {\'name\': \'ブランチウッドの鎧\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしている森１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'鋼でできた鎧もあれば、森でできた鎧もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b8d1ac1-26f8-4c97-837e-0a6d7661b73b\', \'multiverseId\': 585060}, \'multiverseid\': 585060}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de Blanchwood\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 para cada Floresta que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Algumas armaduras são forjadas, outras são florestadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4d3d451-9cd3-4723-aab2-0e0de2abe7c8\', \'multiverseId\': 585321}, \'multiverseid\': 585321}, {\'name\': \'白木甲\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n你每操控一个树林，所结附的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'有些盔甲乃是金属铸就，而有些则是林木织就。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb8725ad-e2d8-4b7e-ad39-dc3d19ba02fa\', \'multiverseId\': 585582}, \'multiverseid\': 585582}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bleichholzrüstung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jeden Wald, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Rüstungen werden geformt, manche werden geforstet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586317&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94f404d8-0680-47df-8dd5-484a3de72ef8\', \'multiverseId\': 586317}, \'multiverseid\': 586317}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de maderapálida\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada Bosque que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Algunas armaduras se forjan y otras se cultivan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'419cf38f-ceca-449b-b5e7-cf14e452841f\', \'multiverseId\': 586322}, \'multiverseid\': 586322}, {\'name\': \'Armure de boisblanc\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque forêt que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Certaines armures sont forgées, d\'autres poussent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586327&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d43e499-4921-445f-a1e0-b6a25cee52d8\', \'multiverseId\': 586327}, \'multiverseid\': 586327}, {\'name\': \'Armatura di Boscopallido\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni Foresta che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Ci sono armature che vengono forgiate nella fucina e armature che vengono forgiate nella foresta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f687e3-564c-44f3-9d52-9c9392286a34\', \'multiverseId\': 586332}, \'multiverseid\': 586332}, {\'name\': \'ブランチウッドの鎧\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしている森１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'鋼でできた鎧もあれば、森でできた鎧もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d45c24a-c822-4382-a523-d2b56158a27d\', \'multiverseId\': 586337}, \'multiverseid\': 586337}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de Blanchwood\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 para cada Floresta que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Algumas armaduras são forjadas, outras são florestadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'578311e2-a561-4c91-a96d-d7ba2802f0e9\', \'multiverseId\': 586347}, \'multiverseid\': 586347}, {\'name\': \'白木甲\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n你每操控一个树林，所结附的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'有些盔甲乃是金属铸就，而有些则是林木织就。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f255165b-240d-4763-9363-5c4adfbe1699\', \'multiverseId\': 586352}, \'multiverseid\': 586352}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzroboter\', \'text\': \'Eile\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n3/2\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Während Urzas Maschinen auf Verteidigung setzten, richtete Mishra seine darauf aus, den Krieg schnell zu beenden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584004&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ca77ad4-6244-4781-b9dc-f162e56d6ec3\', \'multiverseId\': 584004}, \'multiverseid\': 584004}, {\'name\': \'Autómata relámpago\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n3/2\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras que las máquinas de Urza se orientaban hacia la defensa, Mishra construía las suyas para poner fin a la guerra rápidamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c568e63-e6bf-4fb7-89fa-861e3597a052\', \'multiverseId\': 584265}, \'multiverseid\': 584265}, {\'name\': "Automate à l\'attaque-éclair", \'text\': \'Célérité\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n3/2\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "Alors que les machines d\'Urza favorisaient la défense, Mishra construisait les siennes pour finir la guerre au plus vite.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584526&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1549e936-cde9-4a89-8842-2b63c850f718\', \'multiverseId\': 584526}, \'multiverseid\': 584526}, {\'name\': \'Automa da Incursione\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n3/2\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': "Mentre le macchine di Urza prediligevano la difesa, Mishra costruì le sue con l\'obiettivo di porre rapidamente fine alla guerra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4e8101f-fdc8-4618-84a4-0f19a1e16764\', \'multiverseId\': 584787}, \'multiverseid\': 584787}, {\'name\': \'奇襲用自動機械\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n３/２\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'ウルザの機械が防御を重視したのに対し、ミシュラは速やかに戦争を終わらせる目的で機械を作った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c652a2c7-2db3-4c85-88d7-2ccf0712595d\', \'multiverseId\': 585048}, \'multiverseid\': 585048}, {\'name\': \'Autômato da Blitz\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n3/2\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto as máquinas de Urza favoreciam a defesa, Mishra construía as dele para acabar rápido com a guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c37a15-be7a-4f4b-a867-2c651382f986\', \'multiverseId\': 585309}, \'multiverseid\': 585309}, {\'name\': \'闪击自动械\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n3/2\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'克撒建造机械时更注重其防御性能，而米斯拉打造的机械则胜于快速结束战斗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67ad5741-9c4e-4ff4-8955-9a611c984a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 585570}, \'multiverseid\': 585570}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blubbernder Salber\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blubbernden Salber.\\nWenn der Blubbernde Salber stirbt, bringe eine andere Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich der Stärke des Blubbernden Salbers aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a5af75d-1d47-40f4-95af-e8c2b18ffc80\', \'multiverseId\': 583950}, \'multiverseid\': 583950}, {\'name\': \'Consagradora gorgoteante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Consagradora gorgoteante.\\nCuando la Consagradora gorgoteante muera, regresa otra carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná menor o igual que la fuerza de la Consagradora gorgoteante de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87e6fc40-0e63-488b-8009-b61f9ee13e84\', \'multiverseId\': 584211}, \'multiverseid\': 584211}, {\'name\': \'Consécrateur gargouillant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Consécrateur gargouillant.\\nQuand le Consécrateur gargouillant meurt, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une autre carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à la force du Consécrateur gargouillant.\', \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584472&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'734851cb-050e-4471-9111-487101de5a3b\', \'multiverseId\': 584472}, \'multiverseid\': 584472}, {\'name\': \'Consacratore Gorgogliante\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Consacratore Gorgogliante.\\nQuando il Consacratore Gorgogliante muore, rimetti sul campo di battaglia un\'altra carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore alla forza del Consacratore Gorgogliante dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4555b8-aeb2-451a-8590-c82e35a3e97c\', \'multiverseId\': 584733}, \'multiverseid\': 584733}, {\'name\': \'喉鳴らしの選定者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、喉鳴らしの選定者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n喉鳴らしの選定者が死亡したとき、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が喉鳴らしの選定者のパワー以下でありこれでないクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff25c0b0-195a-4464-9316-723029e8f60f\', \'multiverseId\': 584994}, \'multiverseid\': 584994}, {\'name\': \'Ungidor Gorgolejante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você comprar seu segundo card a cada turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Ungidor Gorgolejante.\\nQuando Ungidor Gorgolejante morrer, devolva de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha outro card de criatura alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior ao poder de Ungidor Gorgolejante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'872ffe5e-f2ec-4293-855f-56943aa6344c\', \'multiverseId\': 585255}, \'multiverseid\': 585255}, {\'name\': \'骇笑赐圣兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，在骇笑赐圣兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n当骇笑赐圣兽死去时，将另一张目标法术力值等于或小于骇笑赐圣兽力量的生物牌从你坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7837d1f-585e-4868-b284-d4c0609eb88a\', \'multiverseId\': 585516}, \'multiverseid\': 585516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brandungsmaschine\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\n{U}: Die Brandungsmaschine verliert Verteidiger und erhält „Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden."\\n{2}{U}: Die Brandungsmaschine wird blau und hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 5/4. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls die Brandungsmaschine nicht Verteidiger hat.\\n{4}{U}{U}: Ziehe drei Karten. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls die Brandungsmaschine blau ist, und nur einmal.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e50cbda-baa1-484f-bb70-3b3073e22050\', \'multiverseId\': 583927}, \'multiverseid\': 583927}, {\'name\': \'Máquina impulsada\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\n{U}: La Máquina impulsada pierde la habilidad de defensor y gana "Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada".\\n{2}{U}: La Máquina impulsada se convierte en azul y tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 5/4. Activa esto solo si la Máquina impulsada no tiene la habilidad de defensor.\\n{4}{U}{U}: Roba tres cartas. Activa esto solo si la Máquina impulsada es azul y solo una vez.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d59daf80-b096-429d-b3d3-db07ae498787\', \'multiverseId\': 584188}, \'multiverseid\': 584188}, {\'name\': \'Moteur de houle\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\n{U} : Le Moteur de houle perd le défenseur et acquiert « Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée. »\\n{2}{U} : Le Moteur de houle devient bleu et a une force et une endurance de base de 5/4. N\'activez que si le Moteur de houle n\'a pas le défenseur.\\n{4}{U}{U} : Piochez trois cartes. N\'activez que si le Moteur de houle est bleu et qu\'une seule fois.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c56ca16f-1dc9-41ff-8514-7509efb9c1a1\', \'multiverseId\': 584449}, \'multiverseid\': 584449}, {\'name\': \'Macchina della Marea\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\n{U}: La Macchina della Marea perde difensore e ha "Questa creatura non può essere bloccata".\\n{2}{U}: La Macchina della Marea diventa blu e ha forza e costituzione base 5/4. Attiva solo se la Macchina della Marea non ha difensore.\\n{4}{U}{U}: Pesca tre carte. Attiva solo se la Macchina della Marea è blu e solo una volta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dcca772-db8e-4092-b80b-c2d793ba7b91\', \'multiverseId\': 584710}, \'multiverseid\': 584710}, {\'name\': \'高波エンジン\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n{U}：高波エンジンは防衛を失い、「このクリーチャーはブロックされない。」を得る。\\n{2}{U}：高波エンジンは青になりその基本のパワーとタフネスは５/４になる。高波エンジンが防衛を持っていないときのみ起動できる。\\n{4}{U}{U}：カード３枚を引く。高波エンジンが青のときのみ１回だけ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dbdf0c1-a866-4122-bfb9-4259e171c2de\', \'multiverseId\': 584971}, \'multiverseid\': 584971}, {\'name\': \'Motor de Surto\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\n{U}: Motor de Surto perde defensor e ganha "Esta criatura não pode ser bloqueada".\\n{2}{U}: Motor de Surto torna-se azul e tem poder e resistência básicos 5/4. Ative somente se Motor de Surto não tiver defensor.\\n{4}{U}{U}: Compre três cards. Ative somente se Motor de Surto for azul e apenas uma vez.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdc03c55-06ef-46c0-9e47-a2bbc131de04\', \'multiverseId\': 585232}, \'multiverseid\': 585232}, {\'name\': \'浪涌引擎\', \'text\': \'守军\\n{U}：浪涌引擎失去守军异能并获得「此生物不能被阻挡。」\\n{2}{U}：浪涌引擎成为蓝色且基础力量与防御力为5/4。只能于浪涌引擎不具守军时起动。\\n{4}{U}{U}：抓三张牌。只能于浪涌引擎为蓝色时起动且只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'221335ee-169d-4418-a5d1-9edec558773a\', \'multiverseId\': 585493}, \'multiverseid\': 585493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brandungsmaschine\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\n{U}: Die Brandungsmaschine verliert Verteidiger und erhält „Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden."\\n{2}{U}: Die Brandungsmaschine wird blau und hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 5/4. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls die Brandungsmaschine nicht Verteidiger hat.\\n{4}{U}{U}: Ziehe drei Karten. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls die Brandungsmaschine blau ist, und nur einmal.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585795&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d241882b-762b-4018-9ec6-05b547585a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 585795}, \'multiverseid\': 585795}, {\'name\': \'Moteur de houle\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\n{U} : Le Moteur de houle perd le défenseur et acquiert « Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée. »\\n{2}{U} : Le Moteur de houle devient bleu et a une force et une endurance de base de 5/4. N\'activez que si le Moteur de houle n\'a pas le défenseur.\\n{4}{U}{U} : Piochez trois cartes. N\'activez que si le Moteur de houle est bleu et qu\'une seule fois.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c225d4d-3baf-4268-9810-5c91ee533af4\', \'multiverseId\': 585867}, \'multiverseid\': 585867}, {\'name\': \'高波エンジン\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n{U}：高波エンジンは防衛を失い、「このクリーチャーはブロックされない。」を得る。\\n{2}{U}：高波エンジンは青になりその基本のパワーとタフネスは５/４になる。高波エンジンが防衛を持っていないときのみ起動できる。\\n{4}{U}{U}：カード３枚を引く。高波エンジンが青のときのみ１回だけ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a28ce3ad-5f82-4121-a600-1b75118006e7\', \'multiverseId\': 585939}, \'multiverseid\': 585939}, {\'name\': \'浪涌引擎\', \'text\': \'守军\\n{U}：浪涌引擎失去守军异能并获得「此生物不能被阻挡。」\\n{2}{U}：浪涌引擎成为蓝色且基础力量与防御力为5/4。只能于浪涌引擎不具守军时起动。\\n{4}{U}{U}：抓三张牌。只能于浪涌引擎为蓝色时起动且只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80be1d4d-531e-4cae-a61c-9dfa5dcceb7d\', \'multiverseId\': 586011}, \'multiverseid\': 586011}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bulle von Penregon\', \'text\': \'{1}, opfere ein Artefakt: Der Bulle von Penregon erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges und fügt jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus\', \'flavor\': \'Das Kinderstemmen wurde nur von seiner Darbietung im Kesselweitwurf übertroffen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85019657-0dc2-4d6f-9d94-bcd945ec05d5\', \'multiverseId\': 583993}, \'multiverseid\': 583993}, {\'name\': \'Toro fortachón de Penregon\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrificar un artefacto: El Toro fortachón de Penregon obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno y hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'En su espectáculo, el número de levantar niños solo lo superaba el de patear calderos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eda8ea2a-928b-4189-8338-dfa10b78021a\', \'multiverseId\': 584254}, \'multiverseid\': 584254}, {\'name\': \'Fortetaure de Penregon\', \'text\': "{1}, sacrifiez un artefact : Le Fortetaure de Penregon gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour et inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure\', \'flavor\': "Son lever d\'enfant n\'avait d\'égal que son lancer de chaudron.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584515&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dd4f6a0-862d-4ded-a0ce-667d5788127d\', \'multiverseId\': 584515}, \'multiverseid\': 584515}, {\'name\': \'Taurino di Penregon\', \'text\': \'{1}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Il Taurino di Penregon prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno e infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Minotauro\', \'flavor\': "Il suo numero di sollevamento di ragazzini era secondo soltanto al suo repertorio di \'calcio del calderone\'.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccf79dd7-956c-4b3e-b93b-0cdc9a26f09e\', \'multiverseId\': 584776}, \'multiverseid\': 584776}, {\'name\': \'ペンレゴンの剛牛\', \'text\': \'{1}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、ペンレゴンの剛牛は＋１/＋１の修整を受け、各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス\', \'flavor\': \'子どもに高い高いをしてやることは、彼にとって大鍋を蹴り飛ばす日課の次に大切なことだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3681539a-fc9b-43e8-b6df-a5bad085f8c5\', \'multiverseId\': 585037}, \'multiverseid\': 585037}, {\'name\': \'Tourão de Penregon\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrifique um artefato: Tourão de Penregon recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno e causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'O número em que ele levantava as crianças só perdia pro de chutar os caldeirões.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa42d803-ae6e-4dab-9179-30a0b7137c19\', \'multiverseId\': 585298}, \'multiverseid\': 585298}, {\'name\': \'潘瑞冈蛮牛\', \'text\': \'{1}，牺牲一个神器：潘瑞冈蛮牛得+1/+1直到回合结束，且向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～牛头怪\', \'flavor\': \'他的负孩举重秀相当精彩，仅次于铁锅大脚踢的好戏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abd7061d-7262-49c9-a39c-287a88bd7f46\', \'multiverseId\': 585559}, \'multiverseid\': 585559}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion aus Lehm\', \'text\': \'Der Champion aus Lehm kommt für jedes {G}{G}, das ausgegeben wurde, um ihn zu wirken, mit drei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Champion aus Lehm ins Spiel kommt, bestimme bis zu zwei andere Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Lege auf jede davon für jedes {W}{W}, das ausgegeben wurde, um den Champion aus Lehm zu wirken, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584072&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'973bd607-4ab7-404d-92b5-ebbc6566755f\', \'multiverseId\': 584072}, \'multiverseid\': 584072}, {\'name\': \'Campeón de arcilla\', \'text\': \'El Campeón de arcilla entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores +1/+1 sobre él por cada {G}{G} usados para lanzarlo.\\nCuando el Campeón de arcilla entre al campo de batalla, elige hasta otras dos criaturas objetivo que controlas. Por cada {W}{W} usados para lanzar el Campeón de arcilla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una de ellas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58a83402-b809-4496-b3f1-bdd0773fd202\', \'multiverseId\': 584333}, \'multiverseid\': 584333}, {\'name\': "Champion d\'argile", \'text\': "Le Champion d\'argile arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, trois marqueurs +1/+1 pour chaque {G}{G} dépensé pour le lancer.\\nQuand le Champion d\'argile arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez jusqu\'à deux autres créatures ciblées que vous contrôlez. Pour chaque {W}{W} dépensé pour lancer le Champion d\'argile, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584594&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13899a45-b62c-443a-82ec-a3dc78a64129\', \'multiverseId\': 584594}, \'multiverseid\': 584594}, {\'name\': "Campione d\'Argilla", \'text\': "Il Campione d\'Argilla entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini +1/+1 per ogni {G}{G} spesi per lanciarlo.\\nQuando il Campione d\'Argilla entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli fino ad altre due creature bersaglio che controlli. Per ogni {W}{W} spesi per lanciare il Campione d\'Argilla, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ognuna di esse.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04644f1f-00b1-42e1-b922-5fc868fedf60\', \'multiverseId\': 584855}, \'multiverseid\': 584855}, {\'name\': \'土の勇者\', \'text\': \'土の勇者は、これを唱えるために支払われた {G}{G}につき３個の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n土の勇者が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらの上にそれぞれ、土の勇者を唱えるために支払われた{W}{W}につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce1c0c2c-bc56-4e5c-b061-67fe331e06c5\', \'multiverseId\': 585116}, \'multiverseid\': 585116}, {\'name\': \'Campeão de Argila\', \'text\': \'Campeão de Argila entra no campo de batalha com três marcadores +1/+1 para cada {G}{G} gastos para conjurá-lo.\\nQuando Campeão de Argila entrar no campo de batalha, escolha até duas outras criaturas alvo que você controla. Para cada {W}{W} gastos para conjurar Campeão de Argila, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma delas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2663ae0-4c3b-4e68-b666-467700440ab9\', \'multiverseId\': 585377}, \'multiverseid\': 585377}, {\'name\': \'黏土斗士\', \'text\': \'黏土斗士进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于施放它时所支付之{G}{G}份数的三倍。\\n当黏土斗士进战场时，选择至多两个其他目标由你操控的生物。施放黏土斗士时每支付过一份{W}{W}，便在这些生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'459a781c-8ee9-4400-997d-fec5c53c0d9f\', \'multiverseId\': 585638}, \'multiverseid\': 585638}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion aus Lehm\', \'text\': \'Der Champion aus Lehm kommt für jedes {G}{G}, das ausgegeben wurde, um ihn zu wirken, mit drei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Champion aus Lehm ins Spiel kommt, bestimme bis zu zwei andere Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Lege auf jede davon für jedes {W}{W}, das ausgegeben wurde, um den Champion aus Lehm zu wirken, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585837&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'519de6ff-4bc2-4367-b8e7-2458312e016c\', \'multiverseId\': 585837}, \'multiverseid\': 585837}, {\'name\': "Champion d\'argile", \'text\': "Le Champion d\'argile arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, trois marqueurs +1/+1 pour chaque {G}{G} dépensé pour le lancer.\\nQuand le Champion d\'argile arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez jusqu\'à deux autres créatures ciblées que vous contrôlez. Pour chaque {W}{W} dépensé pour lancer le Champion d\'argile, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cee75f18-0d96-4425-8556-73ececc11e79\', \'multiverseId\': 585909}, \'multiverseid\': 585909}, {\'name\': \'土の勇者\', \'text\': \'土の勇者は、これを唱えるために支払われた {G}{G}につき３個の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n土の勇者が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらの上にそれぞれ、土の勇者を唱えるために支払われた{W}{W}につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d64a18a7-e721-47ae-8dec-45597185b915\', \'multiverseId\': 585981}, \'multiverseid\': 585981}, {\'name\': \'黏土斗士\', \'text\': \'黏土斗士进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于施放它时所支付之{G}{G}份数的三倍。\\n当黏土斗士进战场时，选择至多两个其他目标由你操控的生物。施放黏土斗士时每支付过一份{W}{W}，便在这些生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'422f67c9-c0a6-4b16-b6f6-cb3092413276\', \'multiverseId\': 586053}, \'multiverseid\': 586053}]', '[{\'name\': \'Citanul-Getreuer\', \'text\': \'{T}, tappe ein ungetapptes Artefakt oder eine ungetappte Kreatur, das bzw. die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Der zermürbende Krieg der Brüder hatte das Land Terisiares verdorben und die Himmel geschwärzt. Die Verteidiger Argoths waren fest entschlossen, ihre Insel vor demselben Schicksal zu bewahren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97b8a815-721a-40e8-98f8-6759e3aed72c\', \'multiverseId\': 584020}, \'multiverseid\': 584020}, {\'name\': \'Protector de Citanul\', \'text\': \'{T}, girar una criatura o artefacto enderezado que controlas: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'El azote infinito de la Guerra de los Hermanos había contaminado las tierras de Terisiare y ennegrecido sus cielos. Los defensores de Argoth estaban decididos a evitar que su isla corriera la misma suerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a34a076-5d6a-4c95-b330-312b5ea964c5\', \'multiverseId\': 584281}, \'multiverseid\': 584281}, {\'name\': \'Vaillant de Citanul\', \'text\': \'{T}, engagez un artefact ou une créature dégagée que vous contrôlez : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Les ravages incessants de la Guerre Fratricide avaient pollué la terre de Terisiare et noirci son firmament. Les défenseurs d\'Argoth étaient déterminés à protéger leur île d\'un sort similaire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aef1883-8412-4d35-850d-4a9f8630c88b\', \'multiverseId\': 584542}, \'multiverseid\': 584542}, {\'name\': \'Temerario di Citanul\', \'text\': \'{T}, TAPpa una creatura o un artefatto STAPpati che controlli: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': "L\'infinita crudeltà della Guerra dei Fratelli aveva annerito i cieli di Terisiare e contaminato la sua terra. I difensori di Argoth erano decisi a proteggere la loro isola dallo stesso destino.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60db1ea7-c3d7-42b5-a3cc-3da4123f1818\', \'multiverseId\': 584803}, \'multiverseid\': 584803}, {\'name\': \'シタヌールの重鎮\', \'text\': \'{T}, アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうちあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である１つをタップする：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'兄弟戦争の果てしない戦いが、テリシアの大地を汚し、空を黒く染めた。アルゴスの守護者たちは、自分たちの島が同じ運命を辿らぬよう守ろうと決意していた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a79d821-a3ac-49a4-98f2-c408a0da3fc0\', \'multiverseId\': 585064}, \'multiverseid\': 585064}, {\'name\': \'Destemido de Citanul\', \'text\': \'{T}, vire um artefato desvirado ou uma criatura desvirada que você controla: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'O ordálio infindável da Guerra dos Irmãos conspurcara a terra de Terisiare e escurecera seus céus. Os defensores de Argoth estavam determinados a proteger a ilha daquele mesmo destino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3856510-043c-4ff1-950e-1514e50a8de3\', \'multiverseId\': 585325}, \'multiverseid\': 585325}, {\'name\': \'西坦努坚兵\', \'text\': \'{T}，横置一个由你操控且未横置的神器或生物：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'兄弟之战不断延烧，令泰瑞西亚土地枯萎、天色蒙灰。亚格斯守护者决意保护自己的岛屿，以免落入同样境地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4630a8-39c1-430f-aec8-dadb08902973\', \'multiverseId\': 585586}, \'multiverseid\': 585586}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Steinhirn\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, schicke das Steinhirn ins Exil: Bestimme einen Kartennamen. Durchsuche den Friedhof, die Hand und die Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl nach bis zu vier Karten mit dem bestimmten Namen und schicke sie ins Exil. Jener Spieler mischt und zieht dann für jede Karte, die auf diese Weise aus seiner Hand ins Exil geschickt wurde, eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584088&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc7b9a75-6da1-49a0-ab56-2a76adfb4774\', \'multiverseId\': 584088}, \'multiverseid\': 584088}, {\'name\': \'El Cerebro Pétreo\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, exiliar El Cerebro Pétreo: Elige un nombre de carta. Busca en el cementerio, mano y biblioteca del oponente objetivo hasta cuatro cartas con ese nombre y exílialas. Ese jugador baraja y luego roba una carta por cada carta exiliada de su mano de esta manera. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c23f282-7acf-40a3-9de9-99cd471abf97\', \'multiverseId\': 584349}, \'multiverseid\': 584349}, {\'name\': \'Le Cerveau de Pierre\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}, exilez Le Cerveau de Pierre : Choisissez un nom de carte. Cherchez dans le cimetière, la main et la bibliothèque d\'un adversaire ciblé jusqu\'à quatre cartes de ce nom et exilez-les. Ce joueur mélange, puis pioche une carte pour chaque carte exilée depuis sa main de cette manière. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584610&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0e962be-1de3-4d99-8456-e44821537997\', \'multiverseId\': 584610}, \'multiverseid\': 584610}, {\'name\': \'Il Cervello Roccioso\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Esilia Il Cervello Roccioso: Scegli il nome di una carta. Passa in rassegna il cimitero, la mano e il grimorio di un avversario bersaglio per trovare fino a quattro carte con quel nome ed esiliale. Quel giocatore rimescola, poi pesca una carta per ogni carta esiliata dalla propria mano in questo modo. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7168a5c7-2d56-4a54-96b6-eb0e3f75954a\', \'multiverseId\': 584871}, \'multiverseid\': 584871}, {\'name\': \'石の脳\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, 石の脳を追放する：対戦相手１人を対象とする。カードの名前１つを選ぶ。そのプレイヤーの墓地と手札とライブラリーから、その名前を持つカード最大４枚を探し、それらを追放する。そのプレイヤーはライブラリーを切り直し、その後、これにより自分の手札から追放されたカード１枚につきカード１枚を引く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86656e37-8164-4d58-94dd-38c415c3ce8c\', \'multiverseId\': 585132}, \'multiverseid\': 585132}, {\'name\': \'O Cérebro de Pedra\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, exile O Cérebro de Pedra: Escolha um nome de card. Procure no cemitério, na mão e no grimório do oponente alvo até quatro cards com aquele nome e exile-os. Aquele jogador embaralha e, em seguida, compra um card para cada card exilado da própria mão dessa forma. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f5c712-f3e1-4fae-b072-1d071ff30f40\', \'multiverseId\': 585393}, \'multiverseid\': 585393}, {\'name\': \'魔石大脑\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}，放逐魔石大脑：选择一个牌名。从目标对手的坟墓场，手牌及牌库中搜寻至多四张具该名称的牌，并将它们放逐。该牌手洗牌，然后每以此法从其手上放逐一张牌，其便抓一张牌。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f67b572b-bd7f-4f5b-b17f-eca75b412f98\', \'multiverseId\': 585654}, \'multiverseid\': 585654}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Steinhirn\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, schicke das Steinhirn ins Exil: Bestimme einen Kartennamen. Durchsuche den Friedhof, die Hand und die Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl nach bis zu vier Karten mit dem bestimmten Namen und schicke sie ins Exil. Jener Spieler mischt und zieht dann für jede Karte, die auf diese Weise aus seiner Hand ins Exil geschickt wurde, eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585842&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f786e51-e595-4a88-b57a-4338a604f414\', \'multiverseId\': 585842}, \'multiverseid\': 585842}, {\'name\': \'Le Cerveau de Pierre\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}, exilez Le Cerveau de Pierre : Choisissez un nom de carte. Cherchez dans le cimetière, la main et la bibliothèque d\'un adversaire ciblé jusqu\'à quatre cartes de ce nom et exilez-les. Ce joueur mélange, puis pioche une carte pour chaque carte exilée depuis sa main de cette manière. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585914&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'512a54b0-0fad-4346-9f7e-78807315a75c\', \'multiverseId\': 585914}, \'multiverseid\': 585914}, {\'name\': \'石の脳\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, 石の脳を追放する：対戦相手１人を対象とする。カードの名前１つを選ぶ。そのプレイヤーの墓地と手札とライブラリーから、その名前を持つカード最大４枚を探し、それらを追放する。そのプレイヤーはライブラリーを切り直し、その後、これにより自分の手札から追放されたカード１枚につきカード１枚を引く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e83264b-8084-491d-8131-0b9ef2d61038\', \'multiverseId\': 585986}, \'multiverseid\': 585986}, {\'name\': \'魔石大脑\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}，放逐魔石大脑：选择一个牌名。从目标对手的坟墓场，手牌及牌库中搜寻至多四张具该名称的牌，并将它们放逐。该牌手洗牌，然后每以此法从其手上放逐一张牌，其便抓一张牌。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddcf1d35-9d19-4702-9fe4-4bfeda3922f0\', \'multiverseId\': 586058}, \'multiverseid\': 586058}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dem Erdboden gleichmachen\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nZerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl. Falls sein Manabetrag 1 oder weniger war, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Elfenbeinturm nach den anderen fiel den apokalyptischen Invasoren zum Opfer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d00fbde-4e97-42ab-915f-f13500a8f181\', \'multiverseId\': 583995}, \'multiverseid\': 583995}, {\'name\': \'Asolación total\', \'text\': \'Este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado.\\nDestruye el artefacto objetivo. Si su valor de maná era de 1 o menos, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Primero cayó una torre de marfil, luego otra y después una tercera, mientras los invasores trazaban círculos alrededor de la ciudad como si fueran un reloj apocalíptico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c43634c5-c8b9-4caa-9601-3555519c4c30\', \'multiverseId\': 584256}, \'multiverseid\': 584256}, {\'name\': \'Rasez tout !\', \'text\': \'Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nDétruisez un artefact ciblé. Si sa valeur de mana était inférieure ou égale à 1, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Une première, une deuxième, puis une troisième tour d\'ivoire tomba aux mains des envahisseurs, qui avançaient autour de la ville dans un mouvement d\'horloge apocalyptique.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584517&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79bf5bb3-e86e-473c-bd1d-054ba0dd9caf\', \'multiverseId\': 584517}, \'multiverseid\': 584517}, {\'name\': \'Radere al Suolo\', \'text\': \'Questa magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nDistruggi un artefatto bersaglio. Se il suo valore di mana era pari o inferiore a 1, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Prima una, poi una seconda, poi una terza torre d\'avorio cadde per mano degli invasori, che si muovevano in cerchio intorno alla città come un orologio apocalittico.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f748c053-076c-46bb-9472-a03e25175ae7\', \'multiverseId\': 584778}, \'multiverseid\': 584778}, {\'name\': \'焼き討ち\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\nアーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのマナ総量が１以下であるなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'最初にひとつ、さらにひとつ、またひとつと象牙の塔が侵略者の軍門に下っていった。彼らはまるで終末の訪れを刻む時計の針のように、この都市をぐるっと巡っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd92da2e-0f48-4c2e-9e75-880c19b99244\', \'multiverseId\': 585039}, \'multiverseid\': 585039}, {\'name\': \'Assolação\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica não pode ser anulada.\\nDestrua o artefato alvo. Se seu valor de mana era igual ou inferior a 1, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Primeiro uma, depois a segunda, então a terceira das torres de marfim caiu ante os invasores, que traçaram um círculo ao redor da cidade como um relógio apocalíptico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567183c4-e3b5-4e8d-8b7c-25a5969042ce\', \'multiverseId\': 585300}, \'multiverseid\': 585300}, {\'name\': \'彻底摧毁\', \'text\': \'此咒语不能被反击。\\n消灭目标神器。如果其法术力值等于或小于1，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'象牙塔一座座接二连三地倾倒，敌兵攻势绕着环形的城墙走，一站站推动末日钟的指针。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb040151-3a6c-4968-85b1-2666d20d171e\', \'multiverseId\': 585561}, \'multiverseid\': 585561}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Stasis-Sarg\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, schicke den Stasis-Sarg ins Exil: Du erhältst Schutz vor allem bis zu deinem nächsten Zug.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Tawnos hatte ihn so gebaut, dass er sämtlichen Kräften aus dem Inneren standhalten würde. Glücklicherweise hielt er auch Kräften von außen stand.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584086&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f48bf2b8-031c-4fb9-8945-29a621c8fd61\', \'multiverseId\': 584086}, \'multiverseid\': 584086}, {\'name\': \'El Ataúd de Estasis\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, exiliar El Ataúd de Estasis: Ganas protección contra todo hasta tu próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Tawnos lo construyó para que fuera absolutamente impermeable a cualquier fuerza interior. Por suerte, también servía para cualquier fuerza exterior.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625ac419-75b7-4d5c-962a-ececa42bedb7\', \'multiverseId\': 584347}, \'multiverseid\': 584347}, {\'name\': \'Le Cercueil de Stase\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}, exilez Le Cercueil de Stase : Vous acquérez la protection contre tout jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "Tavnos le conçut pour être totalement imperméable à toute force qu\'il contiendrait. Heureusement, il fonctionnait aussi pour les forces qui l\'entouraient.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584608&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf40b536-e2c6-443f-9486-a5be5b0403d2\', \'multiverseId\': 584608}, \'multiverseid\': 584608}, {\'name\': \'Il Sarcofago di Stasi\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Esilia Il Sarcofago di Stasi: Hai protezione da tutto fino al tuo prossimo turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'Tawnos lo assemblò in modo che fosse del tutto impermeabile a qualsiasi forza interna. Per fortuna, funzionò anche per qualsiasi forza esterna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a595780-118c-469c-b779-a46548465664\', \'multiverseId\': 584869}, \'multiverseid\': 584869}, {\'name\': \'停滞の棺\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, 停滞の棺を追放する：次のあなたのターンまで、あなたはプロテクション（すべて）を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'タウノスは、中に入れたどんな力も絶対に染み出ないようにこの棺を作った。幸いなことに、それは棺の外の力に対しても有効だった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fca661f-dc4c-429a-b139-63cafc0ec7ea\', \'multiverseId\': 585130}, \'multiverseid\': 585130}, {\'name\': \'O Caixão de Estase\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, exile O Caixão de Estase: Você ganha proteção contra tudo até seu próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Tawnos o construiu para ser absolutamente impermeável a qualquer força do lado de dentro. Felizmente, isso também valia para qualquer força do lado de fora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d6fb045-6ae6-48c6-be18-5a1461b7d04e\', \'multiverseId\': 585391}, \'multiverseid\': 585391}, {\'name\': \'静态棺材\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}，放逐静态棺材：你获得反一切保护异能直到你的下一个回合。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'达硌士建造时仅确保其内里能量永不泄漏出外。所幸外部能量也不能进入其内。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ade133f-4ec4-450d-93f6-57b6ac741d04\', \'multiverseId\': 585652}, \'multiverseid\': 585652}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Stasis-Sarg\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, schicke den Stasis-Sarg ins Exil: Du erhältst Schutz vor allem bis zu deinem nächsten Zug.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585841&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d1e4aaa-08aa-4359-b2ef-75c723ca5a00\', \'multiverseId\': 585841}, \'multiverseid\': 585841}, {\'name\': \'Le Cercueil de Stase\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}, exilez Le Cercueil de Stase : Vous acquérez la protection contre tout jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a99ee1ba-27b6-4b78-b4aa-cd3caddab38c\', \'multiverseId\': 585913}, \'multiverseid\': 585913}, {\'name\': \'停滞の棺\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, 停滞の棺を追放する：次のあなたのターンまで、あなたはプロテクション（すべて）を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c2a0f33-017c-49d3-aaa4-55872a60d1f8\', \'multiverseId\': 585985}, \'multiverseid\': 585985}, {\'name\': \'静态棺材\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}，放逐静态棺材：你获得反一切保护异能直到你的下一个回合。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d41b8a1-393e-49be-be45-ba78b84b49f4\', \'multiverseId\': 586057}, \'multiverseid\': 586057}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Untergang von Kroog\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Gegner deiner Wahl. Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl, das jener Spieler kontrolliert. Der Untergang von Kroog fügt jenem Spieler 3 Schadenspunkte und jeder Kreatur, die er kontrolliert, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Als Vergeltung für den Hinterhalt des Kriegsfürsten auf dem Friedensgipfel machte Mishra die Hauptstadt Yotias dem Erdboden gleich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7ee1bc-1705-45bd-94c0-d8fe5e0eca52\', \'multiverseId\': 583979}, \'multiverseid\': 583979}, {\'name\': \'La caída de Kroog\', \'text\': \'Elige un oponente objetivo. Destruye la tierra objetivo que controla ese jugador. La caída de Kroog hace 3 puntos de daño a ese jugador y 1 punto de daño a cada criatura que controla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'En venganza por la emboscada del señor guerrero en la cumbre de paz, Mishra arrasó la capital de Yotia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2331ed83-f12d-4b11-b20a-567b31bb5c56\', \'multiverseId\': 584240}, \'multiverseid\': 584240}, {\'name\': \'La chute de Kroog\', \'text\': "Choisissez un adversaire ciblé. Détruisez un terrain ciblé que ce joueur contrôle. La chute de Kroog inflige 3 blessures à ce joueur et 1 blessure à chaque créature qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "En représailles pour l\'embuscade du Seigneur de guerre à la conférence de paix, Mishra rasa la capitale de Yotia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584501&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cf9b6d2-e441-4497-9968-6248c88dac34\', \'multiverseId\': 584501}, \'multiverseid\': 584501}, {\'name\': \'La Caduta di Kroog\', \'text\': \'Scegli un avversario bersaglio. Distruggi una terra bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore. La Caduta di Kroog infligge 3 danni a quel giocatore e 1 danno a ogni creatura che controlla.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Come rappresaglia all\'imboscata tesa dal signore della guerra al vertice di pace, Mishra rase al suolo la capitale di Yotia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6bb69d3-1f7d-434b-85e2-847e4bcb3594\', \'multiverseId\': 584762}, \'multiverseid\': 584762}, {\'name\': \'クルーグの陥落\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人と、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしている土地１つを対象とする。その土地を破壊する。クルーグの陥落はそのプレイヤーに３点のダメージ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしている各クリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'大将軍が仕掛けた和平交渉での不意打ちに対する報復として、ミシュラはヨーティアの首都を更地に変えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ab17b01-e8db-4131-8984-ebe9e34d88a0\', \'multiverseId\': 585023}, \'multiverseid\': 585023}, {\'name\': \'A Queda de Kroog\', \'text\': \'Escolha um oponente alvo. Destrua o terreno alvo que aquele jogador controla. A Queda de Kroog causa 3 pontos de dano àquele jogador e 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Como retaliação pela emboscada do Senhor da Guerra na Cúpula da Paz, Mishra arrasou a capital de Yotia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c2c4d2-048f-4bf0-99de-9ca5b0dd03d7\', \'multiverseId\': 585284}, \'multiverseid\': 585284}, {\'name\': \'萼城陷落\', \'text\': \'选择目标对手。消灭目标由该牌手操控的地。萼城陷落对该牌手造成3点伤害，且对每个由其操控的生物各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'为报复大领主在和平峰会上的突袭，米斯拉将佑天首都夷为平地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a3ce85f-122f-4d44-b7bc-1bf143c83a5e\', \'multiverseId\': 585545}, \'multiverseid\': 585545}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Zeitanker\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments wendest du Hellsicht 2 an.\\nImmer wenn du bestimmst, eine oder mehrere Karten unter deine Bibliothek zu legen, während du Hellsicht anwendest, schicke entsprechend viele Karten unten von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil.\\nWährend deines Zuges kannst du Karten spielen, die von Dem Zeitanker ins Exil geschickt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583928&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ee3cd62-d32b-4926-bca8-378974e56e90\', \'multiverseId\': 583928}, \'multiverseid\': 583928}, {\'name\': \'El Ancla Temporal\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, adivina 2.\\nSiempre que elijas poner una o más cartas en el fondo de tu biblioteca mientras adivinas, exilia esa misma cantidad de cartas del fondo de tu biblioteca.\\nDurante tu turno, puedes jugar cartas exiliadas con El Ancla Temporal.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e00782b7-ffff-4fc5-9d4c-bbd2a2959bf8\', \'multiverseId\': 584189}, \'multiverseid\': 584189}, {\'name\': "L\'Ancre temporelle", \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, regard 2.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous choisissez de mettre au moins une carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque en appliquant le regard, exilez autant de cartes du dessous de votre bibliothèque.\\nPendant votre tour, vous pouvez jouer des cartes exilées par L\'Ancre temporelle.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8b9ffaf-5f78-4e82-9b12-c09463dcff93\', \'multiverseId\': 584450}, \'multiverseid\': 584450}, {\'name\': "L\'Ancora Temporale", \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, profetizza 2.\\nOgniqualvolta scegli di mettere una o più carte in fondo al tuo grimorio mentre profetizzi, esilia altrettante carte dal fondo del tuo grimorio.\\nDurante il tuo turno, puoi giocare le carte esiliate con L\'Ancora Temporale.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d31946f-c7e9-4dcb-b522-9fbe43d3fbae\', \'multiverseId\': 584711}, \'multiverseid\': 584711}, {\'name\': \'時空錨\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、占術２を行う。\\n占術をしている間にあなたが１枚以上のカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置くことを選ぶたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番下にあるその枚数に等しい枚数のカードを追放する。\\nあなたのターンの間、時空錨によって追放されているカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd6a626-651a-4735-8d91-c6b9363ef689\', \'multiverseId\': 584972}, \'multiverseid\': 584972}, {\'name\': \'A Âncora Temporal\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, use vidência 2.\\nToda vez que você escolher colocar um ou mais cards no fundo de seu grimório enquanto usa vidência, exile aquela quantidade de cards do fundo de seu grimório.\\nDurante o seu turno, você pode jogar cards exilados com A Âncora Temporal.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35657e07-3250-4ce0-9e50-c7cd2fc56830\', \'multiverseId\': 585233}, \'multiverseid\': 585233}, {\'name\': \'时间锚\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，占卜2。\\n每当你于占卜期间选择将一张或数张牌置于你牌库底时，从你牌库底放逐等量的牌。\\n于你的回合中，你可以使用以时间锚放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59c53360-cb83-420b-8ab5-9927c522a58b\', \'multiverseId\': 585494}, \'multiverseid\': 585494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Zeitanker\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments wendest du Hellsicht 2 an.\\nImmer wenn du bestimmst, eine oder mehrere Karten unter deine Bibliothek zu legen, während du Hellsicht anwendest, schicke entsprechend viele Karten unten von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil.\\nWährend deines Zuges kannst du Karten spielen, die von Dem Zeitanker ins Exil geschickt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585796&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4bafaa-96ff-4b8a-b0a4-7e1f2cf21dfa\', \'multiverseId\': 585796}, \'multiverseid\': 585796}, {\'name\': "L\'Ancre temporelle", \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, regard 2.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous choisissez de mettre au moins une carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque en appliquant le regard, exilez autant de cartes du dessous de votre bibliothèque.\\nPendant votre tour, vous pouvez jouer des cartes exilées par L\'Ancre temporelle.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfe0856d-f06e-4acd-9404-0f2620f93948\', \'multiverseId\': 585868}, \'multiverseid\': 585868}, {\'name\': \'時空錨\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、占術２を行う。\\n占術をしている間にあなたが１枚以上のカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置くことを選ぶたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番下にあるその枚数に等しい枚数のカードを追放する。\\nあなたのターンの間、時空錨によって追放されているカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cef94d4-6ec1-4d73-b5d3-1e913fa6314b\', \'multiverseId\': 585940}, \'multiverseid\': 585940}, {\'name\': \'时间锚\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，占卜2。\\n每当你于占卜期间选择将一张或数张牌置于你牌库底时，从你牌库底放逐等量的牌。\\n于你的回合中，你可以使用以时间锚放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24685534-8432-48b6-b1a3-4ed1dcfdf948\', \'multiverseId\': 586012}, \'multiverseid\': 586012}]', '[{\'name\': \'Desynchronisieren\', \'text\': \'Der Besitzer einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, legt sie auf oder unter seine Bibliothek. Hellsicht 2.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Bevor Kaya Teferis Geist zurückholen konnte, gab der überlastete Zeitanker nach und der Strom der Zeit erfasste ihn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583892&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6922cfdd-76b6-4c26-b008-9a89ff206ac3\', \'multiverseId\': 583892}, \'multiverseid\': 583892}, {\'name\': \'Desincronizar\', \'text\': \'El propietario del permanente objetivo que no sea tierra lo pone en la parte superior o en el fondo de su biblioteca. Adivina 2.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Antes de que Kaya pudiera recuperar el espíritu de Teferi, el Ancla Temporal sobrecargada se averió y el mago se encontró vagando a la deriva por las corrientes del tiempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'206c8717-cdb9-48fa-a883-8db724ea820d\', \'multiverseId\': 584153}, \'multiverseid\': 584153}, {\'name\': \'Désynchronisation\', \'text\': "Le propriétaire d\'un permanent non-terrain ciblé le met au-dessus ou au-dessous de sa bibliothèque. Regard 2.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Avant que Kaya ne puisse réintégrer l\'esprit de Téfeiri, l\'Ancre temporelle surchargée lâcha, et il se mit à dériver dans les courants du temps.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584414&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'940d4f4b-68dc-4e69-9436-ce393ec6bf5b\', \'multiverseId\': 584414}, \'multiverseid\': 584414}, {\'name\': \'Desincronizzare\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario di un permanente non terra bersaglio mette quel permanente in cima o in fondo al suo grimorio. Profetizza 2.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Prima che Kaya potesse trascinare via lo spirito di Teferi, l\'ancora temporale sovraccaricata cedette e Teferi andò alla deriva nelle correnti del tempo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a010652b-d512-4e78-9c6a-ef37b8b5814b\', \'multiverseId\': 584675}, \'multiverseid\': 584675}, {\'name\': \'同調解除\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーの一番上か一番下に置く。占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ケイヤはテフェリーの精神を引き戻そうとしたが、時空錨が過負荷に耐えられず間に合わなかった。斯くしてテフェリーは時の流れを漂うことになったのである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff20a7e-3004-4773-832f-d2ac6700c673\', \'multiverseId\': 584936}, \'multiverseid\': 584936}, {\'name\': \'Dessincronizar\', \'text\': \'O dono da permanente alvo não de terreno a coloca no topo ou no fundo do próprio grimório. Use vidência 2.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Antes que Kaya conseguisse puxar de volta o espírito de Teferi, a âncora temporal sobrecarregada falhou e ele foi lançado à deriva na correnteza do tempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22511089-18ae-4062-8617-6a421f83de8e\', \'multiverseId\': 585197}, \'multiverseid\': 585197}, {\'name\': \'时间失调\', \'text\': \'目标非地永久物的拥有者将它置于其牌库顶或牌库底。占卜2。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'超载的时间锚很快就故障失灵，此时卡娅未及将泰菲力灵魂拽回，只得空留他在时间流中飘荡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bae236f-ea03-488a-b8f0-d812a3631442\', \'multiverseId\': 585458}, \'multiverseid\': 585458}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Hülle heißmachen\', \'text\': \'Die Hülle heißmachen fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte und dem Beherrscher jener bleibenden Karte 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Zerstörungskraft des neuen Geschützes machte seinen unvorhersehbaren Sprengradius mehr als wett.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584001&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3a90c9-9268-4db4-9ce9-81d942adee4e\', \'multiverseId\': 584001}, \'multiverseid\': 584001}, {\'name\': \'Bombardeo desatado\', \'text\': \'El Bombardeo desatado hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo y 2 puntos de daño al controlador de ese permanente.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El poder de destrucción del cañón nuevo compensaba de sobra que su radio de explosión fuera impredecible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40c5b41c-e1fa-44cb-b4bb-2cfdd1de8440\', \'multiverseId\': 584262}, \'multiverseid\': 584262}, {\'name\': "L\'enfer des obus", \'text\': "L\'enfer des obus inflige 5 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, et 2 blessures au contrôleur de ce permanent.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La puissance de destruction du nouveau canon compensait largement l\'imprévisibilité de son rayon d\'impact.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584523&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a6217e1-7e9c-4f28-a333-238ef220a92c\', \'multiverseId\': 584523}, \'multiverseid\': 584523}, {\'name\': "Scaricare l\'Inferno", \'text\': "Scaricare l\'Inferno infligge 5 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio e 2 danni al controllore di quel permanente.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Il potere distruttivo del nuovo cannone compensò abbondantemente l\'imprevedibilità del suo raggio di esplosione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a08a286-c9e8-498e-8252-78e028f6bfe5\', \'multiverseId\': 584784}, \'multiverseid\': 584784}, {\'name\': \'拡散砲\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。拡散砲はそれに５点のダメージ、そのパーマネントのコントローラーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'この新型大砲の破壊力は、爆発範囲が予測不可能という点を補って余りあるものだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5ede588-1fd0-4556-abff-1fbf7f994900\', \'multiverseId\': 585045}, \'multiverseid\': 585045}, {\'name\': \'Chover Granadas\', \'text\': \'Chover Granadas causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo e 2 pontos de dano ao controlador daquela permanente.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O poder destrutivo do novo canhão mais que compensou a imprevisibilidade do raio de suas explosões.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6af0754-ca22-4aac-af9a-6f58cdcea377\', \'multiverseId\': 585306}, \'multiverseid\': 585306}, {\'name\': \'猛烈开火\', \'text\': \'猛烈开火对目标生物或鹏洛客造成5点伤害，且对该永久物的操控者造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'新式火炮的毁灭威力，大大弥补了它爆破范围不可预测的缺陷。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79c25300-ddeb-444a-864c-6c73f0ca5564\', \'multiverseId\': 585567}, \'multiverseid\': 585567}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drache des Handwerkers\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{R}: Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nExhumieren {3}{R}{R} ({3}{R}{R}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586151&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95103d8b-c3e9-4f15-bed7-54778cafa2d1\', \'multiverseId\': 586151}, \'multiverseid\': 586151}, {\'name\': \'Dragón del artífice\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{R}: Las criaturas artefacto que controlas obtienen +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\nDesenterrar {3}{R}{R}. ({3}{R}{R}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aa13b78-d495-422b-86fa-2b34c0f0499f\', \'multiverseId\': 586156}, \'multiverseid\': 586156}, {\'name\': "Dragon de l\'artificier", \'text\': "Vol\\n{R} : Les créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nExhumation {3}{R}{R} ({3}{R}{R} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'134d6610-06ca-4743-8cac-39c6620012eb\', \'multiverseId\': 586161}, \'multiverseid\': 586161}, {\'name\': "Drago dell\'Artefice", \'text\': "Volare\\n{R}: Le creature artefatto che controlli prendono +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nDissotterrare {3}{R}{R} ({3}{R}{R}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ee5c495-436c-4c17-900a-900c2a1b9b4d\', \'multiverseId\': 586166}, \'multiverseid\': 586166}, {\'name\': \'工匠のドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{R}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n蘇生{3}{R}{R}（{3}{R}{R}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7a43cf8-188d-498c-9fb2-9cebb2a10d9e\', \'multiverseId\': 586171}, \'multiverseid\': 586171}, {\'name\': \'Dragão do Artífice\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{R}: As criaturas artefato que você controla recebem +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\nDesenterrar {3}{R}{R} ({3}{R}{R}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4e8080b-4f83-4c32-969f-4f0a889e6968\', \'multiverseId\': 586181}, \'multiverseid\': 586181}, {\'name\': \'神器师的巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{R}：由你操控的神器生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n破坟{3}{R}{R}（{3}{R}{R}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8115803b-efe8-43c5-962b-53c3d3a46306\', \'multiverseId\': 586191}, \'multiverseid\': 586191}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drache des Handwerkers\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{R}: Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nExhumieren {3}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586072&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ef972e-c5fb-4b89-9470-f917efda5299\', \'multiverseId\': 586072}, \'multiverseid\': 586072}, {\'name\': "Dragon de l\'artificier", \'text\': "Vol\\n{R} : Les créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nExhumation {3}{R}{R}", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586077&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74281edb-49e6-4896-9ed9-4b990f997566\', \'multiverseId\': 586077}, \'multiverseid\': 586077}, {\'name\': \'工匠のドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{R}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n蘇生{3}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020c58bc-f133-4616-bbb5-4ba4a81612e8\', \'multiverseId\': 586082}, \'multiverseid\': 586082}, {\'name\': \'神器师的巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{R}：由你操控的神器生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n破坟{3}{R}{R}\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a0f771-15ea-4c0c-8bd9-8dbc4bd5304f\', \'multiverseId\': 586087}, \'multiverseid\': 586087}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenschicksal\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat Flugfähigkeit, Eile und „{1}: Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges." Sie ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen ein Drache.\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, bringe das Drachenschicksal auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583976&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5b0da2d-bc34-407a-a4d9-42eedcbb47bb\', \'multiverseId\': 583976}, \'multiverseid\': 583976}, {\'name\': \'Destino dracónico\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene las habilidades de volar y prisa y "{1}: Esta criatura obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno". Es un Dragón además de sus otros tipos.\\nCuando la criatura encantada muera, regresa el Destino dracónico a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ad42517-b062-4730-b925-68ea3789c16b\', \'multiverseId\': 584237}, \'multiverseid\': 584237}, {\'name\': \'Destinée draconique\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a le vol, la célérité, et « {1} : Cette créature gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. » C\'est un dragon en plus de ses autres types.\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, renvoyez la Destinée draconique dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584498&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5efc363a-1d57-4187-a458-6e841c36a304\', \'multiverseId\': 584498}, \'multiverseid\': 584498}, {\'name\': \'Destino Draconico\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha volare, rapidità e "{1}: Questa creatura prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno". È un Drago in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nQuando la creatura incantata muore, fai tornare il Destino Draconico in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4972acc1-8086-4645-ac18-f849499c1e5b\', \'multiverseId\': 584759}, \'multiverseid\': 584759}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの運命\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、飛行と速攻と「{1}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ。それは、それの他のタイプに加えてドラゴンでもある。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、ドラゴンの運命をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbf32cf9-f07a-4856-99b8-c525587841c3\', \'multiverseId\': 585020}, \'multiverseid\': 585020}, {\'name\': \'Destino Dracônico\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem voar, ímpeto e "{1}: Esta criatura recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno." Ela é um Dragão além de seus outros tipos.\\nQuando a criatura encantada morrer, devolva Destino Dracônico para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae20285f-6f0d-4bb5-af4d-6901806a34c5\', \'multiverseId\': 585281}, \'multiverseid\': 585281}, {\'name\': \'化龙命运\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1，且具有飞行、敏捷与「{1}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。」它额外具有龙此类别。\\n当所结附的生物死去时，将化龙命运移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e181bc36-3d57-4325-bb21-119b103e1e28\', \'multiverseId\': 585542}, \'multiverseid\': 585542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenschicksal\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat Flugfähigkeit, Eile und „{1}: Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges." Sie ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen ein Drache.\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, bringe das Drachenschicksal auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585811&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e81c607-29d8-4e80-8800-20891beea2f5\', \'multiverseId\': 585811}, \'multiverseid\': 585811}, {\'name\': \'Destinée draconique\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a le vol, la célérité, et « {1} : Cette créature gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. » C\'est un dragon en plus de ses autres types.\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, renvoyez la Destinée draconique dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585883&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'819d5cc3-8705-461a-89f1-0fb58b7db74c\', \'multiverseId\': 585883}, \'multiverseid\': 585883}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの運命\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、飛行と速攻と「{1}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ。それは、それの他のタイプに加えてドラゴンでもある。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、ドラゴンの運命をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edb33847-312a-4134-88df-4368b1c1ddd6\', \'multiverseId\': 585955}, \'multiverseid\': 585955}, {\'name\': \'化龙命运\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1，且具有飞行、敏捷与「{1}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。」它额外具有龙此类别。\\n当所结附的生物死去时，将化龙命运移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd6cb275-d358-4e86-9531-deb856e6f576\', \'multiverseId\': 586027}, \'multiverseid\': 586027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drafna, Begründer von Lat-Nam\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}: Bringe ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{3}, {T}: Kopiere einen Artefaktzauber deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst. (Die Kopie wird zu einem Spielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'Seite an Seite mit Hurkyl, seiner Frau, schuf Drafna ein Vermächtnis der Gelehrsamkeit, das Jahrtausende überdauern sollte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583893&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac8c9b67-9161-45c6-ad37-d312914b8490\', \'multiverseId\': 583893}, \'multiverseid\': 583893}, {\'name\': \'Drafna, fundador de Lat-Nam\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}: Regresa el artefacto objetivo que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{3}, {T}: Copia el hechizo de artefacto objetivo que controlas. (La copia se convierte en una ficha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Junto con su esposa, Hurkyl, Drafna creó un legado de erudición que sobrevivió durante milenios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79ae54b2-4f52-404e-8027-5656768e57f6\', \'multiverseId\': 584154}, \'multiverseid\': 584154}, {\'name\': \'Drafna, fondateur de Lat-Nam\', \'text\': "{1}{U} : Renvoyez un artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{3}, {T} : Copiez un sort d\'artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez. (La copie devient un jeton.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier et conseiller\', \'flavor\': "Aux côtés de son épouse Hurkyl, Drafna bâtit un héritage d\'études qui perdura pendant des millénaires.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584415&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4524ce3-313a-4988-9c58-6ba646d8150a\', \'multiverseId\': 584415}, \'multiverseid\': 584415}, {\'name\': \'Drafna, Fondatore di Lat-Nam\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}: Fai tornare un artefatto bersaglio che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{3}, {T}: Copia una magia artefatto bersaglio che controlli. (La copia diventa una pedina.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Assieme a sua moglie Hurkyl, Drafna istituì una tradizione di sapienza che durò millenni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53b17eaf-e08d-4906-aadd-e5e6c53ea976\', \'multiverseId\': 584676}, \'multiverseid\': 584676}, {\'name\': \'ラト＝ナムの創立者、ドラフナ\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}：あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{3},{T}：あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・呪文１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。（そのコピーはトークンになる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'ドラフナは妻のハーキルとともに、数千年にわたって続く学問の遺産を築いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49e4700c-41f4-48ed-a9c5-f2d10f59ad97\', \'multiverseId\': 584937}, \'multiverseid\': 584937}, {\'name\': \'Drafna, Fundador de Lat-Nam\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}: Devolva o artefato alvo que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{3}, {T}: Copie a mágica de artefato alvo que você controla. (A cópia torna-se uma ficha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'Como sua esposa, Hurkyl, Drafna construiu um legado de erudição que durou milênios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6acf2115-a30b-467b-8aa5-ef55f54f9ceb\', \'multiverseId\': 585198}, \'multiverseid\': 585198}, {\'name\': \'拉特南创院人札夫拿\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}：将目标由你操控的神器移回其拥有者手上。\\n{3}，{T}：复制目标由你操控的神器咒语。（所成之复制品会成为衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'札夫拿与妻子河鼓共创了一门崭新学术体系，最终传承千代、造福万年。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf4f33a5-d26b-48f2-81fe-cfd53638ec43\', \'multiverseId\': 585459}, \'multiverseid\': 585459}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drafna, Begründer von Lat-Nam\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}: Bringe ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{3}, {T}: Kopiere einen Artefaktzauber deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585788&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d03d5b6e-cb1c-4b87-b681-b889c7a4032c\', \'multiverseId\': 585788}, \'multiverseid\': 585788}, {\'name\': \'Drafna, fondateur de Lat-Nam\', \'text\': "{1}{U} : Renvoyez un artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{3}, {T} : Copiez un sort d\'artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585860&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2ce9847-2660-4fbf-9749-3a3767ee0029\', \'multiverseId\': 585860}, \'multiverseid\': 585860}, {\'name\': \'ラト＝ナムの創立者、ドラフナ\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}：あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{3},{T}：あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・呪文１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f45b964b-d260-456d-96d9-4f1210b5a500\', \'multiverseId\': 585932}, \'multiverseid\': 585932}, {\'name\': \'拉特南创院人札夫拿\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}：将目标由你操控的神器移回其拥有者手上。\\n{3}，{T}：复制目标由你操控的神器咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89d45d4d-20c1-4147-a2a3-dd0172a2d0a2\', \'multiverseId\': 586004}, \'multiverseid\': 586004}]', "[{'name': 'Durchbohrender Kriegspflug', 'text': 'Todesberührung\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{B}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n1/1', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': 'Seine Aufgabe ist, Mauern und Willenskraft gleichermaßen zu brechen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583966&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f28f5886-ff4b-4344-a434-a628bd51b211', 'multiverseId': 583966}, 'multiverseid': 583966}, {'name': 'Arado de guerra embestidor', 'text': 'Toque mortal.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{B}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n1/1', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': 'Construido para aplastar muros y voluntades con la misma eficacia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584227&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8585369-2555-4563-af2b-ad168a7dcb41', 'multiverseId': 584227}, 'multiverseid': 584227}, {'name': 'Charrue de guerre éventreuse', 'text': 'Contact mortel\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{B}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n1/1', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': 'Construite autant pour détruire les volontés que les remparts.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584488&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca948074-0524-4968-b1d9-8a9288ec5441', 'multiverseId': 584488}, 'multiverseid': 584488}, {'name': 'Aratro da Guerra da Incornata', 'text': 'Tocco letale\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{B}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n1/1', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': 'Costruito per travolgere le mura e la volontà dei nemici in egual misura.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584749&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0f92328-1e57-470b-8328-33fefb18f1a6', 'multiverseId': 584749}, 'multiverseid': 584749}, {'name': '突き刺す戦耕し', 'text': '接死\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{B}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n１/１', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '石も意志も等しく打ち砕くために造られた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585010&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '522e0030-9e26-4cab-ba91-6a46c034aeb2', 'multiverseId': 585010}, 'multiverseid': 585010}, {'name': 'Arado de Guerra Sanguinário', 'text': 'Toque mortífero\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{B}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n1/1', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Constructo', 'flavor': 'Construído para esmagar paredes e propósitos na mesma medida.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585271&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f0a86bc-267b-496d-91d4-3d0c3f8bc483', 'multiverseId': 585271}, 'multiverseid': 585271}, {'name': '猛抵战犁', 'text': '死触\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{1}{B}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n1/1', 'type': '神器生物 ～组构体', 'flavor': '打造时便希冀能一举粉碎壁垒、击垮意志。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585532&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f11903dd-3dfe-4600-ae48-b0724dec31ea', 'multiverseId': 585532}, 'multiverseid': 585532}]", '[{\'name\': \'Durchgedrehte Milbe\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Durchgedrehte Milbe stirbt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n{G}, opfere die Durchgedrehte Milbe: Schicke ein Nichtkreatur-Artefakt oder eine Nichtkreatur-Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Man kann sie leicht zerquetschen, aber es ist echt schwierig, sie aus einer Werkbank herauszuwaschen."\\n—Tergel, Goblin-Explosionskünstler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584043&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01fec37a-7362-463e-bdb9-16648b418e10\', \'multiverseId\': 584043}, \'multiverseid\': 584043}, {\'name\': \'Ácaro desestabilizador\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ácaro desestabilizador muera, ganas 2 vidas.\\n{G}, sacrificar el Ácaro desestabilizador: Exilia el artefacto que no sea criatura o el encantamiento que no sea criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Aplastarlos es muy fácil, pero cuesta mucho limpiar los restos del banco de trabajo".\\n—Tergel, explosionador trasgo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e2b79f-9a49-4987-bed1-6033f422f634\', \'multiverseId\': 584304}, \'multiverseid\': 584304}, {\'name\': \'Puce détraquée\', \'text\': \'Quand la Puce détraquée meurt, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\n{G}, sacrifiez la Puce détraquée : Exilez une cible, artefact non-créature ou enchantement non-créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : insecte\', \'flavor\': "« Elles sont faciles à écraser, mais leurs restes s\'incrustent dans l\'établi. »\\n—Tergel, explogénieur gobelin", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584565&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2c758c-2181-4ff2-bd0c-0ca4531e7039\', \'multiverseId\': 584565}, \'multiverseid\': 584565}, {\'name\': \'Acaro del Corto Circuito\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Acaro del Corto Circuito muore, guadagni 2 punti vita.\\n{G}, Sacrifica l\'Acaro del Corto Circuito: Esilia un artefatto non creatura o un incantesimo non creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono piuttosto facili da schiacciare, ma ripulirli dal banco da lavoro è una gran seccatura."\\n—Tergel, goblin esplodente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e29ceff-e6ee-4aac-8b9b-a7b5069c47a1\', \'multiverseId\': 584826}, \'multiverseid\': 584826}, {\'name\': \'機能不全ダニ\', \'text\': \'機能不全ダニが死亡したとき、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\n{G}, 機能不全ダニを生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクトやエンチャントのうちクリーチャーでない１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「潰すのは簡単なんだけどよ、作業台から残らず洗い落とすのは面倒なんだよ。」\\n――ゴブリンの爆発技師、ターゲル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6fd5703-7868-4280-827c-54765eb626e7\', \'multiverseId\': 585087}, \'multiverseid\': 585087}, {\'name\': \'Ácaro do Curto-circuito\', \'text\': \'Quando Ácaro do Curto-circuito morre, você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\n{G}, sacrifique Ácaro do Curto-circuito: Exile o artefato não criatura ou encantamento não criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'"Esmagar é fácil. Limpar a bancada de trabalho depois é que são elas."\\n— Tergel, explodista goblin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eed25cc4-2594-4d1e-b968-eb81e38f3d4c\', \'multiverseId\': 585348}, \'multiverseid\': 585348}, {\'name\': \'失控虫械\', \'text\': \'当失控虫械死去时，你获得2点生命。\\n{G}，牺牲失控虫械：放逐目标非生物神器或非生物结界。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「它们虽然很容易碾碎，但从工作台上清干净很麻烦。」\\n～鬼怪爆炸家特格尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed3c02e6-52ba-44b7-8cdb-76683c73bc2e\', \'multiverseId\': 585609}, \'multiverseid\': 585609}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586208&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e86b4a9-6b5e-44e5-a8cf-cb4a60caaf2f', 'multiverseId': 586208}, 'multiverseid': 586208}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586218&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f64e09f3-5862-4cd5-be90-fdb7889974b0', 'multiverseId': 586218}, 'multiverseid': 586218}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586228&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9aacba2-848d-48b0-ba3e-d27fc1c09910', 'multiverseId': 586228}, 'multiverseid': 586228}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586238&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0f6addf-0a52-467a-9b0e-8da22444b618', 'multiverseId': 586238}, 'multiverseid': 586238}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586248&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ccdd86e9-4ad0-43a9-aa1a-36692ebe4a94', 'multiverseId': 586248}, 'multiverseid': 586248}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586268&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07f32f27-b722-46d5-b812-0591854f477e', 'multiverseId': 586268}, 'multiverseid': 586268}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586288&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfc0f2f7-fec0-496a-bb02-7660b80ee147', 'multiverseId': 586288}, 'multiverseid': 586288}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586209&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3204c20e-e6ae-4f76-bbb9-c38443baf775', 'multiverseId': 586209}, 'multiverseid': 586209}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586219&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a46fd5c-409c-475f-b30a-45ec009a68fa', 'multiverseId': 586219}, 'multiverseid': 586219}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586229&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea90a599-86b4-40ca-b86c-3e4f155167fb', 'multiverseId': 586229}, 'multiverseid': 586229}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586239&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '074caa96-a366-4414-8d93-22d2f8997a43', 'multiverseId': 586239}, 'multiverseid': 586239}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586249&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f39653c5-7093-4cc4-b6e5-9b58cb65b555', 'multiverseId': 586249}, 'multiverseid': 586249}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586269&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3135f0ec-ad62-44a3-94ab-c05ae5e6d6d4', 'multiverseId': 586269}, 'multiverseid': 586269}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586289&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b38adca-c20f-4ea2-8475-df13288c6ed3', 'multiverseId': 586289}, 'multiverseid': 586289}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586363&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dce81b0c-95d5-42ad-a6ce-5066c995ea6d', 'multiverseId': 586363}, 'multiverseid': 586363}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586373&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65dad8f2-19f0-4c28-9d46-67ddfa9ac86b', 'multiverseId': 586373}, 'multiverseid': 586373}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586383&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e3a8b27-ee24-4d19-8e84-8479f215fdad', 'multiverseId': 586383}, 'multiverseid': 586383}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586393&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d497ea7-ca2d-4fa5-9e83-2052ba34788c', 'multiverseId': 586393}, 'multiverseid': 586393}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586403&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b5d4662-f4ae-40a0-b8ce-51a5b5d0e950', 'multiverseId': 586403}, 'multiverseid': 586403}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586423&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e71bd6f3-1f12-42ca-a040-794c0d5fc813', 'multiverseId': 586423}, 'multiverseid': 586423}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586443&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9476208a-e30c-4d3f-9e97-a120fb7b7c4e', 'multiverseId': 586443}, 'multiverseid': 586443}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586364&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f679f46-96ca-4254-a871-14a89bbaf454', 'multiverseId': 586364}, 'multiverseid': 586364}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586374&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d147852-40b6-4b80-a83c-1cc7e4fd6df5', 'multiverseId': 586374}, 'multiverseid': 586374}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586384&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea5ba544-38cc-4698-8968-99c5d78cb6e0', 'multiverseId': 586384}, 'multiverseid': 586384}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586394&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e45f475b-f979-418f-85c9-34312d30ae2b', 'multiverseId': 586394}, 'multiverseid': 586394}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586404&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3a23d8c-f089-4f70-9e6e-7f6bf7a7a7b8', 'multiverseId': 586404}, 'multiverseid': 586404}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586424&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8dda7a1-791b-4f3c-97d1-f5b05ab08bfe', 'multiverseId': 586424}, 'multiverseid': 586424}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586444&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82412e45-1932-4d2c-9be8-55f911666cfd', 'multiverseId': 586444}, 'multiverseid': 586444}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ehrengarde aus Tomakul\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {2} (Immer wenn diese Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {2}.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'In der Großen Wüste gibt es ein oberstes Gesetz: Wasser gehört allen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584039&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'884b85e0-cad1-42ab-8fd2-9ba15eca4baf\', \'multiverseId\': 584039}, \'multiverseid\': 584039}, {\'name\': \'Guardia de honor de Tomakul\', \'text\': \'Rebatir {2}. (Siempre que esta criatura sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarréstalo a menos que ese jugador pague {2}.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'En el Gran Desierto, una sola ley prevalece sobre el resto: el agua es de todos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'119e5831-5231-4d5f-ade9-fb8c3264a560\', \'multiverseId\': 584300}, \'multiverseid\': 584300}, {\'name\': "Garde d\'honneur de Tomakul", \'text\': "Parade {2} (À chaque fois que cette créature devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {2}.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Dans le Grand désert, une loi prime sur toutes les autres : l\'eau appartient à tous.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584561&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d967bb4-302b-40d3-9306-edc20a535c53\', \'multiverseId\': 584561}, \'multiverseid\': 584561}, {\'name\': "Guardia d\'Onore di Tomakul", \'text\': \'Egida {2} (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {2}.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': "Nel Grande Deserto, una legge viene fatta rispettare su tutte le altre: l\'acqua è di tutti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9e505dd-2d78-4c0d-9e84-3e324a1d0a82\', \'multiverseId\': 584822}, \'multiverseid\': 584822}, {\'name\': \'トマクルの儀仗兵\', \'text\': \'護法{2}（このクリーチャーが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'大砂漠では、いかなる掟にも勝るひとつの掟が守られている。水は万人のものである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c642c41-8a6f-4aa6-8171-bf8fe7d77940\', \'multiverseId\': 585083}, \'multiverseid\': 585083}, {\'name\': \'Guarda de Honra de Tomakul\', \'text\': \'Salvaguarda {2} (Toda vez que esta criatura se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, anule-a, a menos que aquele jogador pague {2}.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'No Grande Deserto, uma lei é imposta acima de todas: a água pertence a todos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25949aee-98ef-4b2a-9b98-f8ff9510b627\', \'multiverseId\': 585344}, \'multiverseid\': 585344}, {\'name\': \'托玛库仪队兵\', \'text\': \'守护{2}（每当此生物成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该牌手支付{2}，否则反击之。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'在大沙漠有条至高无上的法律：水源共有。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03fe709e-8399-4a7f-9e9f-91a6e2e2a55c\', \'multiverseId\': 585605}, \'multiverseid\': 585605}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eigensinniger Baloth\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Eigensinnige Baloth ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nFalls ein Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, dazu führt, dass du den Eigensinnigen Baloth abwirfst, bringe ihn ins Spiel, anstatt ihn auf deinen Friedhof zu legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584032&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac321213-9760-439c-9ed8-47adaec1a527\', \'multiverseId\': 584032}, \'multiverseid\': 584032}, {\'name\': \'Báloth obstinado\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Báloth obstinado entre al campo de batalla, ganas 4 vidas.\\nSi un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente te hace descartar el Báloth obstinado, ponlo en el campo de batalla en vez de ponerlo en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4d2e216-ca36-413c-a7f5-25fb6ffac31d\', \'multiverseId\': 584293}, \'multiverseid\': 584293}, {\'name\': \'Baloth tenace\', \'text\': "Quand le Baloth tenace arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\\nSi un sort ou une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle vous contraint à vous défausser du Baloth tenace, mettez-le sur le champ de bataille à la place de le mettre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584554&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10cac9e6-f878-4133-890e-890613cdf7fb\', \'multiverseId\': 584554}, \'multiverseid\': 584554}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Testardo\', \'text\': \'Quando il Baloth Testardo entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 4 punti vita.\\nSe una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario ti fa scartare il Baloth Testardo, mettilo sul campo di battaglia invece di metterlo nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7d10aac-933d-4994-999e-8dffc32093e3\', \'multiverseId\': 584815}, \'multiverseid\': 584815}, {\'name\': \'強情なベイロス\', \'text\': \'強情なベイロスが戦場に出たとき、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力によってあなたが強情なベイロスを捨てるなら、これをあなたの墓地に置く代わりに戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76921027-0e8b-4ee7-a684-a3971f786a20\', \'multiverseId\': 585076}, \'multiverseid\': 585076}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Obstinado\', \'text\': \'Quando Baloth Obstinado entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\\nSe uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla fizer com que você descarte Baloth Obstinado, em vez de colocá-lo no seu cemitério, coloque-o no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc4fa77a-3352-47a2-bcaf-915edcb63325\', \'multiverseId\': 585337}, \'multiverseid\': 585337}, {\'name\': \'顽强巴洛西\', \'text\': \'当顽强巴洛西进战场时，你获得4点生命。\\n如果某个由对手操控的咒语或异能使你弃掉顽强巴洛西，则改为将它放进战场，而非置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43529380-c8b2-437b-a4ac-c2bbb296f838\', \'multiverseId\': 585598}, \'multiverseid\': 585598}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eilgetriebe-Sceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nWenn der Eilgetriebe-Sceada ins Spiel kommt, lege bis zu eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'Tawnos wurde für die Klauen des Sceadas von Raubvögeln inspiriert, die ihre Beute mit überwältigender Geschwindigkeit und Präzision greifen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'891b547e-8b7f-44d0-b673-f44c55284f2d\', \'multiverseId\': 584092}, \'multiverseid\': 584092}, {\'name\': \'Draco formaligera\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nCuando el Draco formaligera entre al campo de batalla, pon hasta una carta objetivo de un cementerio en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'Inspirado por las rapaces pescadoras, Tawnos diseñó las garras del draco para atrapar sus presas con una velocidad y una precisión abrumadoras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'470d0fc0-aafe-433c-9f31-9d009bafd21b\', \'multiverseId\': 584353}, \'multiverseid\': 584353}, {\'name\': \'Drakôn de rouages\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nQuand le Drakôn de rouages arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez jusqu\'à une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : drakôn\', \'flavor\': "Inspiré par les rapaces pêcheurs, Tavnos conçut les serres du drakôn pour qu\'ils saisissent leur proie avec une vitesse et une précision incroyables.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584614&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efda5113-f133-4cae-b67a-25a9942c2d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 584614}, \'multiverseid\': 584614}, {\'name\': \'Draghetto a Ingranaggi Rapidi\', \'text\': \'Volare, rapidità\\nQuando il Draghetto a Ingranaggi Rapidi entra nel campo di battaglia, metti fino a una carta bersaglio da un cimitero in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': \'Ispirato dai raptor pescatori, Tawnos progettò gli artigli del draghetto affinché ghermissero la preda con precisione e velocità travolgenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6065f42-f015-4b0d-9b0b-112542807a38\', \'multiverseId\': 584875}, \'multiverseid\': 584875}, {\'name\': \'速歯車のドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n速歯車のドレイクが戦場に出たとき、墓地にあるカード最大１枚を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'魚を捕まえる猛禽類に着想を得て、タウノスはこのドレイクの鉤爪を、獲物を圧倒的な速度と精度で捕えられるように設計した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a98feffe-2783-4788-b757-98cc0eff9102\', \'multiverseId\': 585136}, \'multiverseid\': 585136}, {\'name\': \'Dragonete Mecânico Veloz\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpeto\\nQuando Dragonete Mecânico Veloz entrar no campo de batalha, coloque até um card alvo de um cemitério no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': \'Inspirando-se nas aves de rapina pescadoras, Tawnos projetou as garras do dragonete para agarrar a presa com velocidade e precisão impressionantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7591a5e-bd4d-4be1-98f4-141489bca20d\', \'multiverseId\': 585397}, \'multiverseid\': 585397}, {\'name\': \'迅械龙兽\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n当迅械龙兽进战场时，将至多一张目标牌从坟墓场置于其拥有者的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'达硌士从捕鱼猛禽上得到启发，设计的龙兽利爪能在极速飞行时精准逮住猎物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ba95c0-2e17-4999-8150-43330e7b68bd\', \'multiverseId\': 585658}, \'multiverseid\': 585658}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eins mit dem Multiversum\', \'text\': \'Du kannst dir zu jedem Zeitpunkt die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen.\\nDu kannst Länder und Zaubersprüche oben von deiner Bibliothek spielen bzw. wirken.\\nEinmal während jedes deiner Züge kannst du einen Zauberspruch aus deiner Hand oder oben von deiner Bibliothek wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583905&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38172f7b-19fd-4b5f-b0d4-debd182f8919\', \'multiverseId\': 583905}, \'multiverseid\': 583905}, {\'name\': \'En armonía con el Multiverso\', \'text\': \'Puedes mirar la primera carta de tu biblioteca en cualquier momento.\\nPuedes jugar tierras y lanzar hechizos desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nUna vez durante cada uno de tus turnos, puedes lanzar un hechizo desde tu mano o desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f1e95ee-817f-43b2-98e2-08f20fe20d4b\', \'multiverseId\': 584166}, \'multiverseid\': 584166}, {\'name\': \'En harmonie avec le Multivers\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque à tout moment.\\nVous pouvez jouer des terrains et lancer des sorts depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nUne fois pendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez lancer un sort depuis votre main ou depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque sans payer son coût de mana.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df3a8c23-7c9a-4937-acc2-b44672bd97a3\', \'multiverseId\': 584427}, \'multiverseid\': 584427}, {\'name\': "Tutt\'uno con il Multiverso", \'text\': \'Puoi guardare la prima carta del tuo grimorio in qualsiasi momento.\\nPuoi giocare terre e lanciare magie dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\nUna volta durante ogni tuo turno, puoi lanciare una magia dalla tua mano o dalla cima del tuo grimorio senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41af9126-b7fe-40fe-b518-71a8a7f0d074\', \'multiverseId\': 584688}, \'multiverseid\': 584688}, {\'name\': \'多元宇宙と共に\', \'text\': \'あなたはいつでもあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見てよい。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上から土地をプレイしたり呪文を唱えたりしてもよい。\\nあなたの各ターン中に１回、あなたは、あなたの手札からかあなたのライブラリーの一番上から、呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da119e2f-d9c0-4c74-aa1e-23c0b812197a\', \'multiverseId\': 584949}, \'multiverseid\': 584949}, {\'name\': \'Uno com o Multiverso\', \'text\': \'Você pode olhar o card do topo de seu grimório a qualquer momento.\\nVocê pode jogar terrenos e conjurar mágicas do topo de seu grimório.\\nUma vez durante cada um de seus turnos, você pode conjurar uma mágica de sua mão ou do topo de seu grimório sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64fa63cf-c64b-4f18-978b-ff4549902e19\', \'multiverseId\': 585210}, \'multiverseid\': 585210}, {\'name\': \'多重宇宙加身\', \'text\': \'你可以随时检视你的牌库顶牌。\\n你可以从你的牌库顶使用地和施放咒语。\\n仅于你的每个回合中且限一次，你可以从你手上或你的牌库顶施放咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08987797-0e0f-47df-9444-44897c79c45c\', \'multiverseId\': 585471}, \'multiverseid\': 585471}]', "[{'name': 'Eins mit dem Multiversum', 'text': 'Du kannst dir zu jedem Zeitpunkt die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen.\\nDu kannst Länder und Zaubersprüche oben von deiner Bibliothek spielen bzw. wirken.\\nEinmal während jedes deiner Züge kannst du einen Zauberspruch aus deiner Hand oder oben von deiner Bibliothek wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585791&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c96d0c16-b294-4dbd-8e92-30d4981ccb52', 'multiverseId': 585791}, 'multiverseid': 585791}, {'name': 'En harmonie avec le Multivers', 'text': 'Vous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque à tout moment.\\nVous pouvez jouer des terrains et lancer des sorts depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nUne fois pendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez lancer un sort depuis votre main ou depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585863&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e800589-1f6e-42f4-ab8c-448c0010f9c1', 'multiverseId': 585863}, 'multiverseid': 585863}, {'name': '多元宇宙と共に', 'text': 'あなたはいつでもあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見てよい。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上から土地をプレイしたり呪文を唱えたりしてもよい。\\nあなたの各ターン中に１回、あなたは、あなたの手札からかあなたのライブラリーの一番上から、呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585935&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4749daf-9fe8-400a-821e-55466859d758', 'multiverseId': 585935}, 'multiverseid': 585935}, {'name': '多重宇宙加身', 'text': '你可以随时检视你的牌库顶牌。\\n你可以从你的牌库顶使用地和施放咒语。\\n仅于你的每个回合中且限一次，你可以从你手上或你的牌库顶施放咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586007&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be0e2315-03fd-4514-ade8-2bf84921eccc', 'multiverseId': 586007}, 'multiverseid': 586007}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eisenmagen-Brechmaschine\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Eisenmagen-Brechmaschine angreift, erhält eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Stärke der Eisenmagen-Brechmaschine ist.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n2/5\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584044&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e4cca56-14de-491a-904c-a248ace7475a\', \'multiverseId\': 584044}, \'multiverseid\': 584044}, {\'name\': \'Triturador de acero\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Triturador de acero ataque, la criatura atacante objetivo obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la fuerza del Triturador de acero.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n2/5\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4993d08-a432-4cbf-86e5-68d1df576b04\', \'multiverseId\': 584305}, \'multiverseid\': 584305}, {\'name\': \'Écrabouilleur gorge-de-fer\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Écrabouilleur gorge-de-fer attaque, une créature attaquante ciblée gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la force de l\'Écrabouilleur gorge-de-fer.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n2/5", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : guivre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584566&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe3c304-f435-4144-ba6c-6a28851c47a9\', \'multiverseId\': 584566}, \'multiverseid\': 584566}, {\'name\': \'Frantumatore Becco Ferreo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Frantumatore Becco Ferreo attacca, una creatura attaccante bersaglio prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è la forza del Frantumatore Becco Ferreo.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n2/5\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14f28dfe-b7e3-40a8-9542-c5c775f3eb6b\', \'multiverseId\': 584827}, \'multiverseid\': 584827}, {\'name\': \'鉄管の破壊者\', \'text\': \'鉄管の破壊者が攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘは鉄管の破壊者のパワーに等しい。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n2/5\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2268577f-b4ce-421f-bd5c-252d5616c9ec\', \'multiverseId\': 585088}, \'multiverseid\': 585088}, {\'name\': \'Esmagador Papo-de-ferro\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Esmagador Papo-de-ferro ataca, a criatura atacante alvo recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno, sendo X o poder de Esmagador Papo-de-ferro.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n2/5\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Vorme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d184a43d-b53b-434c-82d0-1f7204675115\', \'multiverseId\': 585349}, \'multiverseid\': 585349}, {\'name\': \'铁爪轧龙\', \'text\': \'每当铁爪轧龙攻击时，目标进行攻击的生物得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为铁爪轧龙的力量。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n2/5\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～亚龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48efd450-acc4-4826-bf46-075191db667d\', \'multiverseId\': 585610}, \'multiverseid\': 585610}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ende der Bruderschaft\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Ende der Bruderschaft fügt jeder Kreatur und jedem Planeswalker 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre jedes Artefakt mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der Wettstreit der Brüder uferte in offene Feindschaft aus und Tocasia musste den Preis dafür zahlen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2f138f8-5a3a-450b-9a05-59556b8b978a\', \'multiverseId\': 583974}, \'multiverseid\': 583974}, {\'name\': \'Fin de la hermandad\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El Fin de la hermandad hace 3 puntos de daño a cada criatura y a cada planeswalker.\\n• Destruye todos los artefactos con valor de maná de 3 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La rivalidad de los hermanos creció hasta convertirse en una enemistad absoluta, y Tocasia pagó el precio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'229458cf-3ec3-4885-b7ee-b72c3c6bebf7\', \'multiverseId\': 584235}, \'multiverseid\': 584235}, {\'name\': \'Fin de la fraternité\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• La Fin de la fraternité inflige 3 blessures à chaque créature et à chaque planeswalker.\\n• Détruisez tous les artefacts avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La rivalité des deux frères se transforma en haine, et Tocasia en paya le prix.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584496&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02c72ba9-71bf-437f-b2d8-3406e0d8c86b\', \'multiverseId\': 584496}, \'multiverseid\': 584496}, {\'name\': \'Fine del Rapporto Fraterno\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• La Fine del Rapporto Fraterno infligge 3 danni a ogni creatura e a ogni planeswalker.\\n• Distruggi tutti gli artefatti con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La rivalità tra i fratelli crebbe fino a diventare ostilità incondizionata e fu Tocasia a pagarne il prezzo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d8da5e2-b0c4-4332-9db7-314d9819d4a5\', \'multiverseId\': 584757}, \'multiverseid\': 584757}, {\'name\': \'兄弟仲の終焉\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・兄弟仲の終焉は各クリーチャーと各プレインズウォーカーにそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。\\n・マナ総量が３以下であるすべてのアーティファクトを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'兄弟の意地の張り合いは、取り付く島もない反目へと激化し、その対価はトカシアが払うことになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fa6695b-d775-493c-9bf1-ed2fcf339480\', \'multiverseId\': 585018}, \'multiverseid\': 585018}, {\'name\': \'Fim da Fraternidade\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Fim da Fraternidade causa 3 pontos de dano a cada criatura e a cada planeswalker.\\n• Destrua todos os artefatos com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A rivalidade dos irmãos cresceu, transformando-se numa inimizade absoluta, e Tocasia pagou o preço.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bcf3748-93ff-4a93-8c57-e4e70233c176\', \'multiverseId\': 585279}, \'multiverseid\': 585279}, {\'name\': \'兄弟反目\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•兄弟反目对每个生物和每个鹏洛客各造成3点伤害。\\n•消灭所有法术力值等于或小于3的神器。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'兄弟间的对立升级成全面对抗，付出代价的却是托卡西雅。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d5c675d-4c5b-45e4-80d0-64e11787eb82\', \'multiverseId\': 585540}, \'multiverseid\': 585540}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ende der Bruderschaft\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Ende der Bruderschaft fügt jeder Kreatur und jedem Planeswalker 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre jedes Artefakt mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585810&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02153ec1-7b04-4c6a-b15b-09a4ee702310\', \'multiverseId\': 585810}, \'multiverseid\': 585810}, {\'name\': \'Fin de la fraternité\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• La Fin de la fraternité inflige 3 blessures à chaque créature et à chaque planeswalker.\\n• Détruisez tous les artefacts avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3393823-ae92-4c1d-b211-06c524964526\', \'multiverseId\': 585882}, \'multiverseid\': 585882}, {\'name\': \'兄弟仲の終焉\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・兄弟仲の終焉は各クリーチャーと各プレインズウォーカーにそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。\\n・マナ総量が３以下であるすべてのアーティファクトを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11136071-35b5-4c9e-9919-229e74c7327d\', \'multiverseId\': 585954}, \'multiverseid\': 585954}, {\'name\': \'兄弟反目\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•兄弟反目对每个生物和每个鹏洛客各造成3点伤害。\\n•消灭所有法术力值等于或小于3的神器。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9729465c-ba8b-40be-931c-336a96fda240\', \'multiverseId\': 586026}, \'multiverseid\': 586026}]', '[{\'name\': \'Energierefraktor\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Energierefraktor ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{2}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Rohe Energie birgt unendliches Potenzial."\\n—Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584076&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'751600f9-433d-4aab-a540-e09be49b759f\', \'multiverseId\': 584076}, \'multiverseid\': 584076}, {\'name\': \'Refractor de energía\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Refractor de energía entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\n{2}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"La energía pura contiene una infinidad de posibilidades".\\n—Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d41a0993-8e32-4e26-8840-3d723626d157\', \'multiverseId\': 584337}, \'multiverseid\': 584337}, {\'name\': "Réfracteur d\'énergie", \'text\': "Quand le Réfracteur d\'énergie arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\n{2} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« L\'énergie brute contient des possibilités infinies. »\\n—Urza", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584598&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'002c7e72-a154-4a6f-bc72-4357ccce9322\', \'multiverseId\': 584598}, \'multiverseid\': 584598}, {\'name\': \'Rifrattore di Energia\', \'text\': \'Quando il Rifrattore di Energia entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\n{2}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'energia allo stato grezzo contiene infinite possibilità."\\n—Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e54929f0-9d69-45c4-80ae-74d8efd89dae\', \'multiverseId\': 584859}, \'multiverseid\': 584859}, {\'name\': \'エネルギー屈折体\', \'text\': \'エネルギー屈折体が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\n{2}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「未加工のエネルギーには無限の可能性がある。」\\n――ウルザ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'844bcfc7-73d4-49d6-b191-4cc30324fd0b\', \'multiverseId\': 585120}, \'multiverseid\': 585120}, {\'name\': \'Refrator de Energia\', \'text\': \'Quando Refrator de Energia entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\n{2}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A energia bruta contém infinitas possibilidades."\\n— Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27372b4b-b3c4-42dc-b7e4-2cb4bfa5a502\', \'multiverseId\': 585381}, \'multiverseid\': 585381}, {\'name\': \'能量折射镜\', \'text\': \'当能量折射镜进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n{2}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「原始能量蕴含无限可能。」\\n～克撒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2b4c32a-c302-464b-befc-92538cf4b401\', \'multiverseId\': 585642}, \'multiverseid\': 585642}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entfabrizieren\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Neutralisiere einen Artefakt- oder Verzauberungszauber deiner Wahl. Falls ein Zauberspruch auf diese Weise neutralisiert wird, schicke ihn ins Exil, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen.\\n• Neutralisiere eine aktivierte oder ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583891&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a7c7051-5b12-4dbb-9a50-09aa44687e1d\', \'multiverseId\': 583891}, \'multiverseid\': 583891}, {\'name\': \'Desmontar\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo de artefacto o de encantamiento objetivo. Si un hechizo es contrarrestado de esta manera, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario.\\n• Contrarresta la habilidad activada o disparada objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c140dfd-7e56-43cc-bc23-30cf67b87727\', \'multiverseId\': 584152}, \'multiverseid\': 584152}, {\'name\': \'Défabrication\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Contrecarrez un sort d\'artefact ou d\'enchantement ciblé. Si un sort est contrecarré de cette manière, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.\\n• Contrecarrez une capacité activée ciblée ou une capacité déclenchée ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584413&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59107f8c-f911-4afb-aef6-09ab61dcbc4d\', \'multiverseId\': 584413}, \'multiverseid\': 584413}, {\'name\': \'Decostruire\', \'text\': "Scegli uno —\\n• Neutralizza una magia artefatto o incantesimo bersaglio. Se una magia è neutralizzata in questo modo, esiliala invece di metterla nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\\n• Neutralizza un\'abilità attivata o innescata bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1150ec1e-f831-4e2e-90b5-4d124f61cd08\', \'multiverseId\': 584674}, \'multiverseid\': 584674}, {\'name\': \'組立分解\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・アーティファクトやエンチャントである呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。これによりその呪文が打ち消されたなら、それをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\\n・起動型や誘発型である能力１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a013bb-04bc-4a9f-ad92-cfde34548da5\', \'multiverseId\': 584935}, \'multiverseid\': 584935}, {\'name\': \'Desfabricar\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Anule a mágica de artefato ou encantamento alvo. Se uma mágica for anulada dessa maneira, exile-a em vez de colocá-la no cemitério de seu dono.\\n• Anule a habilidade ativada ou desencadeada alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b40f1fa-0221-4c2f-8af2-71ceadc456ac\', \'multiverseId\': 585196}, \'multiverseid\': 585196}, {\'name\': \'拆除装配\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•反击目标神器或结界咒语。如果以此法反击了该咒语，则改为将它放逐，而非置入拥有者的坟墓场。\\n•反击目标起动式或触发式异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3202598e-37ee-4074-af0b-bac3c97ac9d9\', \'multiverseId\': 585457}, \'multiverseid\': 585457}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entstellen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Mit einem metallenen Knall wie ein Blitzeinschlag wendete sich der Kriegsverlauf zugunsten Mishras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04123f59-fecc-49d4-bdd0-5a45e8349850\', \'multiverseId\': 583937}, \'multiverseid\': 583937}, {\'name\': \'Desfigurar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Con un chasquido metálico que recordó a la caída de un rayo, la suerte de la guerra cambió en favor de Mishra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b38ae594-9b6c-4a68-9b7e-68cf0e283fa0\', \'multiverseId\': 584198}, \'multiverseid\': 584198}, {\'name\': \'Défiguration\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Dans un fracas métallique aussi assourdissant qu\'un coup de tonnerre, le cours de la guerre changea en faveur de Mishra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3faa3acf-99fe-4b81-aa3f-1812f7d9e3ae\', \'multiverseId\': 584459}, \'multiverseid\': 584459}, {\'name\': \'Sfigurare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Con uno schiocco di metallo, simile a un lampo, le sorti della guerra volsero in favore di Mishra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a08abf6-e3a1-405d-92e3-ff71e40eb688\', \'multiverseId\': 584720}, \'multiverseid\': 584720}, {\'name\': \'見栄え損ない\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'金属の拉ぐ音が落雷の如く響き渡ると、戦いの潮目はミシュラの側に傾いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57936797-fa09-458c-8644-ea6e5a51cf31\', \'multiverseId\': 584981}, \'multiverseid\': 584981}, {\'name\': \'Desfigurar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Com um estalido metálico semelhante a um relâmpago, as sortes da guerra viraram a favor de Mishra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16d76bfb-13d6-429c-9635-aa14fc388db4\', \'multiverseId\': 585242}, \'multiverseid\': 585242}, {\'name\': \'毁容\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'随着雷鸣般的金属碎裂之声，战局瞬间倒向米斯拉一方。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982a5ab9-3283-4a4d-9af7-3285d88c32bd\', \'multiverseId\': 585503}, \'multiverseid\': 585503}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entzauberung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Eins erledigt, bleiben nur noch mehrere tausend."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583852&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'333fc6bc-9568-4db0-ba97-468fd256de41\', \'multiverseId\': 583852}, \'multiverseid\': 583852}, {\'name\': \'Desencantar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Uno menos. Solo quedan varios miles más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80b6aadb-0f43-4e4b-ba30-b8322ab25485\', \'multiverseId\': 584113}, \'multiverseid\': 584113}, {\'name\': \'Désenchantement\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Un de moins, encore plusieurs milliers à dégager. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584374&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feda7361-1fb9-4e33-8d70-35b3bcdd5d7c\', \'multiverseId\': 584374}, \'multiverseid\': 584374}, {\'name\': \'Disincantare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuori uno. Ne restano ancora altre migliaia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa42a611-f191-4615-bc17-fb52343cbc35\', \'multiverseId\': 584635}, \'multiverseid\': 584635}, {\'name\': \'解呪\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「一つ片付けた。残り数千といったところか。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbdbc6f1-9c7b-4612-9108-c87979b21db6\', \'multiverseId\': 584896}, \'multiverseid\': 584896}, {\'name\': \'Desencantar\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Menos um. Só faltam alguns milhares."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'779ccd5d-53ac-49a7-aa26-ee16500a513e\', \'multiverseId\': 585157}, \'multiverseid\': 585157}, {\'name\': \'消除魔障\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「解决掉一个，还有好几千。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34c25658-47d1-494c-9394-34e8ee57011e\', \'multiverseId\': 585418}, \'multiverseid\': 585418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Epische Konfrontation\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Sie kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Du bist alt geworden und dein Feuer erlischt langsam. Sollen wir noch ein paar letzte Worte wechseln oder muss ich dir jetzt ein Ende setzen?"\\n—Mishra, zu Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3abd5302-5dde-4668-b1b3-9917e0f3b2fc\', \'multiverseId\': 584021}, \'multiverseid\': 584021}, {\'name\': \'Confrontación épica\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+2 hasta el final del turno. Esa criatura lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Te dejaste envejecer y tu luz se apaga. ¿Quieres hablar una última vez o acabo contigo ya?".\\n—Mishra, a Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'271e99c6-c48b-40f8-83a8-aa72f76048f0\', \'multiverseId\': 584282}, \'multiverseid\': 584282}, {\'name\': \'Affrontement épique\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Elle se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Tu t\'es laissé vieillir, ta vie est proche de l\'extinction. Es-tu prêt à parler une dernière fois, ou dois-je te trucider tout de suite ? »\\n—Mishra, à Urza", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584543&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'311604da-0b6f-400c-847b-e0da475cd7de\', \'multiverseId\': 584543}, \'multiverseid\': 584543}, {\'name\': \'Scontro Epico\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Hai permesso alla tua carne di invecchiare e alla tua luce di affievolirsi. Ti va di parlare un\\\'ultima volta o devo annientarti subito?"\\n—Mishra a Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f37b9fae-707b-4747-8eea-bdc54d7d348f\', \'multiverseId\': 584804}, \'multiverseid\': 584804}, {\'name\': \'勇壮な対決\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、その前者は＋１/＋２の修整を受ける。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「おまえはその身を老いるに任せた、その光はか細くなった。最後にもう一度話そうか？ それとも今、殺したほうがいいか？」\\n――ミシュラからウルザへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aceff131-742a-479f-9828-245c0e8a41d1\', \'multiverseId\': 585065}, \'multiverseid\': 585065}, {\'name\': \'Confronto Épico\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+2 até o final do turno. Ela luta com a criatura alvo que você não controla. (Cada uma causa dano igual ao seu poder à outra.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Você envelheceu e perdeu sua luz. Quer conversar uma última vez ou é melhor eu te matar logo?"\\n— Mishra, a Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ef5a22b-2927-4b9b-bdb5-a8a3e1b19a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 585326}, \'multiverseid\': 585326}, {\'name\': \'壮绝对抗\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物得+1/+2直到回合结束。它与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你让你自己衰老得太快啦，所以你的光减弱了。我们该好好谈这最后一次呢，还是我现在就杀了你？」\\n～米斯拉嘲笑克撒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'309e5810-a4fc-4740-b8b6-dc8899e8dcc0\', \'multiverseId\': 585587}, \'multiverseid\': 585587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erweckung der Wälder\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 1/1 grüne Wald-Dryade-Landkreaturenspielsteine. (Sie sind von Einsatzverzögerung betroffen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir hatten erwartet, dass die Argothianer ihr Land verteidigen würden. Wir hatten nicht erwartet, dass das Land selbst sich verteidigen würde."\\n—Myrel, Schild von Argivia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584015&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de919ac7-d8e1-415e-995c-ba7f72aa0c6d\', \'multiverseId\': 584015}, \'multiverseid\': 584015}, {\'name\': \'Despertar del bosque\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura tierra Dríada Bosque verdes 1/1. (Están afectadas por el mareo de invocación.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esperábamos que los argotianos defendieran su tierra, pero no que la propia tierra se defendiera".\\n—Myrel, Escudo de Argivia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67854436-5f08-40cc-aa94-01c3369aa39e\', \'multiverseId\': 584276}, \'multiverseid\': 584276}, {\'name\': \'Éveil des bois\', \'text\': "Créez X jetons de créature-terrain 1/1 verte Forêt et Dryade. (Ils sont affectés par le mal d\'invocation.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Nous nous attendions à ce que les Argothiens se dressent contre nous. Nous ne pensions pas que la forêt le ferait. »\\n— Myrel, bouclier d\'Argive", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584537&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83003ba6-36ef-4a42-9f05-423827faf36f\', \'multiverseId\': 584537}, \'multiverseid\': 584537}, {\'name\': \'Risvegliare la Selva\', \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura terra Driade Foresta 1/1 verdi. (Hanno debolezza da evocazione.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Sapevamo che gli argothiani non avrebbero ceduto terreno. Ma non potevamo immaginare che il terreno stesso si sarebbe levato in loro aiuto."\\n—Myrel, Scudo di Argivia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d85c9b3-439f-4507-a1a9-8a6907c0a587\', \'multiverseId\': 584798}, \'multiverseid\': 584798}, {\'name\': \'森林の目覚め\', \'text\': \'緑の１/１の森・ドライアド・土地・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。（それらは召喚酔いの影響を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「アルゴスの地の民が抵抗するのは予測していた。アルゴスの地そのものが抵抗するのは予測していなかった。」\\n――アルガイヴの盾、ミュレル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32d68ee5-4161-4727-b959-51a55f916e2f\', \'multiverseId\': 585059}, \'multiverseid\': 585059}, {\'name\': \'Despertar as Matas\', \'text\': \'Crie X fichas de criatura terreno Floresta Dríade verde 1/1. (Elas ainda são afetadas pelo enjoo de invocação.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós esperávamos que os argothianos não cedessem terreno. O que não esperávamos é que o próprio terreno viesse em sua ajuda."\\n— Myrel, Escudo de Argivo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c66d20-c3fa-432d-bd70-d5b3302820cc\', \'multiverseId\': 585320}, \'multiverseid\': 585320}, {\'name\': \'唤醒林木\', \'text\': \'派出X个1/1绿色树林／树灵衍生地生物。（它们会受召唤失调影响。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们料到了亚格斯人会固守大地，但没料中大地自己起身固守。」\\n～阿基夫之盾穆雷尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0b9a6db-648a-421a-b0ff-c7cc9cda7424\', \'multiverseId\': 585581}, \'multiverseid\': 585581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erweckung der Wälder\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 1/1 grüne Wald-Dryade-Landkreaturenspielsteine. (Sie sind von Einsatzverzögerung betroffen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585819&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c13799bd-d0f5-46a4-86b3-1ff289104b82\', \'multiverseId\': 585819}, \'multiverseid\': 585819}, {\'name\': \'Éveil des bois\', \'text\': "Créez X jetons de créature-terrain 1/1 verte Forêt et Dryade. (Ils sont affectés par le mal d\'invocation.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'399fe688-9b06-4620-b0ce-87804823f133\', \'multiverseId\': 585891}, \'multiverseid\': 585891}, {\'name\': \'森林の目覚め\', \'text\': \'緑の１/１の森・ドライアド・土地・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。（それらは召喚酔いの影響を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e79dd6-b9dd-4875-b479-fc641767ae9f\', \'multiverseId\': 585963}, \'multiverseid\': 585963}, {\'name\': \'唤醒林木\', \'text\': \'派出X个1/1绿色树林／树灵衍生地生物。（它们会受召唤失调影响。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b937d16b-e4fb-4ce9-bde9-42f02bdb925a\', \'multiverseId\': 586035}, \'multiverseid\': 586035}]', '[{\'name\': \'Evangelist der Synthese\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Evangelist der Synthese ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\nSolange du in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr Karten gezogen hast, erhält der Evangelist der Synthese +1/+0 und hat Bedrohlichkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Schmiedet die Zukunft aus Metall und Öl!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584053&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'933403a9-5449-428c-83dc-a82ce9b4c2ad\', \'multiverseId\': 584053}, \'multiverseid\': 584053}, {\'name\': \'Evangelista de síntesis\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Evangelista de síntesis entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\\nMientras hayas robado dos o más cartas este turno, el Evangelista de síntesis obtiene +1/+0 y tiene la habilidad de amenaza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Forjemos el futuro con metal y aceite!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581b4435-d833-4af9-a2f8-eb659ec37a45\', \'multiverseId\': 584314}, \'multiverseid\': 584314}, {\'name\': \'Prédicateur de synthèse\', \'text\': "Quand le Prédicateur de synthèse arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nTant que vous avez pioché au moins deux cartes ce tour-ci, le Prédicateur de synthèse gagne +1/+0 et a la menace.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Forgez l\'avenir dans le métal et le pétrole. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584575&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb540d7-6b65-4c3a-8c35-fb633632c099\', \'multiverseId\': 584575}, \'multiverseid\': 584575}, {\'name\': \'Evangelista della Sintesi\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Evangelista della Sintesi entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\\nSe hai pescato due o più carte in questo turno, l\'Evangelista della Sintesi prende +1/+0 e ha minacciare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Forgia il futuro nel metallo e nell\\\'olio!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3827f6a-97fb-4ee9-ae56-6bce85498479\', \'multiverseId\': 584836}, \'multiverseid\': 584836}, {\'name\': \'統合の福音者\', \'text\': \'統合の福音者が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\\nこのターンにあなたが２枚以上のカードを引いたことがあるかぎり、統合の福音者は＋１/＋０の修整を受け威迫を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「金属と油を被りて未来を鍛造せん！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'165f4810-3cc6-4b47-9ebc-2600b158164b\', \'multiverseId\': 585097}, \'multiverseid\': 585097}, {\'name\': \'Evangelista da Síntese\', \'text\': \'Quando Evangelista da Síntese entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card e depois descarte um card.\\nContanto que você tenha comprado dois ou mais cards neste turno, Evangelista da Síntese recebe +1/+0 e tem ameaçar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Forjem o futuro em metal e óleo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c8e6d54-4c28-4773-bbf3-31f0417a52eb\', \'multiverseId\': 585358}, \'multiverseid\': 585358}, {\'name\': \'合成福音师\', \'text\': \'当合成福音师进战场时，抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\n只要你本回合中已抓两张或更多牌，合成福音师便得+1/+0且具有威慑异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「用钢铁烁油去铸就未来！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87a1c59e-cfcf-4b2d-a41d-aaeddb49ceff\', \'multiverseId\': 585619}, \'multiverseid\': 585619}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fallaji-Archäologin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Fallaji-Archäologin ins Spiel kommt, millst du drei Karten. Du kannst von den auf diese Weise gemillten Karten eine Karte, die weder eine Kreatur noch ein Land ist, auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du dies nicht tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Fallaji-Archäologin. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583894&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92b31f5e-fa1a-4e05-ad38-062f119416ee\', \'multiverseId\': 583894}, \'multiverseid\': 583894}, {\'name\': \'Arqueóloga fallaji\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Arqueóloga fallaji entre al campo de batalla, muele tres cartas. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta que no sea de tierra ni de criatura de entre las cartas molidas de esta manera. Si no lo haces, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Arqueóloga fallaji. (Para moler una carta, pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8450984e-01d9-4f78-a3f6-95fbb35eca83\', \'multiverseId\': 584155}, \'multiverseid\': 584155}, {\'name\': \'Archéologue fallaji\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Archéologue fallaji arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez trois cartes. Vous pouvez mettre dans votre main une carte non-créature, non-terrain parmi les cartes meulées de cette manière. Si vous ne faites pas ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Archéologue fallaji. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584416&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8b4b304-ae1f-4634-b98e-a06f66ecfabb\', \'multiverseId\': 584416}, \'multiverseid\': 584416}, {\'name\': \'Archeologa di Fallaji\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Archeologa di Fallaji entra nel campo di battaglia, macina tre carte. Puoi aggiungere alla tua mano una carta non terra, non creatura scelta tra le carte macinate in questo modo. Se non lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Archeologa di Fallaji. (Per macinare una carta, metti nel tuo cimitero la prima carta del tuo grimorio.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b41ca7cc-3427-4e38-a4e5-341d479ff0b1\', \'multiverseId\': 584677}, \'multiverseid\': 584677}, {\'name\': \'ファラジの考古学者\', \'text\': \'ファラジの考古学者が戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を切削する。あなたは、これにより切削されたカードの中からクリーチャーでも土地でもないカード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。そうしないなら、ファラジの考古学者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8f08032-333d-4f5c-9b8a-9e7e273f7c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 584938}, \'multiverseid\': 584938}, {\'name\': \'Arqueóloga Fallaji\', \'text\': \'Quando Arqueóloga Fallaji entrar no campo de batalha, triture três cards. Você pode colocar em sua mão um card não de criatura e não de terreno dentre os cards triturados dessa forma. Se não fizer isso, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Arqueóloga Fallaji. (Para triturar um card, coloque o card do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f74ee2ec-4c9e-48d0-b139-4140b5e7ee36\', \'multiverseId\': 585199}, \'multiverseid\': 585199}, {\'name\': \'法拉吉考古学家\', \'text\': \'当法拉吉考古学家进战场时，磨三张牌。你可以将以此法磨掉的一张非生物且非地的牌置于你手上。若你未如此作，则在法拉吉考古学家上放置一个+1/+1指示物。（磨一张牌的流程是将你牌库顶的牌置入你坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a842641-b67c-46a9-a5cb-d14e99bef596\', \'multiverseId\': 585460}, \'multiverseid\': 585460}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fallaji-Ausgrabung\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge drei getappte Kraftstein-Spielsteine. Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu. (Die Spielsteine sind Artefakte mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wenige Reliquien begeisterten die Archäologen der Fallaji so sehr wie Thran-Kraftsteine, die sie als die „Augen der Älteren" bezeichneten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584023&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33391b4a-e991-48b1-af25-135401d76fac\', \'multiverseId\': 584023}, \'multiverseid\': 584023}, {\'name\': \'Excavación fallaji\', \'text\': \'Crea tres fichas de Piedra de poder giradas. Ganas 3 vidas. (Las fichas son artefactos con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Pocas reliquias emocionaban tanto a los arqueólogos fallaji como las piedras de poder thran, a las que llamaban "ojos de los antiguos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aab4eb51-4d09-4d11-b0e0-fa7bc762a533\', \'multiverseId\': 584284}, \'multiverseid\': 584284}, {\'name\': \'Excavation fallaji\', \'text\': \'Créez trois jetons Lithoforce engagés. Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. (Les jetons sont des artefacts avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Peu de reliques enthousiasmaient plus les archéologues fallaji que les lithoforces thrans, qu\'ils appelaient les « yeux des Anciens ».", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584545&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffb288a9-d187-40e8-be1d-262f53421396\', \'multiverseId\': 584545}, \'multiverseid\': 584545}, {\'name\': \'Scavo di Fallaji\', \'text\': \'Crea tre pedine Pietra del Potere TAPpate. Guadagni 3 punti vita. (Le pedine sono artefatti con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Poche reliquie suscitavano l\\\'euforia degli archeologi di Fallaji come le pietre del potere dei Thran, che essi chiamavano gli "occhi degli Antichi".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'156f5cbe-c562-412c-83a6-6a4cf87636e0\', \'multiverseId\': 584806}, \'multiverseid\': 584806}, {\'name\': \'ファラジの発掘\', \'text\': \'パワーストーン・トークン３つをタップ状態で生成する。あなたは３点のライフを得る。（それらのトークンは「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ファラジの考古学者にとって、スランのパワーストーンほど心躍らせる遺物はない。彼らはそれを「古き者の目」と呼んでいた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3fb3288-03c9-4157-b8bc-2eb40714ae0a\', \'multiverseId\': 585067}, \'multiverseid\': 585067}, {\'name\': \'Escavação Fallaji\', \'text\': \'Crie três fichas de Pedra de Energia viradas. Você ganha 3 pontos de vida. (As fichas são artefatos com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Poucas relíquias empolgavam mais os arqueólogos fallaji que as pedras de energia dos thran, às quais chamavam "olhos dos Antigos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8699073f-8f93-464f-988b-443a19667172\', \'multiverseId\': 585328}, \'multiverseid\': 585328}, {\'name\': \'法拉吉掘古\', \'text\': \'派出三个已横置的魔力石衍生物。你获得3点生命。（这些衍生物是具有「{T}，加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'法拉吉考古学家从没遇到过像索蓝魔力石这样令他们欣喜若狂的遗宝。他们把这东西叫作「先贤之眼」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c48135f-ef50-43b5-8e62-29c85aba58bc\', \'multiverseId\': 585589}, \'multiverseid\': 585589}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fallaji-Drachenmaschine\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{2}: Die Fallaji-Drachenmaschine erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n1/3\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584005&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9053fd4b-e58c-4d5d-acc4-d6324bbd82be\', \'multiverseId\': 584005}, \'multiverseid\': 584005}, {\'name\': \'Dragón mecánico fallaji\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{2}: El Dragón mecánico fallaji obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n1/3\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a59b4cdd-9aed-4f22-9b4b-408feadd269e\', \'multiverseId\': 584266}, \'multiverseid\': 584266}, {\'name\': \'Dragon-machine fallaji\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{2} : Le Dragon-machine fallaji gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n1/3", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584527&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b26aa72a-8868-4314-acb7-463f6775dd14\', \'multiverseId\': 584527}, \'multiverseid\': 584527}, {\'name\': \'Drago Meccanico di Fallaji\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{2}: Il Drago Meccanico di Fallaji prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n1/3\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a31e264b-d62b-43ae-a86b-b025fcb634b7\', \'multiverseId\': 584788}, \'multiverseid\': 584788}, {\'name\': \'ファラジのドラゴン・エンジン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{2}：ターン終了時まで、ファラジのドラゴン・エンジンは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n//PRT-Prype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n１/３\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a162d71-01f8-4df7-bccd-3a193959cd65\', \'multiverseId\': 585049}, \'multiverseid\': 585049}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Mecânico Fallaji\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{2}: Dragão Mecânico Fallaji recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n1/3\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f394bf4-033e-4423-95a3-ac913002801f\', \'multiverseId\': 585310}, \'multiverseid\': 585310}, {\'name\': \'法拉吉龙形引擎\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{2}：法拉吉龙形引擎得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n//PRT-Prype_Mech//\\n{2}{R}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n1/3\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f5007dd-4fc5-4dcc-99fc-bd329ebc8301\', \'multiverseId\': 585571}, \'multiverseid\': 585571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fallaji-Kettentänzerin\', \'text\': \'{2}: Die Fallaji-Kettentänzerin erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Sie konnte es kaum erwarten, den einfallenden Yotianern zu zeigen, warum man sie „Sandsturm von Tomakul" nannte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0825659f-c4e3-4294-a2ee-8936dcf45e37\', \'multiverseId\': 583980}, \'multiverseid\': 583980}, {\'name\': \'Danzacadenas fallaji\', \'text\': \'{2}: La Danzacadenas fallaji gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'Estaba deseando enseñarles a los invasores yotianos por qué la apodaban la Tormenta de Arena de Tomakul.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e718f2f-48b8-408f-93a2-54aff9289fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 584241}, \'multiverseid\': 584241}, {\'name\': \'Dansechaînes fallaji\', \'text\': "{2} : La Dansechaînes fallaji acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Elle était impatiente de montrer aux envahisseurs yotiens comment elle avait obtenu son surnom, « la Tempête de sable de Tomakul ».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584502&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30017e06-edc0-481e-959c-2563ece13c07\', \'multiverseId\': 584502}, \'multiverseid\': 584502}, {\'name\': \'Scatenata di Fallaji\', \'text\': \'{2}: La Scatenata di Fallaji ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Era impaziente di dimostrare agli invasori di Yotia perché era stata soprannominata "La tempesta di sabbia di Tomakul".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46c5d270-c3f8-44fc-aba0-5cb567318cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 584763}, \'multiverseid\': 584763}, {\'name\': \'ファラジの鎖舞士\', \'text\': \'{2}：ターン終了時まで、ファラジの鎖舞士は二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は「トマクルの砂嵐」という異名を得た理由を侵略してくるヨーティア人に見せたがっていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d81dd63f-8b53-4cf7-b524-39e597359fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 585024}, \'multiverseid\': 585024}, {\'name\': \'Dançarina das Correntes Fallaji\', \'text\': \'{2}: Dançarina das Correntes Fallaji ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Ela estava ansiosa para mostrar aos invasores yotianos como ganhara seu apelido, "A Tempestade de Areia de Tomakul".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b8b27a0-0ba4-401b-8499-4749a9254c5f\', \'multiverseId\': 585285}, \'multiverseid\': 585285}, {\'name\': \'法拉吉舞链兵\', \'text\': \'{2}：法拉吉舞链兵获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'她迫不及待地想要向佑天侵略者展示自己「托玛库沙暴」外号的由来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40784ced-13ca-40d5-ac88-07dfc9c64891\', \'multiverseId\': 585546}, \'multiverseid\': 585546}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fallaji-Vorhut\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn die Fallaji-Vorhut oder eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Messing-Banner wird dem Kriegsfürsten beweisen, dass die Suwwardi-Mark den Fallaji gehört!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584054&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2a680ce-fa88-444c-b4b7-adf1804002e6\', \'multiverseId\': 584054}, \'multiverseid\': 584054}, {\'name\': \'Vanguardia fallaji\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que la Vanguardia fallaji u otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡El Estandarte Bruñido le enseñará al señor guerrero que las Marcas Suwwardi pertenecen a los fallaji!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81b649fb-767a-4cc3-a476-503839f75497\', \'multiverseId\': 584315}, \'multiverseid\': 584315}, {\'name\': \'Avant-garde fallaji\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Avant-garde fallaji ou une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« L\'Étendard Bruni montrera au Seigneur de guerre que les Marches Suwwardi appartiennent aux Fallaji ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584576&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d248ae77-22a9-48ed-891a-c2059beabbbc\', \'multiverseId\': 584576}, \'multiverseid\': 584576}, {\'name\': \'Avanguardia di Fallaji\', \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Avanguardia di Fallaji o un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo Stendardo Brunito mostrerà al signore della guerra che le Marche dei Suwwardi appartengono ai Fallaji!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5772a509-3371-41dd-8354-36bcbf5ca888\', \'multiverseId\': 584837}, \'multiverseid\': 584837}, {\'name\': \'ファラジの先兵\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nファラジの先兵やこれでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「スワルディの行進はファラジのものと、『輝く軍旗』が証だてる。大将軍よご覧あれ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5479d049-e880-460c-b2dc-512ed3940786\', \'multiverseId\': 585098}, \'multiverseid\': 585098}, {\'name\': \'Vanguarda Fallaji\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nToda vez que Vanguarda Fallaji ou outra criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, a criatura alvo recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"O Estandarte Brunido mostrará ao Senhor da Guerra que as Marcas Suwwardi pertencem aos fallaji!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee729b0c-02ac-4735-b27b-6ac5a16a28c3\', \'multiverseId\': 585359}, \'multiverseid\': 585359}, {\'name\': \'法拉吉先锋\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每当法拉吉先锋或另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，目标生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「铮旗军定会让大领主明白，苏瓦地岭属于法拉吉！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc58fa0b-e820-4c4d-8d1a-b02cdfb657aa\', \'multiverseId\': 585620}, \'multiverseid\': 585620}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fauna-Schamanin\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, wirf eine Kreaturenkarte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich rufe sowohl Räuber als auch Beschützer, denn jetzt ist Kriegssaison."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584024&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36f001d6-42c2-4716-b025-85d5db0336d0\', \'multiverseId\': 584024}, \'multiverseid\': 584024}, {\'name\': \'Chamán de la fauna\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, descartar una carta de criatura: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Estamos en guerra, por lo que convoco tanto a los depredadores como a los protectores".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c990852-bb14-4837-a436-eb15581a296e\', \'multiverseId\': 584285}, \'multiverseid\': 584285}, {\'name\': \'Shamane de la faune\', \'text\': "{G}, {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte de créature : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« J\'en appelle à la fois aux prédateurs et aux protecteurs, car nous sommes en saison de guerre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584546&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffe3ef30-9899-4a4f-8255-71729c59238b\', \'multiverseId\': 584546}, \'multiverseid\': 584546}, {\'name\': \'Sciamana della Fauna\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, Scarta una carta creatura: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Invoco il sostegno di predatori e protettori in egual misura, poiché questa è una stagione di guerra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c3089fd-70f0-42a6-9202-0d6706ea555d\', \'multiverseId\': 584807}, \'multiverseid\': 584807}, {\'name\': \'獣相のシャーマン\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, クリーチャー・カード１枚を捨てる：あなたのライブラリーからクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「捕食者と守護者の両方を呼びましょう。今は戦争の季節ですから。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a4e3455-4f95-45a1-8740-6b68594bbb52\', \'multiverseId\': 585068}, \'multiverseid\': 585068}, {\'name\': \'Xamã da Fauna\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, descarte um card de criatura: Procure um card de criatura em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu convoco protetores e predadores, pois é tempo de guerra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ad6e33-705c-4fae-b1a7-283e91b6ce85\', \'multiverseId\': 585329}, \'multiverseid\': 585329}, {\'name\': \'动物群祭师\', \'text\': \'{G}，{T}，弃掉一张生物牌：从你牌库中搜寻一张生物牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「所有猎食者与保护者都听我号令，如今战事将至。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4bf5ae-2f47-451e-9e7d-9709c41e8bdb\', \'multiverseId\': 585590}, \'multiverseid\': 585590}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fauna-Schamanin\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, wirf eine Kreaturenkarte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585821&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63da9827-8570-4d36-a907-dc1a1014a7b2\', \'multiverseId\': 585821}, \'multiverseid\': 585821}, {\'name\': \'Shamane de la faune\', \'text\': "{G}, {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte de créature : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585893&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94eea023-9c0f-411c-9bd8-29a7ba8da514\', \'multiverseId\': 585893}, \'multiverseid\': 585893}, {\'name\': \'獣相のシャーマン\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, クリーチャー・カード１枚を捨てる：あなたのライブラリーからクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57aa4218-ea03-46de-817f-da1047998c2f\', \'multiverseId\': 585965}, \'multiverseid\': 585965}, {\'name\': \'动物群祭师\', \'text\': \'{G}，{T}，弃掉一张生物牌：从你牌库中搜寻一张生物牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe655c5c-7802-41f9-833f-ecd4daed20d9\', \'multiverseId\': 586037}, \'multiverseid\': 586037}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feindselige Verhandlungen\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek als verdeckten Haufen ins Exil und schicke dann die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek als einen anderen verdeckten Haufen ins Exil. Schaue dir die Karten beider Haufen an und decke dann einen davon auf. Ein Gegner bestimmt einen der Haufen. Nimm ihn auf deine Hand und lege den anderen auf deinen Friedhof. Du verlierst 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c71e9241-cbdb-48a5-9ce0-16830959dc4b\', \'multiverseId\': 583951}, \'multiverseid\': 583951}, {\'name\': \'Negociación hostil\', \'text\': \'Exilia las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en un montón boca abajo y luego exilia las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en otro montón boca abajo. Mira las cartas de cada montón y luego pon un montón de tu elección boca arriba. Un oponente elige uno de esos montones. Pon ese montón en tu mano y el otro en tu cementerio. Pierdes 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa8aa2f5-c0c5-483e-a9d1-f1c4a8abc531\', \'multiverseId\': 584212}, \'multiverseid\': 584212}, {\'name\': \'Négociations hostiles\', \'text\': "Exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans un tas face cachée, puis exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans un autre tas face cachée. Regardez les cartes dans chaque tas, puis retournez un tas de votre choix face visible. Un adversaire choisit un de ces tas. Mettez ce tas dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière. Vous perdez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'532967d1-e44f-4794-9c7c-a3db4f64d9ab\', \'multiverseId\': 584473}, \'multiverseid\': 584473}, {\'name\': \'Negoziazioni Ostili\', \'text\': "Esilia le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio in una pila a faccia in giù, poi esilia le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio in un\'altra pila a faccia in giù. Guarda le carte in ogni pila, poi gira una pila a tua scelta a faccia in su. Un avversario sceglie una pila. Aggiungi alla tua mano quella pila e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero. Perdi 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db62592f-cb3f-4bce-982b-1afe92492ca6\', \'multiverseId\': 584734}, \'multiverseid\': 584734}, {\'name\': \'敵意ある交渉\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を裏向きの束にして追放する。その後、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を別の裏向きの束にして追放する。各束のカードをそれぞれ見、その後、あなたの選んだ束１つを表向きにする。対戦相手１人は、そのうちの１つの束を選ぶ。その束をあなたの手札に、もう一方の束をあなたの墓地に置く。あなたは３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6323f40-4618-4e96-afe1-7ea132bdd4a9\', \'multiverseId\': 584995}, \'multiverseid\': 584995}, {\'name\': \'Negociações Hostis\', \'text\': \'Exile os três cards do topo de seu grimório num monte com a face voltada para baixo, depois exile os três cards do topo de seu grimório em outro monte com a face voltada para baixo. Olhe os cards em cada monte e depois volte as faces de um dos montes à sua escolha para cima. Um oponente escolhe um dos montes. Coloque aquele monte em sua mão e o outro em seu cemitério. Você perde 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c23ff4a6-1cf2-4862-80fc-fbe1b46ad9ab\', \'multiverseId\': 585256}, \'multiverseid\': 585256}, {\'name\': \'敌意谈判\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的三张牌并牌面朝下地放作一堆，然后放逐你牌库顶的三张牌并牌面朝下地放作另一堆。检视各牌堆的牌，然后选择一堆并将其翻为牌面朝上。由任一对手选择其中一堆。将该堆牌置于你手上，另一堆则置入你的坟墓场。你失去3点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'129cc784-0753-48e6-b244-2ef130744f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 585517}, \'multiverseid\': 585517}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feindselige Verhandlungen\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek als verdeckten Haufen ins Exil und schicke dann die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek als einen anderen verdeckten Haufen ins Exil. Schaue dir die Karten beider Haufen an und decke dann einen davon auf. Ein Gegner bestimmt einen der Haufen. Nimm ihn auf deine Hand und lege den anderen auf deinen Friedhof. Du verlierst 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585804&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de5ebad8-b630-4755-a4ce-2475d629f372\', \'multiverseId\': 585804}, \'multiverseid\': 585804}, {\'name\': \'Négociations hostiles\', \'text\': "Exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans un tas face cachée, puis exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans un autre tas face cachée. Regardez les cartes dans chaque tas, puis retournez un tas de votre choix face visible. Un adversaire choisit un de ces tas. Mettez ce tas dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière. Vous perdez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'629c9a13-efde-429d-b88a-1437d77a5544\', \'multiverseId\': 585876}, \'multiverseid\': 585876}, {\'name\': \'敵意ある交渉\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を裏向きの束にして追放する。その後、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を別の裏向きの束にして追放する。各束のカードをそれぞれ見、その後、あなたの選んだ束１つを表向きにする。対戦相手１人は、そのうちの１つの束を選ぶ。その束をあなたの手札に、もう一方の束をあなたの墓地に置く。あなたは３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a2370a2-a7a3-4396-91b5-298bb0779719\', \'multiverseId\': 585948}, \'multiverseid\': 585948}, {\'name\': \'敌意谈判\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的三张牌并牌面朝下地放作一堆，然后放逐你牌库顶的三张牌并牌面朝下地放作另一堆。检视各牌堆的牌，然后选择一堆并将其翻为牌面朝上。由任一对手选择其中一堆。将该堆牌置于你手上，另一堆则置入你的坟墓场。你失去3点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c7a2d4a-6d2b-44d0-86df-39453b272b18\', \'multiverseId\': 586020}, \'multiverseid\': 586020}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feldon, Ronom-Ausgräber\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nFeldon, Ronom-Ausgräber, kann nicht blocken.\\nImmer wenn Feldon Schaden zugefügt wird, schicke entsprechend viele Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bestimme eine davon. Du kannst sie bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583981&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd789719-0462-47ce-a26d-f728459d67e6\', \'multiverseId\': 583981}, \'multiverseid\': 583981}, {\'name\': \'Feldon, excavador de Rónom\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nFeldon, excavador de Rónom no puede bloquear.\\nSiempre que Feldon reciba daño, exilia esa misma cantidad de cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Elige una de ellas. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ee50eea-6500-4b8c-b295-0e4f7429cd42\', \'multiverseId\': 584242}, \'multiverseid\': 584242}, {\'name\': \'Feldonn, excavateur de Ronom\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nFeldonn, excavateur de Ronom ne peut pas bloquer.\\n\\x81À chaque fois que Feldonn subit des blessures, exilez autant de cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Choisissez l\'une d\'elles. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584503&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70b79249-e4f4-479e-b292-f4fb0f493981\', \'multiverseId\': 584503}, \'multiverseid\': 584503}, {\'name\': \'Feldon, Dissotterratore di Ronom\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nFeldon, Dissotterratore di Ronom non può bloccare.\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno a Feldon, esilia altrettante carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio. Scegli una di quelle carte. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9a3dda5-2379-47b6-9b07-0addfd18dea2\', \'multiverseId\': 584764}, \'multiverseid\': 584764}, {\'name\': \'ロノムの発掘家、フェルドン\', \'text\': \'速攻\\nロノムの発掘家、フェルドンではブロックできない。\\nロノムの発掘家、フェルドンがダメージを受けるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるその点数に等しい枚数のカードを追放する。そのうちの１枚を選ぶ。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2382db80-eee2-4dd4-b809-054fe86eed61\', \'multiverseId\': 585025}, \'multiverseid\': 585025}, {\'name\': \'Feldon, Escavador de Ronom\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nFeldon, Escavador de Ronom, não pode bloquear.\\nToda vez que Feldon sofrer dano, exile aquela quantidade de cards do topo de seu grimório. Escolha um deles. Até o final do seu próximo turno, você pode jogar aquele card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36a7360d-84ff-49be-9df4-bdf950e3724e\', \'multiverseId\': 585286}, \'multiverseid\': 585286}, {\'name\': \'若纳掘古师费顿\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n若纳掘古师费顿不能进行阻挡。\\n每当费顿受到伤害时，从你牌库顶放逐等量的牌。选择其中一张。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9220161-73ed-47a9-9ee4-e2b46d668bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 585547}, \'multiverseid\': 585547}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feldon, Ronom-Ausgräber\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nFeldon, Ronom-Ausgräber, kann nicht blocken.\\nImmer wenn Feldon Schaden zugefügt wird, schicke entsprechend viele Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bestimme eine davon. Du kannst sie bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585812&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b141abcb-7784-4727-8bd0-ae1811a3ad5c\', \'multiverseId\': 585812}, \'multiverseid\': 585812}, {\'name\': \'Feldonn, excavateur de Ronom\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nFeldonn, excavateur de Ronom ne peut pas bloquer.\\n\\x81À chaque fois que Feldonn subit des blessures, exilez autant de cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Choisissez l\'une d\'elles. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64ede93f-2856-4e43-9c40-dd7dcdafd3b4\', \'multiverseId\': 585884}, \'multiverseid\': 585884}, {\'name\': \'ロノムの発掘家、フェルドン\', \'text\': \'速攻\\nロノムの発掘家、フェルドンではブロックできない。\\nロノムの発掘家、フェルドンがダメージを受けるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるその点数に等しい枚数のカードを追放する。そのうちの１枚を選ぶ。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66da3555-5615-4c6d-a2e8-d4c8a1a0c9d3\', \'multiverseId\': 585956}, \'multiverseid\': 585956}, {\'name\': \'若纳掘古师费顿\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n若纳掘古师费顿不能进行阻挡。\\n每当费顿受到伤害时，从你牌库顶放逐等量的牌。选择其中一张。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17e47ef4-f3d5-422d-9b1c-ade74c08fd51\', \'multiverseId\': 586028}, \'multiverseid\': 586028}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feldschmiede\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}. Die Feldschmiede fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Nachdem Terisiares Minen erschöpft waren, sah man immer mehr Kriegsgerät aus Altmetall."\\n—*Der Artefakt-Krieg*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584097&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d778f3-81ff-4dda-9116-d40af084391e\', \'multiverseId\': 584097}, \'multiverseid\': 584097}, {\'name\': \'Forja del campo de batalla\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}. La Forja del campo de batalla te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"A medida que las minas de Terisiare se agotaban, empezó a abundar la chatarra metálica".\\n—*La Guerra de las Antigüedades*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cce4483-2d4f-4b1d-ba83-bad5fcce71ae\', \'multiverseId\': 584358}, \'multiverseid\': 584358}, {\'name\': \'Forge de campagne\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}. La Forge de campagne vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Alors que les mines de Terisiare se vidaient, le métal de récupération devint de plus en plus abondant. »\\n—*La Guerre des Antiquités*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584619&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'191781ff-057e-47d4-a079-b681758f0cb0\', \'multiverseId\': 584619}, \'multiverseid\': 584619}, {\'name\': \'Forgia da Campo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}. La Forgia da Campo ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Mentre le miniere di Terisiare si esaurivano, i rottami metallici diventavano sempre più abbondanti."\\n—*La Guerra delle Antichità*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed950138-4d39-49c9-838d-1cafa113547b\', \'multiverseId\': 584880}, \'multiverseid\': 584880}, {\'name\': \'戦場の鍛冶場\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。戦場の鍛冶場はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「テリシアの鉱山が枯渇するにつれ、金属くずはいっそう潤沢になっていった。」\\n――*「アンティキティー戦争」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'180ac278-cf9c-46b8-a6f7-fd6c3aff4662\', \'multiverseId\': 585141}, \'multiverseid\': 585141}, {\'name\': \'Forjaria do Campo de Batalha\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}. Forjaria do Campo de Batalha causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Conforme as minas de Terisiare se esgotavam, a sucata se tornava cada vez mais abundante."\\n— *A Guerra das Antiguidades*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7621541b-8476-4b29-88d7-daef0cbc2c27\', \'multiverseId\': 585402}, \'multiverseid\': 585402}, {\'name\': \'战场融炉\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}。战场融炉对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「随着泰瑞西亚矿藏渐被挖空，金属废渣变得愈发常见。」\\n～*《古文明之战》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55f1d2a2-4c60-40f9-b2d1-e759e7567c3d\', \'multiverseId\': 585663}, \'multiverseid\': 585663}]', "[{'name': 'Feldschmiede', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}. Die Feldschmiede fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586097&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fc39a32-ccdb-41a3-9afc-3cbebbc0ae6e', 'multiverseId': 586097}, 'multiverseid': 586097}, {'name': 'Forja del campo de batalla', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}. La Forja del campo de batalla te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586103&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ffb2ca1-6b4f-4329-af54-119a4385c364', 'multiverseId': 586103}, 'multiverseid': 586103}, {'name': 'Forge de campagne', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}. La Forge de campagne vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586109&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7670f796-65e4-46f7-93c4-a7318b8bb39c', 'multiverseId': 586109}, 'multiverseid': 586109}, {'name': 'Forgia da Campo', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}. La Forgia da Campo ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586115&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e882956-8c46-4419-94c7-7c3320669988', 'multiverseId': 586115}, 'multiverseid': 586115}, {'name': '戦場の鍛冶場', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。戦場の鍛冶場はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586121&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ff2dba3-c988-4ae9-9333-0fe457eb35a6', 'multiverseId': 586121}, 'multiverseid': 586121}, {'name': 'Forjaria do Campo de Batalha', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}. Forjaria do Campo de Batalha causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586133&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '758e2dbd-a07a-4217-b42b-b28ae50fe007', 'multiverseId': 586133}, 'multiverseid': 586133}, {'name': '战场融炉', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}。战场融炉对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586139&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8533064-820b-4037-841a-beb8cdf0dfc9', 'multiverseId': 586139}, 'multiverseid': 586139}]", '[{\'name\': \'Felsenzweiggolem\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Felsenzweiggolem ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe seiner Stärke dazu.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{G}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'„Handwerk ist nicht die einzige Art der Schöpfung."\\n—Titania\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584041&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a8f107-c1dd-4d52-a100-8dd87b05f974\', \'multiverseId\': 584041}, \'multiverseid\': 584041}, {\'name\': \'Gólem pedrerrama\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gólem pedrerrama entre al campo de batalla, ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{G}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'"El artificio no es la única forma de creación".\\n—Titania\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f24d0459-c1f3-46eb-b724-be7307fdf4f6\', \'multiverseId\': 584302}, \'multiverseid\': 584302}, {\'name\': \'Golem brancheroche\', \'text\': \'Quand le Golem brancheroche arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{G}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "« L\'artifice n\'est pas l\'unique forme de création. »\\n—Titania", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584563&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf11756-ca87-4c4d-a00e-7486a1bb0bbe\', \'multiverseId\': 584563}, \'multiverseid\': 584563}, {\'name\': \'Golem Ramacigno\', \'text\': \'Quando il Golem Ramacigno entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni punti vita pari alla sua forza.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{G}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'artificio non è l\\\'unica forma di creazione."\\n—Titania\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9566df1e-201a-4adb-8e2d-02a122b6d03b\', \'multiverseId\': 584824}, \'multiverseid\': 584824}, {\'name\': \'岩枝のゴーレム\', \'text\': \'岩枝のゴーレムが戦場に出たとき、あなたはこれのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{G}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n３/３\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'「工匠の技のみが創造の形ではありませぬ。」\\n――ティタニア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37a41a1d-4534-482f-a8a2-01c358e2d7ff\', \'multiverseId\': 585085}, \'multiverseid\': 585085}, {\'name\': \'Golem Pedragalho\', \'text\': \'Quando Golem Pedragalho entra no campo de batalha, você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao seu poder.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{G}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'"O artifício não é a única forma de criação."\\n— Titânia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee50d154-5632-49ef-90b9-b2f6d586a3de\', \'multiverseId\': 585346}, \'multiverseid\': 585346}, {\'name\': \'岩枝魔像\', \'text\': \'当岩枝魔像进战场时，你获得等同于其力量的生命。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{G}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'「打造奇械并非创造的唯一方式。」\\n～泰坦尼亚\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5ca1b23-f635-4eb8-a93c-6e0e1a5642f6\', \'multiverseId\': 585607}, \'multiverseid\': 585607}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluss des Wissens\', \'text\': \'Ziehe für jede Insel, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte. Wirf dann zwei Karten ab.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Schärfe deinen Geist. Hältst du einen Teil des Ozeans, oder sind es tausend Regentropfen?"\\n—Hurkyl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583895&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06d0782d-a1c3-4ee7-b7f1-535d05a54c84\', \'multiverseId\': 583895}, \'multiverseid\': 583895}, {\'name\': \'Flujo de conocimiento\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta por cada Isla que controlas, luego descarta dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Céntrate. ¿Sostienes un pedazo del océano o miles de gotas de lluvia?".\\n—Hurkyl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69889b13-3abe-4b72-af01-69a6f38cb6e1\', \'multiverseId\': 584156}, \'multiverseid\': 584156}, {\'name\': \'Flot de savoir\', \'text\': \'Piochez une carte pour chaque île que vous contrôlez, puis défaussez-vous de deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Concentrez-vous. Tenez-vous une partie de l\'océan ou mille gouttes de pluie ? »\\n—Hurkyl", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584417&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77e12956-b026-4e19-a869-5a480c31d615\', \'multiverseId\': 584417}, \'multiverseid\': 584417}, {\'name\': \'Profluvio di Conoscenza\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta per ogni Isola che controlli, poi scarta due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Concentrati. Stai reggendo un pezzo di oceano o mille gocce di pioggia?"\\n—Hurkyl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3334cbd1-6d7f-40fb-87c4-f1049c62825b\', \'multiverseId\': 584678}, \'multiverseid\': 584678}, {\'name\': \'知識の流れ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている島１つにつき１枚のカードを引く。その後、カード２枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「心を凝らしなさい。あなたがつかんでいるのは大洋の一部なのですか？ それとも千の雨粒なのですか？」\\n――ハーキル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3787a3e7-50ef-4058-b10e-86338990d7bf\', \'multiverseId\': 584939}, \'multiverseid\': 584939}, {\'name\': \'Fluxo do Conhecimento\', \'text\': \'Compre um card para cada Ilha que você controla e depois descarte dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Concentre sua mente. Você está controlando um pedaço do oceano ou mil gotas de chuva?"\\n— Hurkyl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32658f58-9de7-42f5-9a54-467065b8e444\', \'multiverseId\': 585200}, \'multiverseid\': 585200}, {\'name\': \'知识涌流\', \'text\': \'抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的海岛数量，然后弃两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「集中精神。你控制的是一片海洋，还是千滴雨水？」\\n～河鼓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7163822-ce3c-4dc3-bf96-06274381755c\', \'multiverseId\': 585461}, \'multiverseid\': 585461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluss des Wissens\', \'text\': \'Ziehe für jede Insel, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte. Wirf dann zwei Karten ab.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Schärfe deinen Geist. Hältst du einen Teil des Ozeans, oder sind es tausend Regentropfen?"\\n—Hurkyl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586314&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'383cccda-2d73-4af8-b78c-94034e76dcc1\', \'multiverseId\': 586314}, \'multiverseid\': 586314}, {\'name\': \'Flujo de conocimiento\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta por cada Isla que controlas, luego descarta dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Céntrate. ¿Sostienes un pedazo del océano o miles de gotas de lluvia?".\\n—Hurkyl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d26cb45-d982-4b1c-89f0-9a4907229b33\', \'multiverseId\': 586319}, \'multiverseid\': 586319}, {\'name\': \'Flot de savoir\', \'text\': \'Piochez une carte pour chaque île que vous contrôlez, puis défaussez-vous de deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Concentrez-vous. Tenez-vous une partie de l\'océan ou mille gouttes de pluie ? »\\n—Hurkyl", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586324&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a127a7c7-388e-4970-84c3-a39d9a15ea2d\', \'multiverseId\': 586324}, \'multiverseid\': 586324}, {\'name\': \'Profluvio di Conoscenza\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta per ogni Isola che controlli, poi scarta due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Concentrati. Stai reggendo un pezzo di oceano o mille gocce di pioggia?"\\n—Hurkyl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee5956d5-4108-42ab-8d16-72c29cf3147d\', \'multiverseId\': 586329}, \'multiverseid\': 586329}, {\'name\': \'知識の流れ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている島１つにつき１枚のカードを引く。その後、カード２枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「心を凝らしなさい。あなたがつかんでいるのは大洋の一部なのですか？ それとも千の雨粒なのですか？」\\n――ハーキル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2835b08-6dc3-4522-9599-b7ca06969d22\', \'multiverseId\': 586334}, \'multiverseid\': 586334}, {\'name\': \'Fluxo do Conhecimento\', \'text\': \'Compre um card para cada Ilha que você controla e depois descarte dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Concentre sua mente. Você está controlando um pedaço do oceano ou mil gotas de chuva?"\\n— Hurkyl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43f404eb-dad2-499a-bce2-eb42431e5106\', \'multiverseId\': 586344}, \'multiverseid\': 586344}, {\'name\': \'知识涌流\', \'text\': \'抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的海岛数量，然后弃两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「集中精神。你控制的是一片海洋，还是千滴雨水？」\\n～河鼓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56c9474e-c6b8-4869-8f11-992a49c41b1a\', \'multiverseId\': 586349}, \'multiverseid\': 586349}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flügel des Aeronauten\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+0 und hat Flugfähigkeit.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Freiwilligen hinterfragten nur selten, warum das Fliegerbataillon ständig auf der Suche nach neuen Rekruten war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584073&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb3eb40a-5bda-4653-9fea-b13f7a20671f\', \'multiverseId\': 584073}, \'multiverseid\': 584073}, {\'name\': \'Alas de aeronauta\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+0 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Los voluntarios raramente preguntaban por qué el batallón aerotransportado no dejaba de reclutar gente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a786830-5921-49ee-839b-e0c9e974595f\', \'multiverseId\': 584334}, \'multiverseid\': 584334}, {\'name\': "Ailes d\'aéronaute", \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+0 et a le vol.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Les volontaires se demandaient rarement pourquoi le bataillon aéroporté semblait recruter constamment.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584595&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaa70638-4d7d-4d9e-aecb-b67245746bbb\', \'multiverseId\': 584595}, \'multiverseid\': 584595}, {\'name\': "Ali dell\'Aeronauta", \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+0 e ha volare.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'I volontari si chiedevano di rado il motivo per cui il battaglione aereo cercasse sempre nuove reclute.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51061a5e-62bb-4bb8-a5cc-9bf0f19329a0\', \'multiverseId\': 584856}, \'multiverseid\': 584856}, {\'name\': \'飛空士の翼\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け飛行を持つ。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'なぜ空挺大隊が常に新兵を募集しているのか、志願兵たちが疑問に思うことはめったになかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ead4ed4f-6c2d-4acb-aa16-2a05bfa27944\', \'multiverseId\': 585117}, \'multiverseid\': 585117}, {\'name\': \'Asas de Aeronauta\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+0 e tem voar.\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os voluntários raramente perguntavam por que o batalhão aéreo parecia estar sempre recrutando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2126f926-3675-4c1c-887b-f1602da19d8d\', \'multiverseId\': 585378}, \'multiverseid\': 585378}, {\'name\': \'空行者翔翼\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+0且具有飞行异能。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'志愿兵几乎从没问过空战营为什么总在募员。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df15241-e8f7-4a3b-aeb6-b4047298e459\', \'multiverseId\': 585639}, \'multiverseid\': 585639}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gaeas Geschenk\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursacht sie Trampelschaden und erhält Reichweite, Fluchsicherheit und Unzerstörbarkeit. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren. Schaden und Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Was den Kampf gegen eine Armee aus Bäumen anging, waren selbst Mishras beste Generäle auf dem Holzweg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584027&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c697fd55-e361-4849-b54f-d73a7a03176a\', \'multiverseId\': 584027}, \'multiverseid\': 584027}, {\'name\': \'Obsequio de Gaia\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas. Gana las habilidades de alcance, arrollar, antimaleficio e indestructible hasta el final del turno. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes. El daño y los efectos que dicen "destruir" no la destruyen.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando tuvieron que enfrentarse a un ejército de árboles, hasta los mejores generales de Mishra se quedaron sin palabras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7054c3-4753-4372-bdd8-9679b0c61899\', \'multiverseId\': 584288}, \'multiverseid\': 584288}, {\'name\': \'Bienfait de Gaia\', \'text\': "Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Elle acquiert la portée, le piétinement, la défense talismanique et l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent. Les blessures et les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne la détruisent pas.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Face à une armée d\'arbres, même les meilleurs généraux de Mishra étaient à court d\'idées.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584549&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b131d75-0601-48b0-9225-59ef84a6adfe\', \'multiverseId\': 584549}, \'multiverseid\': 584549}, {\'name\': \'Dono di Gea\', \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Ha raggiungere, travolgere, anti-malocchio e indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari. Il danno e gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non la distruggono.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando si trattò di affrontare un esercito di alberi, persino i migliori generali di Mishra si ritrovarono intralciati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04dc1f39-d0e0-4dea-96ec-711734f4c8cf\', \'multiverseId\': 584810}, \'multiverseid\': 584810}, {\'name\': \'ガイアの贈り物\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは到達とトランプルと呪禁と破壊不能を得る。（それは対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。ダメージや「破壊」と書かれた効果では、それは破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'いざ木々の軍勢と戦うと、ミシュラ麾下の名将たちさえ切り倒された。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bea50c1-2801-41d3-862f-fe0a65cf9aed\', \'multiverseId\': 585071}, \'multiverseid\': 585071}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva de Gaia\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla. Ela ganha alcance, atropelar, resistência a magia e indestrutível até o final do turno. (Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades que seus oponentes controlam. O dano e os efeitos que dizem "destrua" não a destroem.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quando chegou a hora de enfrentar um exército de árvores, nem os melhores generais de Mishra conseguiram chegar à raiz do problema.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f448f17-39fe-4031-a7f6-dbff9e148526\', \'multiverseId\': 585332}, \'multiverseid\': 585332}, {\'name\': \'盖亚赋礼\', \'text\': \'在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得延势、践踏、辟邪与不灭异能直到回合结束。（它不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。伤害与注明「消灭」的效应不会将它消灭。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'当要与树木大军作战时，就连米斯拉最优秀的将领都一筹莫展。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d89eea2-185e-4ed6-bf30-c6d819c9bcbb\', \'multiverseId\': 585593}, \'multiverseid\': 585593}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gaeas Rennerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Gaeas Rennerin angreift und falls sich drei oder mehr Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof befinden, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zentaur, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst die Blätter sträuben sich gegen eure Anwesenheit. Was könnt ihr schon gegen die Macht der Natur ausrichten?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584026&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40ba2be7-dfde-4e89-a857-5df9241afaa6\', \'multiverseId\': 584026}, \'multiverseid\': 584026}, {\'name\': \'Cazadora de Gaia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Cazadora de Gaia ataque, si hay tres o más cartas de criatura en tu cementerio, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado centauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hasta las hojas se oponen a su presencia. ¿Qué esperanza tienen contra el poder de la naturaleza?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f582519f-cca1-497c-b4f7-b301bf722ea8\', \'multiverseId\': 584287}, \'multiverseid\': 584287}, {\'name\': \'Coursière de Gaia\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Coursière de Gaia attaque, s\'il y a au moins trois cartes de créature dans votre cimetière, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : centaure et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Même les feuilles s\'opposent à votre présence. Quel espoir de victoire avez-vous face à la puissance de la nature ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584548&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cdffacd-37e9-408a-91f1-bf2df42dcdc3\', \'multiverseId\': 584548}, \'multiverseid\': 584548}, {\'name\': \'Corsiera di Gea\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la Corsiera di Gea attacca, se ci sono tre o più carte creatura nel tuo cimitero, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Centauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Persino le foglie si oppongono alla tua presenza qui. A quale speranza puoi mai aggrapparti contro la forza della natura?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f30f31b6-f140-48c8-8650-e7ed883603ca\', \'multiverseId\': 584809}, \'multiverseid\': 584809}, {\'name\': \'ガイアの狩猟者\', \'text\': \'ガイアの狩猟者が攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地に３枚以上のクリーチャー・カードがある場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ケンタウルス・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「木々の葉ですら、お主らがここに居座るのを拒絶しておる。自然の力に抗って、いかなる望みがあるというのか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccde93fd-019a-4d62-9718-ecc48a02e43c\', \'multiverseId\': 585070}, \'multiverseid\': 585070}, {\'name\': \'Centaura de Gaia\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Centaura de Gaia atacar, se houver três ou mais cards de criatura em seu cemitério, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Centauro Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Até as folhas se opõem à sua presença aqui. Que chance você tem contra a força da natureza?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22945011-9b30-4db4-831a-9fb8fc2cb6a5\', \'multiverseId\': 585331}, \'multiverseid\': 585331}, {\'name\': \'盖亚的骏马\', \'text\': \'每当盖亚的骏马攻击时，若你坟墓场中有三张或更多生物牌，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半人马／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「就连树叶也反对你的到来。你又拿什么来跟自然之力作对？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8de1ad-2afa-40e9-9d7f-ccc67d3741b7\', \'multiverseId\': 585592}, \'multiverseid\': 585592}]', "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586214&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39b763dd-c556-46dd-8946-0db511e81934', 'multiverseId': 586214}, 'multiverseid': 586214}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586224&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0ad2082-09c7-402a-bf94-788384aa592b', 'multiverseId': 586224}, 'multiverseid': 586224}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586234&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '158f1070-6591-43d8-b2f9-0e667c99a2fa', 'multiverseId': 586234}, 'multiverseid': 586234}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586244&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20b8ebf4-0630-4703-89c9-ac9c4c6e4647', 'multiverseId': 586244}, 'multiverseid': 586244}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586254&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9275e5d6-6200-43a1-a973-ff3e74223900', 'multiverseId': 586254}, 'multiverseid': 586254}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586274&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87b57aeb-c596-4bee-9842-72b4f0dfbe22', 'multiverseId': 586274}, 'multiverseid': 586274}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地 ～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586294&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '192fb46a-10c8-49b6-b20f-138240d18889', 'multiverseId': 586294}, 'multiverseid': 586294}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586215&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcc7485e-238a-49a7-8d39-6cbfd4cc4d67', 'multiverseId': 586215}, 'multiverseid': 586215}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586225&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edcabb3d-c56a-4a85-ac5a-d89074c8eeea', 'multiverseId': 586225}, 'multiverseid': 586225}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586235&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb79fdff-3810-444d-b45a-e5b3c0afd3e4', 'multiverseId': 586235}, 'multiverseid': 586235}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586245&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8dc25540-dbc1-4954-8ad4-57e2fdc9706e', 'multiverseId': 586245}, 'multiverseid': 586245}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586255&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82150031-8e83-4d6e-bb73-f112c5a08ca4', 'multiverseId': 586255}, 'multiverseid': 586255}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586275&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7c135c5-a4bc-4b47-9939-d7b7ece0072a', 'multiverseId': 586275}, 'multiverseid': 586275}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地 ～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586295&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fbc159d-374a-4516-b048-625e7ee870ea', 'multiverseId': 586295}, 'multiverseid': 586295}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586369&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a40febca-ece2-434c-be1f-aeee12fe97a9', 'multiverseId': 586369}, 'multiverseid': 586369}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586379&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd47f4136-ff0b-4bb3-a5d5-4b759814ed83', 'multiverseId': 586379}, 'multiverseid': 586379}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586389&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72052f0f-876e-4c36-a08d-4d1cc042232d', 'multiverseId': 586389}, 'multiverseid': 586389}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586399&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a72a2307-2b7f-49fd-892a-59a8ce1d2462', 'multiverseId': 586399}, 'multiverseid': 586399}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586409&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20d6ab1d-0060-4b1f-8279-ece4e47a7b47', 'multiverseId': 586409}, 'multiverseid': 586409}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586429&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9560da7c-d858-4d49-a6df-1fa0539ea320', 'multiverseId': 586429}, 'multiverseid': 586429}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地 ～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586449&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23d8f814-1736-45b4-b60c-983825a64935', 'multiverseId': 586449}, 'multiverseid': 586449}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586370&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f565739-685f-4445-92c3-637b5bd8b556', 'multiverseId': 586370}, 'multiverseid': 586370}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586380&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6de1a774-7b5c-4f30-adbd-df114308d7c2', 'multiverseId': 586380}, 'multiverseid': 586380}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586390&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96f208fd-db99-44cb-b558-ebf47f7a8e6f', 'multiverseId': 586390}, 'multiverseid': 586390}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586400&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4df10003-c787-4f4b-82a6-289ca954e832', 'multiverseId': 586400}, 'multiverseid': 586400}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586410&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c40a2b7-075e-441e-a325-86469aeff827', 'multiverseId': 586410}, 'multiverseid': 586410}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586430&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98bc06e1-b6a4-4bd2-a5ac-5cf852eece6a', 'multiverseId': 586430}, 'multiverseid': 586430}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地 ～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586450&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d5c9930-e341-4b4d-ab96-76fa867b5452', 'multiverseId': 586450}, 'multiverseid': 586450}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gehörnter Steinsammler\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nWenn der Gehörnte Steinsammler ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\\nWenn der Gehörnte Steinsammler das Spiel verlässt, opfere einen Kraftstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583984&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e9b037-f361-4e98-8237-7f1ff3be2c33\', \'multiverseId\': 583984}, \'multiverseid\': 583984}, {\'name\': \'Buscapiedras astado\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nCuando el Buscapiedras astado entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\\nCuando el Buscapiedras astado deje el campo de batalla, sacrifica una Piedra de poder.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ff7e82a-0aad-4206-8da6-e5cf272f1bd7\', \'multiverseId\': 584245}, \'multiverseid\': 584245}, {\'name\': \'Lithochercheur cornu\', \'text\': "Menace\\nQuand le Lithochercheur cornu arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)\\nQuand le Lithochercheur cornu quitte le champ de bataille, sacrifiez une lithoforce.", \'type\': \'Créature : lézard\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584506&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a237e711-4e39-457a-aef4-d9335fad7b25\', \'multiverseId\': 584506}, \'multiverseid\': 584506}, {\'name\': \'Cercapietre Cornuto\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\\nQuando il Cercapietre Cornuto entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\\nQuando il Cercapietre Cornuto lascia il campo di battaglia, sacrifica una Pietra del Potere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lucertola\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bb98f83-941e-4d51-8c34-b61fc094bada\', \'multiverseId\': 584767}, \'multiverseid\': 584767}, {\'name\': \'有角の石探し\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n有角の石探しが戦場に出たとき、パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n有角の石探しが戦場を離れたとき、パワーストーン１つを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4347bd7b-06eb-42c0-a490-a59b364b27e1\', \'multiverseId\': 585028}, \'multiverseid\': 585028}, {\'name\': \'Buscador de Pedras Cornudo\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nQuando Buscador de Pedras Cornudo entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\\nQuando Buscador de Pedras Cornudo deixar o campo de batalha, sacrifique uma Pedra de Energia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af54c9cf-420a-4a26-bf0b-ca0df00de2bd\', \'multiverseId\': 585289}, \'multiverseid\': 585289}, {\'name\': \'寻石角蜥\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n当寻石角蜥进战场时，派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\\n当寻石角蜥离开战场时，牺牲一个魔力石。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'654c98ed-5307-4378-954f-5adc27c982be\', \'multiverseId\': 585550}, \'multiverseid\': 585550}]', '[{\'name\': \'Genie des Schrottplatzes\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Genie des Schrottplatzes ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\\n{1}{B}{R}, opfere eine andere Kreatur oder ein anderes Artefakt: Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+0, Bedrohlichkeit und Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584058&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08a5fc96-9edd-4f18-bea8-cb97ba9ee2fb\', \'multiverseId\': 584058}, \'multiverseid\': 584058}, {\'name\': \'Genio de la chatarrería\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Genio de la chatarrería entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\\n{1}{B}{R}, sacrificar otra criatura o artefacto: Hasta el final del turno, las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0 y ganan las habilidades de amenaza y prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c63d01d1-dbd4-40eb-9091-5be0a0586f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 584319}, \'multiverseid\': 584319}, {\'name\': \'Génie du dépotoir\', \'text\': "Quand le Génie du dépotoir arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)\\n{1}{B}{R}, sacrifiez une autre créature ou un artefact : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 et acquièrent la menace et la célérité.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584580&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a781546c-53ef-43ab-b30c-323ecd193661\', \'multiverseId\': 584580}, \'multiverseid\': 584580}, {\'name\': \'Genio della Discarica\', \'text\': \'Quando il Genio della Discarica entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\\n{1}{B}{R}, Sacrifica un\\\'altra creatura o artefatto: Fino alla fine del turno, le altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+0 e hanno minacciare e rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3478e356-4816-433a-a559-c77580a116da\', \'multiverseId\': 584841}, \'multiverseid\': 584841}, {\'name\': \'廃品置場の天才\', \'text\': \'廃品置場の天才が戦場に出たとき、パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n{1}{B}{R}, クリーチャーやアーティファクトのうちこれでない１つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け威迫と速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7f1c2d6-b282-4050-b154-291535e852ce\', \'multiverseId\': 585102}, \'multiverseid\': 585102}, {\'name\': \'Gênio do Ferro-velho\', \'text\': \'Quando Gênio do Ferro-velho entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\\n{1}{B}{R}, sacrifique outra criatura ou artefato: Até o final do turno, as outras criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+0 e ganham ameaçar e ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f3b2c1e-1e18-4392-ae80-b0c6af0adcc9\', \'multiverseId\': 585363}, \'multiverseid\': 585363}, {\'name\': \'垃圾场天才\', \'text\': \'当垃圾场天才进战场时，派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\\n{1}{B}{R}，牺牲另一个生物或神器：直到回合结束，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+0且获得威慑与敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'449540e6-2dd6-4f45-9a97-e8f1e7b74d1c\', \'multiverseId\': 585624}, \'multiverseid\': 585624}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geologie-Enthusiastin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\\n{6}: Ziehe eine Karte und lege dann eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Geologie-Enthusiastin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586149&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'915443a1-3ac3-4c0a-8cc4-7c9e71e0f82a\', \'multiverseId\': 586149}, \'multiverseid\': 586149}, {\'name\': \'Geóloga entusiasta\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\\n{6}: Roba una carta y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Geóloga entusiasta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0a5d6e-c548-4814-878d-d617cc483bdf\', \'multiverseId\': 586154}, \'multiverseid\': 586154}, {\'name\': \'Passionnée de géologie\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)\\n{6} : Piochez une carte et mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Passionnée de géologie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586159&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e8d8a47-7271-437a-bd45-f2368891ed6b\', \'multiverseId\': 586159}, \'multiverseid\': 586159}, {\'name\': \'Geologa Fanatica\', \'text\': \'All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\\n{6}: Pesca una carta e metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Geologa Fanatica.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e0d990-ac41-487f-a6d7-127349d0964c\', \'multiverseId\': 586164}, \'multiverseid\': 586164}, {\'name\': \'地質学狂い\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n{6}：カード１枚を引き、地質学狂いの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18364917-6c3f-4212-9ebb-ccb3a872cb8c\', \'multiverseId\': 586169}, \'multiverseid\': 586169}, {\'name\': \'Entusiasta de Geologia\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\\n{6}: Compre um card e coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Entusiasta de Geologia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ff3dd62-a632-4095-8401-f41c8c67f802\', \'multiverseId\': 586179}, \'multiverseid\': 586179}, {\'name\': \'狂热地质家\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\\n{6}：抓一张牌并在狂热地质家上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46699d4c-32c2-4615-9299-ee74ed9f7ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 586189}, \'multiverseid\': 586189}]', "[{'name': 'Geologie-Enthusiastin', 'text': 'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein.\\n{6}: Ziehe eine Karte und lege dann eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Geologie-Enthusiastin.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586070&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b33faa9-dede-4d82-87e2-2acaa9345709', 'multiverseId': 586070}, 'multiverseid': 586070}, {'name': 'Passionnée de géologie', 'text': 'Au début de votre étape de fin, créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé.\\n{6} : Piochez une carte et mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Passionnée de géologie.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et artificier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586075&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01a433b7-7c67-45c8-bdcd-71943949c809', 'multiverseId': 586075}, 'multiverseid': 586075}, {'name': '地質学狂い', 'text': 'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。\\n{6}：カード１枚を引き、地質学狂いの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586080&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26b0f63f-5516-47e2-a3b4-f0e23d3cb022', 'multiverseId': 586080}, 'multiverseid': 586080}, {'name': '狂热地质家', 'text': '在你的结束步骤开始时，派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。\\n{6}：抓一张牌并在狂热地质家上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／神器师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586085&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e84bcd3-fecd-4372-89bb-2c3ba8f580c3', 'multiverseId': 586085}, 'multiverseid': 586085}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geschwisterrivalität\', \'text\': \'Übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Enttappe es bzw. sie. Es bzw. sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583998&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'596637ce-3567-466a-ad39-bdc10db75f67\', \'multiverseId\': 583998}, \'multiverseid\': 583998}, {\'name\': \'Rivalidad fraternal\', \'text\': \'Gana el control del artefacto o la criatura objetivo hasta el final del turno. Enderézalo. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1d1bee0-bf22-4b4b-ae47-f815616bdbf9\', \'multiverseId\': 584259}, \'multiverseid\': 584259}, {\'name\': \'Rivalité fraternelle\', \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle d\'une cible, artefact ou créature, jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez-la. Elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584520&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d292c599-e922-4843-b984-be25134d5dd6\', \'multiverseId\': 584520}, \'multiverseid\': 584520}, {\'name\': \'Rivalità Fraterna\', \'text\': \'Prendi il controllo di un artefatto o di una creatura bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quel permanente. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno. Crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82336e07-0cc8-4463-80b1-d0b259596c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 584781}, \'multiverseid\': 584781}, {\'name\': \'拮抗する兄弟\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。それをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15d528e5-4b64-4f03-86f5-81c20f1cead6\', \'multiverseId\': 585042}, \'multiverseid\': 585042}, {\'name\': \'Rivalidade Fraterna\', \'text\': \'Ganhe o controle do artefato ou da criatura alvo até o final do turno. Desvire-a. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno. Crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d40b420f-8399-4053-b774-cd60b0a533c6\', \'multiverseId\': 585303}, \'multiverseid\': 585303}, {\'name\': \'手足争斗\', \'text\': \'获得目标神器或生物的操控权直到回合结束。将之重置。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'991f06d6-2274-4fbe-97da-303030a11a79\', \'multiverseId\': 585564}, \'multiverseid\': 585564}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gestrüppland\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}. Das Gestrüppland fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Urza legte auf dem Weg nach Tomakul alle dreißig Meilen Befestigungen an und erschuf so ein Netzwerk aus Gräben, deren Kontrolle jahrzehntelang zwischen den Brüdern hin- und herwechseln sollte."\\n—*Der Artefakt-Krieg*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584099&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e50a63bb-d8a4-4e3e-b1d0-0f16992090a1\', \'multiverseId\': 584099}, \'multiverseid\': 584099}, {\'name\': \'Matorrales\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}. Los Matorrales te hacen 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Urza erigió una fortificación cada treinta millas en la ruta a Tomakul y creó una red de trincheras que cambiarían de manos entre los hermanos durante décadas".\\n—*La Guerra de las Antigüedades*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dca7b9a6-e757-482b-b0d2-cd43370ef339\', \'multiverseId\': 584360}, \'multiverseid\': 584360}, {\'name\': \'Broussaille\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}. La Broussaille vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Urza fortifia la route de Tomakul tous les trente miles, créant ainsi un réseau de tranchées que les frères s\'échangeraient pendant des décennies. »\\n—*La Guerre des Antiquités*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584621&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d65fa61-7a1d-464c-bef9-74047b7eff13\', \'multiverseId\': 584621}, \'multiverseid\': 584621}, {\'name\': \'Boscaglia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}. La Boscaglia ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Urza edificò fortificazioni ogni cinquanta chilometri lungo la via per Tomakul, creando una rete di trincee che i fratelli si sarebbero scambiati per decenni."\\n—*La Guerra delle Antichità*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a93aebb8-705f-4e66-bd23-1508e5485136\', \'multiverseId\': 584882}, \'multiverseid\': 584882}, {\'name\': \'低木林地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。低木林地はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「ウルザはトマクルへの道を三十マイルごとに要塞化し、兄弟が何十年も奪い合うことになる塹壕網を作った。」\\n――*「アンティキティー戦争」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71b0eced-40ca-4b7c-8044-e66c58ecf6ca\', \'multiverseId\': 585143}, \'multiverseid\': 585143}, {\'name\': \'Macegal\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}. Macegal causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Urza fortificou o caminho para Tomakul a cada 50 quilômetros, criando uma rede de trincheiras que os irmãos disputariam por décadas."\\n— *A Guerra das Antiguidades*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a3ae07b-af18-4258-b702-bed19e1961fe\', \'multiverseId\': 585404}, \'multiverseid\': 585404}, {\'name\': \'矮丛林地\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}。矮丛林地对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「在通往托玛库的路上，克撒每隔三十里便设置一处要冲，如此构成的壕沟网络四通八达，引得两兄弟数十年间拉锯不休。」\\n～*《古文明之战》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9057fd5a-b76e-4efc-af96-2f890e2ae0ce\', \'multiverseId\': 585665}, \'multiverseid\': 585665}]', "[{'name': 'Gestrüppland', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}. Das Gestrüppland fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586098&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd740f158-a087-4964-aee7-47da34c354f0', 'multiverseId': 586098}, 'multiverseid': 586098}, {'name': 'Matorrales', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}. Los Matorrales te hacen 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586104&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3435371f-a417-4637-a8cb-7e25e493e5b5', 'multiverseId': 586104}, 'multiverseid': 586104}, {'name': 'Broussaille', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}. La Broussaille vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586110&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '941a4033-d857-4ca8-8e8b-0056611ca6d8', 'multiverseId': 586110}, 'multiverseid': 586110}, {'name': 'Boscaglia', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}. La Boscaglia ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586116&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff1dd353-b041-4628-a173-d9f6c11832fd', 'multiverseId': 586116}, 'multiverseid': 586116}, {'name': '低木林地', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。低木林地はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586122&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d1cc415-5bed-4eae-b152-75bfedf00b7a', 'multiverseId': 586122}, 'multiverseid': 586122}, {'name': 'Macegal', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}. Macegal causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586134&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b790c37-e90d-42c6-87e0-a0c7b1337145', 'multiverseId': 586134}, 'multiverseid': 586134}, {'name': '矮丛林地', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}。矮丛林地对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586140&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '796b1944-5d45-4775-bcad-a4bebc3c0176', 'multiverseId': 586140}, 'multiverseid': 586140}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gix, Prätor von Yawgmoth\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur einem deiner Gegner Kampfschaden zufügt, kann ihr Beherrscher 1 Lebenspunkt bezahlen. Falls er dies tut, zieht er eine Karte.\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}, wirf X Karten ab: Schicke die obersten X Karten der Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl ins Exil. Du kannst von den auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickten Karten Länder spielen und Zaubersprüche wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Prätor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583941&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c616e18-227a-4abf-add5-3474b0598f36\', \'multiverseId\': 583941}, \'multiverseid\': 583941}, {\'name\': \'Gix, magistrado de Yawgmoth\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura haga daño de combate a uno de tus oponentes, su controlador puede pagar 1 vida. Si lo hace, ese jugador roba una carta.\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}, descartar X cartas: Exilia las X primeras cartas de la biblioteca del oponente objetivo. Puedes jugar tierras y lanzar hechizos de entre las cartas exiliadas de esta manera sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Magistrado pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6672f688-4547-4046-b670-2d1b0f922a7f\', \'multiverseId\': 584202}, \'multiverseid\': 584202}, {\'name\': \'Gix, praetor de Yaugzebul\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature inflige des blessures de combat à l\'un de vos adversaires, son contrôleur peut payer 1 point de vie. S\'il fait ainsi, il pioche une carte.\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}, défaussez-vous de X cartes : Exilez les X cartes du dessus de la bibliothèque d\'un adversaire ciblé. Vous pouvez jouer des terrains et lancer des sorts parmi les cartes exilées de cette manière sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : phyrexian et praetor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f165a8b0-ed9b-4321-8afa-55235b7f4318\', \'multiverseId\': 584463}, \'multiverseid\': 584463}, {\'name\': \'Gix, Pretore di Yawgmoth\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura infligge danno da combattimento a uno dei tuoi avversari, il suo controllore può pagare 1 punto vita. Se lo fa, quel giocatore pesca una carta.\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}, Scarta X carte: Esilia le prime X carte del grimorio di un avversario bersaglio. Puoi giocare terre e lanciare magie scelte tra le carte esiliate in questo modo senza pagare i loro costi di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Pretore Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e206a12-1782-47f5-bf32-869cf545651e\', \'multiverseId\': 584724}, \'multiverseid\': 584724}, {\'name\': \'ヨーグモスの法務官、ギックス\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体があなたの対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それのコントローラーは１点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を引く。\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}, カードＸ枚を捨てる：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を追放する。あなたはこれにより追放されているカードの中から、土地をプレイしたりマナ・コストを支払うことなく呪文を唱えたりしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・法務官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bed2600-06e8-4814-a814-34752771274f\', \'multiverseId\': 584985}, \'multiverseid\': 584985}, {\'name\': \'Gix, Pretor de Yawgmoth\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura causa dano de combate a um de seus oponentes, seu controlador pode pagar 1 ponto de vida. Se fizer isso, ele compra um card.\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}, descarte X cards: Exile os X cards do topo do grimório do oponente alvo. Você pode jogar terrenos e conjurar mágicas dentre os cards exilados dessa forma sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Phyrexiano Pretor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c76d46ad-d4cf-417d-9f7d-e60d36a35d49\', \'multiverseId\': 585246}, \'multiverseid\': 585246}, {\'name\': \'约格莫夫判官基克斯\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物向你的任一对手造成战斗伤害时，其操控者可以支付1点生命。若其如此作，则其抓一张牌。\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}，弃X张牌：放逐目标对手牌库顶的X张牌。你可以从以此法放逐的牌之中使用地和施放咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～非瑞人／魔判官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed6e1fc-ff84-465c-9260-b4cf00d01a7b\', \'multiverseId\': 585507}, \'multiverseid\': 585507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gix, Prätor von Yawgmoth\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur einem deiner Gegner Kampfschaden zufügt, kann ihr Beherrscher 1 Lebenspunkt bezahlen. Falls er dies tut, zieht er eine Karte.\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}, wirf X Karten ab: Schicke die obersten X Karten der Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl ins Exil. Du kannst von den auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickten Karten Länder spielen und Zaubersprüche wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Prätor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585801&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04234e8b-73d8-4693-b39f-0e2b3f072dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 585801}, \'multiverseid\': 585801}, {\'name\': \'Gix, praetor de Yaugzebul\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature inflige des blessures de combat à l\'un de vos adversaires, son contrôleur peut payer 1 point de vie. S\'il fait ainsi, il pioche une carte.\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}, défaussez-vous de X cartes : Exilez les X cartes du dessus de la bibliothèque d\'un adversaire ciblé. Vous pouvez jouer des terrains et lancer des sorts parmi les cartes exilées de cette manière sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : phyrexian et praetor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585873&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b51d09ce-c5f8-4e4e-9002-1b1e965c0966\', \'multiverseId\': 585873}, \'multiverseid\': 585873}, {\'name\': \'ヨーグモスの法務官、ギックス\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体があなたの対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それのコントローラーは１点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を引く。\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}, カードＸ枚を捨てる：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を追放する。あなたはこれにより追放されているカードの中から、土地をプレイしたりマナ・コストを支払うことなく呪文を唱えたりしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・法務官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0291e1e-7eff-4930-a5a2-603b547831b4\', \'multiverseId\': 585945}, \'multiverseid\': 585945}, {\'name\': \'约格莫夫判官基克斯\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物向你的任一对手造成战斗伤害时，其操控者可以支付1点生命。若其如此作，则其抓一张牌。\\n{4}{B}{B}{B}，弃X张牌：放逐目标对手牌库顶的X张牌。你可以从以此法放逐的牌之中使用地和施放咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～非瑞人／魔判官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fd2d1e1-0ca7-4018-a759-6ef43104b0b0\', \'multiverseId\': 586017}, \'multiverseid\': 586017}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gixianische Infiltratorin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine andere bleibende Karte opferst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Gixianische Infiltratorin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Mensch\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Stadt Terisia wird fallen. Die Pläne meines Meisters laufen so geschmiert wie das Öl in meinen Adern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583944&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b185202-e181-4b4c-8841-0e3e050d205f\', \'multiverseId\': 583944}, \'multiverseid\': 583944}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrada de Gix\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques otro permanente, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Infiltrada de Gix.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"La caída de Terisia es inevitable. El plan de mi amo discurre tan firme y seguro como el aceite por mis venas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'498a5cbd-f8ea-4523-9c8a-eb9b1301b854\', \'multiverseId\': 584205}, \'multiverseid\': 584205}, {\'name\': \'Infiltratrice gixienne\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un autre permanent, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Infiltratrice gixienne.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et humain\', \'flavor\': \'« La chute de Terisia est inévitable. Le plan de mon maître est aussi fluide que le pétrole qui circule dans mes veines. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a636f0bf-81ab-4332-9945-3309f7d7a507\', \'multiverseId\': 584466}, \'multiverseid\': 584466}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrata Gixiana\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi un altro permanente, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Infiltrata Gixiana.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Umano Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"La caduta di Città di Terisia è ineluttabile. Il piano del mio signore fila liscio come l\\\'olio nelle mie vene."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'583e2873-abbc-4898-a3fb-60296052eec9\', \'multiverseId\': 584727}, \'multiverseid\': 584727}, {\'name\': \'ギックスの潜入者\', \'text\': \'あなたがこれでないパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、ギックスの潜入者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・人間\', \'flavor\': \'「テリシア市の陥落は不可避だ。我が主の計画は、我が血管を流れる油の如く、着々と実行されるのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d63b193-4443-4ad3-93c3-aff9fa9332cb\', \'multiverseId\': 584988}, \'multiverseid\': 584988}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrada Gixiana\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você sacrificar outra permanente, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Infiltrada Gixiana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"A queda da cidade de Terisia é inevitável. O plano de meu mestre é fluido e constante como o óleo em minhas veias."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c26e27c7-cb66-47ce-98a6-b12db4996c3a\', \'multiverseId\': 585249}, \'multiverseid\': 585249}, {\'name\': \'基克斯派渗透者\', \'text\': \'每当你牺牲另一个永久物时，在基克斯派渗透者上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／人类\', \'flavor\': \'「泰瑞西亚城陷落只是时间问题。主人的计划平稳而顺利，正如我血脉中流淌的烁油一般。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afad2007-ed7d-4b5f-a0bc-2dc6e4027582\', \'multiverseId\': 585510}, \'multiverseid\': 585510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gixianische Schädelhäuterin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls sich drei oder mehr Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof befinden, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Gixianische Schädelhäuterin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Mensch, Assassine\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit jeder Auslese bringen wir diese Welt einen Schritt näher an die *Vollendung*."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a87b9ea-761a-49d1-ad82-4303d65b481f\', \'multiverseId\': 583946}, \'multiverseid\': 583946}, {\'name\': \'Desollacráneos de Gix\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si hay tres o más cartas de criatura en tu cementerio, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Desollacráneos de Gix.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino humano pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Con cada sacrificio, este mundo está cada vez más cerca de la perfección".**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b1b813-d3ce-4e3b-a6c7-04fa40b6a9cb\', \'multiverseId\': 584207}, \'multiverseid\': 584207}, {\'name\': \'Écorche-crânes gixienne\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, s\'il y a au moins trois cartes de créature dans votre cimetière, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Écorche-crânes gixienne.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et humain et assassin\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque massacre rapproche un peu plus ce monde du *parachèvement*. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea1b086-ebe4-447b-ae6f-dd81e56d1300\', \'multiverseId\': 584468}, \'multiverseid\': 584468}, {\'name\': \'Scorticateschi Gixiana\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se ci sono tre o più carte creatura nel tuo cimitero, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Scorticateschi Gixiana.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Assassino Umano Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Con ogni selezione, questo mondo si avvicina al *completamento*."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d076250-03bc-4552-b61d-8aa0b7170150\', \'multiverseId\': 584729}, \'multiverseid\': 584729}, {\'name\': \'ギックスの頭蓋剥ぎ\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地に３枚以上のクリーチャー・カードがある場合、ギックスの頭蓋剥ぎの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・人間・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': \'「間引くたび、我らのこの世界は*完成*に近づいてゆく。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ff57baa-7707-4efd-9488-dbfab9dd27a8\', \'multiverseId\': 584990}, \'multiverseid\': 584990}, {\'name\': \'Esfolacrânios Gixiana\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se houver três ou mais cards de criatura em seu cemitério, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Esfolacrânios Gixiana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Humano Assassino\', \'flavor\': \'"A cada matança deixamos o mundo mais próximo da *completação*."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18fb21b5-0a63-4ebf-a9e0-00921bbc1e1c\', \'multiverseId\': 585251}, \'multiverseid\': 585251}, {\'name\': \'基克斯派掠颅客\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若你坟墓场中有三张或更多生物牌，则在基克斯派掠颅客上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／人类／杀手\', \'flavor\': \'「每杀一人，就令世界离*完化*更进一步。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8356827-72b4-4e37-90ac-ee4eaa44ef64\', \'multiverseId\': 585512}, \'multiverseid\': 585512}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gixianischer Puppenspieler\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, verliert jeder Gegner 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nWenn der Gixianische Puppenspieler stirbt, bringe eine andere Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'Für manche Entweihung. Für Gix Entzückung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583945&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b65e89a-6160-437d-b82f-e40150b1dbe2\', \'multiverseId\': 583945}, \'multiverseid\': 583945}, {\'name\': \'Titiritero de Gix\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, cada oponente pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.\\nCuando el Titiritero de Gix muera, regresa otra carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'Para algunos, profanación. Para Gix, decoración.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'701e1ea3-8b0d-41af-a0a9-b2c3b8fd4db1\', \'multiverseId\': 584206}, \'multiverseid\': 584206}, {\'name\': \'Marionnettiste gixien\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, chaque adversaire perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nQuand le Marionnettiste gixien meurt, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une autre carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.\', \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': \'Pour certains, une profanation. Pour Gix, une décoration.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48d30fa0-95d9-4014-ab06-94b9762ce165\', \'multiverseId\': 584467}, \'multiverseid\': 584467}, {\'name\': \'Burattinaio Gixiano\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, ogni avversario perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nQuando il Burattinaio Gixiano muore, rimetti sul campo di battaglia un\'altra carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'Dissacrazione, per alcuni. Decorazione, per Gix.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8f88545-ac9f-4cdf-baf7-68302b1b2b88\', \'multiverseId\': 584728}, \'multiverseid\': 584728}, {\'name\': \'ギックスのくぐつ師\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\nギックスのくぐつ師が死亡したとき、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下でありこれでないクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'ある者にとっては冒涜。ギックスにとっては装飾。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c582d028-392b-480a-885b-64aa6ec76ceb\', \'multiverseId\': 584989}, \'multiverseid\': 584989}, {\'name\': \'Titereiro Gixiano\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você compra seu segundo card a cada turno, cada oponente perde 2 pontos de vida e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\nQuando Titereiro Gixiano morrer, devolva outro card de criatura alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Bruxo\', \'flavor\': \'Para alguns, é profanação. Para Gix, é decoração.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5ee32e8-d6f8-4dc2-84bb-b435da970472\', \'multiverseId\': 585250}, \'multiverseid\': 585250}, {\'name\': \'基克斯派控偶师\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，每位对手各失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。\\n当基克斯派控偶师死去时，将另一张目标法术力值等于或小于3的生物牌从你坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'对别人来说，这是亵渎圣物。对基克斯来说，这是增效神物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b76f041-ad83-4e7d-acac-8400bb29e7a9\', \'multiverseId\': 585511}, \'multiverseid\': 585511}]', "[{'name': 'Gixianischer Puppenspieler', 'text': 'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, verliert jeder Gegner 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nWenn der Gixianische Puppenspieler stirbt, bringe eine andere Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Hexenmeister', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585803&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59c4b212-8832-4b27-9d00-b101eb860a6f', 'multiverseId': 585803}, 'multiverseid': 585803}, {'name': 'Marionnettiste gixien', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, chaque adversaire perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nQuand le Marionnettiste gixien meurt, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une autre carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.', 'type': 'Créature : phyrexian et psychagogue', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585875&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cb9ddbc-c23d-4630-8448-2bb4b337444f', 'multiverseId': 585875}, 'multiverseid': 585875}, {'name': 'ギックスのくぐつ師', 'text': 'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\nギックスのくぐつ師が死亡したとき、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下でありこれでないクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・邪術師', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585947&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '674f8bc6-4f33-4944-a2b9-aed1b89c0123', 'multiverseId': 585947}, 'multiverseid': 585947}, {'name': '基克斯派控偶师', 'text': '每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，每位对手各失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。\\n当基克斯派控偶师死去时，将另一张目标法术力值等于或小于3的生物牌从你坟墓场移回战场。', 'type': '生物 ～非瑞人／邪术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586019&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7314c99f-7965-4882-a79f-3395ed34eb74', 'multiverseId': 586019}, 'multiverseid': 586019}]", '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Brandbombe\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\n{7}, {T}, opfere die Goblin-Brandbombe: Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Und wenn das hinhaut, lässt Tawnos uns bestimmt die Version in voller Größe bauen!"\\n—Tergel, Goblin-Explosionskünstler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584077&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe42a2ea-b1da-419e-87ee-086142a3ed01\', \'multiverseId\': 584077}, \'multiverseid\': 584077}, {\'name\': \'Bomba trasga\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrificar la Bomba trasga: Destruye el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Y si esto funciona, Tawnos va a dejarnos construir la versión a escala real!".\\n—Tergel, explosionador trasgo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'362e345c-13f7-4864-8200-428fc4e3d4d1\', \'multiverseId\': 584338}, \'multiverseid\': 584338}, {\'name\': \'Bombe incendiaire gobeline\', \'text\': \'Flash\\n{7}, {T}, sacrifiez la Bombe incendiaire gobeline : Détruisez un permanent ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Et si ça marche, Tavnos nous laissera construire la version à taille réelle ! »\\n—Tergel, explogénieur gobelin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584599&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b6a8e62-2c2e-48ed-921b-f871ca2025de\', \'multiverseId\': 584599}, \'multiverseid\': 584599}, {\'name\': \'Bomba Incendiaria Goblin\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifica la Bomba Incendiaria Goblin: Distruggi un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"E se dovesse funzionare, Tawnos ci permetterà di costruire la versione a grandezza naturale!"\\n—Tergel, goblin esplodente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'696ebbf3-9227-4b47-930d-63b322673db9\', \'multiverseId\': 584860}, \'multiverseid\': 584860}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの焼夷弾\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n{7}, {T}, ゴブリンの焼夷弾を生け贄に捧げる：パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「でまあ、これがうまくいけば、タウノスが実物大のを作らせてくれるってよ！」\\n――ゴブリンの爆発技師、ターゲル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8599de54-da05-4f6f-8703-c1ec5f09385c\', \'multiverseId\': 585121}, \'multiverseid\': 585121}, {\'name\': \'Bomba de Fogo Goblin\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\n{7}, {T}, sacrifique Bomba de Fogo Goblin: Destrua a permanente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"E se essa funcionar, Tawnos vai deixar a gente fazer uma versão em tamanho real!"\\n— Tergel, explodista goblin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'387a117a-61ed-496b-ad18-e0f0e9db5603\', \'multiverseId\': 585382}, \'multiverseid\': 585382}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪火焰弹\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n{7}，{T}，牺牲鬼怪火焰弹：消灭目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「如果这个管用的话，达硌士就会允许我们造原寸版！」\\n～鬼怪爆炸家特格尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69f61da7-d05c-4d5f-8bff-9cf888c23734\', \'multiverseId\': 585643}, \'multiverseid\': 585643}]', "[{'name': 'Goblin-Sprengläufer', 'text': 'Der Goblin-Sprengläufer erhält +2/+0 und hat Bedrohlichkeit, solange du in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte geopfert hast.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin', 'flavor': 'Die meisten Goblins können eine Lunte anzünden und losrennen, aber nur die schlausten denken daran, die Bombe rechtzeitig fallen zu lassen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583983&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fe3be3c-1a1d-4060-a9d2-e742ae42fa93', 'multiverseId': 583983}, 'multiverseid': 583983}, {'name': 'Trasgo insensato', 'text': 'El Trasgo insensato obtiene +2/+0 y tiene la habilidad de amenaza mientras hayas sacrificado un permanente este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trasgo', 'flavor': 'La mayoría de los trasgos pueden prender una mecha y correr, pero solo los más listos se acuerdan de soltar la bomba.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584244&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60fdcb72-602c-44ff-bd83-a85b04560c31', 'multiverseId': 584244}, 'multiverseid': 584244}, {'name': 'Coureur-boum gobelin', 'text': 'Le Coureur-boum gobelin gagne +2/+0 et a la menace tant que vous avez sacrifié un permanent ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin', 'flavor': 'La plupart des gobelins savent allumer une mèche et courir, mais seuls les plus intelligents se souviennent de lâcher la bombe.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584505&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7635626c-5f8c-4bcf-a3ae-c4f869f398e5', 'multiverseId': 584505}, 'multiverseid': 584505}, {'name': 'Maratonante Goblin', 'text': 'Il Maratonante Goblin prende +2/+0 e ha minacciare se hai sacrificato un permanente in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Goblin', 'flavor': 'La maggior parte dei goblin accende la miccia e corre, ma solo i più furbi si ricordano anche di lanciare la bomba.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584766&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e84e5622-4392-4c0c-ab69-8dace820971d', 'multiverseId': 584766}, 'multiverseid': 584766}, {'name': 'ゴブリンの爆風走り', 'text': 'あなたがパーマネントを生け贄に捧げたことがあるターンの間、ゴブリンの爆風走りは＋２/＋０の修整を受け威迫を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン', 'flavor': 'たいていのゴブリンにできるのは導火線に点火して逃げることで、最大級に頭の良いゴブリンだけが、爆弾を下ろすことに思い至る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585027&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2aa5e350-cb4d-4538-aae6-2a81238fa122', 'multiverseId': 585027}, 'multiverseid': 585027}, {'name': 'Goblin Corredor-bomba', 'text': 'Goblin Corredor-bomba recebe +2/+0 e tem ameaçar contanto que você tenha sacrificado uma permanente neste turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin', 'flavor': 'A maioria dos goblins consegue acender um pavio e correr, mas só os mais espertos se lembram de soltar a bomba.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585288&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7cc24fd-c548-41da-a5b1-7e0af0f60b81', 'multiverseId': 585288}, 'multiverseid': 585288}, {'name': '运弹鬼怪', 'text': '只要你本回合中牺牲过永久物，运弹鬼怪便得+2/+0且具有威慑异能。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼怪', 'flavor': '大多数鬼怪都会点燃引信后带着炸弹跑，但只有聪明的记得要把炸弹丢出去。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585549&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '908e9541-dd70-4bdc-b942-30e892ce2c72', 'multiverseId': 585549}, 'multiverseid': 585549}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grabenkampf\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{5}{W}: Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die du nicht kontrollierst, ins Exil, bis der Grabenkampf das Spiel verlässt. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei und nur einmal.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Das Schlachtfeld war derart von Kratern übersät, dass man Verluste oft als „in ein Loch gefallen" deklarierte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583854&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8209e6f6-7364-4f93-8cac-bd61dfeedf3b\', \'multiverseId\': 583854}, \'multiverseid\': 583854}, {\'name\': \'En la trinchera\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\n{5}{W}: Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que no controlas hasta que En la trinchera deje el campo de batalla. Activa esto solo como un conjuro y solo una vez.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'El campo de batalla llegó a estar tan lleno de cráteres y trincheras que muchas bajas se atribuían a "caer en un agujero".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38a60f1d-88bc-4d6b-804a-94199d3b280e\', \'multiverseId\': 584115}, \'multiverseid\': 584115}, {\'name\': \'Dans les tranchées\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{5}{W} : Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé que vous ne contrôlez pas jusqu\'à ce que Dans les tranchées quitte le champ de bataille. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel et qu\'une seule fois.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Le champ de bataille n\'était plus qu\'un chaos de cratères et de tranchées, au point que les pertes étaient régulièrement attribuées au fait d\'être tombé dans un trou.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584376&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bfa0253-e0ba-4d40-bd3e-07706cb55a04\', \'multiverseId\': 584376}, \'multiverseid\': 584376}, {\'name\': \'Nelle Trincee\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\n{5}{W}: Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio che non controlli finché Nelle Trincee non lascia il campo di battaglia. Attiva solo come una stregoneria e solo una volta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Il campo di battaglia era talmente ricoperto di crateri e trincee che "caduto in una buca" era diventata una delle cause di morte più comuni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'834089e4-5355-4d02-b9f9-358e0f8fbf7c\', \'multiverseId\': 584637}, \'multiverseid\': 584637}, {\'name\': \'戦闘態勢\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{5}{W}：あなたがコントロールしておらず土地でもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを、戦闘態勢が戦場を離れるまで追放する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行い、１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'戦場はあばたのようなクレーターや塹壕で埋め尽くされ、死傷者は「穴に落ちた」のがもっぱらの原因とされた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7768a7e-5185-4750-bf39-0afb9bc028d7\', \'multiverseId\': 584898}, \'multiverseid\': 584898}, {\'name\': \'Nas Trincheiras\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\n{5}{W}: Exile a permanente alvo não de terreno que você não controla até que Nas Trincheiras deixe o campo de batalha. Ative somente como um feitiço e uma única vez.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'O campo de batalha ficou tão salpicado de crateras e trincheiras que as baixas chegaram a ser regularmente atribuídas a "queda em buraco".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5e3eeae-38b8-4844-a7e1-0b4387d48668\', \'multiverseId\': 585159}, \'multiverseid\': 585159}, {\'name\': \'壕沟备战\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+1/+1。\\n{5}{W}：放逐目标不由你操控的非地永久物，直到壕沟备战离开战场为止。只能于法术时机起动且只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'战场上很快就布满了弹迹壕沟，伤亡原因也都被简单归结为「掉进坑里」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32a059ae-4002-499a-ba8d-772b8ad64572\', \'multiverseId\': 585420}, \'multiverseid\': 585420}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grabenkampf\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{5}{W}: Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die du nicht kontrollierst, ins Exil, bis der Grabenkampf das Spiel verlässt. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei und nur einmal.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585776&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2406ba0f-25eb-4399-bb9e-76befab3d886\', \'multiverseId\': 585776}, \'multiverseid\': 585776}, {\'name\': \'Dans les tranchées\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{5}{W} : Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé que vous ne contrôlez pas jusqu\'à ce que Dans les tranchées quitte le champ de bataille. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel et qu\'une seule fois.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585848&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d578a888-7fbc-459c-9882-316b61f660fe\', \'multiverseId\': 585848}, \'multiverseid\': 585848}, {\'name\': \'戦闘態勢\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{5}{W}：あなたがコントロールしておらず土地でもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを、戦闘態勢が戦場を離れるまで追放する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行い、１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'132c6ff2-d850-42e2-a037-80f5bcd3bdc9\', \'multiverseId\': 585920}, \'multiverseid\': 585920}, {\'name\': \'壕沟备战\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+1/+1。\\n{5}{W}：放逐目标不由你操控的非地永久物，直到壕沟备战离开战场为止。只能于法术时机起动且只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8de9f146-721c-4c1c-8990-ebe569891116\', \'multiverseId\': 585992}, \'multiverseid\': 585992}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grabenschleicher\', \'text\': \'Solange du in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr Karten gezogen hast, hat der Grabenschleicher Todesberührung und Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'Er kann einen panischen Herzschlag aus tausend Schritten Entfernung vernehmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b593bb52-c6c7-48f5-ad21-50c7e079de10\', \'multiverseId\': 583962}, \'multiverseid\': 583962}, {\'name\': \'Asaltatrincheras\', \'text\': \'Mientras hayas robado dos o más cartas este turno, el Asaltatrincheras tiene las habilidades de toque mortal y vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Puede oír el latido de un corazón aterrorizado a mil pasos de distancia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3344534-6103-4be6-9f71-ba690e9ee0f3\', \'multiverseId\': 584223}, \'multiverseid\': 584223}, {\'name\': \'Rôdeur des tranchées\', \'text\': \'Tant que vous avez pioché au moins deux cartes ce tour-ci, le Rôdeur des tranchées a le contact mortel et le lien de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête et horreur\', \'flavor\': \'Il entend un battement de cœur paniqué à une distance de mille pas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584484&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efcd8010-0c60-48d0-978d-57a88fd25334\', \'multiverseId\': 584484}, \'multiverseid\': 584484}, {\'name\': \'Inseguitore della Trincea\', \'text\': "Se hai pescato due o più carte in questo turno, l\'Inseguitore della Trincea ha tocco letale e legame vitale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'È in grado di sentire un battito di cuore in preda al panico anche a enormi distanze.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'016f71bd-bbbc-43ee-a0da-0c901ae6fd3b\', \'multiverseId\': 584745}, \'multiverseid\': 584745}, {\'name\': \'塹壕の忍び寄り\', \'text\': \'このターンにあなたが２枚以上のカードを引いたことがあるかぎり、塹壕の忍び寄りは接死と絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'それはパニックに陥った心臓の鼓動を、千歩先からも聞きつける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b4fd43f-c440-404d-830f-8c9ffe71ec23\', \'multiverseId\': 585006}, \'multiverseid\': 585006}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador das Trincheiras\', \'text\': \'Desde que você tenha comprado dois ou mais cards neste turno, Espreitador das Trincheiras tem toque mortífero e vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta Horror\', \'flavor\': \'Ele consegue escutar um coração em pânico a mil passos de distância.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c672f58-217e-4f4f-a623-4216f770225c\', \'multiverseId\': 585267}, \'multiverseid\': 585267}, {\'name\': \'壕沟伏兽\', \'text\': \'只要你本回合中已抓两张或更多牌，壕沟伏兽便具有死触与系命异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': \'它在千步开外就能听到慌乱心跳。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26a45730-cfe4-4a94-b250-ba5c8279b37e\', \'multiverseId\': 585528}, \'multiverseid\': 585528}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grabungsexplosion\', \'text\': \'Die Grabungsexplosion fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Urzas Ingenieure brauchten oft Wochen, um Kraftsteine auszugraben. Die Goblins waren weniger zimperlich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'278dcfa1-5acf-42d7-aa51-986f6d4a9d8a\', \'multiverseId\': 583978}, \'multiverseid\': 583978}, {\'name\': \'Estallido en la excavación\', \'text\': \'El Estallido en la excavación hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo. Crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los ingenieros de Urza podían tardar semanas en desenterrar una piedra de poder. En cambio, los trasgos no eran tan meticulosos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4acc4ab7-aaae-4cb7-94b3-ceacf175be27\', \'multiverseId\': 584239}, \'multiverseid\': 584239}, {\'name\': "Explosion d\'excavation", \'text\': "L\'Explosion d\'excavation inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible. Créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Déterrer une lithoforce pouvait prendre des semaines aux ingénieurs d\'Urza. Les gobelins étaient plus rapides.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584500&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'939a3880-7486-4cd6-b321-3f36d1942013\', \'multiverseId\': 584500}, \'multiverseid\': 584500}, {\'name\': \'Esplosione dello Scavo\', \'text\': \'L\\\'Esplosione dello Scavo infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio. Crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli ingegneri di Urza potevano impiegare settimane per estrarre una pietra del potere. I goblin non erano altrettanto scrupolosi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b58cc2d5-b85b-4d5c-8975-278f6d8d2328\', \'multiverseId\': 584761}, \'multiverseid\': 584761}, {\'name\': \'採掘爆発\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。採掘爆発はそれに３点のダメージを与える。パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ウルザの技師たちは、パワーストーンを掘り出すのに何週間かを費やすだろう。ゴブリンたちはそれほど辛抱強くなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a4e2987-510a-4282-b9e7-005936362d1c\', \'multiverseId\': 585022}, \'multiverseid\': 585022}, {\'name\': \'Explosão de Escavação\', \'text\': \'Explosão de Escavação causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo. Crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os engenheiros de Urza podiam levar semanas para desenterrar uma pedra de energia. Os goblins não eram tão criteriosos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9052bec-a1d1-449a-8be4-69753fa33cac\', \'multiverseId\': 585283}, \'multiverseid\': 585283}, {\'name\': \'掘古爆破\', \'text\': \'掘古爆破对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'克撒的工程师往往要花上数星期才能挖出一枚魔力石。鬼怪就没有这么磨蹭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ca7c5ed-959e-4bc4-bae8-288dcb3c328e\', \'multiverseId\': 585544}, \'multiverseid\': 585544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grauenhafte Erkenntnis\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Du ziehst zwei Karten und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\\n• Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, erhalten -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Mishra war fort. Verblieben war nur eine Maschine, die sein Antlitz trug.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583949&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b9dca71-2c8f-46fc-a0e4-4b695bebd679\', \'multiverseId\': 583949}, \'multiverseid\': 583949}, {\'name\': \'Conclusión macabra\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Robas dos cartas y pierdes 2 vidas.\\n• Las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes obtienen -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Mishra ya no estaba; tan solo quedaba una máquina con su rostro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2670201-da0f-4a5f-9179-177b70dee78c\', \'multiverseId\': 584210}, \'multiverseid\': 584210}, {\'name\': \'Horrible réalisation\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Vous piochez deux cartes et vous perdez 2 points de vie.\\n• Les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Mishra n\'était plus. Il ne restait qu\'une machine arborant son visage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584471&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36667c48-2667-4c00-96ae-f1034097c62e\', \'multiverseId\': 584471}, \'multiverseid\': 584471}, {\'name\': \'Comprensione Raccapricciante\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Peschi due carte e perdi 2 punti vita.\\n• Le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Mishra non c\'era più... Di lui rimaneva soltanto una macchina con le sue sembianze.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1efc54cd-db89-4829-a2fd-456a5fe0a21b\', \'multiverseId\': 584732}, \'multiverseid\': 584732}, {\'name\': \'陰惨な実現\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたはカード２枚を引き、２点のライフを失う。\\n・ターン終了時まで、各対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ミシュラは死んだ――残ったのは、彼の顔を着けた機械だけだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50e1fa23-f5f2-4377-8612-68515010d25c\', \'multiverseId\': 584993}, \'multiverseid\': 584993}, {\'name\': \'Constatação Terrível\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Você compra dois cards e perde 2 pontos de vida.\\n• As criaturas que seus oponentes controlam recebem -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Mishra se fora. Tudo que restava era uma máquina com o rosto dele.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'061a675e-c21b-40e9-8968-07b3a505495a\', \'multiverseId\': 585254}, \'multiverseid\': 585254}, {\'name\': \'恶心实化\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•你抓两张牌且失去2点生命。\\n•由对手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'米斯拉已一去不返～剩下的不过是一尊长着相同面庞的机器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8af935c5-a396-4928-863f-f9d20a617edf\', \'multiverseId\': 585515}, \'multiverseid\': 585515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grenzlandpatrouille\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält die Grenzlandpatrouille +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Die Fallaji lernten schnell, dass es im Khergebirge zu viele Höhlen und Täler gab, als dass man sie nur aus der Luft überwachen könnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584033&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e3432b-d2dc-4145-a1fe-6f7d434d56db\', \'multiverseId\': 584033}, \'multiverseid\': 584033}, {\'name\': \'Patrulla perimetral\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un artefacto entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la Patrulla perimetral obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los fallaji descubrieron enseguida que en la Cordillera Kher había demasiados valles y cuevas como para vigilarla solamente desde el aire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ed877e4-da09-475f-8672-63b61bcc0f35\', \'multiverseId\': 584294}, \'multiverseid\': 584294}, {\'name\': \'Patrouille de périmètre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la Patrouille de périmètre gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Les Fallaji apprirent rapidement que les Hauts de Kher contenaient trop de cavernes et de vallées pour être explorés uniquement depuis le ciel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584555&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8c417e8-ff94-4edd-b96f-7609d430e716\', \'multiverseId\': 584555}, \'multiverseid\': 584555}, {\'name\': \'Pattuglia del Perimetro\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un artefatto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, la Pattuglia del Perimetro prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': "I Fallaji impararono in fretta che nelle Creste di Kher c\'erano troppe caverne e valli per ispezionarle soltanto dall\'alto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e96ed5e2-4de6-4018-ba25-b89df185e4fc\', \'multiverseId\': 584816}, \'multiverseid\': 584816}, {\'name\': \'防衛線の巡回兵\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、防衛線の巡回兵は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'ファラジの諸部族は、カー峠には洞窟や峡谷があまりに多く、空からだけでは探査しきれないことをすぐに悟った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55e8f901-7c69-4d91-a39d-3a0d389117f6\', \'multiverseId\': 585077}, \'multiverseid\': 585077}, {\'name\': \'Patrulha do Perímetro\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um artefato entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Patrulha do Perímetro recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Os fallaji logo notaram que a Cordilheira de Kher tinha cavernas e vales demais para ser vigiada apenas do ar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43f8104f-0232-494f-ad5e-7a2c2aac1f3e\', \'multiverseId\': 585338}, \'multiverseid\': 585338}, {\'name\': \'防线巡卫\', \'text\': \'每当一个神器在你的操控下进战场时，防线巡卫得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'法拉吉人很快就发现，喀尔山脊洞窟密布、峡谷错落，单从空中无法侦察全貌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b15ff02-f7ae-454f-b26a-48607d079eab\', \'multiverseId\': 585599}, \'multiverseid\': 585599}]', "[{'name': 'Gwenna, Auge von Gaea', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge zwei Mana in einer beliebigen Kombination von Farben. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Kreaturenzauber zu wirken oder Fähigkeiten einer Kreatur oder Kreaturenkarte zu aktivieren.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber mit Stärke 5 oder mehr wirkst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Gwenna, Auge von Gaea, und enttappe sie.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Druide, Späher', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584030&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c6e0edd-23bc-4bba-8b6e-39073915c015', 'multiverseId': 584030}, 'multiverseid': 584030}, {'name': 'Gwenna, Ojos de Gaia', 'text': '{T}: Agrega dos manás de cualquier combinación de colores. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos de criatura o activar habilidades de una criatura o una carta de criatura.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de criatura con fuerza de 5 o más, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Gwenna, Ojos de Gaia y enderézala.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Explorador druida elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584291&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e89630e-672a-4f5f-8364-c24e2c4e54dd', 'multiverseId': 584291}, 'multiverseid': 584291}, {'name': 'Gwenna, Yeux de Gaia', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez deux manas de la combinaison de mana coloré de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts de créature ou activer des capacités de créature ou de carte de créature.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature de force supérieure ou égale à 5, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Gwenna, Yeux de Gaia et dégagez-la.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : elfe et druide et éclaireur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584552&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18b100cc-ac5a-4cbe-a31d-1d8a2a58c11a', 'multiverseId': 584552}, 'multiverseid': 584552}, {'name': 'Gwenna, Occhi di Gea', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi due mana in qualsiasi combinazione di colori. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie creatura o attivare abilità di una creatura o di una carta creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura con forza pari o superiore a 5, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Gwenna, Occhi di Gea e STAPpala.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Esploratore Druido Elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584813&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '935e3667-23e7-457b-9a46-80e4394278c4', 'multiverseId': 584813}, 'multiverseid': 584813}, {'name': 'ガイアの眼、グウェナ', 'text': '{T}：望む色の組み合わせのマナ２点を加える。このマナは、クリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためか、クリーチャーやクリーチャー・カードの能力を起動するためにしか支払えない。\\nあなたがパワーが５以上であるクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、ガイアの眼、グウェナの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、これをアンタップする。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド・スカウト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585074&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7f2e83b-c7d7-41b7-a31e-4ae783f06022', 'multiverseId': 585074}, 'multiverseid': 585074}, {'name': 'Gwenna, Olhos de Gaia', 'text': '{T}: Adicione dois manas em qualquer combinação de cores. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar mágicas de criatura ou ativar habilidades de uma criatura ou um card de criatura.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de criatura com poder igual ou superior a 5, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Gwenna, Olhos de Gaia, e desvire-a.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Druida Batedor', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585335&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a2d866c-2cd7-4b85-a6e3-5044a4134ef2', 'multiverseId': 585335}, 'multiverseid': 585335}, {'name': '盖亚之眼关娜', 'text': '{T}：加两点法术力，其颜色组合由你选择。此法术力只能用来施放生物咒语，或是起动生物或生物牌的异能。\\n每当你施放力量等于或大于5的生物咒语时，在盖亚之眼关娜上放置一个+1/+1指示物并重置它。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊／斥候', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585596&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a4d02a5-1d90-48b1-a964-e26869517f3b', 'multiverseId': 585596}, 'multiverseid': 585596}]", "[{'name': 'Gwenna, Auge von Gaea', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge zwei Mana in einer beliebigen Kombination von Farben. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Kreaturenzauber zu wirken oder Fähigkeiten einer Kreatur oder Kreaturenkarte zu aktivieren.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber mit Stärke 5 oder mehr wirkst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Gwenna, Auge von Gaea, und enttappe sie.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Druide, Späher', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585822&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24986157-93e8-4d69-a71e-ae103174266b', 'multiverseId': 585822}, 'multiverseid': 585822}, {'name': 'Gwenna, Yeux de Gaia', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez deux manas de la combinaison de mana coloré de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts de créature ou activer des capacités de créature ou de carte de créature.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature de force supérieure ou égale à 5, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Gwenna, Yeux de Gaia et dégagez-la.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : elfe et druide et éclaireur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585894&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86efd4ac-f6e3-441d-9dbf-b42836888015', 'multiverseId': 585894}, 'multiverseid': 585894}, {'name': 'ガイアの眼、グウェナ', 'text': '{T}：望む色の組み合わせのマナ２点を加える。このマナは、クリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためか、クリーチャーやクリーチャー・カードの能力を起動するためにしか支払えない。\\nあなたがパワーが５以上であるクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、ガイアの眼、グウェナの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、これをアンタップする。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド・スカウト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585966&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70e87220-bb33-403b-9fba-300beaa2a263', 'multiverseId': 585966}, 'multiverseid': 585966}, {'name': '盖亚之眼关娜', 'text': '{T}：加两点法术力，其颜色组合由你选择。此法术力只能用来施放生物咒语，或是起动生物或生物牌的异能。\\n每当你施放力量等于或大于5的生物咒语时，在盖亚之眼关娜上放置一个+1/+1指示物并重置它。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊／斥候', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586038&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a3808b4-a669-4fe1-8158-cccd0b8ad837', 'multiverseId': 586038}, 'multiverseid': 586038}]", '[{\'name\': \'Haftstrafe\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn die Haftstrafe ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Kriegsgefangene waren keine nützlichen politischen Spielsteine, da sie beiden Brüdern völlig gleichgültig waren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583867&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6be59c8-9692-4d45-8174-3b07da9ac99f\', \'multiverseId\': 583867}, \'multiverseid\': 583867}, {\'name\': \'Pena de prisión\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando la Pena de prisión entre al campo de batalla, adivina 2.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar ni bloquear y no pueden activarse sus habilidades activadas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Los prisioneros de guerra resultaban inútiles políticamente porque a ninguno de los hermanos le importaban lo suficiente como para negociar por ellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a75692-5324-468a-a03a-5c5b8a7ecb91\', \'multiverseId\': 584128}, \'multiverseid\': 584128}, {\'name\': \'Peine carcérale\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nQuand la Peine carcérale arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 2.\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Les prisonniers de guerre étaient des pions politiques inutiles ; aucun des deux frères ne s\'intéressait suffisamment à eux pour vouloir procéder à un échange.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584389&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30d93811-4c36-4972-9f48-f10409de6dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 584389}, \'multiverseid\': 584389}, {\'name\': \'Pena Detentiva\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando la Pena Detentiva entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 2.\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'I prigionieri di guerra non erano altro che inefficaci pedine politiche e a nessuno dei due fratelli stavano abbastanza a cuore da riscattarli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'179c8d76-ddd2-48ab-8d94-13f763b93772\', \'multiverseId\': 584650}, \'multiverseid\': 584650}, {\'name\': \'服役\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n服役が戦場に出たとき、占術２を行う。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'戦時捕虜に政治的な駒の意味はなく、兄弟のいずれも、捕虜の交換なぞ気にも留めなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb3e5437-6b9a-48a7-b964-5c23b754ca69\', \'multiverseId\': 584911}, \'multiverseid\': 584911}, {\'name\': \'Sentença de Prisão\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Sentença de Prisão entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 2.\\nA criatura encantada não pode atacar nem bloquear e suas habilidades ativadas não podem ser ativadas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Os prisioneiros de guerra tinham valor político extremamente limitado, uma vez que nenhum dos dois irmãos se importava com trocas de reféns.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'683287d9-2838-4fb8-9fdf-1b76dbd4e0bd\', \'multiverseId\': 585172}, \'multiverseid\': 585172}, {\'name\': \'收押入狱\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当收押入狱进战场时，占卜2。\\n所结附的生物不能进行攻击或阻挡，且其起动式异能都不能起动。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'战俘都是不重要的政治筹码，两兄弟均无意付出利益来交换。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ba2dfa-cbe8-4364-a99a-2810d4027876\', \'multiverseId\': 585433}, \'multiverseid\': 585433}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hajar, loyaler Leibwächter\', \'text\': \'Opfere Hajar, loyaler Leibwächter: Legendäre Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich war immer an Mishras Seite. Ich werde ihn auch jetzt nicht im Stich lassen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584055&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d71c9800-6cb6-4514-8d40-9964818dc590\', \'multiverseId\': 584055}, \'multiverseid\': 584055}, {\'name\': \'Hajar, guardaespaldas leal\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar a Hajar, guardaespaldas leal: Las criaturas legendarias que controlas obtienen +1/+0 y ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"He estado al lado de Mishra desde el principio. No voy a abandonarlo ahora".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a09f264-dc9b-4a14-a3ef-87cdae253fc0\', \'multiverseId\': 584316}, \'multiverseid\': 584316}, {\'name\': \'Hajar, garde du corps loyal\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez Hajar, garde du corps loyal : Les créatures légendaires que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 et acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai été aux côtés de Mishra depuis le début. Je ne l\'abandonnerai pas maintenant. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584577&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61bc5938-7e16-48de-b9b5-5516cb0d84ab\', \'multiverseId\': 584577}, \'multiverseid\': 584577}, {\'name\': \'Hajar, Guardia del Corpo Fedele\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica Hajar, Guardia del Corpo Fedele: Le creature leggendarie che controlli prendono +1/+0 e hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono stato accanto a Mishra sin dall\\\'inizio. Non lo abbandonerò adesso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3ab9412-5a03-414a-9566-f4145241ffef\', \'multiverseId\': 584838}, \'multiverseid\': 584838}, {\'name\': \'忠実な護衛、ハジャール\', \'text\': \'忠実な護衛、ハジャールを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべての伝説のクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「我は始まりからミシュラの傍らにいた。今もなお、彼を見捨ててはいない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'311c9595-b994-4be5-800c-c596f4e8b02b\', \'multiverseId\': 585099}, \'multiverseid\': 585099}, {\'name\': \'Hajar, Guarda-costas Leal\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique Hajar, Guarda-costas Leal: As criaturas lendárias que você controla recebem +1/+0 e ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu fiquei ao lado de Mishra desde o início. Não vou abandoná-lo agora."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db6bf0d2-fac2-4e5e-8eba-e2b69853a811\', \'multiverseId\': 585360}, \'multiverseid\': 585360}, {\'name\': \'忠诚保镖哈札\', \'text\': \'牺牲忠诚保镖哈札：直到回合结束，由你操控的传奇生物得+1/+0且获得不灭异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我从最开始就伴随米斯拉左右。现在也不会弃他而去。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89e90c79-4d6e-4c87-a458-9cf9873a0d11\', \'multiverseId\': 585621}, \'multiverseid\': 585621}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hajar, loyaler Leibwächter\', \'text\': \'Opfere Hajar, loyaler Leibwächter: Legendäre Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585829&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa8632d4-89a9-447e-b478-8428dc615799\', \'multiverseId\': 585829}, \'multiverseid\': 585829}, {\'name\': \'Hajar, garde du corps loyal\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez Hajar, garde du corps loyal : Les créatures légendaires que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 et acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585901&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84050324-a272-481a-9af3-9c2e0c5ddbb0\', \'multiverseId\': 585901}, \'multiverseid\': 585901}, {\'name\': \'忠実な護衛、ハジャール\', \'text\': \'忠実な護衛、ハジャールを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべての伝説のクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e00e976-1fb9-4c32-8fa3-7b010db72482\', \'multiverseId\': 585973}, \'multiverseid\': 585973}, {\'name\': \'忠诚保镖哈札\', \'text\': \'牺牲忠诚保镖哈札：直到回合结束，由你操控的传奇生物得+1/+0且获得不灭异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ac2892f-e0a5-481f-997b-ffce061cc7aa\', \'multiverseId\': 586045}, \'multiverseid\': 586045}]', '[{\'name\': \'Halle von Tagsin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{4}, {T}: Erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Es stellte sich heraus, dass die Maschinen der Thran nicht leblos waren, sondern nur ruhten … und warteten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584103&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'179fba02-0bdd-4d0e-8f74-5568c86fa30c\', \'multiverseId\': 584103}, \'multiverseid\': 584103}, {\'name\': \'Salón de Tagsin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{4}, {T}: Crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Resultó que las máquinas de los thran no estaban muertas, sino en letargo... y esperando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34fbd4ff-88a2-45a9-a516-70baebb3ed76\', \'multiverseId\': 584364}, \'multiverseid\': 584364}, {\'name\': \'Salle de Tagsin\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{4}, {T} : Créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les machines des Thrans n\'étaient pas vraiment mortes ; elles étaient en sommeil… dans l\'attente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584625&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb053575-b058-4bc3-9a55-7c5512ce440e\', \'multiverseId\': 584625}, \'multiverseid\': 584625}, {\'name\': \'Sala di Tagsin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{4}, {T}: Crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Le macchine dei Thran non erano morte, dopotutto, ma soltanto dormienti... e in attesa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f62b6cdd-6371-44a7-9cc1-4132a0d23c45\', \'multiverseId\': 584886}, \'multiverseid\': 584886}, {\'name\': \'タグシンの広間\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'つまるところ、スランの機械は死んでなどおらず、ただ休眠状態になっているだけだった……そして待っていたのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4955e345-0540-4b87-957a-1dbd35e6ceca\', \'multiverseId\': 585147}, \'multiverseid\': 585147}, {\'name\': \'Salão de Tagsin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{4}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'No fim das contas, as máquinas dos thran não estavam mortas. Só estavam adormecidas... e aguardando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a2385f4-d0e2-42e0-b61e-630e147b7e0b\', \'multiverseId\': 585408}, \'multiverseid\': 585408}, {\'name\': \'塔格辛石室\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{4}，{T}：派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'索蓝的机器并未死亡，只是在休眠…在等待。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b7c79a4-d842-4ba7-b72b-39ff20b13eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 585669}, \'multiverseid\': 585669}]', "[{'name': 'Halle von Tagsin', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{4}, {T}: Erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585846&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05133e5f-de4b-4c6c-a297-a8f8059324a4', 'multiverseId': 585846}, 'multiverseid': 585846}, {'name': 'Salle de Tagsin', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{4}, {T} : Créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585918&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ece39ef-e86c-4265-8cd1-27f0d3356d6a', 'multiverseId': 585918}, 'multiverseid': 585918}, {'name': 'タグシンの広間', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585990&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ef2c600-ba88-49f0-85b0-625097f83e0a', 'multiverseId': 585990}, 'multiverseid': 585990}, {'name': '塔格辛石室', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{4}，{T}：派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586062&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '291d98c4-c700-41ff-9acb-67e307aba6dc', 'multiverseId': 586062}, 'multiverseid': 586062}]", '[{\'name\': \'Harbin, Pilot der Vorhut\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du mit fünf oder mehr Soldaten angreifst, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Yotia ist mein Geburtsrecht, Vater. Lass mich kämpfen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584056&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf126c3b-3a45-475b-a60a-64f561f385ab\', \'multiverseId\': 584056}, \'multiverseid\': 584056}, {\'name\': \'Harbin, aviador de vanguardia\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que ataques con cinco o más Soldados, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y ganan la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Yotia me pertenece por derecho, padre. Déjame luchar por ella".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d43f5815-ec5b-4c8b-9f1f-404d56fec708\', \'multiverseId\': 584317}, \'multiverseid\': 584317}, {\'name\': "Harbin, aviateur d\'avant-garde", \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez avec au moins cinq soldats, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Yotia est mon droit de naissance, père. Laissez-moi combattre pour le défendre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584578&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d95e01bb-60ce-4f01-8ac3-2d70a8b14913\', \'multiverseId\': 584578}, \'multiverseid\': 584578}, {\'name\': "Harbin, Aviatore dell\'Avanguardia", \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta attacchi con cinque o più Soldati, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Yotia mi appartiene per diritto di nascita, padre. Lasciami combattere per le sue terre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5915e476-6fc1-4bd7-8b7b-495f1c000b93\', \'multiverseId\': 584839}, \'multiverseid\': 584839}, {\'name\': \'先兵の飛行士、ハービン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが５体以上の兵士で攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ヨーティアは僕が受け継ぐ国だ、父さん。僕にも戦わせてくれ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a08f552-d48b-4807-ae63-0f5b955f25bf\', \'multiverseId\': 585100}, \'multiverseid\': 585100}, {\'name\': \'Harbin, Aviador da Vanguarda\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você ataca com cinco ou mais Soldados, as criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 e ganham voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Yotia é meu direito de nascença, pai. Deixe-me lutar por ela."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b233a24-1511-4479-b2ee-1f820df95b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 585361}, \'multiverseid\': 585361}, {\'name\': \'飞行先锋哈宾\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你以五个或更多士兵攻击时，直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「父亲，佑天是生我养我之地。请让我为它而战。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'505df4a0-15b3-401e-84d7-d988aea2bed4\', \'multiverseId\': 585622}, \'multiverseid\': 585622}]', '[{\'name\': \'Harbin, Pilot der Vorhut\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du mit fünf oder mehr Soldaten angreifst, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585830&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'888a1c9f-42d1-4303-91f2-046565b30402\', \'multiverseId\': 585830}, \'multiverseid\': 585830}, {\'name\': "Harbin, aviateur d\'avant-garde", \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez avec au moins cinq soldats, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585902&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ed2d8a1-c553-4448-8e78-dfa382dc2f4b\', \'multiverseId\': 585902}, \'multiverseid\': 585902}, {\'name\': \'先兵の飛行士、ハービン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが５体以上の兵士で攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60bbf553-7870-4d9e-9757-822d8e07ed64\', \'multiverseId\': 585974}, \'multiverseid\': 585974}, {\'name\': \'飞行先锋哈宾\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你以五个或更多士兵攻击时，直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96a3d4a4-07b0-4895-8ed6-cc13949c1dac\', \'multiverseId\': 586046}, \'multiverseid\': 586046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heldin der Dünen\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Heldin der Dünen ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nKreaturen mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Die Geschichte hat ihren Namen vergessen, nicht jedoch ihre Siege.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584057&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61d08f7d-3110-4eca-85da-79e0feab32c8\', \'multiverseId\': 584057}, \'multiverseid\': 584057}, {\'name\': \'Heroína de las dunas\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Heroína de las dunas entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta de artefacto o de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nLas criaturas que controlas con valor de maná de 3 o menos obtienen +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'La historia olvidó su nombre, pero no sus victorias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd421a90-bf98-4b96-ac5f-be9cd43858fb\', \'multiverseId\': 584318}, \'multiverseid\': 584318}, {\'name\': \'Héroïne des dunes\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Héroïne des dunes arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte d\'artefact ou de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 gagnent +1/+0.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "L\'histoire oublia son nom, mais pas ses victoires.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584579&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8724d3a0-dc00-4843-9f6e-080c7f107fb6\', \'multiverseId\': 584579}, \'multiverseid\': 584579}, {\'name\': \'Eroina delle Dune\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Eroina delle Dune entra nel campo di battaglia, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta artefatto o creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.\\nLe creature che controlli con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 prendono +1/+0.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'La storia ha dimenticato il suo nome, ma non le sue vittorie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a6fb5fa-ff9f-4b0f-9396-be9f7672eb55\', \'multiverseId\': 584840}, \'multiverseid\': 584840}, {\'name\': \'砂丘の英雄\', \'text\': \'砂丘の英雄が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下でありアーティファクトやクリーチャーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてマナ総量が３以下であるすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'歴史に彼女の名は埋もれても、その勝利は埋もれない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9950a48e-67b0-4e80-88df-36e53f93a899\', \'multiverseId\': 585101}, \'multiverseid\': 585101}, {\'name\': \'Heroína das Dunas\', \'text\': \'Quando Heroína das Dunas entrar no campo de batalha, devolva de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha o card de artefato ou criatura alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3.\\nAs criaturas que você controla com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 recebem +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'A História esqueceu o nome dela, mas não suas vitórias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4db88fce-e189-46af-9eb3-87112a1df5e2\', \'multiverseId\': 585362}, \'multiverseid\': 585362}, {\'name\': \'沙丘勇士\', \'text\': \'当沙丘勇士进战场时，将目标法术力值等于或小于3的神器或生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n由你操控且法术力值等于或小于3的生物得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'姓名未留青史，战绩流芳百世。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67991470-d2c3-4c58-8189-bb5b1f8b9607\', \'multiverseId\': 585623}, \'multiverseid\': 585623}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmelsfischer-Spinne\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nWenn die Himmelsfischer-Spinne ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine andere Kreatur opfern. Wenn du dies tust, zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist.\\nWenn die Himmelsfischer-Spinne stirbt, kannst du für jede Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten. Falls du dies tust, schicke die Himmelsfischer-Spinne aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584064&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d773b25-b090-4879-a38e-012a3d4c6818\', \'multiverseId\': 584064}, \'multiverseid\': 584064}, {\'name\': \'Araña pescadora celeste\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nCuando la Araña pescadora celeste entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar otra criatura. Cuando lo hagas, destruye el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\\nCuando la Araña pescadora celeste muera, puedes ganar 1 vida por cada carta de criatura en tu cementerio. Si lo haces, exilia la Araña pescadora celeste de tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c2965c4-7827-41e2-b119-4ffd0da3e344\', \'multiverseId\': 584325}, \'multiverseid\': 584325}, {\'name\': \'Araignée pêche-ciel\', \'text\': "Portée\\nQuand l\'Araignée pêche-ciel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature. Quand vous faites ainsi, détruisez un permanent non-terrain ciblé.\\nQuand l\'Araignée pêche-ciel meurt, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie pour chaque carte de créature dans votre cimetière. Si vous faites ainsi, exilez l\'Araignée pêche-ciel depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584586&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a145cd6d-39ce-4296-a2a4-bf944c8dc010\', \'multiverseId\': 584586}, \'multiverseid\': 584586}, {\'name\': \'Ragno Pescatore dei Cieli\', \'text\': "Raggiungere\\nQuando il Ragno Pescatore dei Cieli entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare un\'altra creatura. Quando lo fai, distruggi un permanente non terra bersaglio.\\nQuando il Ragno Pescatore dei Cieli muore, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita per ogni carta creatura nel tuo cimitero. Se lo fai, esilia il Ragno Pescatore dei Cieli dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0df26684-9fb3-4c7d-ae5e-dc84835c8ee5\', \'multiverseId\': 584847}, \'multiverseid\': 584847}, {\'name\': \'空漁師の蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'到達\\n空漁師の蜘蛛が戦場に出たとき、あなたはこれでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたとき、土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n空漁師の蜘蛛が死亡したとき、あなたはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき１点のライフを得てもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地にある空漁師の蜘蛛を追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f92e5e32-d282-47f3-aa8f-8d88bb54013d\', \'multiverseId\': 585108}, \'multiverseid\': 585108}, {\'name\': \'Aranha Pescadora Celeste\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nQuando Aranha Pescadora Celeste entra no campo de batalha, você pode sacrificar outra criatura. Quando fizer isso, destrua a permanente não de terreno alvo.\\nQuando Aranha Pescadora Celeste morre, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida para cada card de criatura em seu cemitério. Se fizer isso, exile Aranha Pescadora Celeste de seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e77c528b-c0ce-4bed-8a32-d5a419ad30df\', \'multiverseId\': 585369}, \'multiverseid\': 585369}, {\'name\': \'捕空蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'延势\\n当捕空蜘蛛进战场时，你可以牺牲另一个生物。当你如此作时，消灭目标非地永久物。\\n当捕空蜘蛛死去时，你可以获得等同于你坟墓场中生物牌数量的生命。若你如此作，则从你的坟墓场放逐捕空蜘蛛。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3819f33e-8a6f-40bf-b41f-2d24f86e5fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 585630}, \'multiverseid\': 585630}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hinterhalt-Absprungjäger\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\n{5}: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Es wäre Torheit, eine Drachenmaschine direkt anzugreifen. Schlagen wir von oben zu."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583849&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cb95102-be1b-4b87-8e86-b569b3436469\', \'multiverseId\': 583849}, \'multiverseid\': 583849}, {\'name\': \'Precipitador de la emboscada\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\n{5}: Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sería una locura enfrentarse a un dragón mecánico frente a frente. Ataquémoslo desde arriba".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e30d5a66-ecb9-4ea3-97e0-b98a4313be16\', \'multiverseId\': 584110}, \'multiverseid\': 584110}, {\'name\': \'Parachutiste embusqueur\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\n{5} : Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Affronter un dragon-machine de face serait de la folie. Attaquons-le du dessus. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584371&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceb60270-52a1-4f1f-8b95-53ea5e595faf\', \'multiverseId\': 584371}, \'multiverseid\': 584371}, {\'name\': "Paracadutista dell\'Imboscata", \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\n{5}: Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Affrontare un drago meccanico a testa bassa sarebbe una pazzia. Bisogna colpirlo dall\\\'alto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9874f6c-8fa7-4fe5-9155-37105a51e3a2\', \'multiverseId\': 584632}, \'multiverseid\': 584632}, {\'name\': \'待ち伏せの降下兵\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n{5}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「正面からドラゴン・エンジンと戦うのは愚行だ。上から叩くぞ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e075808f-a3ef-4b2d-ba79-ad4f1b8e7fa9\', \'multiverseId\': 584893}, \'multiverseid\': 584893}, {\'name\': \'Paraquedista de Emboscada\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVoar\\n{5}: As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Seria tolice enfrentar um dragão mecânico frente a frente. Vamos atacar de cima."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9930ce88-468a-4d92-a8b1-1c17c20051e7\', \'multiverseId\': 585154}, \'multiverseid\': 585154}, {\'name\': \'截击滑翔兵\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n{5}：由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「正面对抗龙形引擎可谓愚蠢至极。让我们从上方入手。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3147aae5-95f1-45f0-8d6c-603f8b2dd4be\', \'multiverseId\': 585415}, \'multiverseid\': 585415}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hoch hinaus\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler deckt so viele Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, wie er bleibende Karten, die keine Länder sind, kontrolliert. Dann bringt er alle bleibenden Karten, die er auf diese Weise aufgedeckt hat, ins Spiel und legt den Rest auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0a2d7c6-e098-4251-9af2-bed316ce8bf6\', \'multiverseId\': 583992}, \'multiverseid\': 583992}, {\'name\': \'Surgir de las trincheras\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador muestra una cantidad de cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca igual a la cantidad de permanentes que no sean tierra que controla, pone todas las cartas de permanente mostradas de esta manera en el campo de batalla y pone el resto en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b3176d5-d616-4440-8b06-e0c60cebf0f8\', \'multiverseId\': 584253}, \'multiverseid\': 584253}, {\'name\': \'Exagération\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur révèle un nombre de cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque égal au nombre de permanents non-terrain qu\'il contrôle, met toutes les cartes de permanent qu\'il a révélées de cette manière sur le champ de bataille, et met le reste dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584514&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a7a6fba-2aba-4e9a-9421-03facfc5c85a\', \'multiverseId\': 584514}, \'multiverseid\': 584514}, {\'name\': "All\'Assalto", \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore rivela un numero di carte dalla cima del proprio grimorio pari al numero di permanenti non terra che controlla, mette sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte permanente che ha rivelato in questo modo e il resto nel proprio cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4263179d-db54-49ec-b7a4-601c92e34752\', \'multiverseId\': 584775}, \'multiverseid\': 584775}, {\'name\': \'やり過ぎ\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーの一番上にある、自分がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネントの数に等しい枚数のカードを公開し、これにより自分が公開したすべてのパーマネント・カードを戦場に出し、残りを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25bd0623-3fea-46a4-8f3e-ba4e1d074c49\', \'multiverseId\': 585036}, \'multiverseid\': 585036}, {\'name\': \'Além das Trincheiras\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador revela um número de cards do topo do próprio grimório igual ao número de permanentes não de terreno que ele controla, coloca todos os cards de permanente revelados dessa forma no campo de batalha e coloca o restante no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'092f3a21-6f42-4c65-8da8-3148902bc530\', \'multiverseId\': 585297}, \'multiverseid\': 585297}, {\'name\': \'越顶出击\', \'text\': \'每位牌手各进行以下流程～展示其牌库顶若干牌，其数量等同于由其操控的非地永久物数量，将所有以此法展示出的永久物牌放进战场，其余则置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b63cf4cc-21d4-4308-8515-f4af84c27cff\', \'multiverseId\': 585558}, \'multiverseid\': 585558}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hoch hinaus\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler deckt so viele Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, wie er bleibende Karten, die keine Länder sind, kontrolliert. Dann bringt er alle bleibenden Karten, die er auf diese Weise aufgedeckt hat, ins Spiel und legt den Rest auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585815&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd6221b6-8f99-442a-9494-0465e09971aa\', \'multiverseId\': 585815}, \'multiverseid\': 585815}, {\'name\': \'Exagération\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur révèle un nombre de cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque égal au nombre de permanents non-terrain qu\'il contrôle, met toutes les cartes de permanent qu\'il a révélées de cette manière sur le champ de bataille, et met le reste dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8015b4bf-e374-432a-a342-418f77b05b13\', \'multiverseId\': 585887}, \'multiverseid\': 585887}, {\'name\': \'やり過ぎ\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーの一番上にある、自分がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネントの数に等しい枚数のカードを公開し、これにより自分が公開したすべてのパーマネント・カードを戦場に出し、残りを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d2d6d2-d060-47a8-a669-d2d679f89689\', \'multiverseId\': 585959}, \'multiverseid\': 585959}, {\'name\': \'越顶出击\', \'text\': \'每位牌手各进行以下流程～展示其牌库顶若干牌，其数量等同于由其操控的非地永久物数量，将所有以此法展示出的永久物牌放进战场，其余则置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9e095d7-0c1f-4f61-91f5-c7df83f32672\', \'multiverseId\': 586031}, \'multiverseid\': 586031}]', '[{\'name\': \'Holzrufer-Automat\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Holzrufer-Automat ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, enttappe ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer Baumhirte-Kreatur mit Eile und Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft in Höhe der Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Holzrufer-Automaten. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586073&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62da71a6-6069-45e3-beb7-ad7dfa3b111e\', \'multiverseId\': 586073}, \'multiverseid\': 586073}, {\'name\': \'Automate parlebois\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Automate parlebois arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, dégagez un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez. Il devient une créature Sylvin avec la célérité et avec une force et une endurance de base égales à la force et à l\'endurance de l\'Automate parlebois. C\'est toujours un terrain.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n3/3", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586078&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ca5612e-2eee-4ff1-9afa-0aa770ba1f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 586078}, \'multiverseid\': 586078}, {\'name\': \'森呼び自動機械\', \'text\': \'森呼び自動機械が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つを対象とする。それをアンタップする。それは速攻を持ち基本のパワーとタフネスが森呼び自動機械のパワーとタフネスに等しいツリーフォーク・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n３/３\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01198ba9-a601-4b7e-b9ce-8c906c19a1ea\', \'multiverseId\': 586083}, \'multiverseid\': 586083}, {\'name\': \'召木机械兽\', \'text\': \'当召木机械兽进战场时，若它经你施放，则重置目标由你操控的地。它成为树妖生物，具敏捷异能，且基础力量与防御力等同于召木机械兽的力量和防御力。它仍然是地。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac86b08-cec5-4a5d-9a47-38ef8dbcd162\', \'multiverseId\': 586088}, \'multiverseid\': 586088}]', '[{\'name\': \'Holzrufer-Automat\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Holzrufer-Automat ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, enttappe ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer Baumhirte-Kreatur mit Eile und Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft in Höhe der Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Holzrufer-Automaten. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586152&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'090c884b-f255-4e40-b06f-1e803c80cbad\', \'multiverseId\': 586152}, \'multiverseid\': 586152}, {\'name\': \'Autómata llamabosques\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Autómata llamabosques entre al campo de batalla, si lo lanzaste, endereza la tierra objetivo que controlas. Se convierte en una criatura Pueblo-arbóreo con la habilidad de prisa y una fuerza y resistencia base iguales a la fuerza y resistencia base del Autómata llamabosques. Sigue siendo una tierra.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'279338bb-e3f2-4698-a44a-5d5208059585\', \'multiverseId\': 586157}, \'multiverseid\': 586157}, {\'name\': \'Automate parlebois\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Automate parlebois arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, dégagez un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez. Il devient une créature Sylvin avec la célérité et avec une force et une endurance de base égales à la force et à l\'endurance de l\'Automate parlebois. C\'est toujours un terrain.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n3/3", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf766872-061c-40f9-a97a-6150fa73ca71\', \'multiverseId\': 586162}, \'multiverseid\': 586162}, {\'name\': \'Automa Evocabosco\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Automa Evocabosco entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciato, STAPpa una terra bersaglio che controlli. Diventa una creatura Silvantropo con rapidità e forza e costituzione base pari alla forza e alla costituzione dell\'Automa Evocabosco. È ancora una terra.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n3/3", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6644bfa-5746-41eb-a34d-8d8708b049e4\', \'multiverseId\': 586167}, \'multiverseid\': 586167}, {\'name\': \'森呼び自動機械\', \'text\': \'森呼び自動機械が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つを対象とする。それをアンタップする。それは速攻を持ち基本のパワーとタフネスが森呼び自動機械のパワーとタフネスに等しいツリーフォーク・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n３/３\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9471712-612b-411c-b2f3-27452472c7ef\', \'multiverseId\': 586172}, \'multiverseid\': 586172}, {\'name\': \'Autômato Convocador de Bosques\', \'text\': \'Quando Autômato Convocador de Bosques entrar no campo de batalha, se você o conjurou, desvire o terreno alvo que você controla. Ele se torna uma criatura Ent com ímpeto e poder e resistência básicos iguais ao poder e à resistência de Autômato Convocador de Bosques. Ela ainda é um terreno.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4301b919-2f0b-4ef8-a8f1-63fa65b76ed4\', \'multiverseId\': 586182}, \'multiverseid\': 586182}, {\'name\': \'召木机械兽\', \'text\': \'当召木机械兽进战场时，若它经你施放，则重置目标由你操控的地。它成为树妖生物，具敏捷异能，且基础力量与防御力等同于召木机械兽的力量和防御力。它仍然是地。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{G}{G}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e825cb59-1936-403e-b308-766de9fe59e7\', \'multiverseId\': 586192}, \'multiverseid\': 586192}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hortende Einsiedlerspinne\', \'text\': \'Reichweite, Todesberührung\\nWenn die Hortende Einsiedlerspinne stirbt, lege bis zu eine andere Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Für die Spinnen Argoths waren Thopter nichts weiter als größere, knusprigere Fliegen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584031&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42575782-e584-45b2-b5e3-230740e13d0f\', \'multiverseId\': 584031}, \'multiverseid\': 584031}, {\'name\': \'Reclusa acaparadora\', \'text\': \'Alcance, toque mortal.\\nCuando la Reclusa acaparadora muera, pon hasta una otra carta objetivo de un cementerio en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Para las arañas de Argoth, los tópteros no eran sino moscas más grandes y crujientes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c16bd365-7ceb-48de-9670-f5e08185e8c6\', \'multiverseId\': 584292}, \'multiverseid\': 584292}, {\'name\': \'Recluse entasseuse\', \'text\': "Portée, contact mortel\\nQuand la Recluse entasseuse meurt, mettez jusqu\'à une autre carte ciblée depuis un cimetière au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Pour les araignées d\'Argoth, les mécanoptères n\'étaient que de grosses mouches croustillantes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584553&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7564464c-5a4a-42ea-ab0a-23cafba2c93f\', \'multiverseId\': 584553}, \'multiverseid\': 584553}, {\'name\': \'Eremita Accumulatore\', \'text\': "Raggiungere, tocco letale\\nQuando l\'Eremita Accumulatore muore, metti fino a un\'altra carta bersaglio da un cimitero in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'Per i ragni di Argoth, i totteri non erano che mosche più grandi e croccanti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ea6788a-f156-4db9-80fb-eb9e1ad29e47\', \'multiverseId\': 584814}, \'multiverseid\': 584814}, {\'name\': \'溜め込むイトグモ\', \'text\': \'到達、接死\\n溜め込むイトグモが死亡したとき、墓地にありこれでないカード最大１枚を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'アルゴスの蜘蛛にとって、飛行機械など少し大きくて、サクサクした歯触りの蝿に過ぎない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a8e8d8b-b2c4-4b24-96df-037d305c69d4\', \'multiverseId\': 585075}, \'multiverseid\': 585075}, {\'name\': \'Reclusa Acumuladora\', \'text\': \'Alcance, toque mortífero\\nQuando Reclusa Acumuladora morrer, coloque até um card alvo de um cemitério no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Para as aranhas de Argoth, os tópteros eram só moscas maiores e mais crocantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c2bc68c-d66a-4e83-b029-3ad34d3bc720\', \'multiverseId\': 585336}, \'multiverseid\': 585336}, {\'name\': \'贮宝遁蛛\', \'text\': \'延势，死触\\n当贮宝遁蛛死去时，将至多另一张目标牌从坟墓场置于其拥有者的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'对亚格斯的蜘蛛来说，扑翼机不过只是更大、更脆的苍蝇罢了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d67994d5-8af2-4bfe-ab29-ff51dda33944\', \'multiverseId\': 585597}, \'multiverseid\': 585597}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hurkyl die Meisterzauberin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch gewirkt hast, decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon für jeden Kartentyp unter den Nichtkreatur-Zaubersprüchen, die du in diesem Zug gewirkt hast, eine Karte jenes Typs auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e508f1a-f1bc-4d7e-9fa9-567b7ee0ea7d\', \'multiverseId\': 583897}, \'multiverseid\': 583897}, {\'name\': \'Hurkyl, maga experta\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si lanzaste un hechizo que no sea de criatura este turno, muestra las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Por cada tipo de carta entre los hechizos que no sean de criatura que lanzaste este turno, puedes poner en tu mano una carta de ese tipo de entre las cartas mostradas. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e6cbe79-6cba-4bb7-a16f-d4c7c362b9fc\', \'multiverseId\': 584158}, \'multiverseid\': 584158}, {\'name\': \'Hurkyl, maîtresse sorcière\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez lancé un sort non-créature ce tour-ci, révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Pour chaque type de carte parmi les sorts non-créature que vous avez lancés ce tour-ci, vous pouvez mettre dans votre main une carte de ce type parmi les cartes révélées. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584419&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aca6118-c99a-48ac-898b-48b2f87df166\', \'multiverseId\': 584419}, \'multiverseid\': 584419}, {\'name\': \'Hurkyl, Maga Magistrale\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai lanciato una magia non creatura in questo turno, rivela le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Per ogni tipo di carta tra le magie non creatura che hai lanciato in questo turno, puoi aggiungere alla tua mano una carta di quel tipo scelta tra le carte rivelate. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8806d0a-8646-4ea2-bfcf-5ea7fbfb5daa\', \'multiverseId\': 584680}, \'multiverseid\': 584680}, {\'name\': \'熟練の魔術師、ハーキル\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えていた場合、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を公開する。このターンにあなたが唱えてクリーチャーでない呪文の中のカード・タイプ１種類につきそれぞれ、その公開されたカードの中からそのタイプのカード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c93a5db-8153-4a47-ae8d-3741f97776af\', \'multiverseId\': 584941}, \'multiverseid\': 584941}, {\'name\': \'Hurkyl, Maga Mestra\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se você tiver conjurado uma mágica não de criatura neste turno, revele os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Para cada tipo de card entre as mágicas não de criatura que você conjurou neste turno, você pode colocar em sua mão um card daquele tipo dentre os cards revelados. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad129bd1-7ec0-456d-96e9-dd09706f4bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 585202}, \'multiverseid\': 585202}, {\'name\': \'魔法大师河鼓\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中已施放非生物咒语，则展示你牌库顶的五张牌。你本回合中已施放的非生物咒语中每有一种牌张类别，你便可以从所展示的牌中将一张该类别的牌置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba7f71e-6865-411a-85cf-f2bd3612094b\', \'multiverseId\': 585463}, \'multiverseid\': 585463}]', "[{'name': 'Hurkyl die Meisterzauberin', 'text': 'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch gewirkt hast, decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon für jeden Kartentyp unter den Nichtkreatur-Zaubersprüchen, die du in diesem Zug gewirkt hast, eine Karte jenes Typs auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer, Berater', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585789&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6918d85f-d356-4412-9b96-3f4a2f7719aa', 'multiverseId': 585789}, 'multiverseid': 585789}, {'name': 'Hurkyl, maîtresse sorcière', 'text': 'Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez lancé un sort non-créature ce tour-ci, révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Pour chaque type de carte parmi les sorts non-créature que vous avez lancés ce tour-ci, vous pouvez mettre dans votre main une carte de ce type parmi les cartes révélées. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier et conseiller', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585861&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1be1cde0-213c-4950-9b96-66bfcb5c0820', 'multiverseId': 585861}, 'multiverseid': 585861}, {'name': '熟練の魔術師、ハーキル', 'text': 'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えていた場合、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を公開する。このターンにあなたが唱えてクリーチャーでない呪文の中のカード・タイプ１種類につきそれぞれ、その公開されたカードの中からそのタイプのカード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード・アドバイザー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585933&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8ef1416-53a6-4082-adee-7f351de7f6f1', 'multiverseId': 585933}, 'multiverseid': 585933}, {'name': '魔法大师河鼓', 'text': '在你的结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中已施放非生物咒语，则展示你牌库顶的五张牌。你本回合中已施放的非生物咒语中每有一种牌张类别，你便可以从所展示的牌中将一张该类别的牌置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／神器师／参谋', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586005&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74ee30f7-0dc3-4ba1-95df-b66eb22e89fc', 'multiverseId': 586005}, 'multiverseid': 586005}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hurkyls letzte Meditation\', \'text\': \'Solange es nicht dein Zug ist, kostet dieser Zauberspruch beim Wirken {3} mehr.\\nBringe alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück. Beende den Zug. (Schicke alle Zaubersprüche und Fähigkeiten vom Stapel ins Exil, einschließlich dieser Karte. Der Spieler, dessen Zug es ist, wirft so viele Karten ab, bis er seine maximale Handkartenzahl erreicht hat. Schaden heilt und „In-diesem-Zug"- und „Bis-zum-Ende-des-Zuges"-Effekte enden.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583898&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8b9a439-8dc4-4e13-8b64-82cf5d876dd4\', \'multiverseId\': 583898}, \'multiverseid\': 583898}, {\'name\': \'Última meditación de Hurkyl\', \'text\': \'Mientras no sea tu turno, te cuesta {3} más lanzar este hechizo.\\nRegresa todos los permanentes que no sean tierra a las manos de sus propietarios. Finaliza el turno. (Exilia todos los hechizos y habilidades de la pila, incluida esta carta. El jugador cuyo turno se está jugando descarta hasta su tamaño máximo de mano. El daño desaparece y terminan los efectos "hasta el final del turno" y "este turno".)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1862142e-957e-43a9-9d28-e185b3049073\', \'multiverseId\': 584159}, \'multiverseid\': 584159}, {\'name\': "Méditation finale d\'Hurkyl", \'text\': "Tant que ce n\'est pas votre tour, ce sort coûte {3} de plus à lancer.\\nRenvoyez tous les permanents non-terrain dans les mains de leurs propriétaires. Terminez le tour. (Exilez tous les sorts et toutes les capacités de la pile, y compris cette carte. Le joueur dont c\'est le tour se défausse de ses cartes jusqu\'à sa taille de main maximum. Les blessures disparaissent et les effets « ce tour-ci » et « jusqu\'à la fin du tour » se terminent.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584420&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'898e46cc-54be-4e42-99a5-db7ee9b7cfc4\', \'multiverseId\': 584420}, \'multiverseid\': 584420}, {\'name\': \'Meditazione Finale di Hurkyl\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che non è il tuo turno, questa magia costa {3} in più per essere lanciata.\\nFai tornare tutti i permanenti non terra in mano ai rispettivi proprietari. Fine del turno. (Esilia tutte le magie e le abilità dalla pila, compresa questa carta. Il giocatore di turno scarta carte fino ad avere in mano il suo limite massimo di carte. Il danno viene rimosso e terminano gli effetti "in questo turno" e "fino alla fine del turno".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cd34f78-e6f4-46ab-aa10-618fe595f230\', \'multiverseId\': 584681}, \'multiverseid\': 584681}, {\'name\': \'ハーキルの最後の瞑想\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンでないかぎり、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{3}多くなる。\\n土地でないすべてのパーマネントをオーナーの手札に戻す。ターンを終了する。（このカードを含め、スタックにあるすべての呪文や能力を追放する。現在のターンを進行しているプレイヤーは、自分の手札の上限までカードを捨てる。ダメージは消え、「このターン」と「ターン終了時まで」の効果は終わる。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eca7fecd-e117-43ae-9ad2-24b2a3c089b4\', \'multiverseId\': 584942}, \'multiverseid\': 584942}, {\'name\': \'Meditação Final de Hurkyl\', \'text\': \'Enquanto não for o seu turno, esta mágica custará {3} a mais para ser conjurada.\\nDevolva todas as permanentes não de terreno para as mãos de seus donos. Termine o turno. (Exile todas as mágicas e habilidades da pilha, inclusive este card. O jogador controlador do turno descarta até chegar ao número máximo de cards na mão. O dano termina e efeitos que ocorrem "neste turno" e "até o final do turno" cessam.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c7083eb-b73d-4293-88d1-66bedf547b9d\', \'multiverseId\': 585203}, \'multiverseid\': 585203}, {\'name\': \'河鼓的最终冥想\', \'text\': \'只要不是在你的回合中，此咒语便增加{3}来施放。\\n将所有非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。结束本回合。（放逐堆叠上的所有咒语和异能，包括此牌。轮到此回合的牌手将手牌弃至其手牌上限。生物上的伤害消失，并且注记着「本回合」与「直到回合结束」的效应均结束。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7258d734-efcd-4f2a-9292-7041f359be37\', \'multiverseId\': 585464}, \'multiverseid\': 585464}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hurkyls letzte Meditation\', \'text\': \'Solange es nicht dein Zug ist, kostet dieser Zauberspruch beim Wirken {3} mehr.\\nBringe alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück. Beende den Zug.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585790&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7169349-2f37-40c7-af81-c3bf50599bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 585790}, \'multiverseid\': 585790}, {\'name\': "Méditation finale d\'Hurkyl", \'text\': "Tant que ce n\'est pas votre tour, ce sort coûte {3} de plus à lancer.\\nRenvoyez tous les permanents non-terrain dans les mains de leurs propriétaires. Terminez le tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'babe537b-6768-439d-8690-3feb4a9f777b\', \'multiverseId\': 585862}, \'multiverseid\': 585862}, {\'name\': \'ハーキルの最後の瞑想\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンでないかぎり、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{3}多くなる。\\n土地でないすべてのパーマネントをオーナーの手札に戻す。ターンを終了する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9303f646-9d8a-4adb-94a4-ebdc2b0d91a6\', \'multiverseId\': 585934}, \'multiverseid\': 585934}, {\'name\': \'河鼓的最终冥想\', \'text\': \'只要不是在你的回合中，此咒语便增加{3}来施放。\\n将所有非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。结束本回合。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4eebf4c-7cad-41ab-b78b-88aa57916855\', \'multiverseId\': 586006}, \'multiverseid\': 586006}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hüterin der Kadenz\', \'text\': \'{3}: Lege eine Artefakt-, Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Was du Magie nennst, nenne ich die Macht der Erinnerung."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583900&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'733b3c11-5f5c-4fd3-bd80-3973647a107d\', \'multiverseId\': 583900}, \'multiverseid\': 583900}, {\'name\': \'Guardiana de la cadencia\', \'text\': \'{3}: Pon la carta de artefacto, instantáneo o conjuro objetivo de un cementerio en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"A lo que tú llamas magia, yo lo llamo el poder de los recuerdos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ff8411b-6e3d-4ae1-ad07-a791823bb9fb\', \'multiverseId\': 584161}, \'multiverseid\': 584161}, {\'name\': \'Gardienne de la cadence\', \'text\': "{3} : Mettez une carte d\'artefact, d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis un cimetière au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Pour vous, c\'est de la magie, pour moi c\'est la puissance de la mémoire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584422&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e3e066f-b3ff-4e3d-b305-29f4618bf0df\', \'multiverseId\': 584422}, \'multiverseid\': 584422}, {\'name\': \'Custode della Cadenza\', \'text\': \'{3}: Metti una carta artefatto, istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio da un cimitero in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ciò che tu chiami magia, io lo chiamo potere della memoria."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb272eb1-615a-40c6-833e-3a8edf261aa6\', \'multiverseId\': 584683}, \'multiverseid\': 584683}, {\'name\': \'抑揚の番人\', \'text\': \'{3}：墓地にありアーティファクトやインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「おまえが魔法と呼ぶものを、私は記憶の力と呼ぶのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abf398d1-104d-4447-959e-190d3ef33030\', \'multiverseId\': 584944}, \'multiverseid\': 584944}, {\'name\': \'Guardiã da Cadência\', \'text\': \'{3}: Coloque o card de artefato, mágica instantânea ou feitiço alvo de um cemitério no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"O que você chama de magia eu chamo de poder da memória."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01781530-a340-4993-a0d5-ed84b1e803c7\', \'multiverseId\': 585205}, \'multiverseid\': 585205}, {\'name\': \'时律护持师\', \'text\': \'{3}：将目标神器，瞬间或法术牌从坟墓场置于其拥有者的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「你管这叫作魔法，我则称其为回忆之力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ea813d-6fc1-478e-9d89-3dc2b329537c\', \'multiverseId\': 585466}, \'multiverseid\': 585466}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ikonoklastin vom Dritten Pfad\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du nur einen Hammer hast, kommt dir alles wie ein Nagel vor. Ich schlage lediglich vor, unseren Werkzeugkasten ein wenig zu erweitern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584066&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24fc2522-da22-40d4-935d-420eb38642bf\', \'multiverseId\': 584066}, \'multiverseid\': 584066}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclasta del Tercer Camino\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Soldado incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando solo tienes un martillo, todo te parece un clavo. Yo únicamente propongo ampliar nuestra caja de herramientas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a529acc-8d9a-466b-84af-448cae601f6c\', \'multiverseId\': 584327}, \'multiverseid\': 584327}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclaste de la Troisième Voie\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': "« Quand on n\'a qu\'un marteau, tout ressemble à un clou. Je propose seulement d\'améliorer notre boîte à outils. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584588&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'944d1278-a67a-4ee2-bfd1-8397464358c5\', \'multiverseId\': 584588}, \'multiverseid\': 584588}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclasta del Terzo Cammino\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Soldato 1/1 incolore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando tutto quel che hai è un martello, ogni cosa sembra un chiodo. Propongo di espandere la nostra cassetta degli attrezzi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56dd2851-8e0d-4bff-8cb8-0ca1f3d827ee\', \'multiverseId\': 584849}, \'multiverseid\': 584849}, {\'name\': \'第三の道の偶像破壊者\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'「手元にあるのが金鎚だけだと、何もかもが釘に見えてしまう。私は単に、我らの工具箱を充実させようと提案しているだけだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c185b9-06ea-4393-8b27-d0090566c7ed\', \'multiverseId\': 585110}, \'multiverseid\': 585110}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclasta da Terceira Via\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica não de criatura, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Soldado incolor 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Monge\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando você só tem um martelo, tudo tem cara de prego. Só proponho que você expanda sua caixa de ferramentas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddb7cf4c-9556-4874-85cd-f8cf93ba37ed\', \'multiverseId\': 585371}, \'multiverseid\': 585371}, {\'name\': \'蹊径会异端\', \'text\': \'每当你施放非生物咒语时，派出一个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你手上只有锤子，那所有东西都只会看着像钉子。我只是建议工具箱里多备点其他器具。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7bac2dd-c532-4a11-b05e-85cc22da2796\', \'multiverseId\': 585632}, \'multiverseid\': 585632}]', '[{\'name\': \'Infanterie-Rekruten\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Infanterie-Rekruten sterben, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist schon komisch", bemerkte Laga seinem Trupp gegenüber. „Mishras Lakaien tragen edle Seide in ihren vergoldeten Palästen, während wir in den Gräben schuften und altes Brot fressen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebf50a7d-b4d7-4088-b80b-01be9a0f6ad6\', \'multiverseId\': 583975}, \'multiverseid\': 583975}, {\'name\': \'Reclutas de infantería\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Reclutas de infantería mueran, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Soldado incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Es curioso", comentó Laga a su escuadra. "Los lacayos de Mishra visten con lujosas sedas en sus hermosos palacios, mientras que nosotros sufrimos en las trincheras comiendo pan rancio".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2b21ec0-8f7a-4b74-afe2-acbbbbbf6085\', \'multiverseId\': 584236}, \'multiverseid\': 584236}, {\'name\': \'Infanterie de conscrits\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Infanterie de conscrits meurt, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est drôle, dit Laga à son escouade. Les laquais de Mishra portent des soieries luxueuses dans leurs palais dorés, tandis que nous pataugeons dans les tranchées en mangeant du pain rassis. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584497&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f1a7291-4a9b-4526-9288-eb44e6e96177\', \'multiverseId\': 584497}, \'multiverseid\': 584497}, {\'name\': \'Fanteria Coscritta\', \'text\': \'Quando la Fanteria Coscritta muore, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Soldato 1/1 incolore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"È buffo" commentò Laga alla sua squadra. "Gli sgherri di Mishra indossano sfarzosi abiti di seta nei loro palazzi dorati, mentre noi ci affanniamo nelle trincee mangiando pane raffermo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c1c962c-4e02-4858-8221-9ffbbe8004b4\', \'multiverseId\': 584758}, \'multiverseid\': 584758}, {\'name\': \'徴集された歩兵部隊\', \'text\': \'徴集された歩兵部隊が死亡したとき、無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ふざけた話だ。」ラガは隊の仲間にこぼした。「ミシュラにおべっかを使う連中が豪華な絹の服を着て金ぴかの宮殿で過ごしてるのに、俺たちは塹壕で固くなったパンをかじってるんだぜ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d6643e-1933-4a10-9d77-a2469ae9519b\', \'multiverseId\': 585019}, \'multiverseid\': 585019}, {\'name\': \'Infantaria Recrutada\', \'text\': \'Quando Infantaria Recrutada morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Soldado incolor 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Engraçado", Laga comentou com seu esquadrão. "Os lacaios de Mishra usam sedas luxuosas em seus palácios dourados, enquanto nós trabalhamos nas trincheiras comendo pão velho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'792851d7-78d7-449b-9b61-ff3572bc48f0\', \'multiverseId\': 585280}, \'multiverseid\': 585280}, {\'name\': \'受征步兵\', \'text\': \'当受征步兵死去时，派出一个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「真有趣。」拉加跟同袍抱怨。「米斯拉的跟班能在镶金宫殿里自在逍遥，我们就得在壕沟里啃馊面包。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6abc7e9c-abc0-46b7-ac8e-16cc6293635c\', \'multiverseId\': 585541}, \'multiverseid\': 585541}]', "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586210&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5316d9e1-994a-41ef-8d71-1d384a3f7c4e', 'multiverseId': 586210}, 'multiverseid': 586210}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586220&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caec6a5e-adaa-4e55-89a7-2d085ad55c8a', 'multiverseId': 586220}, 'multiverseid': 586220}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586230&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9937f33b-dff9-4020-b69a-3c1644075a6b', 'multiverseId': 586230}, 'multiverseid': 586230}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586240&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3a5154b-a237-4e86-aa69-edc4b82a9ce7', 'multiverseId': 586240}, 'multiverseid': 586240}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586250&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c05e556-278a-468b-92df-61c03d81d8f3', 'multiverseId': 586250}, 'multiverseid': 586250}, {'name': 'Ilha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586270&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c58ddef8-e48c-47c4-92e5-38f2c6e9af52', 'multiverseId': 586270}, 'multiverseid': 586270}, {'name': '海岛', 'type': '基本地 ～海岛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586290&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f1399b4-0f5e-4435-8e5d-1225fd22f065', 'multiverseId': 586290}, 'multiverseid': 586290}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586211&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02216820-5b54-4a6d-9541-a2ce97940b41', 'multiverseId': 586211}, 'multiverseid': 586211}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586221&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caddee5f-66c3-4370-a4ec-0b76e3500186', 'multiverseId': 586221}, 'multiverseid': 586221}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586231&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7ea2ef5-4c2f-428a-b1ae-3c83e5b1ca23', 'multiverseId': 586231}, 'multiverseid': 586231}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586241&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1d7d15b-7ab9-4a2e-ab01-f197af6360cb', 'multiverseId': 586241}, 'multiverseid': 586241}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586251&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a8a14f1-c542-45ed-be46-518eb7da2de1', 'multiverseId': 586251}, 'multiverseid': 586251}, {'name': 'Ilha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586271&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de709b23-88ed-415b-aee8-9286a981326d', 'multiverseId': 586271}, 'multiverseid': 586271}, {'name': '海岛', 'type': '基本地 ～海岛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586291&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2647c4e0-37fe-4a7f-a5f6-8ed52bf1c374', 'multiverseId': 586291}, 'multiverseid': 586291}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586365&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4b25cc7-dddc-451c-8d2c-eebea0951f01', 'multiverseId': 586365}, 'multiverseid': 586365}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586375&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c931e71-08c7-4a66-ba17-3be3c7884205', 'multiverseId': 586375}, 'multiverseid': 586375}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586385&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd6934b6-a367-4921-b290-5234367fa90a', 'multiverseId': 586385}, 'multiverseid': 586385}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586395&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c92eed9-bc19-492a-bc2e-1e1ccb6e6003', 'multiverseId': 586395}, 'multiverseid': 586395}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586405&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a20dcf23-0ca3-4905-b1b2-a89a45d3baf0', 'multiverseId': 586405}, 'multiverseid': 586405}, {'name': 'Ilha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586425&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ed62ddb-c115-4c74-9467-27f664dde9a0', 'multiverseId': 586425}, 'multiverseid': 586425}, {'name': '海岛', 'type': '基本地 ～海岛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586445&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fac739e6-487f-484c-8bdc-f69f04ce6c04', 'multiverseId': 586445}, 'multiverseid': 586445}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586366&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a8a9f0e-a473-45cb-8280-7ddba5b29911', 'multiverseId': 586366}, 'multiverseid': 586366}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586376&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1449aac3-cb30-4f4f-bffe-635737d16ab8', 'multiverseId': 586376}, 'multiverseid': 586376}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586386&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '968c0778-4c87-4f53-aaa2-c33fcceb94b9', 'multiverseId': 586386}, 'multiverseid': 586386}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586396&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cff8b12b-b540-4558-a601-046aee3df850', 'multiverseId': 586396}, 'multiverseid': 586396}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586406&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b08be1c-f61f-4dff-aed2-955bd3d42094', 'multiverseId': 586406}, 'multiverseid': 586406}, {'name': 'Ilha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586426&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1820bac5-54bb-438f-93e4-7a344976c0a2', 'multiverseId': 586426}, 'multiverseid': 586426}, {'name': '海岛', 'type': '基本地 ～海岛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586446&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9799e8b-ed7c-4437-b55e-9b4bbd7f2515', 'multiverseId': 586446}, 'multiverseid': 586446}]", "[{'name': 'Kampfdrescher', 'text': 'Doppelschlag\\nWenn der Kampfdrescher ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{W}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n1/1', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583881&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba03f678-6a85-4f69-8b8f-880c2dedb320', 'multiverseId': 583881}, 'multiverseid': 583881}, {'name': 'Trilladora de combate', 'text': 'Daña dos veces.\\nCuando la Trilladora de combate entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{W}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n1/1', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584142&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02ee4645-add3-4d65-8bac-5c34a36497ad', 'multiverseId': 584142}, 'multiverseid': 584142}, {'name': 'Batteuse de combat', 'text': 'Double initiative\\nQuand la Batteuse de combat arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{W}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n1/1', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584403&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84d8662a-c0c3-4ac5-a227-b336cb9e432d', 'multiverseId': 584403}, 'multiverseid': 584403}, {'name': 'Trebbiatrice da Combattimento', 'text': 'Doppio attacco\\nQuando la Trebbiatrice da Combattimento entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{W}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n1/1', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584664&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46a74d2e-9901-4af3-a9c6-a812f9ca1ce9', 'multiverseId': 584664}, 'multiverseid': 584664}, {'name': '戦闘の打破者', 'text': '二段攻撃\\n戦闘の打破者が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{W}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n１/１', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584925&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b448d47-9cf4-451a-a36a-55b31ec0b2b8', 'multiverseId': 584925}, 'multiverseid': 584925}, {'name': 'Debulhador de Combate', 'text': 'Golpe duplo\\nQuando Debulhador de Combate entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{W}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n1/1', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585186&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04f0c042-f188-4f94-9e86-2aabf8dd812c', 'multiverseId': 585186}, 'multiverseid': 585186}, {'name': '战斗甩击械', 'text': '连击\\n当战斗甩击械进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{W}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n1/1', 'type': '神器生物 ～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585447&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ad12d98-f3ac-467a-b49f-de86d6f4cf02', 'multiverseId': 585447}, 'multiverseid': 585447}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kampfkurier\', \'text\': \'{2}, opfere den Kampfkurier: Ziehe eine Karte.\\nExhumieren {U} ({U}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d4f52c4-abcd-4cf5-a793-f0de8a792c71\', \'multiverseId\': 583923}, \'multiverseid\': 583923}, {\'name\': \'Mensajero de combate\', \'text\': \'{2}, sacrificar el Mensajero de combate: Roba una carta.\\nDesenterrar {U}. ({U}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3c40d59-e2fc-4ef4-b9a5-8da7c75c4799\', \'multiverseId\': 584184}, \'multiverseid\': 584184}, {\'name\': \'Messager de combat\', \'text\': "{2}, sacrifiez le Messager de combat : Piochez une carte.\\nExhumation {U} ({U} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584445&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c86ffa2-f44b-4c0b-a3f6-a0142599cde4\', \'multiverseId\': 584445}, \'multiverseid\': 584445}, {\'name\': \'Corriere da Combattimento\', \'text\': "{2}, Sacrifica il Corriere da Combattimento: Pesca una carta.\\nDissotterrare {U} ({U}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62fbe6bd-5f0d-4674-807c-f080df167beb\', \'multiverseId\': 584706}, \'multiverseid\': 584706}, {\'name\': \'戦闘急使\', \'text\': \'{2}, 戦闘急使を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\\n蘇生{U}（{U}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、あるいは、これが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c933b4dd-7977-4e2c-bdc0-605bd6699089\', \'multiverseId\': 584967}, \'multiverseid\': 584967}, {\'name\': \'Mensageiro de Combate\', \'text\': \'{2}, sacrifique Mensageiro de Combate: Compre um card.\\nDesenterrar {U} ({U}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ec1de4-084c-4e91-bb18-f8cee87e78c6\', \'multiverseId\': 585228}, \'multiverseid\': 585228}, {\'name\': \'战斗传讯械\', \'text\': \'{2}，牺牲战斗传讯械：抓一张牌。\\n破坟{U}（{U}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab8bc598-499d-41a9-8e1c-e6e8425c83d7\', \'multiverseId\': 585489}, \'multiverseid\': 585489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaylas Befehl\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Erzeuge einen 2/2 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\n• Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst. Sie erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Standardlandkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\\n• Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu und wendest Hellsicht 2 an.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583855&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e5e3ae2-81bd-4731-b13d-8320eff59ab2\', \'multiverseId\': 583855}, \'multiverseid\': 583855}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de Kayla\', \'text\': \'Elige dos:\\n• Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora 2/2.\\n• Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controlas. Gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\\n• Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.\\n• Ganas 2 vidas y adivinas 2.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2733f697-2796-479d-ade1-1d6fa5545117\', \'multiverseId\': 584116}, \'multiverseid\': 584116}, {\'name\': \'Commandement de Kayla\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 2/2 incolore Construction.\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature que vous contrôlez. Elle acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.\\n• Vous gagnez 2 points de vie et vous appliquez regard 2.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584377&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a73e6f6-0c5b-402c-958d-4a5cb99b59e0\', \'multiverseId\': 584377}, \'multiverseid\': 584377}, {\'name\': \'Comando di Kayla\', \'text\': \'Scegli due —\\n• Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 2/2 incolore.\\n• Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura che controlli. Ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.\\n• Guadagni 2 punti vita e profetizzi 2.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'208ec122-0ab1-4472-8386-95c4adaaec1d\', \'multiverseId\': 584638}, \'multiverseid\': 584638}, {\'name\': \'カイラの命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n・無色の２/２の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n・あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\\n・あなたのライブラリーから基本平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\\n・あなたは２点のライフを得、占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f52f437-637a-40aa-8e3a-01255ed970ca\', \'multiverseId\': 584899}, \'multiverseid\': 584899}, {\'name\': \'Comando de Kayla\', \'text\': \'Escolha dois —\\n• Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Constructo incolor 2/2.\\n• Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em uma criatura que você controla. Ela ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\\n• Procure em seu grimório um card de Planície básica, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe.\\n• Você ganha 2 pontos de vida e usa vidência 2.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e2da83b-c70f-4033-ad03-1b2422489922\', \'multiverseId\': 585160}, \'multiverseid\': 585160}, {\'name\': \'凯拉的指命\', \'text\': \'选择两项～\\n•派出一个2/2无色组构体衍生神器生物。\\n•在一个由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得连击异能直到回合结束。\\n•从你牌库中搜寻一张基本的平原牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\\n•你获得2点生命且占卜2。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00bcba70-b921-4374-b119-4c534bb79098\', \'multiverseId\': 585421}, \'multiverseid\': 585421}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaylas Befehl\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Erzeuge einen 2/2 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\n• Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst. Sie erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Standardlandkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\\n• Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu und wendest Hellsicht 2 an.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585777&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc1892c-8ed4-49da-b177-7508665b0540\', \'multiverseId\': 585777}, \'multiverseid\': 585777}, {\'name\': \'Commandement de Kayla\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 2/2 incolore Construction.\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature que vous contrôlez. Elle acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.\\n• Vous gagnez 2 points de vie et vous appliquez regard 2.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9533332-3bfe-4e98-b048-3cd192bd82ea\', \'multiverseId\': 585849}, \'multiverseid\': 585849}, {\'name\': \'カイラの命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n・無色の２/２の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n・あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\\n・あなたのライブラリーから基本平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\\n・あなたは２点のライフを得、占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0f5fedf-eb01-4a12-9d9d-877ce33854e8\', \'multiverseId\': 585921}, \'multiverseid\': 585921}, {\'name\': \'凯拉的指命\', \'text\': \'选择两项～\\n•派出一个2/2无色组构体衍生神器生物。\\n•在一个由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得连击异能直到回合结束。\\n•从你牌库中搜寻一张基本的平原牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\\n•你获得2点生命且占卜2。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a328897e-5498-427d-a391-c70f0223bdce\', \'multiverseId\': 585993}, \'multiverseid\': 585993}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaylas Wiederaufbau\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten sieben Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Bringe davon bis zu X Artefakt- und/oder Kreaturenkarten mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger ins Spiel. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder kann einen Kontinent in Schutt und Asche legen. Nur wenige haben die Weitsicht, einen wiederaufzubauen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583856&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c273691c-63a1-4180-8f39-1335d4bd6c4a\', \'multiverseId\': 583856}, \'multiverseid\': 583856}, {\'name\': \'Reconstrucción de Kayla\', \'text\': \'Mira las siete primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon en el campo de batalla hasta X cartas de artefacto y/o de criatura con valor de maná de 3 o menos de entre ellas. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cualquiera puede destruir un continente, pero pocos tienen la visión necesaria para reconstruir uno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee4e9e20-abcd-4acc-a01e-4b64cf14f3c8\', \'multiverseId\': 584117}, \'multiverseid\': 584117}, {\'name\': \'Reconstruction de Kayla\', \'text\': "Regardez les sept cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à X cartes d\'artefact et/ou de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 parmi elles. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "N\'importe qui peut détruire un continent. Rares sont ceux suffisamment visionnaires pour le reconstruire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584378&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ce53fc9-ac6b-4b95-88b5-5c7c99c9b79f\', \'multiverseId\': 584378}, \'multiverseid\': 584378}, {\'name\': \'Ricostruzione di Kayla\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime sette carte del tuo grimorio. Metti sul campo di battaglia fino a X carte creatura e/o artefatto con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 scelte tra esse. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Chiunque è in grado di distruggere un continente. Pochi hanno la lungimiranza necessaria per ricostruirne uno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d97d551e-5636-43a3-8691-f6eab1ad395e\', \'multiverseId\': 584639}, \'multiverseid\': 584639}, {\'name\': \'カイラの再建\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード７枚を見る。その中からマナ総量が３以下でありアーティファクトやクリーチャーであるカード最大Ｘ枚を戦場に出す。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'大陸を破壊するのは誰でもできる。だが、再建の構想を有する者はわずかだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bebd79b0-7be0-46d8-8c40-bb9e2c30fbb9\', \'multiverseId\': 584900}, \'multiverseid\': 584900}, {\'name\': \'Reconstrução de Kayla\', \'text\': \'Olhe os sete cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque no campo de batalha até X cards de criatura e/ou artefato com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 dentre eles. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Qualquer um pode destruir um continente. Poucos têm a visão necessária para construir um.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a58aed0-39f1-4095-b8bb-bf833d923583\', \'multiverseId\': 585161}, \'multiverseid\': 585161}, {\'name\': \'凯拉的重筑\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的七张牌。将其中至多X张法术力值等于或小于3的神器和／或生物牌放进战场。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'任谁都能毁灭大陆。没人设想重建愿景。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdea77ee-08df-4fc3-9479-b8d3e0d614ef\', \'multiverseId\': 585422}, \'multiverseid\': 585422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaylas Wiederaufbau\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten sieben Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Bringe davon bis zu X Artefakt- und/oder Kreaturenkarten mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger ins Spiel. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585778&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5ce86aa-cc23-4306-933e-aea671d6cd49\', \'multiverseId\': 585778}, \'multiverseid\': 585778}, {\'name\': \'Reconstruction de Kayla\', \'text\': "Regardez les sept cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à X cartes d\'artefact et/ou de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 parmi elles. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585850&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'580c0c60-adc5-414e-8fdf-c91913385ea6\', \'multiverseId\': 585850}, \'multiverseid\': 585850}, {\'name\': \'カイラの再建\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード７枚を見る。その中からマナ総量が３以下でありアーティファクトやクリーチャーであるカード最大Ｘ枚を戦場に出す。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76c3ff55-a4dc-472c-a2ec-95e967204b42\', \'multiverseId\': 585922}, \'multiverseid\': 585922}, {\'name\': \'凯拉的重筑\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的七张牌。将其中至多X张法术力值等于或小于3的神器和／或生物牌放进战场。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9499514d-dcce-4bae-86ee-85149d5d26b3\', \'multiverseId\': 585994}, \'multiverseid\': 585994}]', "[{'name': 'Klingen-Transmogrant', 'text': 'Der Klingen-Transmogrant kann nicht blocken.\\n{4}{B}{B}: Bringe den Klingen-Transmogranten aus deinem Friedhof mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel zurück. Diese Fähigkeit kostet beim Aktivieren {4} weniger, falls ein Gegner vier oder mehr Nichtstandardländer kontrolliert.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Zombie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583968&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe94f3e4-c196-4e9c-b9cb-3712ce719f51', 'multiverseId': 583968}, 'multiverseid': 583968}, {'name': 'Transmutado latigocortante', 'text': 'El Transmutado latigocortante no puede bloquear.\\n{4}{B}{B}: Regresa el Transmutado latigocortante de tu cementerio al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él. Te cuesta {4} menos activar esta habilidad si un oponente controla cuatro o más tierras no básicas.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Zombie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584229&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd840b056-6149-4649-8a28-0d27db7da675', 'multiverseId': 584229}, 'multiverseid': 584229}, {'name': 'Transfigurant tranchefouet', 'text': 'Le Transfigurant tranchefouet ne peut pas bloquer.\\n{4}{B}{B} : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, le Transfigurant tranchefouet avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui. Cette capacité coûte {4} de moins à activer si un adversaire contrôle au moins quatre terrains non-base.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : zombie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584490&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e722197-50fd-41be-8a1d-346e21589d81', 'multiverseId': 584490}, 'multiverseid': 584490}, {'name': 'Trasmutatore Frustalama', 'text': 'Il Trasmutatore Frustalama non può bloccare.\\n{4}{B}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia il Trasmutatore Frustalama dal tuo cimitero con un segnalino +1/+1. Questa abilità costa {4} in meno per essere attivata se un avversario controlla quattro o più terre non base.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Zombie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584751&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd828e422-f03a-4a47-b52d-484ac970e992', 'multiverseId': 584751}, 'multiverseid': 584751}, {'name': '剃刀鞭の人体改造機', 'text': '剃刀鞭の人体改造機ではブロックできない。\\n{4}{B}{B}：あなたの墓地にある剃刀鞭の人体改造機を＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。対戦相手１人が基本でない４つ以上の土地をコントロールしているなら、この能力を起動するためのコストは{4}少なくなる。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585012&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c87ba2c-a8b3-4e55-b889-8d2fc9e2b09d', 'multiverseId': 585012}, 'multiverseid': 585012}, {'name': 'Transmutado Laminaçoite', 'text': 'Transmutado Laminaçoite não pode bloquear.\\n{4}{B}{B}: Devolva Transmutado Laminaçoite de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1. Esta habilidade custa {4} a menos para ser ativada se um oponente controla quatro ou mais terrenos não básicos.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Zumbi', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585273&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db9e0573-ce4e-48cd-98a7-f27e6fb08d15', 'multiverseId': 585273}, 'multiverseid': 585273}, {'name': '锐鞭变械人', 'text': '锐鞭变械人不能进行阻挡。\\n{4}{B}{B}：将锐鞭变械人从你的坟墓场移回战场，且上面有一个+1/+1指示物。如果任一对手操控四个或更多非基本地，则此异能减少{4}来起动。', 'type': '神器生物 ～灵俑', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585534&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0d60f94-1618-4b1d-b030-516db6f1417c', 'multiverseId': 585534}, 'multiverseid': 585534}]", "[{'name': 'Klingen-Transmogrant', 'text': 'Der Klingen-Transmogrant kann nicht blocken.\\n{4}{B}{B}: Bringe den Klingen-Transmogranten aus deinem Friedhof mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel zurück. Diese Fähigkeit kostet beim Aktivieren {4} weniger, falls ein Gegner vier oder mehr Nichtstandardländer kontrolliert.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Zombie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585808&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8061f50-437a-494d-8137-76931c3eb9f4', 'multiverseId': 585808}, 'multiverseid': 585808}, {'name': 'Transfigurant tranchefouet', 'text': 'Le Transfigurant tranchefouet ne peut pas bloquer.\\n{4}{B}{B} : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, le Transfigurant tranchefouet avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui. Cette capacité coûte {4} de moins à activer si un adversaire contrôle au moins quatre terrains non-base.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : zombie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585880&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edc32876-b9f1-4648-823e-17e941e19999', 'multiverseId': 585880}, 'multiverseid': 585880}, {'name': '剃刀鞭の人体改造機', 'text': '剃刀鞭の人体改造機ではブロックできない。\\n{4}{B}{B}：あなたの墓地にある剃刀鞭の人体改造機を＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。対戦相手１人が基本でない４つ以上の土地をコントロールしているなら、この能力を起動するためのコストは{4}少なくなる。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585952&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e080159-4610-460d-9867-3c349bd9d326', 'multiverseId': 585952}, 'multiverseid': 585952}, {'name': '锐鞭变械人', 'text': '锐鞭变械人不能进行阻挡。\\n{4}{B}{B}：将锐鞭变械人从你的坟墓场移回战场，且上面有一个+1/+1指示物。如果任一对手操控四个或更多非基本地，则此异能减少{4}来起动。', 'type': '神器生物 ～灵俑', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586024&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '167c3ae6-edbe-42e9-9e8d-a4cb80d73a25', 'multiverseId': 586024}, 'multiverseid': 586024}]", '[{\'name\': \'Klingenwindungsschlange\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Klingenwindungsschlange ins Spiel kommt, ziehe für jedes {U}{U}, das ausgegeben wurde, um sie zu wirken, eine Karte.\\nWenn die Klingenwindungsschlange ins Spiel kommt, wirft jeder Gegner für jedes {B}{B}, das ausgegeben wurde, um sie zu wirken, eine Karte ab.\\nWenn die Klingenwindungsschlange ins Spiel kommt, erhält sie bis zum Ende des Zuges Eile, Trampelschaden und +1/+0 für jedes {R}{R}, das ausgegeben wurde, um sie zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Schlange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584071&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2452a7dc-8ccf-4a9a-a50a-1919fc6ac6fd\', \'multiverseId\': 584071}, \'multiverseid\': 584071}, {\'name\': \'Serpiente filoespiral\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Serpiente filoespiral entre al campo de batalla, por cada {U}{U} usados para lanzarla, roba una carta.\\nCuando la Serpiente filoespiral entre al campo de batalla, por cada {B}{B} usados para lanzarla, cada oponente descarta una carta.\\nCuando la Serpiente filoespiral entre al campo de batalla, por cada {R}{R} usados para lanzarla, obtiene +1/+0 y gana las habilidades de arrollar y prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Serpiente\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a039a09f-701d-493d-ae10-2111e48c7360\', \'multiverseId\': 584332}, \'multiverseid\': 584332}, {\'name\': \'Serpent aux annelures tranchantes\', \'text\': "Quand le Serpent aux annelures tranchantes arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque {U}{U} dépensé pour le lancer, piochez une carte.\\nQuand le Serpent aux annelures tranchantes arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque {B}{B} dépensé pour le lancer, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.\\nQuand le Serpent aux annelures tranchantes arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque {R}{R} dépensé pour le lancer, il gagne +1/+0 et acquiert le piétinement et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : grand serpent\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584593&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62e7ddd0-f7c0-4648-8810-48e4a90a785c\', \'multiverseId\': 584593}, \'multiverseid\': 584593}, {\'name\': \'Serpe Spiralama\', \'text\': \'Quando la Serpe Spiralama entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni {U}{U} spesi per lanciarla, pesca una carta.\\nQuando la Serpe Spiralama entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni {B}{B} spesi per lanciarla, ogni avversario scarta una carta.\\nQuando la Serpe Spiralama entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni {R}{R} spesi per lanciarla, prende +1/+0 e ha travolgere e rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Serpe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed0c31c2-c7ad-42ed-8603-58502a1e89a4\', \'multiverseId\': 584854}, \'multiverseid\': 584854}, {\'name\': \'刃とぐろの蛇\', \'text\': \'刃とぐろの蛇が戦場に出たとき、これを唱えるために支払われた{U}{U}につき１枚のカードを引く。\\n刃とぐろの蛇が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれ、これを唱えるために支払われた{B}{B}につき１枚のカードを捨てる。\\n刃とぐろの蛇が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、これは、これを唱えるために支払われた{R}{R}につき＋１/＋０の修整を受け、トランプルと速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 海蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cf6e654-851d-496d-b70e-91ee9c281e20\', \'multiverseId\': 585115}, \'multiverseid\': 585115}, {\'name\': \'Serpente Espiralâmina\', \'text\': \'Quando Serpente Espiralâmina entrar no campo de batalha, para cada {U}{U} gastos para conjurá-la, compre um card.\\nQuando Serpente Espiralâmina entra no campo de batalha, para cada {B}{B} gastos para conjurá-la, cada oponente descarta um card.\\nQuando Serpente Espiralâmina entra no campo de batalha, para cada {R}{R} gastos para conjurá-la, ela recebe +1/+0 e ganha atropelar e ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Serpente\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9163a939-ffcc-48ed-b775-b455cfb1447a\', \'multiverseId\': 585376}, \'multiverseid\': 585376}, {\'name\': \'蜷刃巨蛇\', \'text\': \'当蜷刃巨蛇进战场时，施放它时每支付过一份{U}{U}，便抓一张牌。\\n当蜷刃巨蛇进战场时，施放它时每支付过一份{B}{B}，每位对手便各弃一张牌。\\n当蜷刃巨蛇进战场时，施放它时每支付过一份{R}{R}，直到回合结束，它便得+1/+0且获得践踏与敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～巨蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d463b2c1-6def-4347-92d2-63c4f23a19c3\', \'multiverseId\': 585637}, \'multiverseid\': 585637}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klingenwindungsschlange\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Klingenwindungsschlange ins Spiel kommt, ziehe für jedes {U}{U}, das ausgegeben wurde, um sie zu wirken, eine Karte.\\nWenn die Klingenwindungsschlange ins Spiel kommt, wirft jeder Gegner für jedes {B}{B}, das ausgegeben wurde, um sie zu wirken, eine Karte ab.\\nWenn die Klingenwindungsschlange ins Spiel kommt, erhält sie bis zum Ende des Zuges Eile, Trampelschaden und +1/+0 für jedes {R}{R}, das ausgegeben wurde, um sie zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Schlange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585836&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02228520-cb71-4a97-846f-5ef3de472f58\', \'multiverseId\': 585836}, \'multiverseid\': 585836}, {\'name\': \'Serpent aux annelures tranchantes\', \'text\': "Quand le Serpent aux annelures tranchantes arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque {U}{U} dépensé pour le lancer, piochez une carte.\\nQuand le Serpent aux annelures tranchantes arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque {B}{B} dépensé pour le lancer, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.\\nQuand le Serpent aux annelures tranchantes arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque {R}{R} dépensé pour le lancer, il gagne +1/+0 et acquiert le piétinement et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : grand serpent\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e265b91-4aa3-4f08-8115-ce876ff60f3c\', \'multiverseId\': 585908}, \'multiverseid\': 585908}, {\'name\': \'刃とぐろの蛇\', \'text\': \'刃とぐろの蛇が戦場に出たとき、これを唱えるために支払われた{U}{U}につき１枚のカードを引く。\\n刃とぐろの蛇が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれ、これを唱えるために支払われた{B}{B}につき１枚のカードを捨てる。\\n刃とぐろの蛇が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、これは、これを唱えるために支払われた{R}{R}につき＋１/＋０の修整を受け、トランプルと速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 海蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0323a2dc-397f-418f-82c4-b8609c0ac9a7\', \'multiverseId\': 585980}, \'multiverseid\': 585980}, {\'name\': \'蜷刃巨蛇\', \'text\': \'当蜷刃巨蛇进战场时，施放它时每支付过一份{U}{U}，便抓一张牌。\\n当蜷刃巨蛇进战场时，施放它时每支付过一份{B}{B}，每位对手便各弃一张牌。\\n当蜷刃巨蛇进战场时，施放它时每支付过一份{R}{R}，直到回合结束，它便得+1/+0且获得践踏与敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～巨蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82993770-1434-48c5-936c-74fed7fec615\', \'multiverseId\': 586052}, \'multiverseid\': 586052}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kloster-Flinkspeer\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nBravour (Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'Sie fokussierte ihren Geist auf die Wut des Vulkans, bis ihre eigene aus ihr herausbrach.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3e0f8fa-dec5-49f6-8ead-523c3ed44f6e\', \'multiverseId\': 583990}, \'multiverseid\': 583990}, {\'name\': \'Lanzaveloz del monasterio\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nDestreza. (Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': \'Se centró en la furia del volcán y la suya emergió por igual.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d032e68c-40ad-47cd-9fd2-b01fc8b72519\', \'multiverseId\': 584251}, \'multiverseid\': 584251}, {\'name\': \'Vive-lance du monastère\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nProuesse (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': \'Elle concentra son esprit sur la furie du volcan, et sa furie explosa à son tour.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584512&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d150523-6a37-4c45-a1c7-29057d562120\', \'multiverseId\': 584512}, \'multiverseid\': 584512}, {\'name\': \'Lanciarapida del Monastero\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nProdezza (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, questa creatura prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Concentrò la sua mente sulla furia del vulcano e la sua eruttò con altrettanta violenza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'145f24f4-f6e7-465f-991b-1fb32b032590\', \'multiverseId\': 584773}, \'multiverseid\': 584773}, {\'name\': \'僧院の速槍\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は怒る火山に心を凝らす。そして同じように怒りを噴火させた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d11777e9-8f90-4241-a990-583f483f8044\', \'multiverseId\': 585034}, \'multiverseid\': 585034}, {\'name\': \'Lança Veloz do Monastério\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nDestreza (Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica não de criatura, esta criatura recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Monge\', \'flavor\': \'Ela concentrou sua mente na fúria do vulcão e, como ele, entrou em erupção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771bcca4-db1e-44f1-bbb0-d6006c09efef\', \'multiverseId\': 585295}, \'multiverseid\': 585295}, {\'name\': \'寺院迅矛僧\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n灵技（每当你施放非生物咒语时，此生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'她将精神全数专注在火山怒火上，并爆发同等烈焰回报。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f047832-7522-4f70-84fa-c723f093134f\', \'multiverseId\': 585556}, \'multiverseid\': 585556}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knorrwurzel-Leichenträger\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Knorrwurzel-Leichenträger ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Die Flammen verschlangen die meisten Baumhirten Argoths. Die Rachsucht verschlang den Rest.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584029&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4455cf27-a87d-48c7-9322-cb3d982dd06c\', \'multiverseId\': 584029}, \'multiverseid\': 584029}, {\'name\': \'Portador torcerraíz\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Portador torcerraíz entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': \'Las llamas de la guerra consumieron a casi todo el pueblo arbóreo de Argoth. La venganza consumió al resto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'329a11bb-8c26-43d9-85a9-15ffb3cebc94\', \'multiverseId\': 584290}, \'multiverseid\': 584290}, {\'name\': \'Porteur funéraire noueracine\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand le Porteur funéraire noueracine arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : sylvin et druide\', \'flavor\': "Les flammes de la guerre consumèrent une grande partie de la population sylvine d\'Argoth. La vengeance consuma le reste.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584551&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09abfb26-f6ad-4c65-b1d6-5eca01c21163\', \'multiverseId\': 584551}, \'multiverseid\': 584551}, {\'name\': \'Portasalme delle Radici Nodose\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando il Portasalme delle Radici Nodose entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': \'Le fiamme della guerra consumarono la maggior parte dei silvantropi di Argoth. La vendetta consumò quelli che erano sopravvissuti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8700bb4d-48c6-448a-8ed6-0c2b152c2e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 584812}, \'multiverseid\': 584812}, {\'name\': \'節くれ根の棺担ぎ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n節くれ根の棺担ぎが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'戦いの炎に、アルゴスのツリーフォークのほとんどが焼き尽くされた。生き残った者たちもまた炎と燃え盛った。復讐の炎に。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4999dd4c-db75-4539-b227-37ce2fc458bd\', \'multiverseId\': 585073}, \'multiverseid\': 585073}, {\'name\': \'Radinodo Porta-mortalha\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Radinodo Porta-mortalha entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X o número de cards de criatura em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ent Druida\', \'flavor\': \'As chamas da guerra consumiram a maioria dos ents de Argoth. A vingança consumiu os restantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db51d976-6584-4e71-9a60-b378f873a762\', \'multiverseId\': 585334}, \'multiverseid\': 585334}, {\'name\': \'虬根护柩木\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当虬根护柩木进战场时，目标生物得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为你坟墓场中的生物牌数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～树妖／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'亚格斯的树灵大多数都遭战争火焰吞噬。幸存的则被复仇怒火吞噬。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'690409b1-6422-44b8-b10b-34d3c8778fbc\', \'multiverseId\': 585595}, \'multiverseid\': 585595}]', '[{\'name\': \'Koilos-Roc\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Koilos-Roc ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583901&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b44f86f7-c752-4cab-a241-fcb06165ab14\', \'multiverseId\': 583901}, \'multiverseid\': 583901}, {\'name\': \'Roc de Koilos\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Roc de Koilos entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1363208-cde5-4e2a-bac0-0f55c4e6c9be\', \'multiverseId\': 584162}, \'multiverseid\': 584162}, {\'name\': \'Rokh de Koïlos\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nQuand le Rokh de Koïlos arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584423&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51f59ea4-e976-4877-9bba-7fff67f80f28\', \'multiverseId\': 584423}, \'multiverseid\': 584423}, {\'name\': \'Roc di Koilos\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\nQuando il Roc di Koilos entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb450dea-e61f-4cb5-ac44-fe1c4976580e\', \'multiverseId\': 584684}, \'multiverseid\': 584684}, {\'name\': \'コイロスのロック鳥\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\nコイロスのロック鳥が戦場に出たとき、パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f67e385-4a37-4ed7-ba88-e032fbe45b1b\', \'multiverseId\': 584945}, \'multiverseid\': 584945}, {\'name\': \'Roca de Koilos\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVoar\\nQuando Roca de Koilos entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e0080b1-5ce2-4b08-ba99-0cdab57ddc50\', \'multiverseId\': 585206}, \'multiverseid\': 585206}, {\'name\': \'喀洛斯洛克鸟\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n当喀洛斯洛克鸟进战场时，派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7221e30-e859-4742-93a2-266b8d026aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 585467}, \'multiverseid\': 585467}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kolonnenverteiler\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du zwei oder mehr andere Kreaturen kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{3}{W}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\nExhumieren {2}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Hörst du dieses Stampfen und Scheppern? Wir sind gerettet."\\n—Ani, Urzanischer Soldat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583882&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14d181a7-3738-4e67-a059-1582262d94fb\', \'multiverseId\': 583882}, \'multiverseid\': 583882}, {\'name\': \'Distribuidor de pelotones\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si controlas dos o más otras criaturas, roba una carta.\\n{3}{W}: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Soldado incolora 1/1.\\nDesenterrar {2}{W}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Oyes ese pum, clanc, pum, clanc? Estamos salvados".\\n—Ani, soldado de Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83f5c6fe-081b-4329-ab2c-bca2a4e80c63\', \'multiverseId\': 584143}, \'multiverseid\': 584143}, {\'name\': \'Distributeur de régiments\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous contrôlez au moins deux autres créatures, piochez une carte.\\n{3}{W} : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.\\nExhumation {2}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "« Vous entendez ce bruit mécanique ? Nous sommes sauvés. »\\n—Ani, soldat d\'Urza", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584404&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a318bcb5-5f58-4a84-8f51-45c19d7ebd12\', \'multiverseId\': 584404}, \'multiverseid\': 584404}, {\'name\': \'Erogatore del Plotone\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se controlli due o più altre creature, pesca una carta.\\n{3}{W}: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Soldato 1/1 incolore.\\nDissotterrare {2}{W}{W}", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Senti quello sferragliare? Siamo salvi."\\n—Ani, soldato di Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f20d1c25-f0cd-4bd9-91f2-e37dff187be3\', \'multiverseId\': 584665}, \'multiverseid\': 584665}, {\'name\': \'小隊分配機\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがこれでない２体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、カード１枚を引く。\\n{3}{W}：無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n蘇生 {2}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「あの、ドスドスガチャガチャって音が聞こえるか？俺たち、助かったぞ。」\\n――ウルザの兵士、アニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe86d54-949f-486e-944b-6bddcf9b130d\', \'multiverseId\': 584926}, \'multiverseid\': 584926}, {\'name\': \'Distribuidor de Pelotões\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se você controlar duas ou mais outras criaturas, compre um card.\\n{3}{W}: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Soldado incolor 1/1.\\nDesenterrar {2}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ouviu esse tum-clenc, tum-clenc? Estamos salvos."\\n— Ani, soldado de Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c74c24-e286-476a-9285-10878918a8a7\', \'multiverseId\': 585187}, \'multiverseid\': 585187}, {\'name\': \'兵员配置械\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若你操控两个或更多其他生物，则抓一张牌。\\n{3}{W}：派出一个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\\n破坟{2}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「听到那咔嚓、咔嚓的声音没？我们得救了。」\\n～克撒军士兵亚尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e597308c-a548-4c3d-a9b2-12cf238e000a\', \'multiverseId\': 585448}, \'multiverseid\': 585448}]', "[{'name': 'Kolonnenverteiler', 'text': 'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du zwei oder mehr andere Kreaturen kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{3}{W}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\nExhumieren {2}{W}{W}', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585785&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be8e7f16-63b2-4624-b323-724ac8a02c98', 'multiverseId': 585785}, 'multiverseid': 585785}, {'name': 'Distributeur de régiments', 'text': 'Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous contrôlez au moins deux autres créatures, piochez une carte.\\n{3}{W} : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.\\nExhumation {2}{W}{W}', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585857&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '375be3b9-a09b-4120-8476-1c73b5a3d840', 'multiverseId': 585857}, 'multiverseid': 585857}, {'name': '小隊分配機', 'text': 'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがこれでない２体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、カード１枚を引く。\\n{3}{W}：無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n蘇生 {2}{W}{W}', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585929&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6464ff9-6e08-4b75-bcb2-02d677053a98', 'multiverseId': 585929}, 'multiverseid': 585929}, {'name': '兵员配置械', 'text': '在你的结束步骤开始时，若你操控两个或更多其他生物，则抓一张牌。\\n{3}{W}：派出一个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\\n破坟{2}{W}{W}', 'type': '神器生物 ～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586001&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c79b170c-8239-4c46-bd97-17d08c5d06e2', 'multiverseId': 586001}, 'multiverseid': 586001}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kolossaler Körperwandler\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Kolossalen Körperwandler als Kopie eines Artefakts oder einer Kreatur, das bzw. die du kontrollierst, ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine Artefaktkreatur ist und seine Stärke und Widerstandskraft gleich der Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Kolossalen Körperwandlers sind.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{U}{U}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d086604a-26f5-414d-9d43-3f513e52fc7d\', \'multiverseId\': 583925}, \'multiverseid\': 583925}, {\'name\': \'Metamorfo corpulento\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Metamorfo corpulento entre al campo de batalla como una copia de un artefacto o criatura que controlas, excepto que es una criatura artefacto además de sus otros tipos y su fuerza y resistencia son iguales a la fuerza y la resistencia del Metamorfo corpulento.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{U}{U}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a12931a6-218b-4c93-b13d-892231e034a8\', \'multiverseId\': 584186}, \'multiverseid\': 584186}, {\'name\': \'Métamorphe imposant\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que le Métamorphe imposant arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie d\'un artefact ou d\'une créature que vous contrôlez, excepté que c\'est une créature-artefact en plus de ses autres types, et que sa force et son endurance sont égales à la force et à l\'endurance du Métamorphe imposant.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{U}{U}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n3/3", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a21e80a0-d88f-4b69-b9a3-0a44b1c2babc\', \'multiverseId\': 584447}, \'multiverseid\': 584447}, {\'name\': \'Metamorfo Massiccio\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare il Metamorfo Massiccio nel campo di battaglia come una copia di un artefatto o di una creatura che controlli, tranne che è una creatura artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e la sua forza e la sua costituzione sono pari alla forza e alla costituzione del Metamorfo Massiccio.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{U}{U}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f4d388-25b3-45e9-b34e-ea47b202328a\', \'multiverseId\': 584708}, \'multiverseid\': 584708}, {\'name\': \'巨体変異\', \'text\': \'あなたは巨体変異を、他のタイプに加えてアーティファクト・クリーチャーであり、パワーとタフネスが巨体変異のパワーとタフネスに等しいことを除き、アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうちあなたがコントロールしている１つのコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{U}{U}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n３/３\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b7cb4dd-c405-48f2-9a3a-23661d2a7c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 584969}, \'multiverseid\': 584969}, {\'name\': \'Metamorfo Corpulento\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Metamorfo Corpulento entre no campo de batalha como uma cópia de um artefato ou criatura que você controla, exceto por ser uma criatura artefato além de seus outros tipos e seu poder e sua resistência serem iguais ao poder e à resistência de Metamorfo Corpulento.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{U}{U}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'479ae136-949a-445c-88e6-ed1ab39330ac\', \'multiverseId\': 585230}, \'multiverseid\': 585230}, {\'name\': \'巨型原身械\', \'text\': \'你可以使巨型原身械当成任一由你操控之神器或生物的复制品来进入战场，但它额外是神器生物，且其力量和防御力各等同于巨型原身械的力量和防御力。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{2}{U}{U}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n3/3\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7060e97e-c893-4755-8bd1-da0213941bd5\', \'multiverseId\': 585491}, \'multiverseid\': 585491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Korruption\', \'text\': \'Die Korruption fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Sümpfe kontrollierst. Du erhältst so viele Lebenspunkte dazu, wie auf diese Weise Schadenspunkte zugefügt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Oh, weisester, umsichtigster, mächtigster Qadir", sprach der Gixianer, „wir werden deine Ziele mit aller Kraft unterstützen und in deinem Namen handeln."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db1da716-b0ac-42ac-aaf7-a885138c31f8\', \'multiverseId\': 583934}, \'multiverseid\': 583934}, {\'name\': \'Corromper\', \'text\': \'Corromper hace una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual a la cantidad de Pantanos que controlas. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual al daño hecho de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sabio, inteligentísimo y poderosísimo qadir", dijo el enviado de Gix, "le ofrecemos cualquier ayuda que podamos brindar en su ilustrísimo nombre".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b87705f-0ed9-4126-ad4c-07aba4de323c\', \'multiverseId\': 584195}, \'multiverseid\': 584195}, {\'name\': \'Corruption\', \'text\': "La Corruption inflige à n\'importe quelle cible un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de marais que vous contrôlez. Vous gagnez autant de points de vie que de blessures infligées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Sagissime, grandissime qadir, dit le Gixien, nous t\'offrons de t\'aider en ton illustrissime nom. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00af8655-e5e4-4405-83a0-e37b4d9ce9b1\', \'multiverseId\': 584456}, \'multiverseid\': 584456}, {\'name\': \'Corrompere\', \'text\': \'Corrompere infligge danno pari al numero di Paludi che controlli a un qualsiasi bersaglio. Guadagni punti vita pari ai danni inflitti in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Saggio, generoso e potente qadir" disse la gixiana, "offriamo tutto l\\\'aiuto di cui siamo capaci nel tuo illustre nome."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40409d91-bfac-480a-9146-a1be761c75f1\', \'multiverseId\': 584717}, \'multiverseid\': 584717}, {\'name\': \'堕落\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。堕落はそれに、あなたがコントロールしている沼の数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。あなたはこれにより与えたダメージに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「最も博識にして、最も思慮深く、そして最も強大なる長王よ。」とギックスの信奉者たちは言った。「あなたさまの輝かしい御名に、我ら力の限りお応えしましょうぞ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77a3bde4-04c0-43ca-81b8-478ea9df9a6e\', \'multiverseId\': 584978}, \'multiverseid\': 584978}, {\'name\': \'Corromper\', \'text\': \'Corromper causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de Pântanos que você controla a qualquer alvo. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao dano causado desta maneira.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Ó, mais sábio, ponderado e poderoso qadir," disse a gixiana, "oferecemos toda ajuda que pudermos em vosso ilustre nome."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc92bac5-203b-4e5e-985f-705b669b54df\', \'multiverseId\': 585239}, \'multiverseid\': 585239}, {\'name\': \'腐化\', \'text\': \'腐化对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的沼泽数量。你获得等同于以此法所造成的伤害之生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「最睿智，最博学，最伟大的族长，」基克斯派教徒说道，「承您盛名，我们会献上您要的任何助力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aebad522-636d-443f-91bc-b21aba161b24\', \'multiverseId\': 585500}, \'multiverseid\': 585500}]', '[{\'name\': \'Korruption\', \'text\': \'Die Korruption fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Sümpfe kontrollierst. Du erhältst so viele Lebenspunkte dazu, wie auf diese Weise Schadenspunkte zugefügt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Oh, weisester, umsichtigster, mächtigster Qadir", sprach der Gixianer, „wir werden deine Ziele mit aller Kraft unterstützen und in deinem Namen handeln."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586315&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b616cc7f-31e7-4337-afbb-5b24aa5b1334\', \'multiverseId\': 586315}, \'multiverseid\': 586315}, {\'name\': \'Corromper\', \'text\': \'Corromper hace una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual a la cantidad de Pantanos que controlas. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual al daño hecho de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sabio, inteligentísimo y poderosísimo qadir", dijo el enviado de Gix, "le ofrecemos cualquier ayuda que podamos brindar en su ilustrísimo nombre".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c9971f1-b289-4601-a250-dd4baa0fe1e1\', \'multiverseId\': 586320}, \'multiverseid\': 586320}, {\'name\': \'Corruption\', \'text\': "La Corruption inflige à n\'importe quelle cible un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de marais que vous contrôlez. Vous gagnez autant de points de vie que de blessures infligées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Sagissime, grandissime qadir, dit le Gixien, nous t\'offrons de t\'aider en ton illustrissime nom. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586325&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98047622-82d7-4ef9-b282-9ddd74087e19\', \'multiverseId\': 586325}, \'multiverseid\': 586325}, {\'name\': \'Corrompere\', \'text\': \'Corrompere infligge danno pari al numero di Paludi che controlli a un qualsiasi bersaglio. Guadagni punti vita pari ai danni inflitti in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Saggio, generoso e potente qadir" disse la gixiana, "offriamo tutto l\\\'aiuto di cui siamo capaci nel tuo illustre nome."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87bfbfd9-bf67-463c-afb7-d4756b4523d9\', \'multiverseId\': 586330}, \'multiverseid\': 586330}, {\'name\': \'堕落\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。堕落はそれに、あなたがコントロールしている沼の数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。あなたはこれにより与えたダメージに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「最も博識にして、最も思慮深く、そして最も強大なる長王よ。」とギックスの信奉者たちは言った。「あなたさまの輝かしい御名に、我ら力の限りお応えしましょうぞ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e44c352-a42f-42a5-b97f-7ece79020ea2\', \'multiverseId\': 586335}, \'multiverseid\': 586335}, {\'name\': \'Corromper\', \'text\': \'Corromper causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de Pântanos que você controla a qualquer alvo. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao dano causado desta maneira.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Ó, mais sábio, ponderado e poderoso qadir," disse a gixiana, "oferecemos toda ajuda que pudermos em vosso ilustre nome."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8662a138-4792-4d57-ac0d-76c5353a40bc\', \'multiverseId\': 586345}, \'multiverseid\': 586345}, {\'name\': \'腐化\', \'text\': \'腐化对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的沼泽数量。你获得等同于以此法所造成的伤害之生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「最睿智，最博学，最伟大的族长，」基克斯派教徒说道，「承您盛名，我们会献上您要的任何助力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6cd46b5-4664-499e-8939-c22e3e547e82\', \'multiverseId\': 586350}, \'multiverseid\': 586350}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krabbelstrahl-Bataillon\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nWenn das Krabbelstrahl-Bataillon ins Spiel kommt und falls du es gewirkt hast, erzeuge zwei Spielsteine, die Kopien von ihm sind.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n2/2\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584010&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36da98ee-706d-4bae-8979-f0b06db76343\', \'multiverseId\': 584010}, \'multiverseid\': 584010}, {\'name\': \'Batallón de rayoartrópodos\', \'text\': \'Arrolla, prisa.\\nCuando el Batallón de rayoartrópodos entre al campo de batalla, si lo lanzaste, crea dos fichas que son copias de él.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\nPrototipo. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo con un coste de maná, color y tamaño distintos. Sus habilidades y tipos no cambian.)\\n2/2\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d1e34a-da2f-4b93-8204-3be8440f4b9f\', \'multiverseId\': 584271}, \'multiverseid\': 584271}, {\'name\': \'Bataillon ramperayon\', \'text\': "Piétinement, célérité\\nQuand le Bataillon ramperayon arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, créez deux jetons qui en sont des copies.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n2/2", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584532&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b87827-5f4c-48d0-95b7-b98eea712026\', \'multiverseId\': 584532}, \'multiverseid\': 584532}, {\'name\': \'Battaglione Brulicoraggio\', \'text\': \'Travolgere, rapidità\\nQuando il Battaglione Brulicoraggio entra nel campo di battaglia, se lo hai lanciato, crea due pedine che sono sue copie.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\nPrototipo (Puoi lanciare questa magia con costo di mana, colore e dimensione diversi. Mantiene le sue abilità e i suoi tipi.)\\n2/2\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ee8faa-e8bb-4431-945d-864fe7865ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 584793}, \'multiverseid\': 584793}, {\'name\': \'瞬足光線の大隊\', \'text\': \'トランプル、速攻\\n瞬足光線の大隊が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、これのコピーであるトークン２つを生成する。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n２/２\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf2744de-882e-455c-b204-a3afc6a9adbe\', \'multiverseId\': 585054}, \'multiverseid\': 585054}, {\'name\': \'Batalhão de Raios Artrópodes\', \'text\': \'Atropelar, ímpeto\\nQuando Batalhão de Raios Artrópodes entrar no campo de batalha, se você o tiver conjurado, crie duas fichas que sejam cópias dele.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\nProtótipo (Você pode conjurar esta mágica com custo de mana, cor e tamanho diferentes. Ela permanece com suas habilidades e tipos.)\\n2/2\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b44e05c3-3153-4105-9f94-63a24335daa7\', \'multiverseId\': 585315}, \'multiverseid\': 585315}, {\'name\': \'掠束大队\', \'text\': \'践踏，敏捷\\n当掠束大队进战场时，若它经你施放，则派出两个为其复制品的衍生物。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n2/2\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f3267a4-e042-4356-ab24-5c5f86531673\', \'multiverseId\': 585576}, \'multiverseid\': 585576}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krabbelstrahl-Bataillon\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nWenn das Krabbelstrahl-Bataillon ins Spiel kommt und falls du es gewirkt hast, erzeuge zwei Spielsteine, die Kopien von ihm sind.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\nPrototyp (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch mit anderen Manakosten, Farben und anderer Größe wirken. Er behält seine Fähigkeiten und Typen.)\\n2/2\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585818&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e96dd17-863d-4a29-90a6-9d400355db53\', \'multiverseId\': 585818}, \'multiverseid\': 585818}, {\'name\': \'Bataillon ramperayon\', \'text\': "Piétinement, célérité\\nQuand le Bataillon ramperayon arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, créez deux jetons qui en sont des copies.\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\nPrototype (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort avec un coût de mana, une couleur et une taille différents. Il garde ses capacités et ses types.)\\n2/2", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585890&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'191a92f4-d7d0-4580-a13d-d68731e4bfe0\', \'multiverseId\': 585890}, \'multiverseid\': 585890}, {\'name\': \'瞬足光線の大隊\', \'text\': \'トランプル、速攻\\n瞬足光線の大隊が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、これのコピーであるトークン２つを生成する。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\n試作（あなたはこの呪文を、異なるマナ・コスト、色、サイズで唱えてもよい。これは能力とタイプを保持する。）\\n２/２\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36a95ae9-834e-444a-99b0-b93218534296\', \'multiverseId\': 585962}, \'multiverseid\': 585962}, {\'name\': \'掠束大队\', \'text\': \'践踏，敏捷\\n当掠束大队进战场时，若它经你施放，则派出两个为其复制品的衍生物。\\n//PRT-Prototype_Mech//\\n{3}{R}{R}\\n试作（你施放此咒语时可选不同法术力费用、颜色和攻防的版本，其异能与类别不变。）\\n2/2\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b8266b-1f40-41cc-b282-42cca901d19b\', \'multiverseId\': 586034}, \'multiverseid\': 586034}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraftklinge des Veteranen\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0.\\nAusrüsten eines Soldaten {W}\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583887&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df4f4214-164f-4c6a-b3b5-4fc00480ed65\', \'multiverseId\': 583887}, \'multiverseid\': 583887}, {\'name\': \'Espada de poder de la veterana\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0.\\nEquipar Soldado {W}.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33d67d26-4214-4bc9-9f94-9e312f70dc24\', \'multiverseId\': 584148}, \'multiverseid\': 584148}, {\'name\': \'Forcelame de vétéran\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+0.\\nÉquipement de soldat {W}\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584409&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef0ef0b5-d915-4df0-b70a-505f743effdf\', \'multiverseId\': 584409}, \'multiverseid\': 584409}, {\'name\': \'Lama Potenziata del Veterano\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0.\\nEquipaggia Soldato {W}\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1020c9-5c88-4f05-9338-7bdce4c2bebb\', \'multiverseId\': 584670}, \'multiverseid\': 584670}, {\'name\': \'古参兵の魔力刃\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n兵士に装備 {W}\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23ef2a0d-c508-4af4-bc6a-777bc7a49dee\', \'multiverseId\': 584931}, \'multiverseid\': 584931}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina de Energia do Veterano\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+0.\\nEquipar Soldado {W}\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'857fccdd-a31f-4ea9-8ca0-178be8a29b01\', \'multiverseId\': 585192}, \'multiverseid\': 585192}, {\'name\': \'老兵的魔力剑\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n佩带士兵{W}\\n佩带{2}（{2}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03e1743-29b3-4f75-8893-449b150b9feb\', \'multiverseId\': 585453}, \'multiverseid\': 585453}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraftstein-Fraktur\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nZerstöre eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Bewegung! Wenn der Kraftstein in die Luft fliegt, wird dieser Koloss nichts als ein weiteres Loch im Boden sein."\\n—Ashnod, zu Hajar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8fc2446-0c52-47b8-851c-1267d39dc0f9\', \'multiverseId\': 583958}, \'multiverseid\': 583958}, {\'name\': \'Fractura de la piedra de poder\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica un artefacto o criatura.\\nDestruye la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Apártate! Cuando la piedra de poder estalle, esa mole solo será un agujero en el suelo".\\n—Ashnod, a Hajar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a455e0ef-9b7a-4cd7-ae48-d738bd8e0bf5\', \'multiverseId\': 584219}, \'multiverseid\': 584219}, {\'name\': \'Fracture de lithoforce\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez un artefact ou une créature.\\nDétruisez une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Courez ! Quand la lithoforce explosera, ce béhémoth ne sera plus qu\'un cratère dans le sol. »\\n—Ashnod, à Hajar", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584480&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40de1882-048c-4cf7-aa7f-392cbf7027d3\', \'multiverseId\': 584480}, \'multiverseid\': 584480}, {\'name\': \'Frattura della Pietra del Potere\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica un artefatto o una creatura.\\nDistruggi una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Corri! Quando la pietra del potere salterà in aria, di quel behemoth non resterà che una buca nel terreno."\\n—Ashnod ad Hajar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a413ad29-2ea0-4a44-a1e3-60e1b907dc6b\', \'multiverseId\': 584741}, \'multiverseid\': 584741}, {\'name\': \'パワーストーン破砕\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち１つを生け贄に捧げる。\\nクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「退避して！パワーストーンが爆発したら、ビヒモスは消し飛ばされて地面に大穴が空くわ。」\\n――アシュノッドからハジャールへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26908911-4496-439b-bb07-6b59492a2276\', \'multiverseId\': 585002}, \'multiverseid\': 585002}, {\'name\': \'Fratura na Pedra de Energia\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique um artefato ou uma criatura.\\nDestrua a criatura ou o planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Anda! Quando a pedra de energia explodir, aquele monstrengo não vai passar de um buraco no chão."\\n— Ashnod, para Hajar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7257e91-5bd4-4935-aa56-973eff6a80aa\', \'multiverseId\': 585263}, \'multiverseid\': 585263}, {\'name\': \'魔力石破裂\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个神器或生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n消灭目标生物或鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「快跑！魔力石一旦爆炸，就连那尊庞然大物都会只剩地面巨坑。」\\n～阿士诺提醒哈札\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8e59107-69f1-44ff-9101-5c2039357aa9\', \'multiverseId\': 585524}, \'multiverseid\': 585524}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraftstein-Ingenieur\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Kraftstein-Ingenieur stirbt, erzeuge einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Problem gefunden: Das Resonanzleck senkt die Leistung um dreißig Prozent. Ich werde es kitten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583866&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0678493-ba2d-4231-a414-7a72430a941d\', \'multiverseId\': 583866}, \'multiverseid\': 583866}, {\'name\': \'Ingeniero de piedras de poder\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ingeniero de piedras de poder muera, crea una ficha de Piedra de poder girada. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Bueno, aquí está el problema... Las fugas de resonancia reducen la producción en un treinta por ciento. Pero puedo arreglarlo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbbd74d8-ab26-4a37-a21a-0969d614b383\', \'multiverseId\': 584127}, \'multiverseid\': 584127}, {\'name\': \'Ingénieur de lithoforce\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Ingénieur de lithoforce meurt, créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Voilà d\'où vient le problème. Une fuite de résonance qui réduit le rendement de trente pour cent. Je devrais pouvoir réparer ça. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584388&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2cbcb24-d007-4550-b370-bc5379ee3f66\', \'multiverseId\': 584388}, \'multiverseid\': 584388}, {\'name\': \'Ingegnere della Pietra del Potere\', \'text\': \'Quando l\\\'Ingegnere della Pietra del Potere muore, crea una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ecco qual è il problema: una perdita di risonanza sta diminuendo la produzione del 30%. Posso metterci una pezza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de5c9a3d-1da5-4226-a8c5-873da875c4ce\', \'multiverseId\': 584649}, \'multiverseid\': 584649}, {\'name\': \'パワーストーン技師\', \'text\': \'パワーストーン技師が死亡したとき、パワーストーン・トークン１つをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「問題はここだ。共振漏で出力が３０％低下している。私なら直せる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a43cc51-9aa3-48de-93cf-ac1fc5c9aa47\', \'multiverseId\': 584910}, \'multiverseid\': 584910}, {\'name\': \'Engenheiro de Pedra de Energia\', \'text\': \'Quando Engenheiro de Pedra de Energia morrer, crie uma ficha de Pedra de Energia virada. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}: Adicione {C}. Este mana não pode ser gasto para conjurar uma mágica não de artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Bem, o seu problema tá ali: um escape de ressonância que diminui a saída em trinta por cento. Eu consigo dar um jeito."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d2f857-71a5-4d3b-a8bb-762df48e3661\', \'multiverseId\': 585171}, \'multiverseid\': 585171}, {\'name\': \'魔力石工程师\', \'text\': \'当魔力石工程师死去时，派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。（它是具有「{T}：加{C}。此法术力不能用来施放非神器咒语」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「你的问题出在这～共振泄漏损失了百分之三十的输出。我能修好。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df697e1-73bd-4695-8cdf-4636862e24f1\', \'multiverseId\': 585432}, \'multiverseid\': 585432}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraftwerksarbeiter\', \'text\': \'{3}: Der Kraftwerksarbeiter erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls du Kreaturen namens Bergwerksarbeiter und Turmarbeiter kontrollierst, lege stattdessen zwei +1/+1-Marken auf den Kraftwerksarbeiter. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter\', \'flavor\': \'Die mechanischen Arbeiter schufteten unermüdlich auf das Unmögliche hin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584082&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e59bac37-f5d3-4c3a-867f-ac656ef8b557\', \'multiverseId\': 584082}, \'multiverseid\': 584082}, {\'name\': \'Operario de la central de energía\', \'text\': \'{3}: El Operario de la central de energía obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno. Si controlas criaturas llamadas Operario de la mina y Operario de la torre, en vez de eso, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el Operario de la central de energía. Activa esto solo una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Operario\', \'flavor\': \'Los operarios mecánicos trabajaban incansables para alimentar lo imposible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f61bf3-e7b0-40c3-a879-6acb7fab99a4\', \'multiverseId\': 584343}, \'multiverseid\': 584343}, {\'name\': \'Ouvrier de la centrale énergétique\', \'text\': "{3} : L\'Ouvrier de la centrale énergétique gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si vous contrôlez des créatures appelées Ouvrier de la mine et Ouvrier de la tour, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Ouvrier de la centrale énergétique à la place. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ouvrier spécialisé\', \'flavor\': "Les ouvriers mécaniques ne cessaient de travailler, fabriquant sans relâche l\'impossible.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584604&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'224e849a-0535-4aba-9ace-8c031e0aad72\', \'multiverseId\': 584604}, \'multiverseid\': 584604}, {\'name\': \'Addetto alla Centrale Energetica\', \'text\': "{3}: L\'Addetto alla Centrale Energetica prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Se controlli creature chiamate Addetto alla Miniera e Addetto alla Torre, metti invece due segnalini +1/+1 sull\'Addetto alla Centrale Energetica. Attiva solo una volta per turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Addetto-al-Montaggio\', \'flavor\': "Gli addetti meccanici macinavano lavoro, alimentando l\'impossibile senza avvertire fatica.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea7a14e9-8792-496f-9a5a-6a2cdaa35fad\', \'multiverseId\': 584865}, \'multiverseid\': 584865}, {\'name\': \'魔力炉の作業員\', \'text\': \'{3}：ターン終了時まで、魔力炉の作業員は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。あなたが「鉱山の作業員」という名前を持つクリーチャーと「塔の作業員」という名前を持つクリーチャーを両方ともコントロールしているなら、その代わりに魔力炉の作業員の上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。毎ターン１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員\', \'flavor\': \'機械仕掛けの労働者たちは、コツコツと飽きることなく働き、不可能を可能にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e524a08-8538-44ba-8cfc-39b3305e00c5\', \'multiverseId\': 585126}, \'multiverseid\': 585126}, {\'name\': \'Operário da Usina\', \'text\': \'{3}: Operário da Usina recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno. Se você controlar criaturas com o nome Operário da Mina e Operário da Torre, em vez disso, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em Operário da Usina. Ative apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Operário de Linha de Montagem\', \'flavor\': \'Os operários mecânicos trabalhavam duro, incansavelmente alimentando o impossível.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'381065aa-8a0c-4c68-a5cd-99584c65aa12\', \'multiverseId\': 585387}, \'multiverseid\': 585387}, {\'name\': \'动力炉工人\', \'text\': \'{3}：动力炉工人得+2/+2直到回合结束。如果你操控名称为矿脉工人和高塔工人的生物，则改为在动力炉工人上放置两个+1/+1指示物。每回合只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组装工人\', \'flavor\': \'机械工人埋头苦干，不知疲倦地为突破不可能助力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5cee3ca-18be-4216-9b60-e0f8dfce1b11\', \'multiverseId\': 585648}, \'multiverseid\': 585648}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegsfürsten-Elite\', \'text\': \'Tappe als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, zwei ungetappte Artefakte, Kreaturen und/oder Länder, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Kriegsfürst glaubt also, wir wären verweichlicht? Die Faust des Fortschritts wird ihm das Gegenteil beweisen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18323f9d-4e55-4dc9-b7f7-45c56561042b\', \'multiverseId\': 583878}, \'multiverseid\': 583878}, {\'name\': \'Élite del señor guerrero\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, gira dos criaturas, tierras y/o artefactos enderezados que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"El señor guerrero cree que nos volvimos blandos, ¿verdad? ¡El Puño del Progreso le demostrará su error!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ab3028c-2c60-4171-9224-ac549e4dbbe0\', \'multiverseId\': 584139}, \'multiverseid\': 584139}, {\'name\': \'Élite du seigneur de guerre\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, engagez deux artefacts, créatures et/ou terrains dégagés que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Le seigneur de guerre croit qu\'on s\'est radoucis ? Le Poing du progrès lui prouvera le contraire ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584400&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87c912ac-6460-413d-8edd-8e9217510969\', \'multiverseId\': 584400}, \'multiverseid\': 584400}, {\'name\': \'Élite del Signore della Guerra\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, TAPpa due artefatti, creature e/o terre STAPpati che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il signore della guerra crede che ci siamo rammolliti, eh? Il Pugno del Progresso gli dimostrerà quanto si sbaglia!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc36d1d1-dfcf-4caf-8a26-25df1e27373d\', \'multiverseId\': 584661}, \'multiverseid\': 584661}, {\'name\': \'大将軍の精鋭\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、アーティファクトやクリーチャーや土地のうちあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である２つをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「大将軍は我らがたるんでいるとお思いではないか？そんなことはないと、進撃の拳が証明する！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb29ee54-5f35-4fd7-95e2-d2ddc583fcf9\', \'multiverseId\': 584922}, \'multiverseid\': 584922}, {\'name\': \'Elite do Senhor da Guerra\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, vire dois artefatos, criaturas e/ou terrenos desvirados que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"O Senhor da Guerra acha que a gente amoleceu, é? O Punho do Progresso vai provar que ele está errado!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d9b4aa8-2166-460a-b912-b28263f3c3f4\', \'multiverseId\': 585183}, \'multiverseid\': 585183}, {\'name\': \'大领主精兵\', \'text\': \'横置两个由你操控且未横置的神器，生物和／或地，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「大领主是不是觉得我们变软弱了？进展之拳会让他刮目相看！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9e41e3-c69b-4268-8790-a031589ea4b2\', \'multiverseId\': 585444}, \'multiverseid\': 585444}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krone des Transmogranten\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nAusrüsten {2} oder {B}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Soldaten der Fallaji hassten es, die Gesichter ihrer Familien unter den Transmogranten zu sehen. Ashnod fand eine Lösung dafür.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67d14f59-c5fe-49cb-88d7-9c4424bbf07f\', \'multiverseId\': 583971}, \'multiverseid\': 583971}, {\'name\': \'Corona del transmutado\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada muera, roba una carta.\\nEquipar {2} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Los soldados fallaji odiaban ver las caras de sus seres queridos entre los transmutados. Ashnod encontró una solución.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0f5c52f-0ffa-43ac-a893-506cf2e051e4\', \'multiverseId\': 584232}, \'multiverseid\': 584232}, {\'name\': \'Couronne de transfigurant\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +2/+0.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée meurt, piochez une carte.\\nÉquipement {2} ou {B}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Les soldats fallaji détestaient voir les visages d\'êtres chers parmi les transfigurants. Ashnod mit au point une solution.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584493&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50e638e1-99dd-48fe-bbfb-cab18ef16c27\', \'multiverseId\': 584493}, \'multiverseid\': 584493}, {\'name\': \'Corona del Trasmutatore\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata muore, pesca una carta.\\nEquipaggiare {2} o {B}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'I soldati di Fallaji non sopportavano di vedere i volti delle persone amate tra i trasmutatori. Ashnod escogitò una soluzione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22454bd0-b0f0-463f-8ac3-4403c3da8a33\', \'multiverseId\': 584754}, \'multiverseid\': 584754}, {\'name\': \'人体改造機の冠\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、カード１枚を引く。\\n装備{2}か{B}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'ファラジの兵士たちは、愛した者の顔をした人体改造機を見るのを嫌がった。アシュノッドは解決策を考え出した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5754f4c7-671f-4af5-a358-bff3b402c218\', \'multiverseId\': 585015}, \'multiverseid\': 585015}, {\'name\': \'Coroa do Transmutado\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+0.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada morrer, compre um card.\\nEquipar {2} ou {B}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os soldados fallaji odiavam ver os rostos de seus entes queridos entre os transmutados. Ashnod inventou uma solução.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec7195ba-7761-4324-97e8-244be9e3f220\', \'multiverseId\': 585276}, \'multiverseid\': 585276}, {\'name\': \'变械人冠冕\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物死去时，抓一张牌。\\n佩带{2}或{B}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'法拉吉士兵厌恶看到变械人长着一副熟人面庞。阿士诺想出了解决办法。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'791e4f45-2e77-42b5-a8cd-a4856be275ee\', \'multiverseId\': 585537}, \'multiverseid\': 585537}]', "[{'name': 'Krone des Transmogranten', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nAusrüsten {2} oder {B}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585809&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63f7a721-d50b-4d40-a6f3-b17d7c06c1d0', 'multiverseId': 585809}, 'multiverseid': 585809}, {'name': 'Couronne de transfigurant', 'text': 'La créature équipée gagne +2/+0.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée meurt, piochez une carte.\\nÉquipement {2} ou {B}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585881&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dac8c119-15a0-4328-a61e-f5d1754d6f52', 'multiverseId': 585881}, 'multiverseid': 585881}, {'name': '人体改造機の冠', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、カード１枚を引く。\\n装備{2}か{B}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585953&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc166c4c-45d6-46f1-986e-b31c0c334cb2', 'multiverseId': 585953}, 'multiverseid': 585953}, {'name': '变械人冠冕', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物死去时，抓一张牌。\\n佩带{2}或{B}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586025&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '379dca3e-af44-4b81-87be-e53195d08d77', 'multiverseId': 586025}, 'multiverseid': 586025}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kuratieren\', \'text\': \'Überwachen 2. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Aha! Das ist sicher einer der uralten Schlüssel zu … Nein, Augenblick. Es ist nur ein weiteres Puzzlespielzeug."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ba8434a-c88d-478c-8a28-efdf08e9730f\', \'multiverseId\': 583890}, \'multiverseid\': 583890}, {\'name\': \'Organizar\', \'text\': \'Escruta 2. (Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en tu cementerio y el resto en la parte superior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.)\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Ajá! Debe de ser una de las llaves antiguas de... No, espera. Solo es otro rompecabezas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbb4923e-1302-4dff-a076-eb64027d618f\', \'multiverseId\': 584151}, \'multiverseid\': 584151}, {\'name\': \'Gestion\', \'text\': "Surveillez 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Aha ! Ce doit être une des anciennes clés du… Non, attendez. C\'est juste un casse-tête. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584412&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd68c64b-a545-44b0-9013-006087c5d67e\', \'multiverseId\': 584412}, \'multiverseid\': 584412}, {\'name\': \'Riordinare\', \'text\': \'Sorveglia 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah! Questa dev\\\'essere una delle chiavi antiche per... No, un momento. È soltanto un altro rompicapo giocattolo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f645c586-0620-45d8-ac60-abf647f86f2d\', \'multiverseId\': 584673}, \'multiverseid\': 584673}, {\'name\': \'情報収集\', \'text\': \'諜報２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。）\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「おお！これぞまさしく太古の鍵のひとつ……待て、違うぞ。ただのおもちゃのパズルじゃないか。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55e6540c-9645-4877-9842-e69ca29f60ef\', \'multiverseId\': 584934}, \'multiverseid\': 584934}, {\'name\': \'Organizar\', \'text\': \'Vigiar 2. (Olhe os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Depois, coloque qualquer número deles em seu cemitério e o restante no topo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.)\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Arrá! Deve ser uma das antigas chaves do... Não. Espera. É só mais um quebra-cabeça."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb0f5e50-bed3-459d-9e72-8fe8da9b5894\', \'multiverseId\': 585195}, \'multiverseid\': 585195}, {\'name\': \'悉心布置\', \'text\': \'刺探2。（检视你牌库顶的两张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌置入你的坟墓场，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「啊哈！这肯定是开启神秘珍宝的古董钥匙…不对，等等。只是又一个拼装玩具罢了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eea30a5-5898-4569-907a-58926ecff439\', \'multiverseId\': 585456}, \'multiverseid\': 585456}]', '[{\'name\': \'Königin Kayla bin-Kroog\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten. Du kannst von den auf diese Weise abgeworfenen Karten jeweils bis zu eine Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag 1, 2 und 3 bestimmen. Bringe die bestimmten Karten ins Spiel zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584061&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b8a736-5031-4d4c-aa5b-557f16d0a575\', \'multiverseId\': 584061}, \'multiverseid\': 584061}, {\'name\': \'Reina Kayla bin-Kroog\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Descarta todas las cartas en tu mano, luego roba esa misma cantidad de cartas. Puedes elegir una carta de artefacto o de criatura con valor de maná de 1 que descartaste de esta manera. Luego, haz lo mismo con cartas de artefacto o de criatura con valores de maná de 2 y 3. Regresa esas cartas al campo de batalla. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23acc840-4d9a-4880-9d57-cc10ef816b0b\', \'multiverseId\': 584322}, \'multiverseid\': 584322}, {\'name\': \'Reine Kayla bin-Kroog\', \'text\': "{4}, {T} : Défaussez-vous de toutes les cartes de votre main, puis piochez autant de cartes. Vous pouvez choisir une carte d\'artefact ou de créature avec une valeur de mana de 1 dont vous vous êtes défaussé de cette manière, puis faire de même pour des cartes d\'artefact ou de créature avec des valeurs de mana de 2 et de 3. Renvoyez ces cartes sur le champ de bataille. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584583&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c442ee8-8c4d-4e4b-b6c3-ce76f11fab25\', \'multiverseId\': 584583}, \'multiverseid\': 584583}, {\'name\': \'Regina Kayla bin-Kroog\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Scarta tutte le carte nella tua mano, poi pesca altrettante carte. Puoi scegliere una carta creatura o artefatto con valore di mana pari a 1 che hai scartato in questo modo, poi fai lo stesso per carte creatura o artefatto con valori di mana pari a 2 e a 3. Rimetti quelle carte sul campo di battaglia. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7b0678-71dc-49b0-9206-8e978a011659\', \'multiverseId\': 584844}, \'multiverseid\': 584844}, {\'name\': \'カイラ・ビン・クルーグ女王\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}：あなたの手札にあるすべてのカードを捨て、その後、その枚数のカードを引く。あなたはこれにより捨てられたカードの中から、マナ総量が１でありアーティファクトやクリーチャーであるカード１枚を選んでもよい。その後、マナ総量が２、３についても同じことを行う。それらのカードを戦場に戻す。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3744fc73-7cce-4b2e-9f39-436b8f7a3a06\', \'multiverseId\': 585105}, \'multiverseid\': 585105}, {\'name\': \'Rainha Kayla bin-Kroog\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Descarte todos os cards em sua mão e depois compre uma quantidade equivalente de cards. Você pode escolher um card de artefato ou criatura com valor de mana 1 que você descartou dessa forma, depois faça o mesmo para cards de artefato ou criatura com valores de mana 2 e 3. Devolva aqueles cards ao campo de batalha. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74ae206d-2256-4688-b07d-dd4bbb20c56f\', \'multiverseId\': 585366}, \'multiverseid\': 585366}, {\'name\': \'萼城的凯拉皇后\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：弃掉你的手牌，然后抓等量的牌。你可以选择一张以此法弃掉且法术力值为1的神器或生物牌，然后对法术力值为2和3的神器或生物牌执行同样流程。将这些牌移回战场。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f39cd1-417b-41c2-891a-e7db2bafd377\', \'multiverseId\': 585627}, \'multiverseid\': 585627}]', '[{\'name\': \'Königin Kayla bin-Kroog\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten. Du kannst von den auf diese Weise abgeworfenen Karten jeweils bis zu eine Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag 1, 2 und 3 bestimmen. Bringe die bestimmten Karten ins Spiel zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585693&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac042df-cc71-4316-b0fb-aec024f10cda\', \'multiverseId\': 585693}, \'multiverseid\': 585693}, {\'name\': \'Reine Kayla bin-Kroog\', \'text\': "{4}, {T} : Défaussez-vous de toutes les cartes de votre main, puis piochez autant de cartes. Vous pouvez choisir une carte d\'artefact ou de créature avec une valeur de mana de 1 dont vous vous êtes défaussé de cette manière, puis faire de même pour des cartes d\'artefact ou de créature avec des valeurs de mana de 2 et de 3. Renvoyez ces cartes sur le champ de bataille. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585694&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cab1f00-fb12-4815-b3f2-74152d8335d2\', \'multiverseId\': 585694}, \'multiverseid\': 585694}]', '[{\'name\': \'Königin Kayla bin-Kroog\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten. Du kannst von den auf diese Weise abgeworfenen Karten jeweils bis zu eine Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag 1, 2 und 3 bestimmen. Bringe die bestimmten Karten ins Spiel zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585832&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24d8b35f-f170-4566-bc77-7ed45e053b9f\', \'multiverseId\': 585832}, \'multiverseid\': 585832}, {\'name\': \'Reine Kayla bin-Kroog\', \'text\': "{4}, {T} : Défaussez-vous de toutes les cartes de votre main, puis piochez autant de cartes. Vous pouvez choisir une carte d\'artefact ou de créature avec une valeur de mana de 1 dont vous vous êtes défaussé de cette manière, puis faire de même pour des cartes d\'artefact ou de créature avec des valeurs de mana de 2 et de 3. Renvoyez ces cartes sur le champ de bataille. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f4b81d3-57be-405d-a11c-8af848ab29c0\', \'multiverseId\': 585904}, \'multiverseid\': 585904}, {\'name\': \'カイラ・ビン・クルーグ女王\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}：あなたの手札にあるすべてのカードを捨て、その後、その枚数のカードを引く。あなたはこれにより捨てられたカードの中から、マナ総量が１でありアーティファクトやクリーチャーであるカード１枚を選んでもよい。その後、マナ総量が２、３についても同じことを行う。それらのカードを戦場に戻す。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86991cd8-f435-4359-949a-57792ea6b78b\', \'multiverseId\': 585976}, \'multiverseid\': 585976}, {\'name\': \'萼城的凯拉皇后\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：弃掉你的手牌，然后抓等量的牌。你可以选择一张以此法弃掉且法术力值为1的神器或生物牌，然后对法术力值为2和3的神器或生物牌执行同样流程。将这些牌移回战场。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a080296b-2e08-499c-aee1-0abf2cd2de8d\', \'multiverseId\': 586048}, \'multiverseid\': 586048}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kühnheit\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+0 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nWenn die Kühnheit aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Tapferkeit überlebt die Tapferen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21166866-212c-4dcb-9254-1302762c2992\', \'multiverseId\': 584014}, \'multiverseid\': 584014}, {\'name\': \'Osadía\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+0 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\\nCuando la Osadía vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La valentía vive más que los valientes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850d9a14-558b-405b-af64-8b2ffa69c16c\', \'multiverseId\': 584275}, \'multiverseid\': 584275}, {\'name\': \'Audace\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+0 et a le piétinement.\\nQuand l\'Audace est mise dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'Le courage survit aux courageux.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584536&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02610c79-909e-4efe-87bb-beb475fad748\', \'multiverseId\': 584536}, \'multiverseid\': 584536}, {\'name\': \'Audacia\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+0 e ha travolgere.\\nQuando l\'Audacia viene messa in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Il coraggio sopravvive ai coraggiosi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0c9d0de-f776-4ba7-9ad6-edec64923945\', \'multiverseId\': 584797}, \'multiverseid\': 584797}, {\'name\': \'無鉄砲\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受けトランプルを持つ。\\n無鉄砲が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'勇敢さは勇者よりも生き延びる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b51eb50c-041b-4bd0-8f7e-a8f4a1bbdb17\', \'multiverseId\': 585058}, \'multiverseid\': 585058}, {\'name\': \'Audácia\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+0 e tem atropelar.\\nQuando Audácia for colocada num cemitério vinda do campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A bravura sobrevive aos bravos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6465c44-cbc4-44cd-8e3f-3909fdc8e97f\', \'multiverseId\': 585319}, \'multiverseid\': 585319}, {\'name\': \'勇猛无畏\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+0且具有践踏异能。\\n当勇猛无畏从战场进入坟墓场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'两勇相逢勇者胜。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'839c6649-631e-43d5-913a-f0b4b2146789\', \'multiverseId\': 585580}, \'multiverseid\': 585580}]', '[{\'name\': \'Küstenbollwerk\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nDas Küstenbollwerk erhält +2/+0, solange du eine Insel kontrollierst.\\n{2}, {T}: Überwachen 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583922&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'311ab2ea-9df9-4986-abbd-f3ee1c92e08e\', \'multiverseId\': 583922}, \'multiverseid\': 583922}, {\'name\': \'Baluarte costero\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nEl Baluarte costero obtiene +2/+0 mientras controles una Isla.\\n{2}, {T}: Escruta 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Muro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab16e5cd-4b5c-4861-a46e-f260acd87762\', \'multiverseId\': 584183}, \'multiverseid\': 584183}, {\'name\': \'Rempart côtier\', \'text\': \'Défenseur\\nLe Rempart côtier gagne +2/+0 tant que vous contrôlez une île.\\n{2}, {T} : Surveillez 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584444&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9a9f812-8e47-4fb7-963f-1719dc831e91\', \'multiverseId\': 584444}, \'multiverseid\': 584444}, {\'name\': \'Baluardo Costiero\', \'text\': "Difensore\\nIl Baluardo Costiero prende +2/+0 fintanto che controlli un\'Isola.\\n{2}, {T}: Sorveglia 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Muro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2deede70-9c33-4ca2-9c8e-30845175d569\', \'multiverseId\': 584705}, \'multiverseid\': 584705}, {\'name\': \'沿岸の防壁\', \'text\': \'防衛\\nあなたが島をコントロールしているかぎり、沿岸の防壁は＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{2}, {T}：諜報１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。そのカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71187725-bce4-46b9-a1d3-e47f89b59847\', \'multiverseId\': 584966}, \'multiverseid\': 584966}, {\'name\': \'Baluarte Costeiro\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\nBaluarte Costeiro recebe +2/+0 enquanto você controla uma Ilha.\\n{2}, {T}: Use vigiar 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Barreira\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0592554e-d0fc-45a6-a34a-cac1c85b60f5\', \'multiverseId\': 585227}, \'multiverseid\': 585227}, {\'name\': \'沿岸筑垒械\', \'text\': \'守军\\n只要你操控海岛，沿岸筑垒械便得+2/+0。\\n{2}，{T}：刺探1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～墙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'309d4fa6-39d1-4cd8-b25b-70c3cac16141\', \'multiverseId\': 585488}, \'multiverseid\': 585488}]', '[{\'name\': \'Legionen zu Asche\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, und alle Spielsteine mit demselben Namen, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Bei den sieben Messinggöttern, ich dachte, das sei eine Stadt voller Akademiker! Wie machen sie das?"\\n—Sharaman, Urzanischer Leutnant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584059&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31127d5d-6579-463f-95b3-d4b94a995ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 584059}, \'multiverseid\': 584059}, {\'name\': \'Legiones hechas cenizas\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente y todas las fichas que controla ese jugador con el mismo nombre que ese permanente.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Por el amor de los siete dioses del latón! ¡Es una ciudad de académicos! ¿Cómo lo consiguen?".\\n—Sharaman, teniente de Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72933e4c-6c5b-4b8c-ac9b-02fcdf0924c4\', \'multiverseId\': 584320}, \'multiverseid\': 584320}, {\'name\': \'Légions en cendres\', \'text\': "Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle et tous les jetons que ce joueur contrôle du même nom que ce permanent.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Pour l\'amour des sept dieux d\'airain, c\'est une ville d\'académiciens ! Comment peuvent-ils faire ça ? »\\n—Sharaman, lieutenant d\'Urza", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c41ff4e-bb09-4e78-b342-41ad1d4a0383\', \'multiverseId\': 584581}, \'multiverseid\': 584581}, {\'name\': \'Legioni in Cenere\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario e tutte le pedine con lo stesso nome di quel permanente che quel giocatore controlla.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Per l\\\'amore delle sette divinità d\\\'ottone, è una città di accademici! Come possono fare questo?"\\n—Sharaman, tenente di Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'143f24e7-6fd4-4db2-be6e-107a59fb06d6\', \'multiverseId\': 584842}, \'multiverseid\': 584842}, {\'name\': \'軍勢を灰に\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それと、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていてそれと同じ名前を持つすべてのトークンを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「七柱の真鍮の神にかけて、これが学識の都だというのか！このようなことをどうやって？」\\n――ウルザの副官、シャラマン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ebe6912-e79d-4134-ace4-57bc81d180b6\', \'multiverseId\': 585103}, \'multiverseid\': 585103}, {\'name\': \'De Legiões a Cinzas\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente não de terreno alvo que um oponente controla e todas as fichas que aquele jogador controla com o mesmo nome que aquela permanente.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Pelo amor dos sete deuses de latão, é uma cidade de acadêmicos! Como podem fazer isso?"\\n— Sharaman, tenente de Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2093f5f-dbbd-45bc-bd80-ec01280566ee\', \'multiverseId\': 585364}, \'multiverseid\': 585364}, {\'name\': \'军势散尽\', \'text\': \'放逐目标由对手操控的非地永久物和所有由该牌手操控且与该永久物同名的衍生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「黄铜七神在上，这可是座学术之城！他们怎么下得了手？」\\n～克撒军副官沙勒曼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'665a71b2-e041-4e20-a4ad-8241a05b5622\', \'multiverseId\': 585625}, \'multiverseid\': 585625}]', '[{\'name\': \'Legionen zu Asche\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, und alle Spielsteine mit demselben Namen, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585831&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a672436f-718b-4a13-b167-f6ec45c6391c\', \'multiverseId\': 585831}, \'multiverseid\': 585831}, {\'name\': \'Légions en cendres\', \'text\': "Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle et tous les jetons que ce joueur contrôle du même nom que ce permanent.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585903&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97033842-0178-4af6-88b2-d7b466f8fbd9\', \'multiverseId\': 585903}, \'multiverseid\': 585903}, {\'name\': \'軍勢を灰に\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それと、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていてそれと同じ名前を持つすべてのトークンを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89a7877a-58b2-45b3-9fbb-2e268e124a34\', \'multiverseId\': 585975}, \'multiverseid\': 585975}, {\'name\': \'军势散尽\', \'text\': \'放逐目标由对手操控的非地永久物和所有由该牌手操控且与该永久物同名的衍生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df0233cd-81b3-46c1-a2c0-ea99ecf4e2d3\', \'multiverseId\': 586047}, \'multiverseid\': 586047}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lehm-Wiedergänger\', \'text\': \'Der Lehm-Wiedergänger kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{2}{B}: Bringe den Lehm-Wiedergänger aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Tawnos baute seine Lehmstatuen mit Beständigkeit im Sinn, nichtsahnend, dass sie noch lange nach dem Krieg weiterkämpfen würden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eecb000-4020-4f15-a1aa-5ed4b4d7bb69\', \'multiverseId\': 583964}, \'multiverseid\': 583964}, {\'name\': \'Aparecido de arcilla\', \'text\': \'El Aparecido de arcilla entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{2}{B}: Regresa el Aparecido de arcilla de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'Tawnos construía sus estatuas de arcilla para que duraran, sin saber que seguirían luchando mucho después de que acabara la guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4374d478-56f8-431f-9de8-39393d968b21\', \'multiverseId\': 584225}, \'multiverseid\': 584225}, {\'name\': "Revenant d\'argile", \'text\': "Le Revenant d\'argile arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{2}{B} : Renvoyez le Revenant d\'argile depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "Tavnos avait construit ses statues d\'argile pour durer sans savoir qu\'elles continueraient de se battre longtemps après la guerre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584486&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'127ffb13-ad84-42c3-ad0c-561e341544e3\', \'multiverseId\': 584486}, \'multiverseid\': 584486}, {\'name\': "Redivivo d\'Argilla", \'text\': "Il Redivivo d\'Argilla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{2}{B}: Riprendi in mano il Redivivo d\'Argilla dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': "Tawnos costruì le sue statue d\'argilla per renderle durevoli, senza immaginare che avrebbero continuato a combattere ben oltre la fine della guerra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee29b92d-f181-49c9-be82-078ea8c5e5c0\', \'multiverseId\': 584747}, \'multiverseid\': 584747}, {\'name\': \'土の帰還者\', \'text\': \'土の帰還者は、タップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}{B}：あなたの墓地にある土の帰還者をあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'タウノスは耐久性を重視して粘土像を作ったが、それらが戦争の後もずっと戦い続けるとは知る由もなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cb8a3a4-4392-4e9a-89c0-79bd73dfbaa9\', \'multiverseId\': 585008}, \'multiverseid\': 585008}, {\'name\': \'Ressurgido de Argila\', \'text\': \'Ressurgido de Argila entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{2}{B}: Devolva Ressurgido de Argila de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Tawnos construiu suas estátuas para durar, sem saber que elas continuariam a lutar muito depois da guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b07b0657-ceb8-4a29-b6c8-ef6cd3a08fea\', \'multiverseId\': 585269}, \'multiverseid\': 585269}, {\'name\': \'黏土复仇像\', \'text\': \'黏土复仇像须横置进战场。\\n{2}{B}：将黏土复仇像从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'达硌士打造黏土像时，希望它们能经久耐用。但他不知道的是，这些黏土像战后许久仍在奋战。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b8f2e9-13a0-4d61-ba70-d11f63a19ebf\', \'multiverseId\': 585530}, \'multiverseid\': 585530}]', '[{\'name\': \'Liberator, Urzas Kampfthopter\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nDu kannst farblose Zaubersprüche und Artefaktzauber wirken, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätten.\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst und falls die Menge Mana, die ausgegeben wurde, um den Zauberspruch zu wirken, größer ist als die Stärke von Liberator, Urzas Kampfthopter, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Liberator.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584079&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f4ff14e-7789-4b6a-935d-e48802c347b9\', \'multiverseId\': 584079}, \'multiverseid\': 584079}, {\'name\': \'Liberador, tóptero de guerra de Urza\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nPuedes lanzar los hechizos incoloros y los hechizos de artefacto como si tuvieran la habilidad de destello.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo, si la cantidad de maná usado para lanzar ese hechizo es mayor que la fuerza del Liberador, tóptero de guerra de Urza, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Liberador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f422e981-c9b8-47f8-991a-7458d9139727\', \'multiverseId\': 584340}, \'multiverseid\': 584340}, {\'name\': "Libérateur, mécanoptère de combat d\'Urza", \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nVous pouvez lancer des sorts incolores et des sorts d\'artefact comme s\'ils avaient le flash.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, si la quantité de mana dépensée pour lancer ce sort est supérieure à la force de Libérateur, mécanoptère de combat d\'Urza, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Libérateur.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584601&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3799c841-fe3e-4b1b-a495-5041ea61ddaa\', \'multiverseId\': 584601}, \'multiverseid\': 584601}, {\'name\': \'Liberator, Tottero da Guerra di Urza\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nVolare\\nPuoi lanciare magie incolori e magie artefatto come se avessero lampo.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia, se l\'ammontare di mana speso per lanciare quella magia è superiore alla forza di Liberator, Tottero da Guerra di Urza, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Liberator.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Tottero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49177ef6-330b-4f08-a4ba-a6663b9e83ff\', \'multiverseId\': 584862}, \'multiverseid\': 584862}, {\'name\': \'ウルザの空戦艇、リベレーター号\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\nあなたは無色の呪文やアーティファクト・呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。\\nあなたが呪文を唱えるたび、その呪文を唱えるために支払ったマナの点数がウルザの空戦艇、リベレーター号のパワーよりも大きい場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛（ひ）行（こう）機（き）械（かい）\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d43dce7-aff4-4524-9d70-1bb785db8ed1\', \'multiverseId\': 585123}, \'multiverseid\': 585123}, {\'name\': \'Libertador, Tóptero de Batalha de Urza\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVoar\\nVocê pode conjurar mágicas incolores e mágicas de artefato como se tivessem lampejo.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica, se a quantidade de mana gasta para conjurar aquela mágica for maior que o poder de Libertador, Tóptero de Batalha de Urza, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Libertador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'224c55ae-7b19-4715-a5c9-53cd2ea72fc5\', \'multiverseId\': 585384}, \'multiverseid\': 585384}, {\'name\': \'克撒战翼机解放者号\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n你可以将无色咒语和神器咒语视同具有闪现异能地来施放。\\n每当你施放咒语时，若施放该咒语时所支付的法术力数量大于克撒战翼机解放者号之力量，则在解放者号上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～振翼机\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d71c1c03-33fd-4d6f-b9d3-5f16540edaff\', \'multiverseId\': 585645}, \'multiverseid\': 585645}]', '[{\'name\': \'Liberator, Urzas Kampfthopter\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nDu kannst farblose Zaubersprüche und Artefaktzauber wirken, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätten.\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst und falls die Menge Mana, die ausgegeben wurde, um den Zauberspruch zu wirken, größer ist als die Stärke von Liberator, Urzas Kampfthopter, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Liberator.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585839&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3a4915-2d1d-4f4d-953a-764d957a5cc7\', \'multiverseId\': 585839}, \'multiverseid\': 585839}, {\'name\': "Libérateur, mécanoptère de combat d\'Urza", \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nVous pouvez lancer des sorts incolores et des sorts d\'artefact comme s\'ils avaient le flash.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, si la quantité de mana dépensée pour lancer ce sort est supérieure à la force de Libérateur, mécanoptère de combat d\'Urza, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Libérateur.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f41d114e-56f3-4cc1-ab7d-901b78f90264\', \'multiverseId\': 585911}, \'multiverseid\': 585911}, {\'name\': \'ウルザの空戦艇、リベレーター号\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\nあなたは無色の呪文やアーティファクト・呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。\\nあなたが呪文を唱えるたび、その呪文を唱えるために支払ったマナの点数がウルザの空戦艇、リベレーター号のパワーよりも大きい場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛（ひ）行（こう）機（き）械（かい）\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f25a62f-92cf-4dc6-a315-9201819815dd\', \'multiverseId\': 585983}, \'multiverseid\': 585983}, {\'name\': \'克撒战翼机解放者号\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n你可以将无色咒语和神器咒语视同具有闪现异能地来施放。\\n每当你施放咒语时，若施放该咒语时所支付的法术力数量大于克撒战翼机解放者号之力量，则在解放者号上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～振翼机\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28b2ca81-de29-4b75-a7a1-c99143616b11\', \'multiverseId\': 586055}, \'multiverseid\': 586055}]', '[{\'name\': \'Llanowar-Ödland\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}. Das Llanowar-Ödland fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Detonation des Sylex bedeutete nicht nur das Ende des Krieges, sondern auch das Ende von Dominaria, wie die meisten es kannten."\\n—*Der Artefakt-Krieg*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584104&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e6bde3e-203b-40df-b60d-12787216672a\', \'multiverseId\': 584104}, \'multiverseid\': 584104}, {\'name\': \'Yermos de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}. Los Yermos de Llanowar te hacen 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"La explosión del sylex no solo marcó el final de la guerra, sino también el de Dominaria como la conocían casi todos".\\n—*La Guerra de las Antigüedades*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'004e6a3a-21a6-4922-ae8f-64d666fb3721\', \'multiverseId\': 584365}, \'multiverseid\': 584365}, {\'name\': \'Landes de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}. Les Landes de Llanowar vous infligent 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "L\'explosion du Sylex marqua non seulement la fin de la guerre, mais aussi la fin de Dominaria telle qu\'on l\'avait connue. »\\n—*La Guerre des Antiquités*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584626&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'300f4b0f-8230-4b91-8271-e964aff8993b\', \'multiverseId\': 584626}, \'multiverseid\': 584626}, {\'name\': \'Distese di Llanowar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}. Le Distese di Llanowar ti infliggono 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'esplosione del Sylex non segnò solo la fine della guerra, ma anche la fine di Dominaria come quasi tutti la conoscevano."\\n—*La Guerra delle Antichità*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79c7960a-145c-4c33-b2fc-a4f805b71c17\', \'multiverseId\': 584887}, \'multiverseid\': 584887}, {\'name\': \'ラノワールの荒原\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。ラノワールの荒原はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「酒杯の爆発が告げたのは戦争の終わりだけではなかった。衆知の通り、それはドミナリアの終わりも告げたのだった。」\\n――*「アンティキティー戦争」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ddb162-4628-4218-b6aa-f75eebd78797\', \'multiverseId\': 585148}, \'multiverseid\': 585148}, {\'name\': \'Regiões Agrestes de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}. Regiões Agrestes de Llanowar causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"A explosão do sílex marcou não só o fim da guerra, mas o fim da Dominária que a maioria conhecia."\\n— *A Guerra das Antiguidades*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef5ee428-680d-4be1-8c9d-3058702b7ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 585409}, \'multiverseid\': 585409}, {\'name\': \'罗堰荒野\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。罗堰荒野对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「同兆震爆不仅标志着战事终结，更标志着诸人所熟知的多明纳里亚已然作古。」\\n～*《古文明之战》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e470959e-44d4-4107-b4fe-54b5aa001da6\', \'multiverseId\': 585670}, \'multiverseid\': 585670}]', "[{'name': 'Llanowar-Ödland', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}. Das Llanowar-Ödland fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586099&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89b92c96-d837-4204-82e6-20ca1bdf7567', 'multiverseId': 586099}, 'multiverseid': 586099}, {'name': 'Yermos de Llanowar', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}. Los Yermos de Llanowar te hacen 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586105&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31d30de6-f6e1-436a-af7f-bfa45613062e', 'multiverseId': 586105}, 'multiverseid': 586105}, {'name': 'Landes de Llanowar', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}. Les Landes de Llanowar vous infligent 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586111&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac4b11cc-f366-49be-9eae-6039e89eab33', 'multiverseId': 586111}, 'multiverseid': 586111}, {'name': 'Distese di Llanowar', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}. Le Distese di Llanowar ti infliggono 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586117&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ed146ed-b818-4682-b6b6-f793e7343fa3', 'multiverseId': 586117}, 'multiverseid': 586117}, {'name': 'ラノワールの荒原', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。ラノワールの荒原はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586123&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa263275-c3ab-4829-8701-170ffa6ebf4a', 'multiverseId': 586123}, 'multiverseid': 586123}, {'name': 'Regiões Agrestes de Llanowar', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}. Regiões Agrestes de Llanowar causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586135&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37d3bc9c-48c3-491f-8da8-5e2edac6c744', 'multiverseId': 586135}, 'multiverseid': 586135}, {'name': '罗堰荒野', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。罗堰荒野对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586141&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3db75bb1-de40-468b-9ce8-3a01a6bebb4c', 'multiverseId': 586141}, 'multiverseid': 586141}]", '[{\'name\': \'Loran vom Dritten Pfad\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nWenn Loran vom Dritten Pfad ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre bis zu ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n{T}: Du und ein Gegner deiner Wahl zieht je eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Als Gelehrte sah sie den Sylex nicht als Waffe, sondern als Schlüssel zur Vergangenheit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583858&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7543ea4b-74db-48f4-adb6-779053eeb1c5\', \'multiverseId\': 583858}, \'multiverseid\': 583858}, {\'name\': \'Loran del Tercer Camino\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nCuando Loran del Tercer Camino entre al campo de batalla, destruye hasta un artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\\n{T}: El oponente objetivo y tú roban una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Siendo una erudita, no veía el sylex como un arma, sino como una clave para conocer el pasado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8db6977-b8bc-4913-85b5-51a9cd98a12c\', \'multiverseId\': 584119}, \'multiverseid\': 584119}, {\'name\': \'Loran de la Troisième Voie\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nQuand Loran de la Troisième Voie arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez jusqu\'à une cible, artefact ou enchantement.\\n{T} : Vous et un adversaire ciblé piochez chacun une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'Intellectuellement, elle voyait le Sylex non pas comme une arme, mais comme une clé ouvrant le passé.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584380&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a480640e-d601-4083-80b8-6102de6b9ba8\', \'multiverseId\': 584380}, \'multiverseid\': 584380}, {\'name\': \'Loran del Terzo Cammino\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nQuando Loran del Terzo Cammino entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi fino a un artefatto o incantesimo bersaglio.\\n{T}: Tu e un avversario bersaglio pescate una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': "Come studiosa, considerava il Sylex non come un\'arma, bensì come una chiave per aprire il passato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fbbb99d-c7c0-4fd4-85fb-a087349cbe82\', \'multiverseId\': 584641}, \'multiverseid\': 584641}, {\'name\': \'第三の道のロラン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n第三の道のロランが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち最大１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n{T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は学者として、酒杯を兵器としてではなく過去への鍵として捉えていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a5e8a5-9306-4c7a-8310-9b50a08171f4\', \'multiverseId\': 584902}, \'multiverseid\': 584902}, {\'name\': \'Loran da Terceira Via\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nQuando Loran da Terceira Via entrar no campo de batalha, destrua até um artefato ou encantamento alvo.\\n{T}: Você e o oponente alvo compram um card cada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Como acadêmica, ela viu o sílex não como uma arma, mas como uma chave para o passado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2459d21-9bfe-48d8-8a8c-a533eaa6dff0\', \'multiverseId\': 585163}, \'multiverseid\': 585163}, {\'name\': \'蹊径会的罗兰\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n当蹊径会的罗兰进战场时，消灭至多一个目标神器或结界。\\n{T}：你和目标对手各抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'身为学者，她未将同兆当作武器，而是洞悉过往的关键。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63456712-4bac-4182-8242-bd5d53713507\', \'multiverseId\': 585424}, \'multiverseid\': 585424}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loran vom Dritten Pfad\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nWenn Loran vom Dritten Pfad ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre bis zu ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n{T}: Du und ein Gegner deiner Wahl zieht je eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585779&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020a707b-072a-4a4f-9e99-d552de8c8175\', \'multiverseId\': 585779}, \'multiverseid\': 585779}, {\'name\': \'Loran de la Troisième Voie\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nQuand Loran de la Troisième Voie arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez jusqu\'à une cible, artefact ou enchantement.\\n{T} : Vous et un adversaire ciblé piochez chacun une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585851&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efd7ce39-3c00-4159-ae8e-1fcf1a44fe0d\', \'multiverseId\': 585851}, \'multiverseid\': 585851}, {\'name\': \'第三の道のロラン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n第三の道のロランが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち最大１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n{T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ab89825-f238-491a-a0c8-9e2b948df7e9\', \'multiverseId\': 585923}, \'multiverseid\': 585923}, {\'name\': \'蹊径会的罗兰\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n当蹊径会的罗兰进战场时，消灭至多一个目标神器或结界。\\n{T}：你和目标对手各抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cbc239f-557d-48fa-ba57-1273fdb932fa\', \'multiverseId\': 585995}, \'multiverseid\': 585995}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loran, Schülerin der Geschichte\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Loran, Schülerin der Geschichte, oder eine andere legendäre Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Urza und Mishra mögen die berühmtesten Schüler Tocasias gewesen sein, aber Loran war die wahre Erbin ihres Vermächtnisses.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583859&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dcae5d0-0a17-4ddd-bbfb-0d4affd866f8\', \'multiverseId\': 583859}, \'multiverseid\': 583859}, {\'name\': \'Loran, discípula de la historia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Loran, discípula de la historia u otra criatura legendaria entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Puede que Urza y Mishra fueran los alumnos más famosos de Tocasia, pero Loran fue la auténtica heredera de su legado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cfc6b70-a777-4e99-a380-ccd28be0d507\', \'multiverseId\': 584120}, \'multiverseid\': 584120}, {\'name\': "Loran, disciple de l\'histoire", \'text\': "À chaque fois que Loran, disciple de l\'histoire ou une autre créature légendaire arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, renvoyez une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'Urza et Mishra étaient peut-être les étudiants les plus célèbres de Tocasia, mais Loran était sa véritable héritière.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584381&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0ce136a-d4f2-40fa-93c5-d7aa53bba98e\', \'multiverseId\': 584381}, \'multiverseid\': 584381}, {\'name\': \'Loran, Discepola della Storia\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta Loran, Discepola della Storia o un\'altra creatura leggendaria entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, riprendi in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': "Urza e Mishra sono considerati i due più famosi studenti di Tocasia, ma Loran è stata l\'unica degna allieva a raccoglierne l\'eredità.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4247f13-8956-48fd-9dbc-eb0508ab7c83\', \'multiverseId\': 584642}, \'multiverseid\': 584642}, {\'name\': \'歴史学の信奉者、ロラン\', \'text\': \'歴史学の信奉者、ロランやこれでない伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'ウルザとミシュラはトカシアの生徒の中で最も高名な者であったかもしれない。だが、彼女の遺産を真に受け継いだ者はロランであった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e250a0d-4176-409d-86a9-65ce390a16dd\', \'multiverseId\': 584903}, \'multiverseid\': 584903}, {\'name\': \'Loran, Discípula da História\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Loran, Discípula da História, ou outra criatura lendária entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, devolva o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Urza e Mishra podem ter sido os estudantes mais famosos de Tocasia, mas Loran foi a verdadeira herdeira de seu legado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63536e59-74c9-4336-8534-998c489eb5a5\', \'multiverseId\': 585164}, \'multiverseid\': 585164}, {\'name\': \'崇史学徒罗兰\', \'text\': \'每当崇史学徒罗兰或另一个传奇生物在你的操控下进战场时，将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'虽然托卡西雅诸学子中属克撒与米斯拉最广为人知，但罗兰才是她一生所学的正统传承。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737befd6-8369-4750-9e9c-1b4080d8a111\', \'multiverseId\': 585425}, \'multiverseid\': 585425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lorans Flucht\', \'text\': \'Ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Fluchsicherheit und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Hellsicht 1.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Stadt Terisia in Flammen stand, drückte Feldon den Sylex in Lorans Hände und beschwor sie, zu fliehen. Die Hoffnung floh mit ihr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583860&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9e06cf7-64bf-4b1b-849f-fc6fe22de33b\', \'multiverseId\': 583860}, \'multiverseid\': 583860}, {\'name\': \'Huida de Loran\', \'text\': \'El artefacto o criatura objetivo gana las habilidades de antimaleficio e indestructible hasta el final del turno. Adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras Terisia ardía, Feldon puso el sylex en manos de Loran y la urgió a huir. Con ella, también partió toda esperanza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8c25760-d17b-46c9-8820-bd58980e312b\', \'multiverseId\': 584121}, \'multiverseid\': 584121}, {\'name\': \'Fuite de Loran\', \'text\': "Une cible, artefact ou créature, acquiert la défense talismanique et l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Regard 1.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Alors que la ville de Terisia brûlait, Feldonn confia le Sylex à Loran et lui intima de s\'enfuir. L\'espoir prit la fuite avec elle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584382&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e16cdbe-911c-4160-b171-92fba7059c08\', \'multiverseId\': 584382}, \'multiverseid\': 584382}, {\'name\': \'Fuga di Loran\', \'text\': \'Una creatura o un artefatto bersaglio ha anti-malocchio e indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. Profetizza 1.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre le fiamme avvolgevano Città di Terisia, Feldon affidò il Sylex nelle mani di Loran e la esortò a fuggire. Con lei fuggì la speranza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddbb8863-196f-4a22-854b-d247173c5c16\', \'multiverseId\': 584643}, \'multiverseid\': 584643}, {\'name\': \'ロランの脱出\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは呪禁と破壊不能を得る。占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'テリシア市が燃え落ちる中、フェルドンはロランの手に酒杯を押しつけ、逃れよと促した。斯くして希望は彼女とともに難を逃れたのである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c24eefbd-acdc-49b2-aba5-d952c3016b40\', \'multiverseId\': 584904}, \'multiverseid\': 584904}, {\'name\': \'Fuga de Loran\', \'text\': \'O artefato ou a criatura alvo ganha resistência a magia e indestrutível até o final do turno. Use vidência 1.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto a cidade de Terisia queimava, Feldon pôs o sílex nas mãos de Loran e a mandou correr. E a esperança correu com ela.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5668d2f4-379d-43f2-8f1e-466895300aa0\', \'multiverseId\': 585165}, \'multiverseid\': 585165}, {\'name\': \'罗兰的逃难\', \'text\': \'目标神器或生物获得辟邪与不灭异能直到回合结束。占卜1。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'眼见泰瑞西亚城火光熊熊倾覆在即，费顿急忙将同兆硬塞到罗兰手中，让她赶紧逃命。希望与她随行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bf524a2-5f08-464c-b4d8-b0c588e77103\', \'multiverseId\': 585426}, \'multiverseid\': 585426}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftangriffsoffizier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Luftangriffsoffizier angreift, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\nTappe drei ungetappte Soldaten, die du kontrollierst: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Landezone ist gesichert. Aktivieren und ausschwärmen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583908&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc924bde-d180-45f0-9ba6-0dae7f872d61\', \'multiverseId\': 583908}, \'multiverseid\': 583908}, {\'name\': \'Oficial del tiro celeste\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Oficial del tiro celeste ataque, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Soldado incolora 1/1.\\nGirar tres Soldados enderezados que controlas: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La zona de aterrizaje está despejada. ¡Actívense y despliéguense!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f8c216c-d71d-4d01-b568-caeea712c0c1\', \'multiverseId\': 584169}, \'multiverseid\': 584169}, {\'name\': \'Officier frappeciel\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Officier frappeciel attaque, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.\\nEngagez trois soldats dégagés que vous contrôlez : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« La zone d\'atterrissage est libre. Activez et déployez ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584430&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b4b3b0-fde3-4a4a-b79a-9275c1f1eba7\', \'multiverseId\': 584430}, \'multiverseid\': 584430}, {\'name\': \'Ufficiale del Colpo Aereo\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Ufficiale del Colpo Aereo attacca, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Soldato 1/1 incolore.\\nTAPpa tre Soldati STAPpati che controlli: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La zona di atterraggio è sgombra. Attivazione, prepararsi allo schieramento!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7244c571-deaf-4f4d-9d0e-660ec921d053\', \'multiverseId\': 584691}, \'multiverseid\': 584691}, {\'name\': \'天空射の士官\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n天空射の士官が攻撃するたび、無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である兵士３体をタップする：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「着陸地点に障害なし。起動して展開せよ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09b7397e-09dc-4f1f-9f34-e7fbca02f13e\', \'multiverseId\': 584952}, \'multiverseid\': 584952}, {\'name\': \'Oficial de Ataque Celeste\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Oficial de Ataque Celeste atacar, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Soldado incolor 1/1.\\nVire três Soldados desvirados que você controla: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Zona de aterrisagem livre. Ativar e despachar!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eab157b1-0101-4b90-a08d-962016678e9a\', \'multiverseId\': 585213}, \'multiverseid\': 585213}, {\'name\': \'天袭长官\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当天袭长官攻击时，派出一个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\\n横置三个由你操控且未横置的士兵：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「着陆区安全。启动，出发！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a330604-1348-4ca8-bbd1-9b65a1236553\', \'multiverseId\': 585474}, \'multiverseid\': 585474}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftangriffsoffizier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Luftangriffsoffizier angreift, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\nTappe drei ungetappte Soldaten, die du kontrollierst: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585792&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4065357-ee46-4476-b03c-d8b9b6cd18a5\', \'multiverseId\': 585792}, \'multiverseid\': 585792}, {\'name\': \'Officier frappeciel\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Officier frappeciel attaque, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.\\nEngagez trois soldats dégagés que vous contrôlez : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585864&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ded6932-887a-4c3d-bc9f-c0dddc1668fd\', \'multiverseId\': 585864}, \'multiverseid\': 585864}, {\'name\': \'天空射の士官\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n天空射の士官が攻撃するたび、無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である兵士３体をタップする：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4493f12-613e-447f-aa4c-d6b30716f9b7\', \'multiverseId\': 585936}, \'multiverseid\': 585936}, {\'name\': \'天袭长官\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当天袭长官攻击时，派出一个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\\n横置三个由你操控且未横置的士兵：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16cf8462-3417-4a8e-b796-46bd8e55f38d\', \'multiverseId\': 586008}, \'multiverseid\': 586008}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftkommando\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nBravour (Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Schweißnähte sind oben am schwächsten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583919&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae301d9-b021-4f1d-a7fc-95ed383b3aeb\', \'multiverseId\': 583919}, \'multiverseid\': 583919}, {\'name\': \'Comando alado\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nDestreza. (Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Las soldaduras son más débiles en la parte de arriba".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e6c4d3d-9f42-4d00-8bd5-685a66584b6e\', \'multiverseId\': 584180}, \'multiverseid\': 584180}, {\'name\': \'Commando ailé\', \'text\': "Vol\\nProuesse (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Les soudures du haut sont plus fragiles. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32020cee-ecd1-47d1-985e-38ada8acb8de\', \'multiverseId\': 584441}, \'multiverseid\': 584441}, {\'name\': \'Commando Alato\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nProdezza (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, questa creatura prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Le saldature sono più deboli in cima."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03a27e91-2d99-43d0-9296-6718a8b22552\', \'multiverseId\': 584702}, \'multiverseid\': 584702}, {\'name\': \'翼の猛士\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「その溶接部の上のほうが脆い。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83a5ab6d-bdf2-4e8b-8b64-91958c95c177\', \'multiverseId\': 584963}, \'multiverseid\': 584963}, {\'name\': \'Comando Alado\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nDestreza (Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica não de criatura, esta criatura recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"As soldas são mais fracas no topo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53932669-35e7-4a31-a8f3-b62dcc2278ef\', \'multiverseId\': 585224}, \'multiverseid\': 585224}, {\'name\': \'翔翼突击兵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n灵技（每当你施放非生物咒语时，此生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「焊接点从上方攻击最脆弱。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7b68e3-532d-4a50-ac10-8c6e48f40609\', \'multiverseId\': 585485}, \'multiverseid\': 585485}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftmarschall\', \'text\': \'{3}: Ein Soldat deiner Wahl erhält Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Heute werden unsere Klingen Kroog alle Ehre machen! Mögen die sieben Messinggötter mit uns sein!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583889&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b536d210-edf1-4cbb-ae46-941f33f62fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 583889}, \'multiverseid\': 583889}, {\'name\': \'Mariscal aéreo\', \'text\': \'{3}: El Soldado objetivo gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Hoy, nuestras espadas recuerdan Kroog! ¡Que los siete dioses del latón estén con nosotros!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e74918b3-e212-4a81-8b25-6b3f95f5282b\', \'multiverseId\': 584150}, \'multiverseid\': 584150}, {\'name\': \'Maréchal aérien\', \'text\': "{3} : Un soldat ciblé acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Aujourd\'hui, nos lames se souviennent de Kroog ! Puissent les sept dieux d\'airain veiller sur nous ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584411&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f54365b-d843-4707-8127-8bb7319df3fe\', \'multiverseId\': 584411}, \'multiverseid\': 584411}, {\'name\': "Maresciallo dell\'Aria", \'text\': \'{3}: Un Soldato bersaglio ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Oggi le nostre lame evocheranno il ricordo di Kroog! Che le sette divinità d\\\'ottone siano con noi!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6827b19-bbe3-4053-8dfd-0d4d5e38b612\', \'multiverseId\': 584672}, \'multiverseid\': 584672}, {\'name\': \'空挺司令官\', \'text\': \'{3}：兵士１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「我らが刃よクルーグを思い出せ！七柱の真鍮神が我らと共に在らんことを！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23a0264c-893f-4453-9b42-c9141f816ae3\', \'multiverseId\': 584933}, \'multiverseid\': 584933}, {\'name\': \'Marechal do Ar\', \'text\': \'{3}: O Soldado alvo ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoje nossas lâminas recordam Kroog! Que os sete deuses de latão estejam conosco!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33f56fc7-0403-48bb-be09-f1934723e763\', \'multiverseId\': 585194}, \'multiverseid\': 585194}, {\'name\': \'空战元帅\', \'text\': \'{3}：目标士兵获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「今日手中利刃会铭记萼城荣光！愿黄铜七神与我们同在！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19b6376e-b926-4e85-b0d8-9145fed8ad18\', \'multiverseId\': 585455}, \'multiverseid\': 585455}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lufttransport-Kaplanin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Lufttransport-Kaplanin ins Spiel kommt, millst du drei Karten. Du kannst von den Karten, die auf diese Weise gemillt wurden, eine Ebene-Karte oder eine Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du dies nicht tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Lufttransport-Kaplanin. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583848&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33b73bd4-b072-4b01-a113-df50bb252fea\', \'multiverseId\': 583848}, \'multiverseid\': 583848}, {\'name\': \'Aerocapellán\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Aerocapellán entre al campo de batalla, muele tres cartas. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta de Llanura o una carta de criatura con valor de maná de 3 o menos de entre las cartas molidas de esta manera. Si no lo haces, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Aerocapellán. (Para moler una carta, pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52094f89-a2fb-4065-8ea0-8c1cabcd125e\', \'multiverseId\': 584109}, \'multiverseid\': 584109}, {\'name\': \'Aumônière aéroportée\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Aumônière aéroportée arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez trois cartes. Vous pouvez mettre dans votre main une carte de plaine ou une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 parmi les cartes meulées de cette manière. Si vous ne faites pas ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Aumônière aéroportée. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584370&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba4f6b14-2ff8-49a8-8601-1a90080e1878\', \'multiverseId\': 584370}, \'multiverseid\': 584370}, {\'name\': \'Cappellana Aerea\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Cappellana Aerea entra nel campo di battaglia, macina tre carte. Puoi aggiungere alla tua mano una carta Pianura o una carta creatura con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 scelta tra le carte macinate in questo modo. Se non lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Cappellana Aerea. (Per macinare una carta, metti nel tuo cimitero la prima carta del tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33917b33-5ef8-46a5-b800-ee3e0efbe8a9\', \'multiverseId\': 584631}, \'multiverseid\': 584631}, {\'name\': \'空輸する従軍牧師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n空輸する従軍牧師が戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を切削する。あなたはこれにより切削されたカードの中から、平地・カード１枚かマナ総量が３以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。そうしないなら、空輸する従軍牧師の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94dd76c2-2217-412e-add1-dd740c98fecd\', \'multiverseId\': 584892}, \'multiverseid\': 584892}, {\'name\': \'Capelã do Transporte Aéreo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Capelã do Transporte Aéreo entrar no campo de batalha, triture três cards. Você pode colocar em sua mão um card de Planície ou um card de criatura com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 dentre os cards triturados dessa forma. Se não fizer isso, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Capelã do Transporte Aéreo. (Para triturar um card, coloque o card do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'114d6e33-95f2-476e-aa8a-2669fe6df36a\', \'multiverseId\': 585153}, \'multiverseid\': 585153}, {\'name\': \'空运教士\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当空运教士进战场时，磨三张牌。你可以将以此法磨掉的一张平原牌或法术力值等于或小于3的生物牌置于你手上。若你未如此作，则在空运教士上放置一个+1/+1指示物。（磨一张牌的流程是将你牌库顶的牌置入你坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d71081b9-8700-4288-b2e1-db1d293bedd9\', \'multiverseId\': 585414}, \'multiverseid\': 585414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Machtstein-Belebung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Artefakt\\nWenn die Machtstein-Belebung ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nDas verzauberte Artefakt ist zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'414d723d-d9cd-43fb-b188-db24aef79f68\', \'multiverseId\': 583904}, \'multiverseid\': 583904}, {\'name\': \'Animación de la Piedra de Fortaleza\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefacto.\\nCuando la Animación de la Piedra de Fortaleza entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nEl artefacto encantado es una criatura con fuerza y resistencia base de 4/4 además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81b8e2b6-fe0f-42cc-8176-dd9ac2f92643\', \'multiverseId\': 584165}, \'multiverseid\': 584165}, {\'name\': \'Animation de la Lithopuissance\', \'text\': "Enchanter : artefact\\nQuand l\'Animation de la Lithopuissance arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nL\'artefact enchanté est une créature avec une force et une endurance de base de 4/4 en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584426&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b4516e9-bfb8-4889-b938-9b8307bbc3f5\', \'multiverseId\': 584426}, \'multiverseid\': 584426}, {\'name\': \'Animazione della Pietra del Vigore\', \'text\': "Incanta artefatto\\nQuando l\'Animazione della Pietra del Vigore entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nL\'artefatto incantato è una creatura con forza e costituzione base 4/4 in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95d502a6-c947-4e72-a528-eb048c900c70\', \'multiverseId\': 584687}, \'multiverseid\': 584687}, {\'name\': \'マイトストーンの稼動力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（アーティファクト）\\nマイトストーンの稼動力が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\nエンチャントしているアーティファクトは、他のタイプに加えて基本のパワーとタフネスが４/４のクリーチャーでもある。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cca4f02c-eb06-4218-a36d-e3ee820b78e3\', \'multiverseId\': 584948}, \'multiverseid\': 584948}, {\'name\': \'Animação da Pedra de Força\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefato\\nQuando Animação da Pedra de Força entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nO artefato encantado é uma criatura com poder e resistência básicos 4/4 além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf8f7823-a957-4179-83d4-d9ab92120aa6\', \'multiverseId\': 585209}, \'multiverseid\': 585209}, {\'name\': \'强能石注能\', \'text\': \'结附于神器\\n当强能石注能进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的神器是基础力量与防御力为4/4的生物，且仍具有原本类别。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2824a7d3-0b84-41f8-9f01-f5654ac8f9b1\', \'multiverseId\': 585470}, \'multiverseid\': 585470}]', "[{'name': 'Maschine bezwingt Materie', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {1} weniger, falls du eine Artefaktkreatur kontrollierst.\\nBringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Nur jemand, der in der Lage war, die Statue zu versetzen, würde die Prinzessin heiraten dürfen. Also versetzte Urza sie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583903&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4b6774c-276e-46ef-a6d8-908dd6ae569f', 'multiverseId': 583903}, 'multiverseid': 583903}, {'name': 'Máquinas sobre la materia', 'text': 'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo si controlas una criatura artefacto.\\nRegresa el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra a la mano de su propietario.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'El señor guerrero decretó que solo alguien que fuera capaz de mover la estatua sería lo suficientemente fuerte como para casarse con la princesa. Así que Urza la movió.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584164&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fca0371-fa24-485a-9fb3-f32dde5fd239', 'multiverseId': 584164}, 'multiverseid': 584164}, {'name': 'La machine domine la matière', 'text': 'Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer si vous contrôlez une créature-artefact.\\nRenvoyez un permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Le Seigneur de guerre décréta que seul celui qui pourrait déplacer la statue serait assez fort pour épouser la princesse. Alors Urza la déplaça.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584425&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '347cf462-6fbd-4fe4-aa84-7def7c04da91', 'multiverseId': 584425}, 'multiverseid': 584425}, {'name': 'Il Potere della Macchina', 'text': 'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata se controlli una creatura artefatto.\\nFai tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Il signore della guerra stabilì che solo chi fosse riuscito a spostare la statua sarebbe stato considerato forte abbastanza da sposare la principessa. Così Urza la spostò.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584686&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30e30127-4d6a-4011-aafb-4e6fb517cb6d', 'multiverseId': 584686}, 'multiverseid': 584686}, {'name': '機械力', 'text': 'あなたがアーティファクト・クリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '大将軍は、この像を動かせるほどの強き者のみに愛娘を娶らせると宣言した。そこでウルザは像を動かした。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584947&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3abd045d-ba20-4888-a368-e87fa8c23955', 'multiverseId': 584947}, 'multiverseid': 584947}, {'name': 'Máquina Sobre Matéria', 'text': 'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada se você controla uma criatura artefato.\\nDevolva a permanente alvo não de terreno para a mão de seu dono.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'O Senhor da Guerra decretou que só alguém que conseguisse mover a estátua seria forte o suficiente para desposar a princesa. Então Urza a moveu.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585208&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22449904-ccb7-4555-9b79-3d3eca554da3', 'multiverseId': 585208}, 'multiverseid': 585208}, {'name': '械胜于物', 'text': '如果你操控神器生物，则此咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n将目标非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '大领主曾颁令公告，唯有能够搬动雕像的强者，方能与公主联姻。克撒办到了。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585469&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc9a67fe-ba9b-4360-b9ce-652702ecc96b', 'multiverseId': 585469}, 'multiverseid': 585469}]", '[{\'name\': \'Maske des Jadekünstlers\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}, opfere die Maske des Jadekünstlers: Erzeuge einen X/X farblosen Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\\nExhumieren {2}{G} ({2}{G}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584045&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc6eedbf-11fe-46b4-b779-635b45702e76\', \'multiverseId\': 584045}, \'multiverseid\': 584045}, {\'name\': \'Máscara del artesano del jade\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}, sacrificar la Máscara del artesano del jade: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Gólem incolora X/X. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\\nDesenterrar {2}{G}. ({2}{G}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac0c20a-c170-451f-b33a-885329ec68d1\', \'multiverseId\': 584306}, \'multiverseid\': 584306}, {\'name\': \'Masque du façonneur de jade\', \'text\': "{X}, {T}, sacrifiez le Masque du façonneur de jade : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact X/X incolore Golem. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.\\nExhumation {2}{G} ({2}{G} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584567&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9162ef10-f67f-45ae-89af-3cb52ae67a3c\', \'multiverseId\': 584567}, \'multiverseid\': 584567}, {\'name\': \'Maschera del Plasmagiada\', \'text\': "{X}, {T}, Sacrifica la Maschera del Plasmagiada: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Golem X/X incolore. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\\nDissotterrare {2}{G} ({2}{G}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4eb529b-9bdc-42b0-a070-787baf5f6599\', \'multiverseId\': 584828}, \'multiverseid\': 584828}, {\'name\': \'翡翠細工師の仮面\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}, 翡翠細工師の仮面を生け贄に捧げる：無色のＸ/Ｘのゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\\n蘇生{2}{G}（{2}{G}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccf598d9-ede7-4a1a-a782-636225e9c7be\', \'multiverseId\': 585089}, \'multiverseid\': 585089}, {\'name\': \'Máscara do Artesão de Jade\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}, sacrifique Máscara do Artesão de Jade: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Golem incolor X/X. Ative somente como um feitiço.\\nDesenterrar {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d99b449-87c8-4286-a0b5-94997cff5f0e\', \'multiverseId\': 585350}, \'multiverseid\': 585350}, {\'name\': \'雕玉匠面具\', \'text\': \'{X}，{T}，牺牲雕玉匠面具：派出一个X/X无色魔像衍生神器生物。只能于法术时机起动。\\n破坟{2}{G}（{2}{G}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f618f395-ce22-4c19-9da5-4ef723108942\', \'multiverseId\': 585611}, \'multiverseid\': 585611}]', '[{\'name\': \'Massenproduktion\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge vier 1/1 farblose Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich brauche eine Armee, keine Meisterwerke. Beschleunigt die Produktion, um jeden Preis."\\n—Urza, Anweisungen an seine Ingenieure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583861&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c029358f-f156-4c63-bc55-402fef288def\', \'multiverseId\': 583861}, \'multiverseid\': 583861}, {\'name\': \'Producción en cadena\', \'text\': \'Crea cuatro fichas de criatura artefacto Soldado incoloras 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Necesito un ejército, no una obra de arte. Aceleren la producción, cueste lo que cueste".\\n—Urza, notas a sus ingenieros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52d5754e-ad29-4588-bf7d-53b4e8935559\', \'multiverseId\': 584122}, \'multiverseid\': 584122}, {\'name\': \'Production de masse\', \'text\': \'Créez quatre jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai besoin d\'une armée, pas d\'une œuvre d\'art. Accélérez la production, coûte que coûte. »\\n—Urza, notes à ses ingénieurs", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584383&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a550d2ff-3a6a-4be2-b54f-23f022020fc7\', \'multiverseId\': 584383}, \'multiverseid\': 584383}, {\'name\': \'Produzione di Massa\', \'text\': \'Crea quattro pedine creatura artefatto Soldato 1/1 incolori.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi serve un esercito, non un capolavoro. Accelerate la produzione, a qualunque costo."\\n—Urza, appunti ai suoi ingegneri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f7ba7a8-f105-43e2-96c5-ac7374e6111f\', \'multiverseId\': 584644}, \'multiverseid\': 584644}, {\'name\': \'大量生産\', \'text\': \'無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン４体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「必要なのは軍勢だ、傑作機ではない。生産を増強するのだ、あらゆる手段を使え。」\\n――ウルザ、配下の技師へのメモ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfcd3057-0903-47e0-bb20-08d6fd97decd\', \'multiverseId\': 584905}, \'multiverseid\': 584905}, {\'name\': \'Produção em Massa\', \'text\': \'Crie quatro fichas de criatura artefato Soldado incolor 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu preciso de um exército, não de uma obra-prima. Acelerem as entregas, custe o que custar."\\n— Urza, observações para seus engenheiros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e673875-84cc-49af-beda-280cad3f1fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 585166}, \'multiverseid\': 585166}, {\'name\': \'大量制造\', \'text\': \'派出四个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我要的是军队，不是作品。加速生产，不计代价。」\\n～克撒，给工程师的批注\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9cf8e56-6afe-4a77-9314-f820a2b75f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 585427}, \'multiverseid\': 585427}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mechanisierte Kriegsführung\', \'text\': \'Falls eine rote Quelle oder eine Artefaktquelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Gegner oder einer bleibenden Karte, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, Schaden zufügen würde, fügt sie stattdessen so viele Schadenspunkte plus 1 zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Zunächst dienten die Kampfmaschinen ausgedünnten Kampftrupps nur als Verstärkung. Bald darauf ersetzten sie sie vollständig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583985&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fe3344f-db67-4766-929e-e652aa863395\', \'multiverseId\': 583985}, \'multiverseid\': 583985}, {\'name\': \'Guerra mecanizada\', \'text\': \'Si una fuente roja o artefacto que controlas fuera a hacer daño a un oponente o un permanente que controla un oponente, en vez de eso, hace esa misma cantidad de daño más 1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Primero, los autómatas reforzaron las escuadras diezmadas. Después, las sustituyeron por completo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89b33fbb-e05e-4099-9d6c-b532ffc71d52\', \'multiverseId\': 584246}, \'multiverseid\': 584246}, {\'name\': \'Guerre mécanisée\', \'text\': "Si une source rouge ou artefact que vous contrôlez devait infliger des blessures à un adversaire ou à un permanent qu\'un adversaire contrôle, elle inflige autant de blessures plus 1 à la place.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Au départ, les automates renforcèrent les escouades affaiblies. Puis ils les remplacèrent entièrement.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584507&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b10b22c6-da48-4d08-8e48-95daeeaa4b31\', \'multiverseId\': 584507}, \'multiverseid\': 584507}, {\'name\': \'Guerra Meccanizzata\', \'text\': \'Se una fonte rossa o artefatto che controlli sta per infliggere danno a un avversario o a un permanente controllato da un avversario, infligge invece altrettanti danni più 1.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Dapprima gli automi rinforzarono le squadre decimate. Poi le sostituirono del tutto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'170a920f-0813-4936-8aa7-fad6daecf654\', \'multiverseId\': 584768}, \'multiverseid\': 584768}, {\'name\': \'機械化戦\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて赤やアーティファクトである発生源１つが、対戦相手や対戦相手がコントロールしているパーマネントのうち１つにダメージを与えるなら、代わりに、それはその点数に１を足した点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'当初の自動機械は、損耗した隊を補強するものだった。その後、隊員はすべて自動機械に置き換えられた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6147dbe4-e1f8-4fea-a0db-674ffb15f538\', \'multiverseId\': 585029}, \'multiverseid\': 585029}, {\'name\': \'Guerra Mecanizada\', \'text\': \'Se uma fonte vermelha ou artefato que você controla causaria dano a um oponente ou a uma permanente que um oponente controla, em vez disso, ela causa aquela quantidade de dano mais 1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Primeiro, os autômatos reforçaram os esquadrões desfalcados. Depois os substituíram completamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ebc27b8-1042-4a81-97ff-3af10ace7570\', \'multiverseId\': 585290}, \'multiverseid\': 585290}, {\'name\': \'机械化战争\', \'text\': \'如果某个由你操控的红色或神器来源将向任一对手或由对手操控的永久物造成伤害，则改为它造成原数量加1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'一开始只是用自动机械来为减员部队补充战力。之后便全面取而代之。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68dc79cf-f2bb-41c8-8ac5-47a7c09f83ce\', \'multiverseId\': 585551}, \'multiverseid\': 585551}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mechanisierte Kriegsführung\', \'text\': \'Falls eine rote Quelle oder eine Artefaktquelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Gegner oder einer bleibenden Karte, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, Schaden zufügen würde, fügt sie stattdessen so viele Schadenspunkte plus 1 zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585813&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd22861e-c44d-4470-8cbb-8d2bc3b99a6c\', \'multiverseId\': 585813}, \'multiverseid\': 585813}, {\'name\': \'Guerre mécanisée\', \'text\': "Si une source rouge ou artefact que vous contrôlez devait infliger des blessures à un adversaire ou à un permanent qu\'un adversaire contrôle, elle inflige autant de blessures plus 1 à la place.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585885&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'726b0b53-293b-4d3b-9980-faa24d02c93f\', \'multiverseId\': 585885}, \'multiverseid\': 585885}, {\'name\': \'機械化戦\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて赤やアーティファクトである発生源１つが、対戦相手や対戦相手がコントロールしているパーマネントのうち１つにダメージを与えるなら、代わりに、それはその点数に１を足した点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a120ea0-5703-4ee0-9ae5-c7b0e3cdc2fd\', \'multiverseId\': 585957}, \'multiverseid\': 585957}, {\'name\': \'机械化战争\', \'text\': \'如果某个由你操控的红色或神器来源将向任一对手或由对手操控的永久物造成伤害，则改为它造成原数量加1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f646b1-cd58-4620-a774-3444a23277dd\', \'multiverseId\': 586029}, \'multiverseid\': 586029}]', '[{\'name\': \'Metallbeleberin\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird ein Nichtkreatur-Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, zu einer 4/4 Artefaktkreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Bevor dieses Metall aus dem Boden gerissen wurde, gehörte es Argoth. Nun ist es in Argoths Besitz zurückgekehrt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584011&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afa3057a-c72c-4012-97ec-2cdc48726c21\', \'multiverseId\': 584011}, \'multiverseid\': 584011}, {\'name\': \'Animista de aleación\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Hasta el final del turno, el artefacto objetivo que no sea criatura que controlas se convierte en una criatura artefacto 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Este metal pertenecía a Argoth antes de que lo arrancaran de la tierra. Ahora vuelve a pertenecerle".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c1dc835-cfef-4f30-8c1b-8000d886287a\', \'multiverseId\': 584272}, \'multiverseid\': 584272}, {\'name\': "Animiste d\'alliage", \'text\': "{2}{G} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, un artefact non-créature ciblé que vous contrôlez devient une créature-artefact 4/4.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Ce métal appartenait à Argoth avant d\'être arraché du sol. Il appartient désormais à nouveau à Argoth. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584533&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'908a46e9-3ce9-465f-82e8-6ddcbbb750c4\', \'multiverseId\': 584533}, \'multiverseid\': 584533}, {\'name\': \'Animista delle Leghe\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Fino alla fine del turno, un artefatto non creatura bersaglio che controlli diventa una creatura artefatto 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo metallo apparteneva ad Argoth prima che venisse strappato dal terreno. Adesso appartiene di nuovo ad Argoth."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9c16e4f-c0b7-44a3-a007-26ad8aa3b169\', \'multiverseId\': 584794}, \'multiverseid\': 584794}, {\'name\': \'合金の精霊信者\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでないアーティファクト１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは４/４のアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「この金属は大地より引き裂かれる前にはアルゴスのものであった。今再び、これはアルゴスのものとなったのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be97ebdb-a832-4e86-b5ee-cf12edd5a521\', \'multiverseId\': 585055}, \'multiverseid\': 585055}, {\'name\': \'Animista de Liga Metálica\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Até o final do turno, o artefato não criatura alvo que você controla se torna uma criatura artefato 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Este metal pertencia a Argoth antes de ser arrancado do solo. Agora ele pertence a Argoth de novo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6781e21-2c20-4e32-975a-932284ab4344\', \'multiverseId\': 585316}, \'multiverseid\': 585316}, {\'name\': \'合金物灵师\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：直到回合结束，目标由你操控的非生物神器成为4/4神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「这金属在被从地里掘出之前，原本就属于亚格斯。现在它又重归亚格斯怀抱。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f9d4f94-989e-4507-a60d-39e7477813a2\', \'multiverseId\': 585577}, \'multiverseid\': 585577}]', '[{\'name\': \'Militärische Disziplin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn die Militärische Disziplin ins Spiel kommt, erhält die verzauberte Kreatur Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583863&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39366afa-a44a-4716-b14a-558fab42bbd5\', \'multiverseId\': 583863}, \'multiverseid\': 583863}, {\'name\': \'Disciplina militar\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nCuando la Disciplina militar entre al campo de batalla, la criatura encantada gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65e5981e-7fc1-475c-a6b2-56bc2e58ee87\', \'multiverseId\': 584124}, \'multiverseid\': 584124}, {\'name\': \'Discipline militaire\', \'text\': "Flash\\nEnchanter : créature\\nQuand la Discipline militaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, la créature enchantée acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+0.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584385&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'097b527d-edc9-43ad-91a3-1e0f7f4fa35e\', \'multiverseId\': 584385}, \'multiverseid\': 584385}, {\'name\': \'Disciplina Militare\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nIncanta creatura\\nQuando la Disciplina Militare entra nel campo di battaglia, la creatura incantata ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ed837b2-406e-4661-9e18-7660ea6ca994\', \'multiverseId\': 584646}, \'multiverseid\': 584646}, {\'name\': \'軍事規律\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n軍事規律が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、エンチャントしているクリーチャーは先制攻撃を得る。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e7002dd-63cc-48fb-944d-0d70c65bf925\', \'multiverseId\': 584907}, \'multiverseid\': 584907}, {\'name\': \'Disciplina Militar\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nEncantar criatura\\nQuando Disciplina Militar entra no campo de batalha, a criatura encantada ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11d38311-723d-43c9-980f-216f21405d1f\', \'multiverseId\': 585168}, \'multiverseid\': 585168}, {\'name\': \'军纪严明\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n结附于生物\\n当军纪严明进战场时，所结附的生物获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\\n所结附的生物得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16b667d1-b4d5-446c-b056-6762fc107fa4\', \'multiverseId\': 585429}, \'multiverseid\': 585429}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishra, Ausgräber-Wunderkind\', \'text\': \'Eile\\n{1}, {T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.\\nImmer wenn du eine oder mehrere Artefaktkarten abwirfst, erzeuge {R}{R}. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Während Urza Bücher las, lernte Mishra, die Wüste selbst zu lesen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583986&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbd59fd0-d78f-4a82-9a6e-f6c9b946a422\', \'multiverseId\': 583986}, \'multiverseid\': 583986}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, excavador prodigioso\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\n{1}, {T}, descartar una carta: Roba una carta.\\nSiempre que descartes una o más cartas de artefacto, agrega {R}{R}. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras Urza leía libros, Mishra aprendía a leer el propio desierto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d96ed347-438b-43f2-b84d-2bc9a6dff61f\', \'multiverseId\': 584247}, \'multiverseid\': 584247}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, prodige excavateur\', \'text\': "Célérité\\n{1}, {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Piochez une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous vous défaussez au moins d\'une carte d\'artefact, ajoutez {R}{R}. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Alors qu\'Urza lisait des livres, Mishra apprenait à lire le désert.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584508&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a38402-dd1a-4cbe-9a13-0dd11d179ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 584508}, \'multiverseid\': 584508}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, Prodigio dello Scavo\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\n{1}, {T}, Scarta una carta: Pesca una carta.\\nOgniqualvolta scarti una o più carte artefatto, aggiungi {R}{R}. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre Urza leggeva libri, Mishra imparava a leggere il deserto stesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a225e90-ff80-430e-af42-d9eccc90ec1e\', \'multiverseId\': 584769}, \'multiverseid\': 584769}, {\'name\': \'採掘の神童、ミシュラ\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n{1}, {T}, カード１枚を捨てる：カード１枚を引く。\\nあなたが１枚以上のアーティファクト・カードを捨てるたび、 {R}{R}を加える。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'ウルザが書物を読みふける間に、ミシュラは砂漠そのものを読む術を学んだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad7315dc-c42f-400d-9ff1-c7c43a9795bb\', \'multiverseId\': 585030}, \'multiverseid\': 585030}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, Prodígio da Escavação\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\n{1}, {T}, descarte um card: Compre um card.\\nToda vez que você descartar um ou mais cards de artefato, adicione {R}{R}. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto Urza lia livros, Mishra aprendia a ler o próprio deserto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe7db25-0c1a-4c1b-9bcb-ae272c072d5e\', \'multiverseId\': 585291}, \'multiverseid\': 585291}, {\'name\': \'掘古逸才米斯拉\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n{1}，{T}，弃一张牌：抓一张牌。\\n每当你弃一张或数张神器牌时，加{R}{R}。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'当克撒在研读书本时，米斯拉学着去研读沙漠本身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bca55e4-6a45-4791-a310-1025055cf33d\', \'multiverseId\': 585552}, \'multiverseid\': 585552}]', "[{'name': 'Mishra, Vasall des Gix', 'text': 'Immer wenn du angreifst, verliert jeder Gegner X Lebenspunkte und du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an angreifenden Kreaturen ist. Falls Mishra, Vasall des Gix, und eine Kreatur namens Phyrexianische Drachenmaschine angreifen und du sie besitzt und kontrollierst, schicke beide ins Exil und verschmilz sie dann zu Mishra, verloren an Phyrexia. Er kommt getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Mensch, Handwerker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588296&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfc0bf82-1ddf-4eda-81e6-30b02696fbf4', 'multiverseId': 588296}, 'multiverseid': 588296}, {'name': 'Mishra, poseído por Gix', 'text': 'Siempre que ataques, cada oponente pierde X vidas y tú ganas X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas atacantes. Si Mishra, poseído por Gix y una criatura llamada Dragón mecánico pirexiano están atacando, y tú eres su propietario y los controlas, exílialos. Luego, combínalos para formar a Mishra, en manos de Pirexia. Entra al campo de batalla girado y atacando.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano pirexiano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588305&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f42820ae-803f-4755-ac02-42b921affc8a', 'multiverseId': 588305}, 'multiverseid': 588305}, {'name': 'Mishra, arrogé par Gix', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous attaquez, chaque adversaire perd X points de vie et vous gagnez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de créatures attaquantes. Si Mishra, arrogé par Gix et une créature appelée Dragon-machine phyrexian attaquent, et que vous possédez et contrôlez les deux, exilez-les, puis assimilez-les en Mishra, tombé aux mains de Phyrexia. Il arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé et attaquant.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : phyrexian et humain et artificier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588314&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f75b641d-c0f8-468b-8455-08d7584c29d7', 'multiverseId': 588314}, 'multiverseid': 588314}, {'name': 'Mishra, Rivendicato da Gix', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta attacchi, ogni avversario perde X punti vita e tu guadagni X punti vita, dove X è il numero di creature attaccanti. Se Mishra, Rivendicato da Gix e una creatura chiamata Drago Meccanico di Phyrexia attaccano e possiedi e controlli entrambi, esiliali, poi combinali in Mishra, Sottratto da Phyrexia. Entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato e attaccante.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano Phyrexiano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588323&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53653115-416d-454c-bacf-c55d0c9117ae', 'multiverseId': 588323}, 'multiverseid': 588323}, {'name': 'ギックスに拾われし者、ミシュラ', 'text': 'あなたが攻撃するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失い、あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘは攻撃クリーチャーの数に等しい。ギックスに拾われし者、ミシュラと、「ファイレクシアのドラゴン・エンジン」という名前を持つクリーチャー１体が攻撃していて、あなたがその両方をコントロールしていてそれらのオーナーであるなら、それらを追放し、その後、それらを「ファイレクシアに下りし者、ミシュラ」へと合体させる。それはタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・人間・工匠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588332&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7f4e5b1-c441-4b86-bcee-75fd8cb419f3', 'multiverseId': 588332}, 'multiverseid': 588332}, {'name': 'Mishra, Tomado por Gix', 'text': 'Toda vez que você ataca, cada oponente perde X pontos de vida e você ganha X pontos de vida, sendo X o número de criaturas atacantes. Se Mishra, Tomado por Gix, e uma criatura com o nome Dragão Mecânico Phyrexiano estiverem atacando e você possuí-los e controlá-los, exile-os e, depois, funda-os em Mishra, Perdido para Phyrexia. Ele entra no campo de batalha virado e atacando.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Phyrexiano Humano Artesão', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588341&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef7de2c3-ebe3-4544-80b7-e1b7244fa1ed', 'multiverseId': 588341}, 'multiverseid': 588341}, {'name': '基克斯掌偶米斯拉', 'text': '每当你攻击时，每位对手各失去X点生命且你获得X点生命，X为进行攻击的生物数量。如果基克斯掌偶米斯拉与一个名称为非瑞克西亚龙形引擎的生物都正进行攻击，且你同时拥有并操控两者，则放逐它们，然后将它们融合为非瑞克西亚臣民米斯拉。它须横置进战场，且正进行攻击。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～非瑞人／人类／神器师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588350&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46beb629-c655-44df-a836-3751b531b257', 'multiverseId': 588350}, 'multiverseid': 588350}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mishra, Zähmer von Mak Fawa\', \'text\': \'Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, haben „Abwehr — Eine bleibende Karte opfern."\\nJede Artefaktkarte in deinem Friedhof hat Exhumieren {1}{B}{R}. ({1}{B}{R}: Bringe die Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584060&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c736263f-e9b3-4a09-bf14-c70daf2351de\', \'multiverseId\': 584060}, \'multiverseid\': 584060}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, domador del mak fawa\', \'text\': \'Los permanentes que controlas tienen "Rebatir—Sacrificar un permanente".\\nCada carta de artefacto en tu cementerio tiene la habilidad de desenterrar {1}{B}{R}. ({1}{B}{R}: Regresa la carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a061c22-7b79-435c-aa23-56439181adeb\', \'multiverseId\': 584321}, \'multiverseid\': 584321}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, dresseur de Mak Fawa\', \'text\': "Les permanents que vous contrôlez ont « Parade—Sacrifiez un permanent. »\\nChaque carte d\'artefact dans votre cimetière a exhumation {1}{B}{R}. ({1}{B}{R} : Renvoyez la carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584582&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a2a0b3-0881-43ae-bf12-388928784027\', \'multiverseId\': 584582}, \'multiverseid\': 584582}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, Domatore di Mak Fawa\', \'text\': \'I permanenti che controlli hanno "Egida—Sacrifica un permanente".\\nOgni carta artefatto nel tuo cimitero ha dissotterrare {1}{B}{R}. ({1}{B}{R}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia la carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\\\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe56214b-1ea4-4c39-b7fb-d308b4d81c40\', \'multiverseId\': 584843}, \'multiverseid\': 584843}, {\'name\': \'マク・ファワを手懐ける者、ミシュラ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは「護法―パーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げる。」を持つ。\\nあなたの墓地にあるすべてのアーティファクト・カードは蘇生{1}{B}{R}を持つ。（{1}{B}{R}：あなたの墓地にあるそのカードを戦場に戻す。それは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、あるいは、これが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e7f3571-b1db-4ee2-83c4-6969cdae53f7\', \'multiverseId\': 585104}, \'multiverseid\': 585104}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, Domador de Mak Fawa\', \'text\': \'As permanentes que você controla têm "Salvaguarda — Sacrifique uma permanente".\\nCada card de artefato em seu cemitério tem desenterrar {1}{B}{R}. ({1}{B}{R}: Devolva o card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac0be47a-797e-4582-b3c8-bc8373088d0c\', \'multiverseId\': 585365}, \'multiverseid\': 585365}, {\'name\': \'马法瓦威领米斯拉\', \'text\': \'由你操控的永久物具有「守护～牺牲一个永久物。」\\n你坟墓场中的每张神器牌均具有破坟{1}{B}{R}。（{1}{B}{R}：将该牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9f48f1d-c824-4d6a-801c-7a0070f6cd92\', \'multiverseId\': 585626}, \'multiverseid\': 585626}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishra, Zähmer von Mak Fawa\', \'text\': \'Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, haben „Abwehr — Eine bleibende Karte opfern."\\nJede Artefaktkarte in deinem Friedhof hat Exhumieren {1}{B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Durch die Einflüsterung der Bruderschaft des Gix verwandelte sich Mishras Drang, sich zu beweisen, langsam in einen unersättlichen Machthunger."\\n—*Der Artefakt-Krieg*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586095&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f43019b-b416-47ce-a295-091dea774e16\', \'multiverseId\': 586095}, \'multiverseid\': 586095}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, domador del mak fawa\', \'text\': \'Los permanentes que controlas tienen "Rebatir—Sacrificar un permanente".\\nCada carta de artefacto en tu cementerio tiene la habilidad de desenterrar {1}{B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Con la Hermandad de Gix susurrándole al oído, la determinación de Mishra por demostrar su valía degeneró lentamente en un hambre insaciable de poder".\\n—*La Guerra de las Antigüedades*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'548392ac-6461-43cf-a3f4-46d536c1df07\', \'multiverseId\': 586101}, \'multiverseid\': 586101}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, dresseur de Mak Fawa\', \'text\': "Les permanents que vous contrôlez ont « Parade—Sacrifiez un permanent. »\\nChaque carte d\'artefact dans votre cimetière a exhumation {1}{B}{R}.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Les murmures de la Confrérie de Gix à son oreille transformèrent lentement l\'ambition de Mishra à prouver sa valeur en une soif de pouvoir immense. »\\n—*La Guerre des Antiquités*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18abf5b3-2daa-4507-bcad-0d32c1f9d533\', \'multiverseId\': 586107}, \'multiverseid\': 586107}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, Domatore di Mak Fawa\', \'text\': \'I permanenti che controlli hanno "Egida—Sacrifica un permanente".\\nOgni carta artefatto nel tuo cimitero ha dissotterrare {1}{B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Con la Fratellanza di Gix che gli sussurrava nelle orecchie, il desiderio di Mishra di dimostrare il suo valore fu lentamente plasmato in un\\\'insaziabile sete di potere."\\n—*La Guerra delle Antichità*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a2490a-5556-4e93-81c7-4366a7cfa14f\', \'multiverseId\': 586113}, \'multiverseid\': 586113}, {\'name\': \'マク・ファワを手懐ける者、ミシュラ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは「護法―パーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げる。」を持つ。\\nあなたの墓地にあるすべてのアーティファクト・カードは蘇生{1}{B}{R}を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「ギックスの教団がミシュラの耳元で囁き、己の能力を証明せんとする彼の衝動は、力への飽くなき渇望へと徐々に歪められた。」\\n――*「アンティキティー戦争」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22e84479-f6f4-4988-b434-6b67db52eefb\', \'multiverseId\': 586119}, \'multiverseid\': 586119}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, Domador de Mak Fawa\', \'text\': \'As permanentes que você controla têm "Salvaguarda — Sacrifique uma permanente".\\nCada card de artefato em seu cemitério tem desenterrar {1}{B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Com a Irmandade de Gix sussurrando em seu ouvido, a determinação de Mishra para provar seu valor transformou-se lentamente em uma fome insaciável de poder."\\n— *A Guerra das Antiguidades*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'786db7af-d541-4f70-af22-6faee9ce0995\', \'multiverseId\': 586131}, \'multiverseid\': 586131}, {\'name\': \'马法瓦威领米斯拉\', \'text\': \'由你操控的永久物具有「守护～牺牲一个永久物。」\\n你坟墓场中的每张神器牌均具有破坟{1}{B}{R}。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「基克斯兄弟会不断在米斯拉耳边挑拨蛊惑，原本那股想要证明自己的动力，也被慢慢扭曲成对力量的无魇饥渴。」\\n～*《古文明之战》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'531eda16-d780-4427-96f9-ff1f0e610f88\', \'multiverseId\': 586137}, \'multiverseid\': 586137}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishras Aufmarsch\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.\\n• Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ha. Urza hat meine Stärke schon wieder unterschätzt."\\n—Mishra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'693f2cc1-43ce-41dd-b101-e5e30e6a45e4\', \'multiverseId\': 583989}, \'multiverseid\': 583989}, {\'name\': \'Arremetida de Mishra\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Soldado incoloras 1/1.\\n• Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ja. Una vez más, Urza vuelve a subestimar mi fuerza".\\n—Mishra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd0a7392-ab98-4f02-ae40-c4ceda1de549\', \'multiverseId\': 584250}, \'multiverseid\': 584250}, {\'name\': \'Carnage de Mishra\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.\\n• Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Ha ! Urza a encore une fois sous-estimé ma force. »\\n—Mishra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584511&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63ff0f6b-c6b6-495e-b12f-9d9769247ddf\', \'multiverseId\': 584511}, \'multiverseid\': 584511}, {\'name\': \'Assalto di Mishra\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Crea due pedine creatura artefatto Soldato 1/1 incolori.\\n• Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah. Ancora una volta, Urza ha sottovalutato la mia forza."\\n—Mishra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14f06b85-705f-443d-92c9-6c5f593c69df\', \'multiverseId\': 584772}, \'multiverseid\': 584772}, {\'name\': \'ミシュラの猛攻\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\n・ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ハッ、ウルザはまたしても私の力を見くびったな。」\\n――ミシュラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49369f03-5263-4d31-abfd-cbe9e3229cf7\', \'multiverseId\': 585033}, \'multiverseid\': 585033}, {\'name\': \'Investida de Mishra\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Crie duas fichas de criatura artefato Soldado incolor 1/1.\\n• As criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah! Urza subestimou minha força novamente."\\n— Mishra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aadf7d8-7a0c-4b79-a0c6-638cb84b9c34\', \'multiverseId\': 585294}, \'multiverseid\': 585294}, {\'name\': \'米斯拉的猛攻\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•派出两个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\\n•由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「哈。克撒又低估了我的力量。」\\n～米斯拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8d10426-d06a-43e2-b302-05626a90654e\', \'multiverseId\': 585555}, \'multiverseid\': 585555}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishras Befehl\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Bestimme einen Spieler deiner Wahl. Er kann bis zu X Karten abwerfen. Dann zieht er für jede auf diese Weise abgeworfene Karte eine Karte.\\n• Dieser Zauberspruch fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Dieser Zauberspruch fügt einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +X/+0 und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583987&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'836c2d00-f9d9-42ff-abed-d71aa17cc32e\', \'multiverseId\': 583987}, \'multiverseid\': 583987}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de Mishra\', \'text\': \'Elige dos:\\n• Elige un jugador objetivo. Puede descartar hasta X cartas. Luego roba una carta por cada carta descartada de esta manera.\\n• Este hechizo hace X puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n• Este hechizo hace X puntos de daño al planeswalker objetivo.\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene +X/+0 y gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5c4bee0-cde5-42de-be1d-e8dc727a8d9b\', \'multiverseId\': 584248}, \'multiverseid\': 584248}, {\'name\': \'Commandement de Mishra\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Choisissez un joueur ciblé. Il peut se défausser de jusqu\'à X cartes. Puis il pioche une carte pour chaque carte défaussée de cette manière.\\n• Ce sort inflige X blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n• Ce sort inflige X blessures à un planeswalker ciblé.\\n• Une créature ciblée gagne +X/+0 et acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584509&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1889401-26a0-45ab-81b4-ac71526f995b\', \'multiverseId\': 584509}, \'multiverseid\': 584509}, {\'name\': \'Comando di Mishra\', \'text\': \'Scegli due —\\n• Scegli un giocatore bersaglio. Può scartare fino a X carte. Poi quel giocatore pesca una carta per ogni carta scartata in questo modo.\\n• Questa magia infligge X danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Questa magia infligge X danni a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende +X/+0 e ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aae6e776-8036-4000-9d15-f342707ba02b\', \'multiverseId\': 584770}, \'multiverseid\': 584770}, {\'name\': \'ミシュラの命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n・プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード最大Ｘ枚を捨ててもよい。その後、そのプレイヤーはこれにより捨てられたカード１枚につき１枚のカードを引く。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。この呪文はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n・プレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。この呪文はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受け速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f5046c8-9da5-41f8-b859-4360443a4f9a\', \'multiverseId\': 585031}, \'multiverseid\': 585031}, {\'name\': \'Comando de Mishra\', \'text\': \'Escolha dois —\\n• Escolha o jogador alvo. Ele pode descartar até X cards. Depois, ele compra um card para cada card descartado dessa forma.\\n• Esta mágica causa X pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\n• Esta mágica causa X pontos de dano ao planeswalker alvo.\\n• A criatura alvo recebe +X/+0 e ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c7208db-2c99-4ffb-a973-07fe18fd6cdb\', \'multiverseId\': 585292}, \'multiverseid\': 585292}, {\'name\': \'米斯拉的指命\', \'text\': \'选择两项～\\n•选择目标牌手。其可以弃至多X张牌。然后每以此法弃掉一张牌，其便抓一张牌。\\n•此咒语对目标生物造成X点伤害。\\n•此咒语对目标鹏洛客造成X点伤害。\\n•直到回合结束，目标生物得+X/+0且获得敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2628ea3-cfe5-4274-a758-f09523e9fe6a\', \'multiverseId\': 585553}, \'multiverseid\': 585553}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishras Befehl\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Bestimme einen Spieler deiner Wahl. Er kann bis zu X Karten abwerfen. Dann zieht er für jede auf diese Weise abgeworfene Karte eine Karte.\\n• Dieser Zauberspruch fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Dieser Zauberspruch fügt einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +X/+0 und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585814&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'990f25ae-df78-4159-8a8b-4c6b43e5f833\', \'multiverseId\': 585814}, \'multiverseid\': 585814}, {\'name\': \'Commandement de Mishra\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Choisissez un joueur ciblé. Il peut se défausser de jusqu\'à X cartes. Puis il pioche une carte pour chaque carte défaussée de cette manière.\\n• Ce sort inflige X blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n• Ce sort inflige X blessures à un planeswalker ciblé.\\n• Une créature ciblée gagne +X/+0 et acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585886&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef1f541-28e2-490c-b61d-fdfa3124d9b5\', \'multiverseId\': 585886}, \'multiverseid\': 585886}, {\'name\': \'ミシュラの命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n・プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード最大Ｘ枚を捨ててもよい。その後、そのプレイヤーはこれにより捨てられたカード１枚につき１枚のカードを引く。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。この呪文はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n・プレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。この呪文はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受け速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'257743fc-6981-4bf5-af3e-fcdc020d2a40\', \'multiverseId\': 585958}, \'multiverseid\': 585958}, {\'name\': \'米斯拉的指命\', \'text\': \'选择两项～\\n•选择目标牌手。其可以弃至多X张牌。然后每以此法弃掉一张牌，其便抓一张牌。\\n•此咒语对目标生物造成X点伤害。\\n•此咒语对目标鹏洛客造成X点伤害。\\n•直到回合结束，目标生物得+X/+0且获得敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd742460-741c-4e34-8862-fdf9df4744f5\', \'multiverseId\': 586030}, \'multiverseid\': 586030}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishras Dominanz\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nSolange du die verzauberte Kreatur kontrollierst, erhält sie +2/+2. Anderenfalls kann sie nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Der Schwächestein strahlte eine Macht aus, die die Drachenmaschine Mishras Willen unterwarf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=583988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cc3ce97-3a5a-44c9-bf04-e4a9a4e4e460\', \'multiverseId\': 583988}, \'multiverseid\': 583988}, {\'name\': \'Dominio de Mishra\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nMientras controles la criatura encantada, obtiene +2/+2. De lo contrario, no puede bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'De la Piedra de Debilidad irradió un poder que sometió al dragón mecánico a las órdenes de Mishra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'092ddef6-97f4-41db-9d78-64f941a52954\', \'multiverseId\': 584249}, \'multiverseid\': 584249}, {\'name\': \'Domination de Mishra\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nTant que vous contrôlez la créature enchantée, elle gagne +2/+2. Sinon, elle ne peut pas bloquer.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'La puissance qui irradiait de la Lithorpeur assouvit le dragon-machine au commandement de Mishra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584510&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a6d9c23-e571-4788-8acb-22230dc14f0d\', \'multiverseId\': 584510}, \'multiverseid\': 584510}, {\'name\': \'Dominio di Mishra\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nFintanto che controlli la creatura incantata, quella creatura prende +2/+2. Altrimenti, non può bloccare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "L\'energia della Pietra della Debilitazione iniziò a irradiarsi, vincolando il drago meccanico al comando di Mishra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a641c6-8993-4d82-b970-1f06eec7fa20\', \'multiverseId\': 584771}, \'multiverseid\': 584771}, {\'name\': \'ミシュラの支配\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーをあなたがコントロールしているかぎり、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。そうでないなら、それではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'ウィークストーンから力が放射され、ドラゴン・エンジンはミシュラの命令に束縛された。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'489ddbdd-cce4-4d68-acd3-8a8de6b791be\', \'multiverseId\': 585032}, \'multiverseid\': 585032}, {\'name\': \'Dominação de Mishra\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nEnquanto você controla a criatura encantada, ela recebe +2/+2. Caso contrário, ela não pode bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'O poder irradiou da Pedra de Fraqueza, vinculando o dragão mecânico aos comandos de Mishra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d8dfd0d-0032-49f9-9a24-db7ec50ad2e1\', \'multiverseId\': 585293}, \'multiverseid\': 585293}, {\'name\': \'米斯拉的掌控\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n只要你操控所结附的生物，它便得+2/+2。若否，则它不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'从弱能石中散发出来的力量，让龙形引擎屈身听从米斯拉号令。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbfc0a46-28cb-4b17-9c90-adae05fdaddf\', \'multiverseId\': 585554}, \'multiverseid\': 585554}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishras Juggernaut\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nMishras Juggernaut greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nExhumieren {5}{R} ({5}{R}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584007&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc2fd924-a868-4cb6-a05a-540acb51d239\', \'multiverseId\': 584007}, \'multiverseid\': 584007}, {\'name\': \'Destructor de Mishra\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nEl Destructor de Mishra ataca cada combate si puede.\\nDesenterrar {5}{R}. ({5}{R}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Destructor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cae0c28-739b-4e68-91dc-fd027a9752b2\', \'multiverseId\': 584268}, \'multiverseid\': 584268}, {\'name\': \'Djaggernaut de Mishra\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nLe Djaggernaut de Mishra attaque à chaque combat si possible.\\nExhumation {5}{R} ({5}{R} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : djaggernaut\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584529&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55e89d65-91f5-4014-8d30-8fbf4dedb386\', \'multiverseId\': 584529}, \'multiverseid\': 584529}, {\'name\': \'Juggernaut di Mishra\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nIl Juggernaut di Mishra attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\\nDissotterrare {5}{R} ({5}{R}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c91ec72f-f423-4489-82e7-fbee5aa006cb\', \'multiverseId\': 584790}, \'multiverseid\': 584790}, {\'name\': \'ミシュラの巨大戦車\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n各戦闘で、ミシュラの巨大戦車は可能なら攻撃する。\\n蘇生{5}{R}（{5}{R}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、あるいは、これが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 巨大戦車\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cd46962-bf3e-429b-b6d9-00bd95c04cc9\', \'multiverseId\': 585051}, \'multiverseid\': 585051}, {\'name\': \'Juggernaut de Mishra\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nJuggernaut de Mishra ataca a cada combate se estiver apto.\\nDesenterrar {5}{R} ({5}{R}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a1cedd1-aca2-4060-84f9-cd8ed0b77dcc\', \'multiverseId\': 585312}, \'multiverseid\': 585312}, {\'name\': \'米斯拉的攻城巨车\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n米斯拉的攻城巨车每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n破坟{5}{R}（{5}{R}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～攻城巨车\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dd21970-1ad9-4ad7-b91e-820c102f229c\', \'multiverseId\': 585573}, \'multiverseid\': 585573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishras Labortisch\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, opfere Mishras Labortisch: Schicke die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bestimme eine davon. Du kannst sie bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\\nExhumieren {1}{R} ({1}{R}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6245c362-3e3a-47d4-9554-43c63d55b76a\', \'multiverseId\': 584008}, \'multiverseid\': 584008}, {\'name\': \'Mesa de investigación de Mishra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Mesa de investigación de Mishra: Exilia las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Elige una de ellas. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esa carta.\\nDesenterrar {1}{R}. ({1}{R}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23a73f4b-6481-4310-b500-d893c22cd61d\', \'multiverseId\': 584269}, \'multiverseid\': 584269}, {\'name\': \'Bureau de recherche de Mishra\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, sacrifiez le Bureau de recherche de Mishra : Exilez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Choisissez l\'une d\'elles. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.\\nExhumation {1}{R} ({1}{R} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584530&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d9dd4ce-a40a-4666-813a-b37c67f44168\', \'multiverseId\': 584530}, \'multiverseid\': 584530}, {\'name\': \'Tavolo di Ricerca di Mishra\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, Sacrifica il Tavolo di Ricerca di Mishra: Esilia le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Scegli una di quelle carte. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quella carta.\\nDissotterrare {1}{R} ({1}{R}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'680ba56e-09cf-4808-a512-b61ddb990b82\', \'multiverseId\': 584791}, \'multiverseid\': 584791}, {\'name\': \'ミシュラの研究机\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, ミシュラの研究机を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を追放する。そのうちの１枚を選ぶ。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\\n蘇生{1}{R}（{1}{R}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0833eec-c4bf-4280-ba46-d72d37380a00\', \'multiverseId\': 585052}, \'multiverseid\': 585052}, {\'name\': \'Mesa de Pesquisas de Mishra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, sacrifique Mesa de Pesquisas de Mishra: Exile os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Escolha um deles. Até o final do seu próximo turno, você pode jogar aquele card.\\nDesenterrar {1}{R} ({1}{R}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ee17ab5-7908-4c7c-aa17-44a077cd39fa\', \'multiverseId\': 585313}, \'multiverseid\': 585313}, {\'name\': \'米斯拉的书案\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}，牺牲米斯拉的书案：放逐你牌库顶的两张牌。选择其中一张。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用该牌。\\n破坟{1}{R}（{1}{R}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e5b7185-7d07-494d-aaf9-77c628c73acf\', \'multiverseId\': 585574}, \'multiverseid\': 585574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishras Schmelze\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}: Mishras Schmelze wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 2/2 Montagearbeiter-Artefaktkreatur. Sie ist immer noch ein Land.\\n{1}, {T}: Ein angreifender Montagearbeiter deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584105&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe53462e-6b53-4e17-98c8-2771aff5043d\', \'multiverseId\': 584105}, \'multiverseid\': 584105}, {\'name\': \'Fundición de Mishra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}: La Fundición de Mishra se convierte en una criatura artefacto Operario 2/2 hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\\n{1}, {T}: El Operario atacante objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afe15deb-4f14-4bb2-befe-e0a54e3f82cd\', \'multiverseId\': 584366}, \'multiverseid\': 584366}, {\'name\': \'Fonderie de Mishra\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2} : La Fonderie de Mishra devient une créature-artefact 2/2 Ouvrier spécialisé jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.\\n{1}, {T} : Un ouvrier spécialisé attaquant ciblé gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584627&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aca550f-4dda-4675-9254-e7c1b7e48a82\', \'multiverseId\': 584627}, \'multiverseid\': 584627}, {\'name\': \'Fonderia di Mishra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}: La Fonderia di Mishra diventa una creatura artefatto Addetto-al-Montaggio 2/2 fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\\n{1}, {T}: Un Addetto-al-Montaggio attaccante bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=584888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b3da473-7072-4a76-9fe2-fd11a30b5f2a\', \'multiverseId\': 584888}, \'multiverseid\': 584888}, {\'name\': \'ミシュラの鋳造所\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}：ターン終了時まで、ミシュラの鋳造所は２/２の組立作業員・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\\n{1}, {T}：攻撃している組立作業員１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'iden