inal del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4e91119-4848-494a-81e8-05cfb6b01454\', \'multiverseId\': 585697}, \'multiverseid\': 585697}, {\'name\': \'Fonderie de Mishra\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2} : La Fonderie de Mishra devient une créature-artefact 2/2 Ouvrier spécialisé jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.\\n{1}, {T} : Un ouvrier spécialisé attaquant ciblé gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45cc5e2d-9cbe-41a4-a59d-d47b5a01a2c7\', \'multiverseId\': 585698}, \'multiverseid\': 585698}, {\'name\': \'Fonderia di Mishra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}: La Fonderia di Mishra diventa una creatura artefatto Addetto-al-Montaggio 2/2 fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\\n{1}, {T}: Un Addetto-al-Montaggio attaccante bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dfebd6f-91fa-4b01-a8e0-30ff2b5ba739\', \'multiverseId\': 585699}, \'multiverseid\': 585699}, {\'name\': \'ミシュラの鋳造所\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}：ターン終了時まで、ミシュラの鋳造所は２/２の組立作業員・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\\n{1}, {T}：攻撃している組立作業員１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=585700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5471f7d6-c365-4e81-85c1-84bb9593e7bf\', \'multiverseId\': 585700}, \'multiverseid\': 585700}, {\'name\': \'Fundição de Mishra\', \'text\': \'{